G["forever/reputation/merchants-favor"] = {
	["A {item:18662} for the writ"] = "用{item:18662}交一份令状",
	["A {item:18662} for the writ again"] = "再用{item:18662}交一份令状",
	["A {item:7371} for the writ"] = "用{item:7371}交一份令状",
	["A {item:7371} for the writ again"] = "再用{item:7371}交一份令状",
	["After the {quest:98247}, Friendly is 1000 more: 14 Journeyman writs, 8 Expert or 5 Artisan. Expert and Artisan customers are mostly not in Polestar's data yet: follow the mark the quest puts on your map. Journeyman envelopes drop from mobs of about level 11 to 31; Expert and Artisan ones from higher mobs."] = "完成{quest:98247}后，到友善还需1000点：14份中级令状、8份高级令状或5份大师级令状。高级和大师级顾客大多还不在 Polestar 的数据中：跟着任务在地图上留下的标记走。中级信封由约11-31级的怪物掉落；高级和大师级信封来自更高级的怪物。",
	["All five stand at the {area:2240} on the {area:439}, south-east of {area:484}: {npc:4720}, the chicken \"Plucky\" Johnson, {npc:4706}, the {npc:4496} and {npc:6548}. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "五人都在{area:484}东南、{area:439}上的{area:2240}：{npc:4720}、名叫“普拉基”约翰逊的鸡、{npc:4706}、{npc:4496}和{npc:6548}。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["All four stand around {area:431}: {npc:257315} about 850 yards south-west of it, {npc:257322} to the south, the {npc:257316} about 350 yards south-east and {npc:257317} about 650 yards north-east. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "四人都在{area:431}附近：{npc:257315}在其西南约850码，{npc:257322}在南边，{npc:257316}在东南约350码，{npc:257317}在东北约650码。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["An {item:4384} for the writ"] = "用{item:4384}交一份令状",
	["An {item:4384} for the writ again"] = "再用{item:4384}交一份令状",
	["Craftsman's Writs are the camp's reputation: 75 for a Journeyman writ, 125 for an Expert, 200 for an Artisan. Each asks for one crafted item, named in its quest (not always the writ's title: a {spell:3176} writ wants a {item:3388}). Make it or buy it on the Auction House; you need not know the profession. Each writ can be done once a day, and any number of different ones. Take the quest only of writs whose item you have or will buy on the way (right-click the writ), keep the writ in your bags, then tick this: the next steps lead to each customer you hold a writ for."] = "工匠令状就是营地声望：中级令状75点，高级令状125点，大师级令状200点。每份都要求一件制成品，名称写在它的任务里（不一定与令状标题相同：一份{spell:3176}令状要的是{item:3388}）。自己制作或在拍卖行购买；不需要学会该专业。每份令状每天可完成一次，不同令状数量不限。只接你已经拥有物品、或顺路会买到的令状任务（右键点击令状），把令状留在包里，然后勾选此项：后续步骤会带你去见每一位你持有令状的顾客。",
	["Engineers make the {item:4384}; {npc:789} sells it in {area:69} (Alliance). Otherwise buy one at the Auction House."] = "{item:4384}由工程学制造；{npc:789}在{area:69}出售（联盟）。否则就在拍卖行买一个。",
	["Exalted"] = "崇拜",
	["Exalted opens the camp's tabard (200 Favor) at {npc:256389} or {npc:256384}, and the {item:262766} (6,000 Favor; the mount needs level 60 and Journeyman mount training) at {npc:256736} in {area:1002} or Okamache at the {area:380} camp. The {npc:10636} guide under Collectibles leads you there."] = "崇拜后可在{npc:256389}或{npc:256384}处购买营地战袍（200点恩惠），并可在{area:1002}的{npc:256736}或{area:380}营地的奥卡马奇处购买{item:262766}（6,000点恩惠；坐骑需要60级和中级骑术）。收藏品分类下的{npc:10636}指南会带你去那里。",
	["Forever's trade camps: their best recipes, the Minimule and the {npc:10636} need standing, not only Merchant's Favor."] = "Forever 的贸易营地：最好的配方、迷你骡和{npc:10636}都需要声望，而不只是商人的恩惠。",
	["Friendly opens the first gated recipes at the camp's profession vendors ({skill:197} 25, {skill:165} 17, {skill:333} 13, {skill:164} 10, {skill:202} 10, {skill:171} 5, {skill:185} 2) and the Uncertified Scribe: {npc:256742} at {area:1002}, {npc:256672} at the south end of the {area:380} camp. The scribe's {item:262902} (15 Merchant's Favor) turns an empty {item:248549} into a {item:262917}; hand it to {npc:256390} or {npc:256386} for 50 reputation ({quest:93862}). Any crate works, so buy the cheapest one the Auction House has. Honored is 6000 more: 80 Journeyman writs, 48 Expert, 30 Artisan, or 120 crate returns (1,800 Favor and 120 crates). Mix both: every writ you can fill, returns with spare Favor. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "友善解锁营地专业供应商处的第一批门槛配方（{skill:197}25、{skill:165}17、{skill:333}13、{skill:164}10、{skill:202}10、{skill:171}5、{skill:185}2），以及无证抄写员：{area:1002}的{npc:256742}、{area:380}营地南端的{npc:256672}。抄写员的{item:262902}（15点商人的恩惠）能把一个空的{item:248549}变成{item:262917}；把它交给{npc:256390}或{npc:256386}可得50点声望（{quest:93862}）。任何板条箱都行，所以买拍卖行里最便宜的那个。到尊敬还需6000点：80份中级令状、48份高级令状、30份大师级令状，或交还120个板条箱（1800点恩惠和120个箱子）。两者混合：能填的令状都做，剩余的恩惠用交箱补。传承特长“外交家”可使每次获取量最多提高10%。",
	["Friendly to Honored"] = "友善到尊敬",
	["From level 10, mobs anywhere drop Waylaid Crates and sealed writs (Journeyman's, Expert's and Artisan's). Fill a crate with one of the bundles it lists (right-click it), or open a sealed writ: by beta reports, the first time you do either you also get a {quest:98247}. Right-click the label to start its quest. Crates and writs can be traded, so the Auction House sells them too."] = "从10级起，任何地方的怪物都会掉落被劫的板条箱和密封令状（中级、高级和大师级）。用它所列出的任意一种包裹（右键点击箱子）装满箱子，或打开一份密封令状：据测试服报告，第一次做其中任一件事时还会得到{quest:98247}。右键点击标签即可接取它的任务。板条箱和令状都能交易，所以拍卖行也有出售。",
	["Gather your writs"] = "收集令状",
	["Gather your writs again"] = "再次收集令状",
	["Honored opens the rest of the gated recipes ({skill:165} 28, {skill:164} 21, {skill:333} 16, {skill:171} 15, {skill:202} 9, {skill:197} 6, {skill:185} 1), the {item:270887} (1,200 Favor from {npc:256389} or {npc:256384}: it starts the quest for a Tradeskill Sign toy) and the scribe's {item:262896} (15 Favor), which swaps a writ you cannot fill for a random one of the same rank. Revered is 12000 more: 160 Journeyman writs, 96 Expert, 60 Artisan, or 240 crate returns (3,600 Favor). Forever's quest data sets no standing limit on Journeyman writs: their customers are the ones in the zone steps above."] = "尊敬解锁其余的门槛配方（{skill:165}28、{skill:164}21、{skill:333}16、{skill:171}15、{skill:202}9、{skill:197}6、{skill:185}1）、{item:270887}（在{npc:256389}或{npc:256384}处以1200点恩惠购买：它会开启专业技能招牌玩具的任务），以及抄写员的{item:262896}（15点恩惠），可把你无法完成的令状换成一份同等级的随机令状。到崇敬还需12000点：160份中级令状、96份高级令状、60份大师级令状，或交还240个板条箱（3600点恩惠）。Forever 的任务数据对中级令状没有声望限制：它们的顾客就是上面各区域步骤中的那些。",
	["Honored to Revered"] = "尊敬到崇敬",
	["Leatherworkers make the {item:18662}, and the Auction House has it. Its only vendor is {npc:14860} at the Darkmoon Faire, which Forever has not shown yet: go there only if the Faire is in town."] = "{item:18662}由制皮制作，拍卖行有售。它唯一的供应商是暗月马戏团的{npc:14860}，而 Forever 目前尚未开放马戏团：只有马戏团来到城里时才去那里。",
	["Leatherworkers make the {item:7371}; the bow and gun vendors of {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and the {zone:1458} sell it. Otherwise buy one at the Auction House."] = "{item:7371}由制皮制作；{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1458}的弓与枪供应商有售。否则就在拍卖行买一个。",
	["Neutral to Friendly"] = "中立到友善",
	["Profession recipes at Friendly and Honored"] = "友善与尊敬时的专业配方",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered opens the {item:284664}, the Minimule pet (1,500 Favor from {npc:256389} or {npc:256384}). Exalted is 21000 more: 280 Journeyman writs, 168 Expert, 105 Artisan, or 420 crate returns (6,300 Favor). Keep 6,000 Favor for the {npc:10636} if you want it."] = "崇敬解锁{item:284664}，即迷你骡宠物（在{npc:256389}或{npc:256384}处以1500点恩惠购买）。到崇拜还需21000点：280份中级令状、168份高级令状、105份大师级令状，或交还420个板条箱（6300点恩惠）。如果想要{npc:10636}，请留出6000点恩惠。",
	["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
	["Supply Factions Reputation"] = "补给阵营声望",
	["Take the quests of the writs you can fill"] = "接取你能完成的令状任务",
	["The {faction:2586} camp is at {area:1002}, where the roads from {zone:1429}, {zone:1431} and {area:69} meet in western Redridge. The label pays 2000 reputation once (and, by beta reports, 50 Merchant's Favor): two thirds of the way to Friendly. Filled crates go to {npc:256390} too, but they pay only Merchant's Favor and silver, never reputation."] = "{faction:2586}的营地在{area:1002}，即赤脊山西部{zone:1429}、{zone:1431}和{area:69}的道路交汇处。该标签一次性给2000点声望（据测试服报告，还有50点商人的恩惠）：相当于到友善的三分之二。装满的板条箱也交给{npc:256390}，但只给商人的恩惠和银币，从不给声望。",
	["The {faction:2587} camp stands just outside the west gate of the {area:380}. The label pays 2000 reputation once (and, by beta reports, 50 Merchant's Favor): two thirds of the way to Friendly. Filled crates go to {npc:256386} too, but they pay only Merchant's Favor and silver, never reputation."] = "{faction:2587}的营地就在{area:380}西门外。该标签一次性给2000点声望（据测试服报告，还有50点商人的恩惠）：相当于到友善的三分之二。装满的板条箱也交给{npc:256386}，但只给商人的恩惠和银币，从不给声望。",
	["Your first {item:248549} or writ"] = "你的第一个{item:248549}或令状",
	["bring it: craft it or buy it at the Auction House"] = "带上它：自己制作或在拍卖行购买",
	["{area:1002}: the {quest:98247}"] = "{area:1002}：{quest:98247}",
	["{area:35} holds three customers: \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley (on the inn's top floor), {npc:7853} at the zeppelin-style transporter pad and {npc:2663}. {npc:14508} stands about 800 yards south of {object:3202}, by the {area:1741}; {npc:261961} is in northern Stranglethorn. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{area:35}有三位顾客：旅店顶楼的“海狼”麦金利、飞艇式传送平台旁的{npc:7853}，以及{npc:2663}。{npc:14508}站在{object:3202}以南约800码的{area:1741}旁；{npc:261961}在荆棘谷北部。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{area:35} holds three customers: \"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley (on the inn's top floor), {npc:7853}, the goblin transporter's engineer, and {npc:2663}. {npc:14508} stands at the {area:1741}, about 800 yards south of {object:3202}; {npc:261961} is in northern Stranglethorn. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{area:35}有三位顾客：旅店顶楼的“海狼”麦金利、地精传送器的工程师{npc:7853}，以及{npc:2663}。{npc:14508}站在{area:1741}，位于{object:3202}以南约800码；{npc:261961}在荆棘谷北部。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{area:380} camp: the {quest:98248}"] = "{area:380}营地：{quest:98248}",
