	["{npc:257281} and {npc:257282} are close together in the south-west of the mountains; Syndicate thugs roam around {npc:257282}. {npc:6176} stands on the eastern edge, above {area:272}. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{npc:257281}和{npc:257282}彼此靠近，位于山脉西南部；辛迪加暴徒在{npc:257282}周围游荡。{npc:6176}站在东部边缘、{area:272}上方。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{npc:257296} is about 250 yards south of {area:320}, {npc:257304} about 700 yards north-west of it. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{npc:257296}在{area:320}以南约250码，{npc:257304}在其西北约700码。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{npc:261932} and {npc:3536} are in the east of the foothills; the {npc:261928} hangs in a spider cocoon about 500 yards south-east of {area:271}. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{npc:261932}和{npc:3536}在山麓东部；{npc:261928}挂在{area:271}东南约500码的蜘蛛茧里。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{npc:2921} works about 550 yards east of {area:340}. He is the only Expert customer Polestar's data knows."] = "{npc:2921}在{area:340}以东约550码工作。他是 Polestar 数据中唯一的高级顾客。",
	["{npc:3134} stands about 450 yards north of {area:42}, by the road. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{npc:3134}站在{area:42}以北约450码的路边。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{npc:3134} stands about 450 yards north of {area:42}. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{npc:3134}站在{area:42}以北约450码。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{npc:4201} has a small hut about 550 yards east of {area:460}. Four Journeyman writs go to him. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{npc:4201}在{area:460}以东约550码处有一间小屋。有四份中级令状要交给他。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{npc:8305} stands about 600 yards south of {area:205}. Five Journeyman writs go to him: the most of any customer. Customers show no quest mark: right-click them anyway."] = "{npc:8305}站在{area:205}以南约600码。有五份中级令状要交给他：是所有顾客中最多的。顾客不显示任务标记：照样右键点击他们。",
	["{quest:93862}: 50 reputation"] = "{quest:93862}：50点声望",
