G["forever/class/druid/bear-form"] = {
	["Cast {spell:18960}: it lands you beside the building where {npc:11802} stands upstairs, in {area:2361}. Learn the {area:493} flight path while you are here (Faustron for the Horde, south-west of the lake; {npc:10897} for the Alliance, south of it)."] = "施放{spell:18960}：你会落在{npc:11802}所在建筑旁，他在楼上，位于{area:2361}。趁在这里，顺便学会{area:493}的飞行航线（部落去湖西南的Faustron；联盟去湖南边的{npc:10897}）。",
	["Cast {spell:18960}: it lands you beside the building where {npc:11802} stands upstairs, past the armor vendor. The {quest:5929} sits in the woods to the north-west. Speak to it and go through all of its words (what it represents, the strength of the body, the strength of the heart, then ask for its blessing): the talk is the objective, there is no fight. It blends into the ground, has no quest mark and gives off a faint blue-grey glow by a group of three trees: from {area:2361} go west along the foot of the northern mountains, through the gap between the trees and the hills. If {npc:11802} is missing when you return, step outside and cast {spell:18960} again. Learn the {area:493} flight path ({npc:10897}, south of the lake) for later, then take {npc:11800}'s flight from the middle of {area:2361}: she flies druids straight to {area:702}, no flight path needed. Take the portal up to {zone:1457}."] = "施放{spell:18960}：你会落在{npc:11802}所在建筑旁，他在楼上，走过护甲商人就是。{quest:5929}位于西北方的树林中。与它交谈，听它把话说完（它代表什么、肉体的力量、心灵的力量，然后请求它的祝福）：对话本身就是目标，没有战斗。它融入地面，没有任务标记，在三棵树旁发出微弱的蓝灰色光：从{area:2361}沿北面山脉的山脚向西，穿过树木与丘陵之间的缺口。回来时若{npc:11802}不见了，走到门外再次施放{spell:18960}。先学会{area:493}的飞行航线（{npc:10897}，在湖的南边）以备后用，然后乘坐{npc:11800}的航班，从{area:2361}中央出发：她直接载德鲁伊飞往{area:702}，无需飞行航线。乘传送门前往{zone:1457}。",
	["Cast {spell:18960}: it lands you beside the building where {npc:11802} stands upstairs. The {quest:5930} sits in the woods to the north-west. Speak to it and go through all of its words (what it represents, the strength of the body, the strength of the heart, then ask for its blessing): the talk is the objective, there is no fight. It blends into the ground, has no quest mark and gives off a faint blue-grey glow by a group of three trees: from {area:2361} go west along the foot of the northern mountains, through the gap between the trees and the hills. If {npc:11802} is missing when you return, step outside and cast {spell:18960} again. Learn the {quest:5922} flight path (Faustron, south-west of the lake); {npc:11798} in {area:2361} flies druids to {area:1638}."] = "施放{spell:18960}：你会落在{npc:11802}所在建筑旁，他在楼上。{quest:5930}位于西北方的树林中。与它交谈，听它把话说完（它代表什么、肉体的力量、心灵的力量，然后请求它的祝福）：对话本身就是目标，没有战斗。它融入地面，没有任务标记，在三棵树旁发出微弱的蓝灰色光：从{area:2361}沿北面山脉的山脚向西，穿过树木与丘陵之间的缺口。回来时若{npc:11802}不见了，走到门外再次施放{spell:18960}。学会{quest:5922}的飞行航线（Faustron，在湖的西南边）；{area:2361}里的{npc:11798}会载德鲁伊飞往{area:1638}。",
	["Druid"] = "德鲁伊",
	["Fly from {area:702} to {area:442}. The {object:177525} stands inside the nearest moonkin cave east of the village: the northern of two small rock-pile caves where the {area:442} road meets the main north-south road. Moonkin (level 11-13) stand outside, the cave is empty: slip past them. Use the {item:15208} by the stone: Lunaclaw (level 12-13) walks in towards you and stays three minutes. Kill her, then speak to the {npc:12144} that appears and ask for the strength of her body and heart: the talk is the credit. Another druid's Lunaclaw gives you the spirit too."] = "从{area:702}飞往{area:442}。{object:177525}立在村子东边最近的枭兽洞穴里：那是两处小石堆洞穴的北面一个，就在{area:442}道路与南北主路的交汇处。枭兽（11-13级）守在外边，洞穴里没有人：绕过它们。在石旁使用{item:15208}：月爪（12-13级）会朝你走来，停留三分钟。杀死她，然后与出现的{npc:12144}交谈，讨要她身体与心灵的力量：对话即算完成。其他德鲁伊的月爪也能给你那份精魂。",
	["The Skyborne Portal takes you to {zone:1453}. {npc:5504} is the city's druid trainer (the arrow points at him); he teaches you {spell:18960} with the next quest (it stays in your spellbook, Balance tab)."] = "天裔传送门会把你送到{zone:1453}。{npc:5504}是该城的德鲁伊训练师（箭头指向他）；他会随下一个任务教你{spell:18960}（该法术会留在法术书中，平衡页签）。",
	["The {object:177525} stands in the {zone:1413} just south-west of {area:378}, by the road out of {zone:1412}. Level 20 Thunderheads roam close by: clear the way first. Use the {item:15710} by the stone: Lunaclaw (level 12-13) appears for three minutes. Kill her, then speak to the {npc:12144} that appears and ask for the strength of her body and heart: the talk is the credit. Die in the fight? Lunaclaw stays by the stone: run back and finish her."] = "{object:177525}立在{zone:1413}，就在{area:378}西南，位于离开{zone:1412}的路上。20级的Thunderheads在附近游荡：先把路清干净。在石旁使用{item:15710}：月爪（12-13级）会现身三分钟。杀死她，然后与出现的{npc:12144}交谈，讨要她身体与心灵的力量：对话即算完成。战斗里死了？月爪仍守在石旁：跑回去把她了结。",
	["Ur'endra"] = "乌伦德拉",
	["{npc:255853} waits by the waterfall below the {area:16629}, north-east of {area:16638}. {npc:258443} (the bear you must defeat) lairs in an unmarked cave high on the cliff face west of him, where the {area:16623} meet the {area:16626}: take the path west out of {area:16638} (not north), cross the river on the log bridge and reach the cave from the cliff's upper, northern side. The cave at the foot of the cliffs and the foggy cave are the wrong ones."] = "{npc:255853}在{area:16629}下方的瀑布旁等候，位于{area:16638}东北。{npc:258443}（你必须击败的那头熊）巢居在他西面崖壁高处的无标记洞穴里，就在{area:16623}与{area:16626}交界处：从{area:16638}沿向西的小路走（不是向北），过河上的木桥，从崖壁上侧、北面接近洞穴。崖脚的洞穴和雾中的洞穴都不是。",
	["{npc:3033} stands in the druids' hut on {area:1639}, over the rope bridges east of the lifts. He teaches you {spell:18960} with the quest (it stays in your spellbook, Balance tab)."] = "{npc:3033}站在{area:1639}的德鲁伊小屋中，走过升降梯东边的绳索桥就到。他会随任务教你{spell:18960}（该法术会留在法术书中，平衡页签）。",
	["{npc:3033} trains druids in the druids' hut on {area:1639}, over the rope bridges east of the lifts. He teaches you {spell:18960} with the next quest (it stays in your spellbook, Balance tab)."] = "{npc:3033}在{area:1639}的德鲁伊小屋中训练德鲁伊，走过升降梯东边的绳索桥就到。他会随下一个任务教你{spell:18960}（该法术会留在法术书中，平衡页签）。",
	["{npc:4217} stands upstairs in the druids' building of the {area:1658}. He teaches you {spell:18960} with the quest (it stays in your spellbook, Balance tab)."] = "{npc:4217}站在{area:1658}德鲁伊建筑的上层。他会随任务教你{spell:18960}（该法术会留在法术书中，平衡页签）。",
}

G["forever/class/priest/blood-of-morphaz"] = {
	["17,060 XP and 1g55s at 50: {zone:1447}, then Morphaz in the {area:1417} (group of 5). The item choice may be gone."] = "50级时可得17,060经验和1金55银：先到{zone:1447}，再进{area:1417}杀莫法兹（5人队伍）。物品选择可能已经取消。",
	["17,060 experience and 1 gold 55 silver"] = "17,060经验和1金55银",
	["At 50 in {zone:1455}, {npc:11406} in the {object:32386} ({object:32362}) offers {quest:8254}. Before you leave a city, buy an {item:7972} at the Auction House (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely."] = "50级时在{zone:1455}，{object:32386}（{object:32362}）里的{npc:11406}会提供{quest:8254}。离开城市前，先在拍卖行买一个{item:7972}（几个银币）：第三个任务要一个，而且它掉落率极低。",
	["At 50, {npc:5489} at the altar of {zone:1453}'s Cathedral of Light offers {quest:8254} ({npc:11406} in {zone:1455} has it too). Before you leave, buy an {item:7972} at the Auction House in the {object:2096} (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely."] = "50级时，{zone:1453}光明大教堂祭坛旁的{npc:5489}提供{quest:8254}（{zone:1455}的{npc:11406}也有）。离开前，先在{object:2096}的拍卖行买一个{item:7972}（几个银币）：第三个任务要一个，而且它掉落率极低。",
	["At 50, {npc:6018} in {zone:1454}'s {object:172961} offers {quest:8254}. Before you leave, buy an {item:7972} at the Auction House (a few silver): the third quest asks for one and it drops rarely."] = "50级时，{zone:1454}{object:172961}里的{npc:6018}提供{quest:8254}。离开前，先在拍卖行买一个{item:7972}（几个银币）：第三个任务要一个，而且它掉落率极低。",
	["Carrying an {item:7972} already? It counts at once. Otherwise any undead may drop one, rarely: the {npc:7864} (level 48) in the {area:1221} below {npc:8405}'s cliff drop it about one kill in ten, the highborne ghosts on {zone:1447}'s border with {zone:1440} (level 45-46) a little less, the Anguished and {npc:7523} in {zone:1452} (54-55) about one in eight. The Auction House is usually quicker."] = "身上已经带着{item:7972}？会立即计入。否则任何亡灵都可能极罕见地掉落一个：{npc:8405}崖下的{area:1221}中，{npc:7864}（48级）约十杀掉一个；{zone:1447}与{zone:1440}交界处的上层精灵鬼魂（45-46级）略低一些；{zone:1452}里的痛苦者与{npc:7523}（54-55级）约八分之一。拍卖行通常更快。",
	["Morphaz is a level 52 elite green dragon inside the {area:1417}, a five-player dungeon: bring a group of five (a level 60 group clears it with ease). Horde: fly to {area:75}; Alliance: fly to {area:1438} in the {zone:1419} and ride north. The temple stands in the middle of the {area:74}: climb the steps on its south side, swim down through the flooded hall and take the stairs to the portal. Inside, Morphaz only appears late: kill the six troll minibosses on the upper balconies, then {npc:5710} below them; that wakes the drakes Weaver and Dreamscythe in the Pit of Sacrifice, and killing both brings Morphaz and Hazzas. The pair patrols together and cannot be split: pull them into a hallway and have the tank face them away from the group (breath and a knockback). Loot him in a party, not a raid group: the blood always drops."] = "莫法兹是{area:1417}内的52级精英绿龙，那是5人副本：带上五人队伍（60级队伍可以轻松清掉）。部落：飞到{area:75}；联盟：飞到{zone:1419}的{area:1438}，然后向北骑行。神庙立在{area:74}中部：从南侧台阶上去，游过淹水大厅，再走楼梯到传送门。里面，莫法兹很晚才出现：先杀上层露台上的六个巨魔小首领，再杀下方的{npc:5710}；这惊醒了献祭之池的龙类韦弗与梦镰，杀掉两者就会引出莫法兹和哈扎斯。这两条龙一起巡逻，无法分开：把它们拉进走廊，让坦克背对队伍（它们有吐息和击退）。用小队而不是团队拾取：血液必定掉落。",
	["Mosshoof Coursers (level 52-53, not elite) graze all over {zone:1447}, thickest north-east of {npc:8405} and south of the mountains; about one in three drops a {item:20027}, so plan on a dozen kills for four. They enrage at 30% health: finish them fast. Killing them costs no Cenarion Circle reputation. Keep any {item:7972} you loot."] = "苔蹄骏马（52-53级，非精英）遍布{zone:1447}，{npc:8405}东北和山脉以南最密集；约三杀掉一个{item:20027}，所以四块大概要杀十几个。它们在血量30%时会狂暴：快点解决。杀它们不损失塞纳里奥议会声望。拾到的{item:7972}都留着。",
	["Priest"] = "牧师",
	["{npc:10922} is at the {area:2479} in southern {zone:1448}. Horde: fly to {area:1997} and ride south-east; Alliance: fly to {area:415} in {zone:1440} and ride north into {zone:1448}. She takes the blood for experience and gold. Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic let you pick {item:19990}, {item:20006} or Woestave, and Forever's notes say that choice may be gone."] = "{npc:10922}在{zone:1448}南部的{area:2479}。部落：飞到{area:1997}，然后向东南骑行；联盟：飞到{zone:1440}的{area:415}，再向北进入{zone:1448}。她会收下血液，给你经验和金币。交任务前先看清奖励窗口：经典旧世让你选{item:19990}、{item:20006}或Woestave，而Forever的说明称那个选项可能已经没有了。",
	["{npc:8405}, a furbolg, lives on the clifftop north-east of the {area:1221}. Alliance: fly to {area:3137}; Horde: fly to {area:1237}. Ride east and leave the road at the fork before the ruins, then follow the northern cliff edge east to him: the naga ruins and the beach below are walled in by cliffs with no way up."] = "{npc:8405}是个熊怪，住在{area:1221}东北的崖顶。联盟：飞到{area:3137}；部落：飞到{area:1237}。向东骑行，在废墟前的岔路离开道路，然后沿北面崖边向东走到他那里：下方的纳迦废墟和海滩被峭壁围住，无路可上。",
}

G["forever/class/warrior/whirlwind-weapon"] = {
	["At 30, {npc:5479}, beside {npc:5480} in the warrior trainers' building of {object:2100}, sends you to {npc:6236} on {area:720} in the {zone:1413}."] = "30级时，{object:2100}战士训练师建筑里的{npc:5479}（{npc:5480}旁边）会派你去找{zone:1413}中{area:720}上的{npc:6236}。",
	["Back to {npc:6176}. Accepting {quest:1713} starts his ritual, and {quest:1712} appears just north of his camp. {quest:1712} is elite (level 40): grouping up is encouraged; it needs a group of two or three around level 40. It deals nature damage (a {item:6052} soaks it), whirls, and {spell:10101} throws you far while it heals itself as you run back: fight with your back to a slope or rock. The {item:6894} always drops. If the fight fails {npc:6176} stops answering: abandon {quest:1713} and take it again for a new summon; the earlier items are not needed again."] = "回到{npc:6176}。接受{quest:1713}会启动他的仪式，{quest:1712}会出现在他营地正北。{quest:1712}是精英（40级）：建议组队；需要两到三个40级左右的队友。它造成自然伤害（{item:6052}可以扛住），会旋风斩，而{spell:10101}会把你远远击飞，同时它在你跑回来时自愈：背靠斜坡或岩石作战。{item:6894}必定掉落。如果战斗失败，{npc:6176}就不再搭理你：放弃{quest:1713}重新接取，可重新召唤；之前的物品不必再准备。",
	["Big Will"] = "大个子威尔",
	["Bloodscalp Tusks"] = "血顶獠牙",
	["Cyclonian"] = "塞克罗尼安",
	["Fly to {area:392} and go south along the {area:391}. {area:720} lies offshore to the south-east: wade across on the shallow sand bar; off it the water is deep and fatigue sets in. {npc:6236} stands by the arena."] = "飞到{area:392}，沿{area:391}向南。{area:720}在东南方的近海：从浅沙滩上涉水过去；离岸后水很深，会陷入疲劳。{npc:6236}站在竞技场旁。",
	["Put the 24 charms into {object:89931}: it hands you the {quest:1714}."] = "把24个护符放进{object:89931}：它会给你{quest:1714}。",
	["The cauldron wants 8 of each charm, 24 in all, and each exile drops its charm about one kill in three, so plan on some 70 kills. All are level 38-39, not elite, and hit hard at 30-33: bring a friend or come at 35 or more. Burning Exiles (fire) by the {area:334} in the north-west, north-west of {area:320}; Thundering Exiles (air) by the {area:336} south-east of {area:320}, casting {spell:403} from 40 yards; Cresting Exiles (water) by the {area:333}, north-west of {area:321}, with {spell:122}. About a dozen of each, back in under 7 minutes. The charms trade and sell on the auction house; using one banishes another kind of exile for a while (Burning on Thundering, Thundering on Cresting, Cresting on Burning)."] = "大锅要每种护符8个，共24个，而每种流放者约三杀掉一个护符，所以预计要杀70个左右。它们都是38-39级、非精英，但对30-33级的人来说打得很疼：带上同伴，或者35级以上再来。燃烧的流放者（火）在西北{area:334}旁、{area:320}西北；雷鸣的流放者（风）在{area:320}东南{area:336}旁，从40码外施放{spell:403}；波涛的流放者（水）在{area:321}西北{area:333}旁，会{spell:122}。每种约十几个，7分钟内能回来。护符可在拍卖行交易出售；使用一个会暂时驱逐另一种流放者（燃烧驱雷鸣、雷鸣驱波涛、波涛驱燃烧）。",
	["Warrior"] = "战士",
	["You have 10 minutes. Eat and drink to full, then step onto the grate in the middle of the crowd: {npc:6248} announces the challengers (level 26-27), who come one at a time, 15-20 seconds apart, and only while you stand near the grate. After each kill, step off the grate to eat or bandage; step back on when ready for the next. Six of them, then {npc:6238} (level 33, not elite) walks out; he stays neutral until you attack him, so bandage or eat first. Do not use {spell:1160}: it sends the challengers running and more of them pile in at once. If nothing starts, step off and on the grate again, or abandon the quest and take it again."] = "你有10分钟。先吃喝补满，然后踏上人群中央的铁栅：{npc:6248}会宣布挑战者（26-27级）出场，他们一次来一个，间隔15-20秒，而且只在你站在铁栅附近时才来。每杀一个就离开铁栅去吃喝或包扎；准备好下一个再踏回去。六个之后，{npc:6238}（33级，非精英）会走出来；在你攻击他之前他一直保持中立，所以先包扎或吃喝。不要用{spell:1160}：它会把挑战者吓跑，让更多人同时涌上来。如果什么都没开始，就离开铁栅再踏回去，或者放弃任务重新接。",
	["You need 30 tusks. Every Bloodscalp troll (level 33-37) of north-west Stranglethorn drops one about one kill in three, so plan on some 80 kills: the camps and ruins north and north-west of {area:117} and around the {area:123} on the coast. They enrage below 30% health and the Warriors disarm; back in 5 minutes."] = "你需要30根獠牙。荆棘谷西北部的每个血顶巨魔（33-37级）约三杀掉一根，所以预计要杀80个左右：{area:117}以北和西北的营地与废墟，以及海岸{area:123}周围。它们在血量低于30%时会狂暴，战士会缴械；5分钟内能回来。",
	["You need 8 {item:3357}. Herbalists pick it by rivers and lakes in the {zone:1437}, {zone:1417} and {zone:1434}; otherwise the auction house. Herb vendors keep only one at a time and restock every two hours: {npc:1302} and {npc:1313} in {zone:1453}, {npc:844} on the road in eastern Elwynn, Jeeda at {area:460} in Stonetalon, Montarr in {zone:1441}. Kurzen Medicine Men in northern Stranglethorn drop one about one kill in twelve."] = "你需要8个{item:3357}。草药师在{zone:1437}、{zone:1417}和{zone:1434}的河湖边采集；否则就去拍卖行。草药商每次只备一个，每两小时补货：{zone:1453}的{npc:1302}和{npc:1313}、艾尔文森林东部路上的{npc:844}、石爪山脉{area:460}的Jeeda、{zone:1441}的Montarr。荆棘谷北部的库尔森药剂师约十二杀掉一个。",
	["{item:4479}, from Burning Exiles"] = "{item:4479}，来自燃烧的流放者",
	["{item:4480}, from Thundering Exiles"] = "{item:4480}，来自雷鸣的流放者",
	["{item:4481}, from Cresting Exiles"] = "{item:4481}，来自波涛的流放者",
	["{item:6894}, from {quest:1712}"] = "{item:6894}，来自{quest:1712}",
	["{npc:6176} camps by ruins on the east bank of the river that runs past {area:272}, a short walk north-east of the town, just over the border in {zone:1416}; his cauldron stands beside him. Horde: fly to {area:272}. Alliance: fly to {area:271} and go north along the river; {area:272}'s guards are level 42 elites, so keep away from the town. Accepting {quest:1712} gives you {item:6929}, the list of what he needs: 8 {item:3357}, 30 Bloodscalp Tusks and the {quest:1714} from his cauldron. Click the cauldron for that quest."] = "{npc:6176}在{area:272}旁那条河的东岸废墟边扎营，从镇子向东北走一小段，就在{zone:1416}边境那侧；他的大锅就在他身边。部落：飞到{area:272}。联盟：飞到{area:271}，沿河向北；{area:272}的卫兵是42级精英，所以离镇子远点。接受{quest:1712}会给你{item:6929}，上面列着他要的东西：8个{item:3357}、30根血顶獠牙，以及他大锅给的{quest:1714}。点击大锅接取那个任务。",
	["{npc:6176}: {item:6975}, Sword or Warhammer"] = "{npc:6176}：{item:6975}，剑或战锤",
	["{quest:1714}, from the cauldron by {npc:6176}"] = "{quest:1714}，来自{npc:6176}旁的大锅",
	["{spell:2458} at 30 and a {spell:1680} axe, sword or warhammer at 40."] = "30级学{spell:2458}，40级学{spell:1680}，用斧、剑或战锤。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/swift-galestrider"] = {
	["Any race can buy Galestriders, but riding one also takes {spell:1285849}, which only the Skyborne get with {skill:762}. Other races can learn it too, but how is not known yet: in Classic another race's riding needed Exalted with its home faction, here the High Order (Alliance) or the Windshapers (Horde). Ask {npc:265756} before you buy."] = "任何种族都能买风行者，但骑乘还需要{spell:1285849}，只有天裔在{skill:762}中才能获得。其他种族也能学，但方法尚不清楚：经典旧世中，其他种族骑乘需要与所属阵营达到崇拜，这里则是高等议会（联盟）或风塑者（部落）。购买前先问问{npc:265756}。",
	["Journeyman {skill:762} with {npc:265756}"] = "向{npc:265756}学习中级{skill:762}",
	["Skyborne train Journeyman {skill:762} with {npc:265756} himself for 1,000g; Blizzard says it comes with a mount. He stands at the {area:17684} in {area:16638}, near the skyboat docks."] = "天裔在{npc:265756}本人那里花1,000金训练中级{skill:762}；暴雪说会附赠一匹坐骑。他站在{area:16638}的{area:17684}，靠近飞船码头。",
	["Swift Galestriders need level 60 and Journeyman {skill:762}. Train it at your own race's riding trainer; see the Level 60 mount guides for where."] = "迅捷风行者需要60级和中级{skill:762}。到自己种族的骑术训练师处学习；具体位置见60级坐骑指南。",
	["{npc:265756} is at the {area:17684} in {area:16638}, the island's harbour town, near the skyboat docks. The Forever client lists each Swift Galestrider at 200g; choose one."] = "{npc:265756}在{area:16638}的{area:17684}，那是岛上的港口镇，靠近飞船码头。Forever客户端标价每匹迅捷风行者200金；挑一匹吧。",
	["{npc:265756}, riding trainer"] = "{npc:265756}，骑术训练师",
	["{spell:1285849} for other races"] = "其他种族学{spell:1285849}",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/siamese-cat"] = {
	["{area:1581} is a group of five under {area:20}: the mine mouth is in {area:20}, the instance portal deep inside the mine. Cookie, the murloc cook, waits on a small island under the pirate ship at the far end, an optional boss; his cooking heals him, so interrupt it. He drops the Siamese about 15% of the time in Classic's data: expect several runs. The carrier can be traded, so check the Auction House too."] = "{area:1581}是{area:20}下方的5人副本：矿洞入口在{area:20}，副本传送门在矿洞深处。鱼人厨师曲奇守在尽头海盗船下的小岛上，是可选首领；他的烹饪会治疗他，所以要打断。按经典旧世的数据，他约15%几率掉落暹罗猫：预计要刷好几次。装猫的笼子可以交易，所以也去拍卖行看看。",
	["{area:1581}, in the {area:20} mine"] = "{area:1581}，在{area:20}的矿洞内",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/spectral-bear-cub"] = {
	["Legacy Points are account-wide: each Legacy Challenge (a class reaching 25, 45 and 60, a crafting profession at 150, 225 and 300, PvP ranks and battleground reputations, exploring, dungeons and raids) is worth one, and the track counts points earned, not spent. It gives the {item:281060} at 15, the {item:277714} at 25, the {item:277717} at 40 and the {item:277718} at 55. The rewards are claimed as quests from {npc:6791} in the inn at {area:392}, the goblin port on the {zone:1413} coast (Alliance players come by the boat from {area:35}): with 25 points he offers {quest:96383}; hand it straight back for the cub."] = "传承点数是账号通用的：每个传承挑战（一个职业达到25、45和60级，一门制造专业达到150、225和300，PvP军衔与战场声望，探索、地下城和团队副本）值一点，而进度只算赚到的点数，不算花掉的。它在15点时给{item:281060}，25点时给{item:277714}，40点时给{item:277717}，55点时给{item:277718}。奖励以任务形式从{area:392}旅店里的{npc:6791}处领取，那是{zone:1413}海岸的地精港口（联盟玩家从{area:35}坐船过来）：有25点时他会提供{quest:96383}；直接交回去就能拿到熊崽。",
	["Without PvP one character can earn 17 points: its class at 25, 45 and 60, two professions to 300, the two adventure challenges, the three dungeon tiers and the three raids. A second class or more professions on an alt make up the rest; the Legacy Challenges guide plans them."] = "不碰PvP的话，一个角色能赚17点：职业到25、45和60级，两门专业到300，两个冒险挑战，三个地下城层级和三个团队副本。第二个职业或小号上的更多专业来凑齐其余部分；传承挑战指南会帮你规划。",
	["{npc:6791} in {area:392}"] = "在{area:392}的{npc:6791}",
}

G["forever/miscellaneous/library-books"] = {
	["At {area:118}, the dig in the middle of the {zone:1437}."] = "在{area:118}，{zone:1437}中部的挖掘场。",
	["At {area:233}, the mage village in south-eastern Silverpine."] = "在{area:233}，银松森林东南部的法师村。",
	["Beside a tent entrance in the troll village in south-eastern Arathi."] = "阿拉希东南部巨魔村庄的一座帐篷入口旁。",
	["Cave mouth at {area:387}"] = "{area:387}的洞口",
	["Down the stairs at the {area:443} in northern {zone:1439}."] = "在{zone:1439}北部的{area:443}，沿楼梯下去。",
	["Eight more books lie in level 55-60 zones; the mage trainers beside the librarians take them, not the librarians. {item:228141} lies on a table in the ruined keep on {area:2298}, above {area:2057} (outside the dungeon); {item:228132} at {area:199}."] = "还有八本书在55-60级区域；收书的是图书馆员旁的法师训练师，不是图书馆员。{item:228141}在{area:2298}废弃城堡的一张桌子上，{area:2057}上方（副本外）；{item:228132}在{area:199}。",
	["From level 20, with 20 different books handed in, {npc:211033} offers {quest:79536}: {item:281634} or {item:281635}."] = "从20级起，交满20种不同的书后，{npc:211033}会提供{quest:79536}：{item:281634}或{item:281635}。",
	["From level 35, with 25 different books handed in, {npc:211033} offers the second {quest:82208}: {item:277254}, {item:277258} or {item:277260} (level 40 to equip)."] = "从35级起，交满25种不同的书后，{npc:211033}会提供第二个{quest:82208}：{item:277254}、{item:277258}或{item:277260}（40级可装备）。",
	["Halfway up the {area:91}, east of {area:87}. Nothing hostile inside."] = "{area:91}半山腰，{area:87}以东。里面没有敌人。",
	["Hand in the books so far. {npc:211022} keeps the library in the {object:36082}. He offers each book's quest while the book is in your bags: take it and hand it in, one at a time, so your quest log stays free. Skip the books you did not find."] = "把目前找到的书交掉。{npc:211022}在{object:36082}里管理图书馆。书在你背包里时，他会给出对应的任务：一次接一个、交一个，这样任务日志不会占满。没找到的书就跳过。",
	["Hand in the books so far. {npc:211033} keeps the library at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum in the {object:2101}. He offers each book's quest while the book is in your bags: take it and hand it in, one at a time, so your quest log stays free. Skip the books you did not find."] = "把目前找到的书交掉。{npc:211033}在{object:2101}巫师圣殿顶层管理图书馆。书在你背包里时，他会给出对应的任务：一次接一个、交一个，这样任务日志不会占满。没找到的书就跳过。",
	["Hand in this part's books. {npc:211022} keeps the library in the {object:36082}. He offers each book's quest while the book is in your bags: take it and hand it in, one at a time, so your quest log stays free. Skip the books you did not find."] = "把这一部分的书交掉。{npc:211022}在{object:36082}里管理图书馆。书在你背包里时，他会给出对应的任务：一次接一个、交一个，这样任务日志不会占满。没找到的书就跳过。",
	["Hand in this part's books. {npc:211033} keeps the library at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum in the {object:2101}. He offers each book's quest while the book is in your bags: take it and hand it in, one at a time, so your quest log stays free. Skip the books you did not find."] = "把这一部分的书交掉。{npc:211033}在{object:2101}巫师圣殿顶层管理图书馆。书在你背包里时，他会给出对应的任务：一次接一个、交一个，这样任务日志不会占满。没找到的书就跳过。",
	["In the troll ruins of {area:353}, in the south of the {zone:1425}."] = "在{zone:1425}南部的{area:353}巨魔废墟内。",
	["Inside a crypt near the middle of the zone, reached from the path to its south."] = "区域中部的一座陵墓内，从南面的小路进去。",
	["Inside a hut on the {area:2097} mesa."] = "在{area:2097}台地的一座小屋内。",
	["Inside the first tower of the ogre fort at {area:1357}, in the middle of the zone."] = "区域中部{area:1357}食人魔堡垒的第一座塔内。",
	["Inside {area:254}, not in a dungeon: the book lies on the altar in {npc:8888}'s tomb, near {npc:14387}. The waypoint marks the mountain."] = "在{area:254}内，不在副本里：书放在{npc:8888}陵墓的祭坛上，{npc:14387}附近。路径点标的是那座山。",
	["Level 60 books: {area:1769}"] = "60级书籍：{area:1769}",
	["Level 60 books: {area:2255}"] = "60级书籍：{area:2255}",
	["Level 60 books: {area:254}"] = "60级书籍：{area:254}",
	["Level 60 books: {zone:1422}"] = "60级书籍：{zone:1422}",
	["Level 60 books: {zone:1423}"] = "60级书籍：{zone:1423}",
	["Lost books and scrolls all over the world: each pays experience at the library, and 10, 20 and 25 of them earn a necklace, a ring and an off-hand."] = "世界各地散落的失窃书籍与卷轴：每一本都能在图书馆换取经验，交满10、20和25本可得一条项链、一枚戒指和一件副手物品。",
	["On a barrel in a tent at {area:2537}, in the far south-east of the zone."] = "区域东南角{area:2537}帐篷里的桶上。",
	["On a bench beside the {area:310} entrance, in the middle of the zone."] = "区域中部{area:310}入口旁的长椅上。",
	["On a bookshelf in the middle building of the pirate camp on the eastern coast."] = "东海岸海盗营地中间建筑的书架上。",
	["On a crate in the {area:1236}, in the far west of {zone:1447}."] = "{zone:1447}最西边{area:1236}里的木箱上。",
	["On a shelf in {area:159}'s apothecary."] = "在{area:159}药剂店的架子上。",
	["On a table inside a tent near the middle of the zone."] = "区域中部附近一座帐篷内的桌子上。",
	["On the ground at the eastern side of the murloc camp in north-eastern Dustwallow."] = "尘泥沼泽东北部鱼人营地东侧的地面上。",
	["On the top walkway of the {area:1477}, outside the dungeon."] = "副本外{area:1477}的顶层走廊。",
	["Rumi of Gnomeregan"] = "诺莫瑞根的鲁米",
	["Scrolls in the Mo'grosh ogre cave in the north-east. The ogres in the cave are level 18-19 elites: grouping up is advised. (Rumi of Gnomeregan also lies in {area:144}, if you missed it at {area:108}.)"] = "卷轴在东北的莫格罗什食人魔洞穴里。洞里的食人魔是18-19级精英：建议组队。（《诺莫瑞根的鲁米》也放在{area:144}，如果你在{area:108}漏掉了它。）",
	["The Mural of Ta'zo is the stone tablet leaning against the wall in the {object:172961}, on the way to the mage trainers. Use it to take the book."] = "《塔佐的壁画》就是{object:172961}里靠墙立的石板，在去法师训练师的路上。点击它来领取那本书。",
	["The level 60 books: {npc:5497}"] = "60级书籍：{npc:5497}",
	["The level 60 books: {npc:7825}"] = "60级书籍：{npc:7825}",
	["The library: first books"] = "图书馆：第一批书",
	["The library: first books (Horde)"] = "图书馆：第一批书（部落）",
	["The library: second books"] = "图书馆：第二批书",
	["The library: second books (Horde)"] = "图书馆：第二批书（部落）",
	["The library: third books"] = "图书馆：第三批书",
	["The library: third books (Horde)"] = "图书馆：第三批书（部落）",
	["The scrolls lie underground, in the cave below {area:387} by the {area:718} entrance, not inside the dungeon. Go in at the cave mouth in the oasis and follow the cave down; the arrow points at the scrolls from the surface."] = "卷轴在地下，位于{area:387}下方、{area:718}入口旁的洞穴里，不在副本内。从绿洲的洞口进去，沿洞穴向下走；箭头会从地面指向卷轴。",
	["The second {quest:82208}"] = "第二个{quest:82208}",
	["The spellbook lies in the {area:2098}, the crypt in north-western {zone:1431}. Undead fill it; a corpse run works if you are low."] = "法术书在{area:2098}，即{zone:1431}西北的陵墓。里面全是亡灵；等级低就跑尸进去。",
	["The {area:718}' cave"] = "{area:718}的洞穴",
	["Two books: one in a house at {area:20}, one at {area:108} (Alliance only)."] = "两本书：一本在{area:20}的一间屋子里，一本在{area:108}（仅联盟）。",
	["Two books: the manual in the control room at the top of the oil rig at the {area:382}, and the Goblin Tome beside Gazlowe in {area:392}."] = "两本书：手册在{area:382}钻井平台顶部的控制室，地精典籍在{area:392}加兹鲁维旁边。",
	["With 10 different books handed in, the librarian offers {quest:78150}: a choice of two necklaces ({item:277203} or {item:277204}). Take it when it appears."] = "交满10种不同的书后，图书馆员会提供{quest:78150}：两条项链二选一（{item:277203}或{item:277204}）。出现时就接。",
	["{item:228133} lies inside {area:254}, in the mine passage towards {area:1584} beyond the {area:2717} quest giver. The waypoint marks the mountain."] = "{item:228133}在{area:254}内，位于{area:2717}任务发布者之后通往{area:1584}的矿道里。路径点标的是那座山。",
	["{item:228134} lies inside the {area:1769} tunnel between {zone:1448} and {zone:1452}."] = "{item:228134}在{zone:1448}与{zone:1452}之间{area:1769}通道内。",
	["{item:228135} is inside {area:2268}. {item:228138} lies at {area:2264}; other copies lie elsewhere in the zone (one by the {area:2279} gates), and you can take only one. {item:228140} is on a table in {area:2277}: wait for the patrolling elite to clear the creatures beside it and walk on."] = "{item:228135}在{area:2268}内。{item:228138}在{area:2264}；其他副本在区域别处（一处在{area:2279}大门旁），而你只能拿一本。{item:228140}在{area:2277}的一张桌子上：等巡逻精英把旁边的生物清掉，然后走过去。",
	["{item:228136} sits on a shelf behind the alchemy supplier in {area:2255}."] = "{item:228136}放在{area:2255}炼金供应商身后的架子上。",
	["{npc:5497}, the mage trainer beside {npc:211033} in the Wizard's Sanctum, takes the level 60 books: she offers each book's quest while the book is in your bags. Hand in {item:228132}, {item:228138} and {item:228140} the same way (their quests are not in Polestar's data yet)."] = "{npc:5497}是巫师圣殿里{npc:211033}旁的法师训练师，收60级的书：书在背包里时她会给出对应的任务。{item:228132}、{item:228138}和{item:228140}也照同样方式交（它们的任务还不在Polestar的数据里）。",
	["{npc:7825}, beside {npc:211022} in the {object:36082}, takes the level 60 books: each book's quest is offered while the book is in your bags. Take and hand them in one at a time (Polestar cannot track these quests for the Horde yet)."] = "{npc:7825}在{object:36082}里{npc:211022}旁边，收60级的书：书在背包里时会给出对应任务。一次接一个、交一个（Polestar还无法为部落追踪这些任务）。",
}

G["forever/professions/first-aid"] = {
	["Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:129} (character level 5, 1s); the arrow picks the nearest. Forever teaches {item:118} with it: {item:2447}, {item:2678} and an {item:3371}, orange to 55. With {skill:182} it can replace the Linen Bandages below."] = "本方阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师都教初级{skill:129}（角色5级，1银）；箭头会选最近的一位。Forever会同时教{item:118}：{item:2447}、{item:2678}和一个{item:3371}，55点前为橙色。配合{skill:182}，它可以替代下面的亚麻绷带。",
	["Artisan {skill:129} comes from the {quest:6622} quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the {skill:129} trainer in {zone:1454} sends you to the doctor in {area:321}. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and {item:14047} (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages."] = "大师级{skill:129}来自{quest:6622}任务。需要技能225和角色35级；{zone:1454}的{skill:129}训练师会派你去找{area:321}的医生。现在就带上魔纹布（约74匹）和{item:14047}（约65匹）用于225-300：绷带不需要火，所以你可以就在医生旁边做225-300，他会教大师级绷带。",
	["Artisan {skill:129} comes from the {quest:6624} quest. It needs skill 225 and level 35; the {skill:129} trainer in {zone:1455} sends you to the doctor in Theramore. Bring the Mageweave (about 74) and {item:14047} (about 65) for 225-300 now: bandages need no fire, so you craft 225-300 beside the doctor, who teaches the Artisan bandages."] = "大师级{skill:129}来自{quest:6624}任务。需要技能225和角色35级；{zone:1455}的{skill:129}训练师会派你去找塞拉摩的医生。现在就带上魔纹布（约74匹）和{item:14047}（约65匹）用于225-300：绷带不需要火，所以你可以就在医生旁边做225-300，他会教大师级绷带。",
	["Expert {skill:129} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and character level 20: it is a book, {item:16084} (1g); the arrow picks its nearest seller for your faction. Buy it and read it. The same vendor sells the Heavy Silk and {item:8544} manuals (22s and 50s): buy both now, you read them at 180 and 210."] = "高级{skill:129}把上限提到225；需要技能125和角色20级：它是一本书，{item:16084}（1金）；箭头会选本方阵营最近的卖家。买下并阅读。同一个商人还卖厚重丝绸绷带和{item:8544}手册（22银和50银）：现在把两本都买下，你会在180和210时读到它们。",
	["Journeyman {skill:129} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10: the arrow picks the nearest {skill:129} trainer of your faction; training costs 5s."] = "中级{skill:129}把上限提到150；需要技能50和角色10级：箭头会选本方阵营最近的{skill:129}训练师；训练费5银。",
	["{item:1251} (1-40)"] = "{item:1251}（1-40）",
	["{item:1251} is orange from 1 (yellow at 30, green at 45, grey at 60): about 41 crafts to 40. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. At 20 the trainer also teaches {item:279968} (1s; the Camping 101: {skill:129} quest at your starting area's camp teaches it free), Forever's camping item for {skill:129}: three Linen Bandages and a {item:159}; it gives a few points until 25."] = "{item:1251}从1点起为橙色（30点转黄、45点转绿、60点转灰）：做到40约需41次。绷带不需要火：随处可做。20级时训练师还会教{item:279968}（1银；起始区域营地的“露营入门：{skill:129}”任务可免费学到），这是Forever的{skill:129}露营物品：三条亚麻绷带和一个{item:159}；它一直能给几点直到25。",
	["{item:14529} (260-300)"] = "{item:14529}（260-300）",
	["{item:14529} is yellow from 260 (yellow at 260, green at 290, grey at 320): about 65 crafts to 300. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. {item:14529} turns green at 290, yet to 300 it takes about the same {item:14047} as switching to {item:14530} (the doctor teaches it at 290): one recipe is enough."] = "{item:14529}从260起为黄色（260黄、290绿、320灰）：到300约需65次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。{item:14529}在290转绿，但做到300所耗的{item:14047}与改用{item:14530}差不多（医生在290教它）：一个配方就够了。",
	["{item:2581} (40-50)"] = "{item:2581}（40-50）",
	["{item:2581} (50-80)"] = "{item:2581}（50-80）",
	["{item:2581} is orange from 40 (yellow at 50, green at 75, grey at 100): about 10 crafts to 50. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 40 for 1s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{item:2581}从40起为橙色（50黄、75绿、100灰）：到50约需10次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。本方阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师从技能40起教它，收费1银；箭头会选最近的一位。",
	["{item:2581} is yellow from 50 (yellow at 50, green at 75, grey at 100): about 46 crafts to 80. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Herbalists: {item:858} (from 55, 1s 50c; {item:2450}, two {item:2678} and an {item:3371}) is orange to 85."] = "{item:2581}从50起为黄色（50黄、75绿、100灰）：到80约需46次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。草药师注意：{item:858}（55点起可学，1银50铜；{item:2450}、两个{item:2678}和一个{item:3371}）到85点前为橙色。",
	["{item:6450} (150-180)"] = "{item:6450}（150-180）",
	["{item:6450} is yellow from 150 (yellow at 150, green at 180, grey at 210): about 42 crafts to 180. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 150 for 50s; the arrow picks the nearest."] = "{item:6450}从150起为黄色（150黄、180绿、210灰）：到180约需42次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。本方阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师从技能150起教它，收费50银；箭头会选最近的一位。",
	["{item:6451} (180-210)"] = "{item:6451}（180-210）",
	["{item:6451} is yellow from 180 (yellow at 180, green at 210, grey at 240): about 42 crafts to 210. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:6451}从180起为黄色（180黄、210绿、240灰）：到210约需42次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。",
	["{item:8544} (210-225)"] = "{item:8544}（210-225）",
	["{item:8544} (225-240)"] = "{item:8544}（225-240）",
	["{item:8544} is yellow from 210 (yellow at 210, green at 240, grey at 270): about 18 crafts to 225. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:8544}从210起为黄色（210黄、240绿、270灰）：到225约需18次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。",
	["{item:8544} is yellow from 225 (yellow at 210, green at 240, grey at 270): about 24 crafts to 240. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. {item:8544} turns green at 240: switch to Heavy Mageweave there, which costs less cloth than green Mageweave Bandages to 260."] = "{item:8544}从225起为黄色（210黄、240绿、270灰）：到240约需24次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。{item:8544}在240转绿：那时改用厚重魔纹绷带，到260所耗的布比绿色的魔纹绷带更少。",
	["{item:8545} (240-260)"] = "{item:8545}（240-260）",
	["{item:8545} is yellow from 240 (yellow at 240, green at 270, grey at 300): about 25 crafts to 260. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{item:8545}从240起为黄色（240黄、270绿、300灰）：到260约需25次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。",
	["{item:8545}: cloth"] = "{item:8545}：布料",
	["{quest:6622}: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie on the floor inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again."] = "{quest:6622}：医生会给你检伤绷带；用这些，别用你自己的。里面有十五名伤兵躺在地上：在任何人死去之前，先包扎危重伤员，再包扎重伤员，最后是伤员（按Ctrl+V显示血条）。救满十五人的那一刻立刻交任务：其他人会继续死去，死亡过多即使显示完成也会失败。若失败，放弃任务重新接。",
	["{quest:6624}: the doctor hands you Triage Bandages; use those, not your own. Fifteen wounded soldiers lie inside: bandage the critically injured first, then the badly injured, then the injured, before any die (show the health bars with Ctrl+V). Turn the quest in the moment fifteen are saved: the others keep dying, and too many deaths fail it even after it reads complete. If it fails, abandon it and take it again."] = "{quest:6624}：医生会给你检伤绷带；用这些，别用你自己的。里面有十五名伤兵：在任何人死去之前，先包扎危重伤员，再包扎重伤员，最后是伤员（按Ctrl+V显示血条）。救满十五人的那一刻立刻交任务：其他人会继续死去，死亡过多即使显示完成也会失败。若失败，放弃任务重新接。",
	["{skill:129} 1-300"] = "{skill:129} 1-300",
	["{spell:10841} (skill 240) is an Artisan recipe: only the {quest:6622} doctor teaches it ({npc:12939} in Theramore, {npc:12920} in {area:321})."] = "{spell:10841}（技能240）是大师级配方：只有{quest:6622}的医生会教（塞拉摩的{npc:12939}、{area:321}的{npc:12920}）。",
	["{spell:3277} (80-115)"] = "{spell:3277}（80-115）",
	["{spell:3277} is yellow from 80 (yellow at 80, green at 115, grey at 150): about 49 crafts to 115. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 80 for 2s 50c; the arrow picks the nearest. {item:6452} ({item:1475}, from spiders) is taught at 80 too: Rogues need it for {spell:9810}, and it sells."] = "{spell:3277}从80起为黄色（80黄、115绿、150灰）：到115约需49次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。本方阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师从技能80起教它，收费2银50铜；箭头会选最近的一位。{item:6452}（{item:1475}，从蜘蛛身上取得）也在80点时教：盗贼需要它来配合{spell:9810}，而且它卖得出去。",
	["{spell:3278} (115-125)"] = "{spell:3278}（115-125）",
	["{spell:3278} (125-150)"] = "{spell:3278}（125-150）",
	["{spell:3278} is yellow from 115 (yellow at 115, green at 150, grey at 185): about 11 crafts to 125. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere. Any {skill:129} trainer of your faction teaches it from skill 115 for 10s; the arrow picks the nearest. Herbalists: {item:929} (from 110, 8s; {item:2453}, {item:2692} and a {item:3372}) is orange to 135."] = "{spell:3278}从115起为黄色（115黄、150绿、185灰）：到125约需11次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。本方阵营的任何{skill:129}训练师从技能115起教它，收费10银；箭头会选最近的一位。草药师注意：{item:929}（110点起可学，8银；{item:2453}、{item:2692}和一个{item:3372}）到135点前为橙色。",
	["{spell:3278} is yellow from 125 (yellow at 115, green at 150, grey at 185): about 38 crafts to 150. Bandages need no fire: craft them anywhere."] = "{spell:3278}从125起为黄色（115黄、150绿、185灰）：到150约需38次制作。绷带不需要火：随处可做。",
}

G["forever/reputation/brood-of-nozdormu"] = {
	["10"] = "10",
	["10 (and 100 Cenarion Circle)"] = "10（另加100塞纳里奥议会）",
	["100"] = "100",
	["100 (and 100 Cenarion Circle)"] = "100（另加100塞纳里奥议会）",
	["200"] = "200",
	["200 (and 200 Cenarion Circle)"] = "200（另加200塞纳里奥议会）",
	["500"] = "500",
	["75"] = "75",
	["A raid event: follow {npc:11832} toward {area:2361} and keep him alive against Eranikus and his nightmare adds until Tyrande arrives and redeems Eranikus. Do not kill Eranikus."] = "团队事件：跟随{npc:11832}向{area:2361}走，在伊兰尼库斯和他的梦魇小怪攻击下保住他，直到泰兰德赶到并救赎伊兰尼库斯。不要杀死伊兰尼库斯。",
	["After The Path, Baristolth takes 200 more fragments for {quest:8302}: 200 reputation, again and again, but only until Neutral. From Hated 500 that is 208 turn-ins, 41,600 fragments, 20,000 to 30,000 elite kills: the only way without the Temple, and a very long one. With the {area:16076} open (a 40-player raid) it is far quicker: every Temple trash mob gives 100 until 2,999 of 3,000 Neutral, about 9,500 a full clear, so four to five clears reach Neutral. Save every {item:21230} and {item:21229} you loot until the trash stops counting: they pay the same later."] = "完成“路径”后，巴里斯托尔斯还会收200块碎片交{quest:8302}：每次200声望，可反复进行，但只能做到中立。从仇恨500起步，那意味着208次交付、41,600块碎片、2万到3万次精英击杀：这是不进神庙的唯一办法，而且极其漫长。开放{area:16076}（40人团队副本）后就快得多：神庙的每个小怪都给100，直到中立2,999/3,000，一次全通约9,500，所以四到五次全通就能到中立。在垃圾不再计数之前，把拾到的每块{item:21230}和{item:21229}都留着：它们以后同样值钱。",
	["At Exalted, {npc:15192} gives the last ring of your path: The Protector of Kalimdor, The Qiraji Conqueror or The Grand Invoker. Bring the Revered ring; 100 reputation."] = "崇拜时，{npc:15192}会给你所选路径的最后一枚戒指：卡利姆多保护者、其拉征服者或大祈求者。带上崇敬戒指；100声望。",
	["At Friendly, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "友善时，{npc:15192}会升级你所选路径的戒指：保护者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路。带上你佩戴的戒指；100声望。",
	["At Honored, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "尊敬时，{npc:15192}会升级你所选路径的戒指：保护者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路。带上你佩戴的戒指；100声望。",
	["At Revered, {npc:15192} upgrades the ring of the path you chose: The Path of the Protector, Conqueror or Invoker. Bring the ring you wear; 100 reputation."] = "崇敬时，{npc:15192}会升级你所选路径的戒指：保护者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路。带上你佩戴的戒指；100声望。",
	["Back to Baristolth"] = "回到巴里斯托尔斯",
	["Back to {npc:11811}"] = "回到{npc:11811}",
	["Baristolth in {area:3425}"] = "巴里斯托尔斯在{area:3425}",
	["Brood of Nozdormu Reputation"] = "诺兹多姆子嗣声望",
	["Friendly to Honored: the turn-ins"] = "友善到尊敬：交付",
	["Hated to Neutral"] = "仇恨到中立",
	["Honored to Revered"] = "尊敬到崇敬",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000: twelve artifacts, 24 insignias, or a mix with {npc:15727} (2,500). After the first, each insignia is the repeatable {quest:8595}. Every Temple boss sometimes drops an {quest:8789} or Regalia (about one time in twenty): {npc:15380} and {npc:15378}, inside the Temple once {npc:15727} is dead, take it with 3 {item:18562} for 200 and a weapon. Honored opens the chest exchange of the tier set (200)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12,000：十二件神器、24枚徽记，或用{npc:15727}（2,500）混搭。第一枚之后，每枚徽记都靠可重复的{quest:8595}。神庙每个首领偶尔会掉落{quest:8789}或徽饰（约二十分之一）：{npc:15727}死后，神庙内的{npc:15380}和{npc:15378}会收下它，外加3个{item:18562}，给200声望和一件武器。尊敬解锁套装胸甲兑换（200）。",
	["Meet {npc:15192}"] = "与{npc:15192}见面",
	["Neutral opens the rest of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands chain. Baristolth sends you back to {quest:8303}."] = "中立会开启流沙节杖任务的后续。巴里斯托尔斯会把你送回{quest:8303}。",
	["Neutral to Friendly in the Temple"] = "在神庙内从中立到友善",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 reputation. Every trash mob of the {area:16076} (a 40-player raid behind the {area:2737}) gives 100, and the Twin Emperors 210 each, until 2,999 of 3,000 Neutral, one point short of Friendly; there they stop. Then hand in one saved {item:21230} (1,000, to {npc:15502}) or {item:21229} (500, to {npc:15503}) to tip you over. The shoulder and boot exchanges of the Temple's tier set need no standing: the token, two idols and ten scarabs to {npc:15502} (shoulders) or {npc:15503} (boots) pay 200 each. The {area:3454} (20 players) give a little from bosses: Kurinnaxx, Moam, Buru and Ayamiss 50 each, Rajaxx 34, Ossirian 100, to Exalted."] = "中立到友善需要3,000声望。{area:16076}（{area:2737}后面的40人团队副本）的每个小怪给100，双子皇帝各给210，直到中立2,999/3,000——离友善还差一点；到那里就停止了。然后交一块留存的{item:21230}（1,000，给{npc:15502}）或{item:21229}（500，给{npc:15503}）把你顶过去。神庙套装的护肩和靴子兑换不需要声望：把徽记、两个神像和十个甲虫交给{npc:15502}（护肩）或{npc:15503}（靴子），各得200。{area:3454}（20人）的首领也给一些：库林纳克斯、莫阿姆、布鲁和阿亚米斯各50，拉贾克斯34，奥西里安100，直到崇拜。",
	["Now hand in what you saved. Each {item:21230} (any Temple trash, 1% to 9%) starts {quest:8784}: 1,000 reputation from {npc:15502}, one of the three bronze dragons inside the Temple. Each {item:21229} (nearly every Temple boss) goes to {npc:15503} for {quest:8595}: 500 here and 100 Cenarion Circle. {npc:15727} gives 2,500, to Exalted. Friendly to Honored is 6,000: six artifacts or twelve insignias. Friendly also opens the helm and leg exchanges of the Temple's tier set (200 reputation each) at {npc:15502} and {npc:15503}."] = "现在把攒下的交出去。每块{item:21230}（神庙任何小怪，1%到9%）会开启{quest:8784}：交给神庙内三条青铜龙之一的{npc:15502}，得1,000声望。每个{item:21229}（几乎每个神庙首领）交给{npc:15503}完成{quest:8595}：这里得500，另加100塞纳里奥议会。{npc:15727}给2,500，直到崇拜。友善到尊敬需要6,000：六件神器或十二枚徽记。友善还会在{npc:15502}和{npc:15503}处解锁神庙套装的头盔和腿甲兑换（各200声望）。",
	["Number Two"] = "第二项",
	["Pick one: The Path of the Protector, the Conqueror or the Invoker, 100"] = "三选一：保护者之路、征服者之路或祈求者之路，100",
	["Reputation · Raids and dungeons"] = "声望 · 团队副本与地下城",
	["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 21 artifacts or 42 insignias, with {npc:15727}'s 2,500 a week. {npc:15727}'s eye starts {quest:8801} for {npc:15379} (200, and 200 Cenarion Circle). At Exalted Anachronos gives the last ring: The Protector of Kalimdor, The Qiraji Conqueror or The Grand Invoker."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21,000：21件神器或42枚徽记，外加{npc:15727}每周2,500。{npc:15727}之眼会为{npc:15379}开启{quest:8801}（200，另加200塞纳里奥议会）。崇拜时，阿纳克洛斯会给最后一枚戒指：卡利姆多保护者、其拉征服者或大祈求者。",
	["Stewvul's crate"] = "斯图沃的箱子",
	["The Bronze Dragonflight's ring, upgraded at every standing; a long climb from Hated, mostly in raids."] = "青铜龙军团的戒指，每个声望等级都会升级；从仇恨起步是漫长的爬升，且大多靠团队副本。",
	["The Exalted ring"] = "崇拜戒指",
	["The Redemption of Eranikus: raid"] = "伊兰尼库斯的救赎：团队副本",
	["The blue shard: Azuregos's ledger"] = "蓝色碎片：艾索雷葛斯的账本",
	["The four dream portals sit in groves guarded by elite dragonkin of level 60 to 62 that respawn every 30 minutes; each drops the portal's fragment one time in twenty. Raid content."] = "四条梦境传送门位于树林中，由60到62级的精英龙人守卫，每30分钟重生；每个约二十分之一几率掉落该传送门的碎片。团队副本内容。",
	["The green shard: Eranikus"] = "绿色碎片：伊兰尼库斯",
	["The island off {area:987}"] = "{area:987}外的岛屿",
	["The red shard: Vaelastrasz"] = "红色碎片：瓦拉斯塔兹",
	["The red shard: {npc:13020}, the second boss of {area:2677}, gives {quest:8730} before his fight; Nefarian, the last boss, drops the {item:21138} for one raider on the quest each kill. The quest lasts five hours."] = "红色碎片：{area:2677}的二号首领{npc:13020}会在战斗前给{quest:8730}；最终首领奈法利安每次击杀会为一名接了任务的团队成员掉落{item:21138}。任务持续五小时。",
	["The ring at Friendly"] = "友善戒指",
	["The ring at Honored"] = "尊敬戒指",
	["The ring at Revered"] = "崇敬戒指",
	["The {area:1121}"] = "那个{area:1121}",
	["The {faction:910} is not in your reputation list until you meet {npc:15192}. {npc:15180}, in the main building of {area:3425}, sends you to him. Meeting him sets you at Hated, 0 of 36,000: Neutral is 42,000 reputation away, and almost all of it comes from raids. {area:2677} and the {area:16076} are not among the first raids Blizzard has announced for Forever: until one of them opens, the 100 from Baristolth's first quest is all the Brood reputation there is. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers in this guide are without it."] = "在你见到{npc:15192}之前，{faction:910}不会出现在你的声望列表里。{area:3425}主建筑里的{npc:15180}会派你去找他。见到他后你会被设为仇恨，0/36,000：到中立还差42,000声望，而且几乎全靠团队副本。{area:2677}和{area:16076}并不在暴雪公布的首批Forever团队副本之列：在其中一个开放之前，巴里斯托尔斯第一个任务给的100声望就是子嗣声望的全部来源。传承特长“外交家”可为每次声望获取最多加10%；本指南的数字不含它。",
	["The {npc:15481} stands on the south coast of {zone:1447}. His ledger starts {npc:11811}'s long chain in {zone:1446}."] = "{npc:15481}站在{zone:1447}的南海岸。他的账本会在{zone:1446}开启{npc:11811}的长任务链。",
	["The {npc:15624}"] = "这位{npc:15624}",
	["The {npc:15625} (level 63 boss) always drops its fragment."] = "这位{npc:15625}（63级首领）必定掉落它的碎片。",
	["The {object:180633}"] = "那个{object:180633}",
	["The {object:180633} is a small red crystal on the ground just outside the gates of {area:3428}, in the far south-west of {zone:1451}. Click it, then stay and watch the vision of the War of the Shifting Sands to its end. If it is cut short, abandon the quest and click the Tear again."] = "{object:180633}是一小块红色水晶，就在{area:3428}大门外的地上，位于{zone:1451}最西南。点击它，然后留在这里，把流沙之战的幻象看完。如果中途被打断，放弃任务再点一次泪珠。",
	["The {object:180642} leans on the {area:230} at the south end of {zone:1421}, left of the closed gate."] = "{object:180642}靠在{zone:1421}南端的{area:230}上，在关闭的大门左侧。",
	["The {object:180652} lies on the farther of two islands south of {area:987}, past the fatigue line. {npc:15526}, on the sea floor south of the beach's crashed gyrocopter, gives {quest:8599} and a three-minute swim-speed blessing that gets you across."] = "{object:180652}位于{area:987}以南两座岛中较远的那座，已过疲劳线。海滩坠毁旋翼机以南的海底有{npc:15526}，他会给{quest:8599}和一个三分钟的游泳加速祝福，助你渡海。",
	["The {zone:1431} portal"] = "{zone:1431}传送门",
	["The {zone:1440} portal"] = "{zone:1440}传送门",
	["The {zone:1444} portal"] = "{zone:1444}传送门",
	["Watch the vision"] = "观看幻象",
	["With the three shards, {npc:15192} makes the Scepter of the Shifting Sands. In Classic its first holder rings the {object:180717} once for the whole realm, opening the gates of {area:3428}, and those who finish within ten hours earn the black qiraji crystal mount; whether Forever's realms get that event is not known."] = "集齐三块碎片后，{npc:15192}会打造流沙节杖。在经典旧世，第一个持有者敲响{object:180717}，全服仅此一次，打开{area:3428}的大门，十小时内完成的人可获得黑色其拉水晶坐骑；Forever的服务器是否会有这个事件尚不清楚。",
	["{area:2677} is a 40-player raid at the top of {area:254}. {npc:12017} always drops his head."] = "{area:2677}是{area:254}顶部的40人团队副本。{npc:12017}必定掉落他的头颅。",
	["{item:12360}: Alchemists, or the auction house"] = "{item:12360}：炼金师，或拍卖行",
	["{item:18562}, {area:2677} or the auction house"] = "{item:18562}，{area:2677}或拍卖行",
	["{item:18562}: {area:2677}, or the auction house"] = "{item:18562}：{area:2677}，或拍卖行",
	["{item:20383}: raid of 40"] = "{item:20383}：40人团队副本",
	["{item:21027}, {npc:12803}: raid"] = "{item:21027}、{npc:12803}：团队副本",
	["{item:21137}, {npc:15571}: raid"] = "{item:21137}、{npc:15571}：团队副本",
	["{item:21137}: 200"] = "{item:21137}：200",
	["{item:21138}, Nefarian"] = "{item:21138}，奈法利安",
	["{item:21138}: 200"] = "{item:21138}：200",
	["{item:21139}: 100"] = "{item:21139}：100",
	["{item:21175} quest chain"] = "{item:21175}任务链",
	["{item:21229}, Temple bosses"] = "{item:21229}，神庙首领",
	["{item:21230}: right-click it, then {npc:15502}"] = "{item:21230}：右键点击它，然后找{npc:15502}",
	["{npc:11811}, a goblin seer, lives in a hut north-east of {area:976}. He sends you three ways at once: to Stewvul's crate in {zone:1421}, to an island off the south coast of {zone:1446}, and to {npc:8125} in {area:976}."] = "{npc:11811}是个地精先知，住在{area:976}东北的一座小屋里。他一次派你走三条路：去{zone:1421}斯图沃的箱子、去{zone:1446}南海岸外的岛屿，以及去{area:976}的{npc:8125}。",
	["{npc:11811}: 200"] = "{npc:11811}：200",
	["{npc:11811}: 25"] = "{npc:11811}：25",
	["{npc:12803} and the Chimaerok on the {area:1121} are elites of level 60 to 62 that respawn every ten minutes: a raid's work. The Chimaerok drop a tenderloin about half the time, Lakmaeran two to four now and then."] = "{npc:12803}和{area:1121}上的奇美洛克是60到62级精英，每十分钟重生：这是团队副本的活。奇美洛克约半数掉落里脊肉，拉克麦拉则偶尔掉两到四块。",
	["{npc:13020}, {area:2677}: raid of 40"] = "{npc:13020}，{area:2677}：40人团队副本",
	["{npc:15192} at the {area:2300}"] = "{npc:15192}在{area:2300}",
	["{npc:15192} now offers the {item:21200} in three kinds: the Path of the Protector (tanks), of the Conqueror (melee fighters) or of the Invoker (casters). Take one: the other two close. Each standing from Friendly to Exalted brings an upgrade of the same ring, 100 reputation each. {quest:8555} sends you after the three shards of the Scepter of the Shifting Sands."] = "{npc:15192}现在提供三种{item:21200}：保护者之路（坦克）、征服者之路（近战）或祈求者之路（施法者）。选一种：另外两种就会关闭。从友善到崇拜，每个声望等级都会带来同一枚戒指的升级，各需100声望。{quest:8555}会派你去寻找流沙节杖的三块碎片。",
	["{npc:15192}, a bronze dragon in elf form, stands at the mouth of the {area:2300} in eastern {zone:1446}, south-east of {area:976}. Walk up to him."] = "{npc:15192}是一条化为人形的青铜龙，站在{zone:1446}东部{area:2300}的入口，位于{area:976}东南。走到他跟前。",
	["{npc:15192}: the Exalted ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你路径的崇拜戒指任务",
	["{npc:15192}: the Friendly ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你路径的友善戒指任务",
	["{npc:15192}: the Honored ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你路径的尊敬戒指任务",
	["{npc:15192}: the Revered ring quest of your path"] = "{npc:15192}：你路径的崇敬戒指任务",
	["{npc:15362} appears beside the {npc:5709} at the bottom of the {area:1477} (a five-player dungeon). He sends you to a {npc:15624} outside {zone:1457} (Horde players walk past the city's guards), then to {npc:11832} in {zone:1450}."] = "{npc:15362}出现在{area:1477}（5人副本）底部的{npc:5709}旁。他会派你去找{zone:1457}城外的{npc:15624}（部落玩家会经过该城的卫兵），然后去找{zone:1450}的{npc:11832}。",
	["{npc:15362}, inside the {area:1477}"] = "{npc:15362}，在{area:1477}内",
	["{npc:15378}: Regalia and 3 {item:18562}, 200"] = "{npc:15378}：徽饰和3个{item:18562}，200",
	["{npc:15379}: 200"] = "{npc:15379}：200",
	["{npc:15380}: Armaments and 3 {item:18562}, 200"] = "{npc:15380}：军械和3个{item:18562}，200",
	["{npc:15502}: 1,000"] = "{npc:15502}：1,000",
	["{npc:15554}, elite: group of 3 to 5"] = "{npc:15554}，精英：3到5人队伍",
	["{npc:15624}: 25 (and 25 Cenarion Circle)"] = "{npc:15624}：25（另加25塞纳里奥议会）",
	["{npc:8125} cooks in {area:976}. He sends you to the {area:1121} off southern {zone:1444} for a Chimaerok feast."] = "{npc:8125}在{area:976}做饭。他会派你去{zone:1444}南部外海的{area:1121}赴一场奇美洛克盛宴。",
	["{npc:8125} wants 20 {item:9061} and 20 {item:8150} with the meat. {npc:11811} then wants 20 Arcanite Bars, 10 {item:18562}, 10 Azerothian Diamonds and 10 Blue Sapphires, and gives you an {item:21136}: placed at the {object:180669} in {zone:1447}'s {area:1227}, it calls up {npc:15571}, a level 63 boss for a raid. {npc:15571} drops the {item:21137} for one raider on the quest each kill."] = "{npc:8125}要在肉之外再加20个{item:9061}和20个{item:8150}。随后{npc:11811}要20块奥金锭、10个{item:18562}、10颗艾泽拉斯钻石和10颗蓝宝石，并给你一个{item:21136}：把它放在{zone:1447}{area:1227}的{object:180669}处，会召唤{npc:15571}，一个63级的团队副本首领。{npc:15571}每次击杀会为一名接了任务的团队成员掉落{item:21137}。",
	["{npc:8125}'s Chops"] = "{npc:8125}的肉排",
	["{object:180633}: 50"] = "{object:180633}：50",
	["{object:180642}: 10"] = "{object:180642}：10",
	["{object:180652}: 10"] = "{object:180652}：10",
	["{object:180717} hangs before the gates of {area:3428}. {npc:15693} appears beside it once the gong has been rung, with {quest:8745}: a weapon and 200 reputation."] = "{object:180717}悬挂在{area:3428}的大门前。铜锣敲响后，{npc:15693}会出现在它旁边，带着{quest:8745}：一件武器和200声望。",
	["{quest:8288} wants the head of {npc:12017}, the third boss of {area:2677} (a 40-player raid in {area:254}). Everything after it needs the head, the fragment turn-ins included: until you have it, {quest:8286} is all the Brood reputation there is, solo or not."] = "{quest:8288}要{npc:12017}的头颅，他是{area:2677}（{area:254}里的40人团队副本）的三号首领。之后的一切都需要这颗头颅，包括碎片交付：在拿到它之前，{quest:8286}就是子嗣声望的全部来源，无论单刷与否。",
	["{quest:8301} wants 200 Silithid Carapace Fragments. Every hive silithid drops one to three on most kills: the Hive'Ashi Workers, Stingers, Swarmers and Defenders north and north-west of {area:3425}, and those of {area:2743} in the west and {area:2744} in the south. Almost all of them are elites of level 57 to 60: one at a time solo, faster in a group."] = "{quest:8301}要200块异种蝎壳碎片。每个虫巢的异种蝎多数击杀都会掉一到三块：{area:3425}以北和西北的亚什虫巢工蜂、刺虫、群居者和守卫，以及西面{area:2743}和南面{area:2744}的那些。它们几乎都是57到60级精英：单刷一次一只，组队更快。",
	["{quest:8302}: 200 fragments, 200"] = "{quest:8302}：200块碎片，200",
	["{quest:8303}'s quests"] = "{quest:8303}的任务",
	["{quest:8303}: 200"] = "{quest:8303}：200",
	["{quest:8595}: 1 insignia, 500"] = "{quest:8595}：1枚徽记，500",
	["{quest:8597}, Volume II"] = "{quest:8597}，第二卷",
	["{quest:8597}: Volume II"] = "{quest:8597}：第二卷",
	["{quest:8606} sends you, disguised with {npc:11811}'s turban, to a drop-off point south of {area:2255} in {zone:1452}. Leave the bag of gold there: {npc:15554}, a level 61 elite, comes for it (group of 3 to 5)."] = "{quest:8606}会让你戴上{npc:11811}的头巾伪装，前往{zone:1452}中{area:2255}以南的交货点。把金币袋放在那里：61级精英{npc:15554}会来取（3到5人队伍）。",
	["{quest:8620} needs the eight chapters of {quest:8597}, Volume II: from {npc:15552} in his house on {area:2079} (a level 63 elite with guards, raid), the Felguard Elites, Doomguard Commanders and Dreadlords of the {zone:1419}, the Hederine south of {area:2255}, and a book in the {zone:1458}. {npc:11811} hands out the binding when you accept."] = "{quest:8620}需要{quest:8597}第二卷的八个章节：来自{area:2079}他房子里的{npc:15552}（63级精英，带守卫，需团队）、{zone:1419}的恶魔卫士精英、末日守卫指挥官和恐惧魔王、{area:2255}以南的赫达林，以及{zone:1458}的一本书。接受任务时{npc:11811}会给你装订本。",
	["{quest:8735} wants a fragment from each of the four Dragons of Nightmare portals: elite dragonkin at the {zone:1440}, {zone:1444} and {zone:1425} portals (5% each) and the {npc:15625} in {zone:1431}. Raid content."] = "{quest:8735}要四条梦魇巨龙传送门各一块碎片：{zone:1440}、{zone:1444}和{zone:1425}传送门的精英龙人（各5%），以及{zone:1431}的{npc:15625}。团队副本内容。",
	["{zone:1425} portal"] = "{zone:1425}传送门",
}

G["forever/class/mage/destroy-morphaz"] = {
	["Back to {zone:1447}, {npc:8395} and the tower. Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic offered the {item:20037}, the {item:20036} or the {item:20035}, and Forever's notes say the choice may be gone."] = "回到{zone:1447}的{npc:8395}和塔。交任务前先看奖励窗口：经典旧世提供{item:20037}、{item:20036}或{item:20035}，而Forever的说明称那个选择可能已经取消。",
	["Experience at 50 through {zone:1447} and the {area:1417}; Classic's item choice may be gone on Forever."] = "50级时经{zone:1447}和{area:1417}获得经验；Forever上经典旧世的物品选择可能已经取消。",
	["Fly to {area:3137} (Alliance) or {area:1237} (Horde). {npc:8395} camps below his master's tower, a short way east of {area:1237}: from the fork of {zone:1447}'s main road at the {area:1221}, head straight north to the cliffs. Get off your mount before he teleports you up, or the teleport may not take you. A trail with no enemies climbs to {npc:8379} at the top of the tower; an attendant at the top sends you back down, as often as you like."] = "飞往{area:3137}（联盟）或{area:1237}（部落）。{npc:8395}扎营在他师父的塔下，就在{area:1237}以东不远处：从{area:1221}处{zone:1447}主路的岔口，径直向北走到崖边。在他把你传送上去之前先下坐骑，否则传送可能带不走你。一条没有敌人的小路通往塔顶的{npc:8379}；塔顶的侍从会把你送下去，想多少次都行。",
	["Mage"] = "法师",
	["The Spitelash Sirens (level 50-52) walk the ruins and beaches around the {area:1221} and the bay east of {area:1237}, often three together, and a few stand inside the {area:1223}; each drops a coral about one time in four. The Spitelash Screamers look almost the same but never drop it. Killing the other naga there makes more Sirens appear in their spots. {npc:7864} ghosts wander the ruins: watch your back."] = "怒鳞海妖（50-52级）在{area:1221}周围的废墟和海滩，以及{area:1237}以东的海湾游荡，常常三只一起，还有几只站在{area:1223}里；每只约四分之一概率掉落一块珊瑚。怒鳞尖啸者长相几乎一样，但从不掉落。杀掉那里的其他纳迦会让海妖在它们的位置上刷新。{npc:7864}幽灵在废墟中游荡：小心背后。",
	["The blood elves hold the {area:1220} on the hills of north-eastern {zone:1447}. Blood Elf Surveyors (51-52, {spell:8349} up close) and Reclaimers (52-53, {spell:133}, and they heal and {spell:139} each other) each drop the dust about one time in four; they spot you from far off, so pull at the edges. They come back after 5 1/2 minutes."] = "血精灵占据着{zone:1447}东北山丘上的{area:1220}。血精灵勘测员（51-52级，近身时用{spell:8349}）和收复者（52-53级，会{spell:133}，还会互相治疗并用{spell:139}）各约四分之一概率掉落粉末；他们远远就能发现你，所以要在边缘一只只拉。5分半后刷新。",
	["{area:1477}, the {area:1417}, lies in the {area:74}: climb the steps into the sunken building, swim down through it and follow the passage down to the portal. A group of five, level 50-54. Morphaz is not waiting when you arrive. First kill the six troll guardians (elites of 50-52) on the platforms around the upper ring; that opens the way down (the left-hand ramp from the entrance) to {npc:5710} and {npc:5711} in the Pit of Sacrifice. Once Jammal'an dies, two green drakes, Weaver and Dreamscythe, come out and patrol the pit: pull them one at a time. When both are dead, Morphaz (level 52 elite, {spell:12533} and {spell:11019}) and Hazzas appear together and cannot be split, so fight both. The shard always drops. Hunters, Priests and Rogues of 50 need Morphaz too: a group of them shares one clear."] = "{area:1477}，即{area:1417}，位于{area:74}：登上台阶进入沉没的建筑，向下游过它，沿通道一路下到传送门。五人队伍，50-54级。你到达时莫法兹不会等在那里。先杀掉上层环廊平台上的六个巨魔守卫（50-52级精英）；这会打开通往献祭之池中{npc:5710}和{npc:5711}的下行通道（入口左侧的坡道）。贾玛兰一死，两条绿龙——韦弗和梦镰——就会出来并在池中巡逻：一次拉一只。两条都死后，莫法兹（52级精英，{spell:12533}和{spell:11019}）和哈扎斯会同时出现且无法分开，所以两个都要打。碎片必定掉落。50级的猎人、牧师和盗贼也需要莫法兹：他们组一队可以共用一次通关。",
	["{npc:7311}, one of {zone:1454}'s mage trainers in {object:173161}, gives it; so do {npc:4567} in the {zone:1458} and {npc:3047} in {zone:1456}."] = "{object:173161}里{zone:1454}的法师训练师之一{npc:7311}会给你任务；{zone:1458}的{npc:4567}和{zone:1456}的{npc:3047}也会。",
}

G["forever/class/warlock/enchanted-gold-bloodrobe"] = {
	["At 31 {npc:3326} in the {object:172960} sends you to {npc:6266} in {area:392}. Buy a {item:5770} and a {item:3577} first (next steps) to save a trip."] = "31级时，{object:172960}里的{npc:3326}会让你去{area:392}找{npc:6266}。先买一个{item:5770}和一块{item:3577}（见后续步骤），省得跑一趟。",
	["At 31 {npc:4563} in the {object:36082} sends you to {npc:6266} in {area:392}; the zeppelin from {zone:1420} flies to {zone:1411}. Buy a {item:5770} and a {item:3577} first (next steps) to save a trip."] = "31级时，{object:36082}里的{npc:4563}会让你去{area:392}找{npc:6266}；从{zone:1420}的飞艇飞往{zone:1411}。先买一个{item:5770}和一块{item:3577}（见后续步骤），省得跑一趟。",
	["At 31 {npc:461} in the {object:2164}, in the {object:2101}, sends you to {npc:6266} in {area:392}. Buy a {item:5770} and a {item:3577} first (next steps) to save a trip."] = "31级时，{object:2101}中{object:2164}里的{npc:461}会让你去{area:392}找{npc:6266}。先买一个{item:5770}和一块{item:3577}（见后续步骤），省得跑一趟。",
	["At 31 {npc:5172} in {zone:1455} sends you to {npc:6266} in {area:392}. Buy a {item:5770} and a {item:3577} first (next steps) to save a trip."] = "31级时，{zone:1455}的{npc:5172}会让你去{area:392}找{npc:6266}。先买一个{item:5770}和一块{item:3577}（见后续步骤），省得跑一趟。",
	["Back to {npc:2670} in {area:35}: he offers {quest:4785} as a quest you hand straight back to him. He may show no quest marker; talk to him anyway."] = "回到{area:35}的{npc:2670}：他会给出{quest:4785}，然后你直接交回给他。他可能不显示任务标记；照样和他交谈。",
	["Back to {npc:6266} with the thread, the coals and a {item:6265}. Then wait beside her while she works the robe (do not attack her: the quest log calls it a kill), and speak to her again."] = "带着线、煤和一个{item:6265}回到{npc:6266}。然后在她缝制长袍时守在她旁边（不要攻击她：任务日志把这算作击杀），之后再和她交谈。",
	["Tailors sew the {item:5770} from a rare pattern; miners smelt Gold Bars from {item:2776}. Everyone else buys both at the Auction House. If you wear the robe, take it off: {npc:6266} keeps it."] = "裁缝用稀有图样缝制{item:5770}；矿工用{item:2776}熔炼金锭。其他人都可以在拍卖行买这两样。如果你穿着长袍，先脱下来：{npc:6266}会收走它。",
	["The Burning Exiles (level 38-39), fire elementals at the {area:334} in western {zone:1417}, drop the coal about one time in three. They resist fire: {spell:686} and Corruption. Below 38 they hit hard; the Cresting Charms from the Cresting Exiles near {area:321} finish one off once you have hurt it. Make a {item:6265} with {spell:1120} on the way."] = "燃烧的流放者（38-39级）是{zone:1417}西部{area:334}的火元素，约三次击杀掉一块煤。他们抗火：用{spell:686}和腐蚀术。你不到38级时，他们打得很疼；先把它打伤，再用{area:321}附近波涛流放者掉落的波涛护符收尾。顺路对一只流放者使用{spell:1120}，做一个{item:6265}。",
	["The Hatefury satyrs (level 31-32) hold {area:603} in the far north-east of {zone:1443}, past {area:608}: two kills in five give a vial, so plan on about 25. The Lesser Infernals (36-37) and Demon Portal Guardians (38) of {area:602}, in the south, drop the stone half the time; they resist fire, so use {spell:686} and Corruption."] = "憎怒萨特（31-32级）占据着{zone:1443}最东北的{area:603}，在{area:608}之外：五只里有两只会掉小瓶，所以准备杀25只左右。南边{area:602}的次级地狱火（36-37级）和恶魔传送门守卫（38级）约一半概率掉落石头；他们抗火，所以用{spell:686}和腐蚀术。",
	["The boat from {area:392} sails to {area:35}. {npc:2670} runs {object:59851} on an upper level of the town. Give him the {item:3577}; he will spin the thread later."] = "从{area:392}的船驶往{area:35}。{npc:2670}在镇上的上层经营{object:59851}。把{item:3577}交给他；之后他会把线纺好。",
	["Wait beside {npc:6266} while she finishes the robe"] = "在{npc:6266}旁边等她做完长袍",
	["Warlock"] = "术士",
	["You need no thread yet: {npc:6266} wants demon parts from {zone:1443} next."] = "现在还不需要线：{npc:6266}接下来要{zone:1443}的恶魔部件。",
	["{item:3577}: the Auction House"] = "{item:3577}：拍卖行",
	["{item:5770} and a {item:3577}"] = "{item:5770}和一个{item:3577}",
	["{item:5770}: the Auction House"] = "{item:5770}：拍卖行",
	["{item:6265}: {spell:1120} on an Exile as it dies"] = "{item:6265}：在流放者死亡时用{spell:1120}",
	["{npc:6266} stands by {npc:6251}'s tower on the hill above {area:392}, behind the engineers' hut. She takes the robe, then sends the gold bar to {npc:2670} in {area:35}."] = "{npc:6266}站在{area:392}上方山丘上{npc:6251}的塔旁，工程师小屋后面。她收下长袍，然后把金锭送到{area:35}的{npc:2670}那里。",
}

G["forever/class/warrior/voodoo-feathers"] = {
	["At 50, {npc:5479}, beside {npc:5480} in the warrior trainers' building of {object:2100}, sends you to the {npc:7572} in the {zone:1435}."] = "50级时，{object:2100}战士训练师建筑里的{npc:5479}（{npc:5480}旁边）会让你去{zone:1435}的{npc:7572}那里。",
	["Experience at 50, ending in the {area:1417}; Classic's item choice may be gone on Forever."] = "50级的经验奖励，任务链在{area:1417}收尾；Forever上经典旧世的物品选择可能已经取消。",
	["Helboar"] = "地狱野猪",
	["In Classic the {npc:10996} let you choose the {item:20130}, the {item:20521} or the {item:20517} here. Forever's change notes say the choice is gone, though its quest page still lists three unnamed rewards: look at the reward window before you hand in."] = "经典旧世里，{npc:10996}让你在这里选择{item:20130}、{item:20521}或{item:20517}。Forever的更新说明称该选择已取消，但它的任务页面仍列出三项未具名的奖励：交任务前先看奖励窗口。",
	["Seven Helboars (level 52-53, not elite) roam the north-west of the {zone:1419}, south-west of {area:1438}; some stand near the ogres on the mountainside by the road. They charge from 25 yards and cast {spell:8349}. They share spawn points with the Felbeasts and scorpids: if no boars are around, kill those and boars may appear instead. Back in 5 minutes."] = "七只地狱野猪（52-53级，非精英）在{zone:1419}西北、{area:1438}西南一带游荡；有几只站在路边山坡上的食人魔附近。它们会从25码外冲锋，并施放{spell:8349}。它们与地狱兽和蝎子共用刷新点：如果附近没有野猪，就杀掉那些，野猪可能会取而代之刷新。5分钟后回来。",
	["Shadowsworn Adept"] = "暗影誓缚侍僧",
	["Shadowsworn Cultist"] = "暗影誓缚教徒",
	["Shadowsworn Thug"] = "暗影誓缚暴徒",
	["The Shadowsworn camp around the mouth of the {area:1440} cave, south of {area:1438} on the way to the {area:72}. You need 20 Adepts (level 52-53, they leech blood and heal hurt allies: kill them first), 10 Cultists (51-52, they throw from range, so close in) and 20 Thugs (52-53, Thrash and {spell:1766}). Thugs can run short before the others: kill every Shadowsworn you pass."] = "暗影誓缚营地分布在{area:1440}洞口周围，在{area:1438}以南、通往{area:72}的路上。你需要20个侍僧（52-53级，他们会吸血并治疗受伤的同伴：先杀他们）、10个教徒（51-52级，远程投掷，所以贴上去）和20个暴徒（52-53级，会横扫和{spell:1766}）。暴徒可能先于其他两种杀不够：路过时把所有暗影誓缚都杀掉。",
	["The {npc:7572}, a ghost, stands in the south-west of the {zone:1435}, at the pass into the {zone:1419}, a short ride south-west of {area:75}. Horde: fly to {area:75}. Alliance: fly to {area:1438} in the {zone:1419} and ride north through the pass. High-level beasts roam the way."] = "{npc:7572}是个幽灵，站在{zone:1435}西南、通往{zone:1419}的山口处，从{area:75}向西南骑一小段就到。部落：飞到{area:75}。联盟：飞到{zone:1419}的{area:1438}，然后向北穿过山口。路上有高等级野兽游荡。",
	["Warrior"] = "战士",
	["You need two feathers of each colour from the six Atal'ai troll guardians (level 51-52, elite) on the {area:1417}'s balcony, who hold the barrier in front of {npc:5710}: Gasher and {npc:5716} drop the amber, Hukku and Mijan the blue, Zolo and Loro the green, every kill; each player on the quest loots their own set. The {area:1417} is a five-player dungeon: needs a group of five. It lies in the {area:74} in eastern {zone:1435}: climb the temple's outer steps, dive into the flooded hall and follow the stairs down to the entrance. Inside, reach the balcony by the stairs or the path on the right, not the spiral stairs. Hukku calls guardians and casts {spell:9081} and {spell:8282}; Mijan heals the others ({spell:139}, a {npc:3560}, {spell:331} below half health): kill her or her ward fast; {npc:5716} cleaves."] = "你需要每种颜色的两根羽毛，来自{area:1417}阳台上把守{npc:5710}前屏障的六个阿塔莱巨魔守卫（51-52级精英）：加什尔和{npc:5716}掉琥珀色，胡库和米詹掉蓝色，佐洛和洛若掉绿色，每次击杀必掉；每个接了任务的玩家各自拾取自己的一套。{area:1417}是五人副本：需要五人队伍。它位于{zone:1435}东部的{area:74}：登上神庙外台阶，潜入淹水大厅，沿楼梯下到入口。进去后，走楼梯或右侧的小路到阳台，别走螺旋楼梯。胡库会召唤守卫并施放{spell:9081}和{spell:8282}；米詹会治疗其他人（{spell:139}，一个{npc:3560}，血量低于一半时用{spell:331}）：快点杀掉她或她的守护；{npc:5716}会顺劈斩。",
	["{item:20606}, from Gasher and {npc:5716}"] = "{item:20606}，来自加什尔和{npc:5716}",
	["{item:20607}, from Hukku and Mijan"] = "{item:20607}，来自胡库和米詹",
	["{item:20608}, from Zolo and Loro"] = "{item:20608}，来自佐洛和洛若",
}

G["forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed"] = {
	["At 60 {npc:5520}, the demon trainer in the {object:2164}, sends you to {quest:7562} in the {zone:1428}."] = "60级时，{object:2164}里的恶魔训练师{npc:5520}会让你去{zone:1428}的{quest:7562}。",
	["At 60 {npc:5753}, the demon trainer in the {object:36082}, sends you to {quest:7562} in the {zone:1428}."] = "60级时，{object:36082}里的恶魔训练师{npc:5753}会让你去{zone:1428}的{quest:7562}。",
	["At 60 {npc:5815}, the demon trainer in the {object:172960}, sends you to {quest:7562} in the {zone:1428}."] = "60级时，{object:172960}里的恶魔训练师{npc:5815}会让你去{zone:1428}的{quest:7562}。",
	["At 60 {npc:6382}, the demon trainer in {zone:1455}, sends you to {quest:7562} in the {zone:1428}."] = "60级时，{zone:1455}的恶魔训练师{npc:6382}会让你去{zone:1428}的{quest:7562}。",
	["Back to {npc:14436}: he gives you the {item:18591} for {npc:14437} beside him. Then {npc:14436} asks for the bell, the wheel and the candle, and {npc:14437} sends you to {quest:7623} in {area:1763}: buy three Shadowy Potions from him for that trip (6 gold each: one to walk in, one after {npc:14523}, and a spare in case one runs out) and bring 150 gold for the stardust."] = "回到{npc:14436}：他给你{item:18591}，让你交给旁边的{npc:14437}。然后{npc:14436}索要铃、轮和蜡烛，{npc:14437}会派你去{area:1763}的{quest:7623}：为这趟行程向他买三瓶暗影药水（每瓶6金：一瓶走进去，一瓶在{npc:14523}之后，再留一瓶备用以防一瓶失效），并带上150金买星尘。",
	["Back to {npc:14437} with the stardust; with the {quest:7630} also done he gives you the {item:18688} for the {area:2057}. Put a group of five together now: a party, not a raid group."] = "带着星尘回到{npc:14437}；如果{quest:7630}也已完成，他会给你用于{area:2057}的{item:18688}。现在组一个五人队：是小队，不是团队。",
	["Back to {npc:14437}, then {npc:14436} hands you his instructions. Buy {item:18663} (150 gold), the {item:18629} (50) and the {item:18670} (50) from {npc:14437}; a warlock friend who owns them can bring theirs instead. Every other warlock who will recharge the nodes needs a Lodestone of their own. Carry 15 or more Soul Shards."] = "回到{npc:14437}，然后{npc:14436}会把他的指示交给你。从{npc:14437}处购买{item:18663}（150金）、{item:18629}（50金）和{item:18670}（50金）；拥有的术士朋友可以带自己的来。其他每一位要为节点充能的术士都需要自备一块磁石。带上15个以上灵魂碎片。",
	["Every owlbeast of {zone:1452} (level 53-58, none elite) drops the blood about one time in three: about ninety kills for thirty. {area:2250}, in the north-east, and the {area:2242}'s surroundings are packed with them, and they respawn in five and a half minutes."] = "{zone:1452}的每种枭兽（53-58级，均非精英）约三次击杀掉一份血：三十份大约要杀九十只。东北的{area:2250}和{area:2242}周边满地都是，它们5分半后刷新。",
	["Hand the three pieces to {npc:14437}. He then wants 3 Arcanite Bars for the {item:18629}: alchemists transmute them (an {item:12363} and a {item:12359} each, on a long cooldown); everyone else buys them."] = "把三件物品交给{npc:14437}。然后他要3块奥金锭，用于{item:18629}：炼金师可以转化（每块用一个{item:12363}和一块{item:12359}，冷却很长）；其他人直接买。",
	["Immol'thar"] = "伊莫塔尔",
	["Into Dire Maul West"] = "进入厄运之槌西区",
	["Stand on the dais and use {item:18663}: {npc:14500} sets out the Bell, the Wheel and the Candle. The Bell heals warlocks, the Wheel shields the party, the Candle burns the imps: ignore the imps and kill the Dread Guards (elite felguards, about ten, sometimes two at once); Banish or Enslave helps. Give one player each node to watch: when one sags, tilts and sounds, a warlock with a Lodestone recharges it, a 3-second cast that any hit breaks (a {item:6265} each), so keep attackers off them. If all three fail, the ritual ends and you start again; while one stands it survives even a wipe. After about six minutes nine symbols glow and a red vortex closes the circle: walk out and the remaining demons vanish at its edge. Rest, then use the {item:18670}. Kill the {npc:14502} (level 62, elite); at half health {npc:14506} joins, a hard hitter who knocks you back. Speak to the {npc:14504}: every warlock in the party who is on this quest can bind it."] = "站到台座上使用{item:18663}：{npc:14500}会摆出铃、轮和蜡烛。铃会治疗术士，轮会为队伍提供护盾，蜡烛会灼烧小鬼：无视小鬼，杀掉恐惧守卫（恶魔卫士精英，约十个，有时一次两个）；放逐或奴役有帮助。给每个节点派一名玩家盯守：当某个节点下垂、倾斜并发声时，由带着磁石的术士为其充能，3秒施法，任何攻击都会打断（每次消耗一个{item:6265}），所以要让攻击者远离他们。如果三个全部失效，仪式结束，你得重新开始；只要还有一个立着，即使团灭也能撑住。约六分钟后九个符号亮起，一个红色漩涡闭合圆圈：走出去，剩下的恶魔会在其边缘消失。休息一下，然后使用{item:18670}。杀掉{npc:14502}（62级精英）；血量过半时{npc:14506}加入，是个会把你击退的硬手。与{npc:14504}交谈：队伍中每个接了此任务的术士都能绑定它。",
	["The ritual"] = "仪式",
	["The {area:2057} (level 58-60, a group of five) lies under {area:2298}, the island town in the south-east of the {zone:1422}: someone needs the {item:13704} or a rogue to open the door. Fight down to {npc:10508}'s room and use the {item:18688} at the alchemy lab tables to the right: {npc:14500} makes the parchment. You need not kill Ras, but it only counts at this lab and only in a party."] = "{area:2057}（58-60级，五人队伍）位于{zone:1422}东南的岛上城镇{area:2298}下方：需要有人带着{item:13704}，或让盗贼开门。一路打下去到{npc:10508}的房间，在右侧炼金实验台上使用{item:18688}：{npc:14500}会制作羊皮纸。不必杀掉莱斯，但只有在这个实验台、且必须在小队中才算数。",
	["Ulathek"] = "乌拉泰克",
	["Use the {item:18688} at the alchemy lab inside"] = "在里面的炼金实验台上使用{item:18688}",
	["Warlock"] = "术士",
	["Xorothian Dreadsteed"] = "克索诺斯恐惧战马",
	["Your epic mount at 60, summoned anywhere: no epic horse to buy and no 1,000g Journeyman Riding needed."] = "你在60级的史诗坐骑，随处召唤：不用买史诗战马，也无需1,000金的中级骑术。",
	["{area:1763} lies just south of {area:1997} in western {zone:1448}, west of the road; of its two caves, {area:1770} is the northern one, further up the hill. Drink a {item:18802} at its mouth: for 20 minutes the Shadow Council there treat you as one of their own ({spell:23179}). The oozes in the red pool and the succubus Rakaiah beyond them still attack: hug the wall past them. Go down past the second, red pool, up the ramp and across two bridges to {quest:7623}, a great winged dreadlord at the back. He talks to you only while the potion lasts."] = "{area:1763}就在{zone:1448}西部{area:1997}的正南、道路以西；它有两个洞穴，{area:1770}是北边那个，位置更靠山上。在洞口喝下{item:18802}：20分钟内，那里的暗影议会会把你当作自己人（{spell:23179}）。红色水池里的软泥怪和更远处的魅魔拉凯亚仍会攻击：贴着墙绕过它们。经过第二个红色水池往下，上坡道，过两座桥，到后面的{quest:7623}，一个巨大的有翼恐惧魔王。药水持续期间他才会和你说话。",
	["{area:2577} stands in the ruins of central {zone:1444}: from the gate at the foot of the ruins, walk up through the outer courtyards to the west wing's door at the north end. That door and an inner door need the {item:18249} (it drops from Pusillin in Dire Maul East) or a rogue with 300 Lockpicking. Bring a party of five. Lower {npc:11496}'s shield by killing the guardians of the five pylons (two stand in his own room), then kill {npc:11496}: his dais is the summoning circle. Rest and rebuff before you start."] = "{area:2577}立在{zone:1444}中部的废墟中：从废墟脚下的城门进去，穿过外围庭院，走到北端西翼的门前。那扇门和里面的一扇门需要{item:18249}（由厄运之槌东区的普希林掉落），或一名开锁300的盗贼。带一支五人队伍。杀掉五座能量塔的守卫（其中两个就在他自己的房间里）以削弱{npc:11496}的护盾，然后杀掉{npc:11496}：他的台座就是召唤法阵。开始前先休息并补好增益。",
	["{item:12360}: the Auction House"] = "{item:12360}：拍卖行",
	["{item:14344}: the Auction House"] = "{item:14344}：拍卖行",
	["{item:18629}, 50 gold"] = "{item:18629}，50金",
	["{item:18663}, 150 gold"] = "{item:18663}，150金",
	["{item:18663}, on {npc:11496}'s dais"] = "{item:18663}，在{npc:11496}的台座上",
	["{item:18670}, 50 gold"] = "{item:18670}，50金",
	["{item:18670}, once the circle is complete"] = "{item:18670}，圆圈完成后",
	["{item:9264}: the Auction House"] = "{item:9264}：拍卖行",
	["{npc:11496}, inside the west wing"] = "{npc:11496}，西翼内",
	["{npc:14437} wants 10 Elixirs of Shadow Power ({skill:171}: 3 Ghost Mushrooms and a {item:8925} each), 6 Large Brilliant Shards ({skill:333}: disenchant level 51+ blue items), 25 {item:11370} ({skill:186} 230: the Dark Iron Deposits of the {zone:1428} and {area:1584}) and 35 Black Dragonscales ({skill:393}: the black dragonkin of the {zone:1428}, a few percent a kill, best from the {npc:7043}). Make or gather what your professions allow and buy the rest at the Auction House; it can take a while to find 35 scales."] = "{npc:14437}要10瓶暗影之力药剂（{skill:171}：每瓶3个幽灵菇和一个{item:8925}）、6块大块魔光碎片（{skill:333}：分解51级以上蓝色物品）、25个{item:11370}（{skill:186}230：{zone:1428}和{area:1584}的黑铁矿脉）以及35片黑龙鳞片（{skill:393}：{zone:1428}的黑龙人，每只几个百分点，最好来自{npc:7043}）。用你的专业能做的就做、能采的就采，其余的拍卖行买；35片鳞片可能要收一阵子。",
	["{npc:14522}, beside {quest:7623}, sells the {item:18687} for 150 gold. He deals with you only while a {item:18802} is active."] = "{quest:7623}旁边的{npc:14522}以150金出售{item:18687}。只有在{item:18802}生效期间他才会和你交易。",
	["{npc:14523} waits in a small side room up a bridge you passed on the way down. Speak to him and he and four guards attack (all level 57, none elite): let your voidwalker hold the guards and burn {npc:14523}, sacrificing it if you must. Or click off your {spell:23179} aura to start the fight, kill {npc:14523}, then drink another potion: the guards stop at once. Take his heart back to {npc:9516} with a potion active."] = "{npc:14523}在下去途中经过的一座桥上方的小侧室里等候。和他说话后，他和四名守卫会攻击（都是57级，非精英）：让你的虚空行者拉住守卫，集火{npc:14523}，必要时牺牲虚空行者。或者点掉{spell:23179}增益来开战，杀掉{npc:14523}，再喝一瓶药水：守卫会立刻停止攻击。带着药水效果把他的心脏带回{npc:9516}。",
	["{quest:7562} and his goblin {npc:14437} camp on the hill across the road from the {area:255}, in the far north-west of the {zone:1428}, west of {area:254}. The chain is long: about 420 gold in {npc:14437}'s and {npc:14522}'s goods, a pile of crafted materials, the {area:2057} and {area:2577}. Start buying or gathering the materials of the next steps now."] = "{quest:7562}和他的地精{npc:14437}在{area:255}对面路边的山丘上扎营，位于{zone:1428}最西北、{area:254}以西。任务链很长：{npc:14437}和{npc:14522}的商品约需420金，还有一堆制作材料、{area:2057}和{area:2577}。现在就开始购买或收集后续步骤的材料吧。",
	["{quest:7625}, from {npc:14522}"] = "{quest:7625}，来自{npc:14522}",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/minimule"] = {
	["The Alliance camp is at {area:1002} in western {zone:1433}. Merchant's Favor comes from Waylaid Crates that mobs drop from level 10: fill one with a bundle it lists and hand it to {npc:214101}, for 5 to 30 Favor a crate. The treat costs 1,500 Favor and, by beta vendor lists, needs Revered with the Azeroth Commerce Authority. Crates pay no standing: that comes from the Craftsman's Writs, 21,000 from Neutral to Revered. The Supply Factions Reputation guide takes you there."] = "联盟营地设在{zone:1433}西部的{area:1002}。商人的恩惠来自10级起怪物掉落的被劫的板条箱：按箱内列出的包裹装满一箱，交给{npc:214101}，每箱可得5到30点恩惠。该零食用1,500点恩惠购买；据测试服的商人列表，还需要对艾泽拉斯商业协会达到崇敬。板条箱不给声望：声望来自工匠令状，从中立到崇敬共21,000点。《补给阵营声望》指南会带你走完。",
	["The Horde camp is just outside the west gate of the {area:380}. Merchant's Favor comes from Waylaid Crates that mobs drop from level 10: fill one with a bundle it lists and hand it to Dokimi, for 5 to 30 Favor a crate. The treat costs 1,500 Favor and, by beta vendor lists, needs Revered with Durotar Supply and Logistics. Crates pay no standing: that comes from the Craftsman's Writs, 21,000 from Neutral to Revered. The Supply Factions Reputation guide takes you there. (Another {npc:256384} stands in the {zone:1458}; this is the one at the camp.)"] = "部落营地就在{area:380}西门外。商人的恩惠来自10级起怪物掉落的被劫的板条箱：按箱内列出的包裹装满一箱，交给多基米，每箱可得5到30点恩惠。该零食用1,500点恩惠购买；据测试服的商人列表，还需要对杜隆塔尔补给与后勤达到崇敬。板条箱不给声望：声望来自工匠令状，从中立到崇敬共21,000点。《补给阵营声望》指南会带你走完。（{zone:1458}里还有另一个{npc:256384}；这里说的是营地那个。）",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/shadowgale-squirrel"] = {
	["{npc:254151}, the druids' quartermaster, waits inside their den in the {area:16631}, the cave just north-east of {npc:257944}'s camp. He sells the squirrel (50s) once you are Revered with the {faction:2758}. Get there young: the Shadowgale storyline and {npc:254151}'s first ear quest take you to Friendly, and his repeatable pays 1000 for five Al'Aketh Cultist's Ears up to level 18 but, by Classic's rules, only 200 from level 22. From Friendly to Revered that is about 80 ears at level 18 and about 400 at 22 or above. The Nightclaw Druids Reputation guide walks you through it."] = "{npc:254151}，德鲁伊的军需官，在他们位于{area:16631}的巢穴里等候，那是{npc:257944}营地东北方的洞穴。只要你对{faction:2758}达到崇敬，他就会出售这只松鼠（50银）。趁等级低就去：影风剧情线和{npc:254151}的第一个耳朵任务能把你带到友善，他的可重复任务在18级及以下时每五只奥阿克教徒耳朵给1000点，但按经典旧世的规则，22级起只给200点。从友善到崇敬，18级约需80只耳朵，22级及以上约需400只。《夜爪德鲁伊声望》指南会带你走完。",
	["{zone:2521} is the Skyborne starting island; by beta reports anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the cliffs south of {area:17045}, north of {zone:1456}, about every five minutes (another flies from {area:279}; either faction may take either)."] = "{zone:2521}是天裔的起始岛；据测试服反馈，任何人都能前往。一艘天船每五分钟一班，从{zone:1456}以北{area:17045}南边的悬崖出发（另一艘从{area:279}起飞；两个阵营都能乘坐任意一艘）。",
	["{zone:2521} is the Skyborne starting island; by beta reports anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the north side of {area:279} about every five minutes (another flies from north of {zone:1456}; either faction may take either)."] = "{zone:2521}是天裔的起始岛；据测试服反馈，任何人都能前往。一艘天船每五分钟一班，从{area:279}北侧出发（另一艘从{zone:1456}以北起飞；两个阵营都能乘坐任意一艘）。",
}

G["forever/exploration/kalimdor-30-45"] = {
	["Fly to {area:467} (or to {area:608} if you have it) and take the road south-west out of the {zone:1442} into {zone:1443}; {area:608} in the north is the Alliance town."] = "飞往{area:467}（如果已开通{area:608}就飞那里），沿西南方向的道路走出{zone:1442}，进入{zone:1443}；北边的{area:608}是联盟城镇。",
	["{area:1113} and {area:1111} are level 60 areas, far above this guide. Skip this step for now and come back near that level: exploring the whole map needs them."] = "{area:1113}和{area:1111}是60级区域，远高于本指南。暂时跳过这一步，接近那个等级再回来：探索全图需要它们。",
	["{area:2079} is a level 61 area, far above this guide. Skip this step for now and come back near that level: exploring the whole map needs it."] = "{area:2079}是61级区域，远高于本指南。暂时跳过这一步，接近那个等级再回来：探索全图需要它。",
	["{zone:1443} (1/2)"] = "{zone:1443}（1/2）",
	["{zone:1443} (2/2)"] = "{zone:1443}（2/2）",
	["{zone:1444} (1/2)"] = "{zone:1444}（1/2）",
	["{zone:1444} (2/2)"] = "{zone:1444}（2/2）",
	["{zone:1444}: level 60+ areas"] = "{zone:1444}：60级以上区域",
	["{zone:1445}: level 61+ area"] = "{zone:1445}：61级以上区域",
}

G["forever/professions/mining"] = {
	["Any {skill:186} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:186} at any level (10c), and so does the Junior Mining Trainer in each starting area; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:2901} from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot mine without it. Turn on {spell:2580} (spellbook, General tab) so veins show on the minimap. Forever's starting areas also have Poor Copper Veins ({item:2770} and {item:2835}, from skill 1). The first-hour quest of each starting area (Rascally Rodents, Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery, The Woodland Protector, Galgar's {item:11584}, A Humble Task, Marla's Last Wish) offers {item:247840} as a reward: reading it gives 2 skill, up to 15. Trade goods vendors and the junior trainers sell the {item:277115}, a four-slot bag for ore and stone (25c). If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:186}: hand it in to the mining trainer it names once you reach skill 20, for the {spell:1230161} recipe."] = "任何本阵营的{skill:186}训练师都能在任意等级教学徒级{skill:186}（10铜），每个起始区域的初级采矿训练师也一样；箭头会指向最近的一位。从杂货或贸易品商人处买一把{item:2901}：放在背包里，没有它就无法采矿。打开{spell:2580}（法术书，通用页签），矿脉就会显示在小地图上。Forever的起始区域还有劣质铜矿脉（{item:2770}和{item:2835}，技能1起可采）。每个起始区域的第一小时任务（捣乱的啮齿动物、寒脊山谷送信、林地守护者、加尔加的{item:11584}、简单的任务、玛拉的遗愿）会以{item:247840}作为奖励：阅读它可得2点技能，最多到15。贸易品商人和初级训练师出售{item:277115}，一个装矿石和石头的四格包（25铜）。如果你为了《野外生存》在起始区域的篝火旁坐过，那里的露营指南还会提供《露营入门：{skill:186}》：技能达到20后，把它交给任务指定的采矿训练师，换取{spell:1230161}配方。",
	["Artisan {skill:186} raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and no character level, and costs 5g: train it as soon as you reach 200. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:186} trainer of your faction."] = "大师级{skill:186}把上限提高到300；需要技能200，不限角色等级，花费5金：一到200就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:186}训练师。",
	["At 65 a {skill:186} trainer teaches {spell:2659} (2s; grey at 115) and {spell:3304} (50c; grey at 75): smelting at a forge raises {skill:186} too, so smelt what you mine."] = "技能65时，{skill:186}训练师会教{spell:2659}（2银；115后变灰）和{spell:3304}（50铜；75后变灰）：在熔炉旁熔炼也会提升{skill:186}，所以挖到的矿都熔掉。",
	["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1411} (1-50)"] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1411}（1-50）",
	["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1411} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1411}（50-65）续",
	["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1420} (1-50)"] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1420}（1-50）",
	["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1420} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1420}（50-65）续",
	["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1426} (1-50)"] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1426}（1-50）",
	["Copper & Poor Copper: {zone:1426} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿与劣质铜矿：{zone:1426}（50-65）续",
	["Copper & Tin: {zone:1413} (65-125)"] = "铜矿与锡矿：{zone:1413}（65-125）",
	["Copper, Poor Copper"] = "铜矿、劣质铜矿",
	["Copper: {zone:2521} (1-50)"] = "铜矿：{zone:2521}（1-50）",
	["Copper: {zone:2521} (50-65) cont."] = "铜矿：{zone:2521}（50-65）续",
	["Expert {skill:186} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and no character level, and costs 50s: train it as soon as you reach 125. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:186} trainer of your faction. Learn {spell:3307} (5s; orange to 130, grey at 140) on the same visit: smelting at a forge raises {skill:186} too, so smelt what you mine."] = "高级{skill:186}把上限提高到225；需要技能125，不限角色等级，花费50银：一到125就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:186}训练师。同一次拜访中学{spell:3307}（5银；130前橙色，140后变灰）：在熔炉旁熔炼也会提升{skill:186}，所以挖到的矿都熔掉。",
	["Incendicite & Tin: {zone:1437} (65-125)"] = "燃石与锡矿：{zone:1437}（65-125）",
	["Incendicite, Tin"] = "燃石、锡矿",
	["Iron, Mithril"] = "铁矿、秘银",
	["Iron, Tin"] = "铁矿、锡矿",
	["Iron: {zone:1417} (125-155)"] = "铁矿：{zone:1417}（125-155）",
	["Iron: {zone:1417} (155-175)"] = "铁矿：{zone:1417}（155-175）",
	["Journeyman {skill:186} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:186} trainer of your faction. {spell:1230161}, Forever's camping item for {skill:186}, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: {skill:186}): a {item:2835} and a {item:2840} each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour."] = "中级{skill:186}把上限提高到150；需要技能50，不限角色等级，花费5银：一到50就立刻学习。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:186}训练师。{spell:1230161}是Forever为{skill:186}提供的露营物品，从技能20起可学（1银，或完成《露营入门：{skill:186}》免费获得）：每份需要一个{item:2835}和一块{item:2840}，可涨点直到25；放在篝火旁，能给营地里所有人一个持续一小时的增益。",
	["Lesser Bloodstone, Gold"] = "次级血石、金矿",
	["Lesser Bloodstone, Silver"] = "次级血石、银矿",
