	["Mine every Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 65. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 80 nodes for these 15 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，黄色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到65。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级10-20。这15点大约需要80个矿点。",
	["Mine every Copper (1, yellow), Poor Copper (1, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 65. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:2657} (orange to 25, grey at 70) gives points too. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 80 nodes for these 15 points."] = "路过每一处铜矿（1点，黄色）、劣质铜矿（1点，黄色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到65。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:2657}（25前橙色，70后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级1-10。这15点大约需要80个矿点。",
	["Mine every Gold (155, green), Mithril (175, green), {object:147516} (230, orange), Truesilver (230, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 245. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. {item:11099} smelts only at the {object:174824} in {area:1584} (8 ore a bar). Zone level 43-50. Expect about 40 nodes for these 15 points."] = "路过每一处金矿（155，绿色）、秘银（175，绿色）、{object:147516}（230，橙色）、真银（230，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到245。从这里起熔炼不再涨点（学会后更高级的熔炼都变灰）：需要就熔炼用于制作或出售，否则直接卖矿石。{item:11099}只能在{area:1584}的{object:174824}熔炼（8块矿石成一块锭）。区域等级43-50。这15点大约需要40个矿点。",
	["Mine every Gold (155, green, rare), Mithril (175, green), Truesilver (230, orange), Small Thorium (245, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 275. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Quests here that need {skill:186}: Salve via {skill:186} (level 55, {npc:9528}; Alliance), Salve via {skill:186} (level 55, {npc:9529}; Horde). Zone level 48-55. Expect about 50 nodes for these 30 points."] = "路过每一处金矿（155，绿色，稀有）、秘银（175，绿色）、真银（230，橙色）、小瑟银（245，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到275。从这里起熔炼不再涨点（学会后更高级的熔炼都变灰）：需要就熔炼用于制作或出售，否则直接卖矿石。此处需要{skill:186}的任务：《以{skill:186}制膏》（55级，{npc:9528}；联盟）、《以{skill:186}制膏》（55级，{npc:9529}；部落）。区域等级48-55。这30点大约需要50个矿点。",
	["Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, orange), Mithril (175, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 200. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:3308} (orange to 170, grey at 185) gives points too. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 40 nodes for these 25 points."] = "路过每一处铁矿（125，绿色）、金矿（155，橙色）、秘银（175，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到200。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:3308}（170前橙色，185后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级35-45。这25点大约需要40个矿点。",
	["Mine every Iron (125, green), Gold (155, yellow), Mithril (175, yellow) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 230. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 90 nodes for these 30 points."] = "路过每一处铁矿（125，绿色）、金矿（155，黄色）、秘银（175，黄色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到230。从这里起熔炼不再涨点（学会后更高级的熔炼都变灰）：需要就熔炼用于制作或出售，否则直接卖矿石。区域等级35-45。这30点大约需要90个矿点。",
