	["Mine every Tin (65, green), Lesser Bloodstone (75, green), Silver (75, green, rare), Iron (125, yellow), Gold (155, orange, rare) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 175. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: {spell:3308} (orange to 170, grey at 185) gives points too. Zone level 30-40. Expect about 40 nodes for these 20 points. {spell:3308} (25s; orange to 170, grey at 185) is taught from 155: learn it if you pass a {skill:186} trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own."] = "路过每一处锡矿（65，绿色）、次级血石（75，绿色）、银矿（75，绿色，稀有）、铁矿（125，黄色）、金矿（155，橙色，稀有）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到175。背包满了就在熔炉熔炼：{spell:3308}（170前橙色，185后变灰）也能涨点。区域等级30-40。这20点大约需要40个矿点。{spell:3308}（25银；170前橙色，185后变灰）从155起可学：路过{skill:186}训练师就学，不值得专门跑一趟。",
	["Mine every Truesilver (230, yellow), Small Thorium (245, yellow), Rich Thorium (275, orange) node you pass and circle the waypoints until {skill:186} 300. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Zone level 55-60. Expect about 40 nodes for these 25 points."] = "路过每一处真银（230，黄色）、小瑟银（245，黄色）、富瑟银（275，橙色）都采，并沿路径点循环，直到{skill:186}达到300。从这里起熔炼不再涨点（学会后更高级的熔炼都变灰）：需要就熔炼用于制作或出售，否则直接卖矿石。区域等级55-60。这25点大约需要40个矿点。",
