	["A 20-player raid behind the {area:2737} in the far south-west of {zone:1451}. A full clear is about 1,600 Cenarion reputation: the trash 3 each until 20,999 of 21,000 Revered, Kurinnaxx, Moam, Buru and Ayamiss 150 each and Ossirian 300, to Exalted. Ossirian's head starts {quest:8791} (200 here and 200 {npc:15185}). Their drops buy the ring (Honored), cloak (Revered) and weapon (Exalted) quests of {npc:15498}, {npc:15500} and {npc:15499} in the Hold, 100 reputation each. {npc:16091} in the Hold pays 100 once for {quest:9023}: {item:22217} from here and Venoxis's from {area:19}. {npc:15471} sells {item:22219} (Revered, 5g) and {item:22191} (Exalted, 8g) inside."] = "位于{zone:1451}最西南{area:2737}之后的20人团队副本。全通约1,600点塞纳里奥声望：小怪每只3点，直到崇敬的20,999/21,000；库林纳克斯、莫阿姆、布鲁和阿亚米斯各150点，奥西里安300点，直到崇拜。奥西里安的头颅会开启{quest:8791}（这里200点，另加{npc:15185}的200点）。他们的掉落可以换取要塞里{npc:15498}、{npc:15500}和{npc:15499}的戒指（尊敬）、披风（崇敬）和武器（崇拜）任务，各100点声望。要塞的{npc:16091}为{quest:9023}一次性支付100点：这里的{item:22217}和{area:19}温诺希斯的物品。{npc:15471}在里面出售{item:22219}（崇敬，5金）和{item:22191}（崇拜，8金）。",
