	["Dredge Crusher"] = "挖掘粉碎者",
	["Dredge Striker"] = "挖掘打击者",
	["Each Keeper is a level 60, not elite, alone at a camp edge, and always drops its chapter: Mayna in the far west camp, Havunth in the camp south-west of the Hold, Exeter in the far south-west camp beside the Twilight Lord."] = "每位守护者都是60级非精英，独自守在营地边缘，必定掉落它那一章：梅娜在最西边的营地，哈文斯在要塞西南的营地，埃克塞特在最西南的营地、暮光领主旁边。",
	["Forever's new {zone:1451} patterns for Tailors, Leatherworkers and Blacksmiths, Friendly and Honored"] = "Forever为裁缝、制皮和锻造新增的{zone:1451}图样，友善与尊敬",
	["Friendly (3,000) opens Kania's {item:20732} (10g), Mishta's {item:22251} (2g) and {item:22758} (5g), and Forever's new Friendly gloves patterns (7g 50s)."] = "友善（3,000）解锁卡尼亚的{item:20732}（10金）、米什塔的{item:22251}（2金）和{item:22758}（5金），以及Forever新增的友善手套图样（7金50银）。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation. {npc:15306} takes 10 {quest:8319} for 100 reputation, again and again, until Exalted: 120 turn-ins (1,200 texts) to Revered without the quests, or about 950 texts after them. Hand in the texts you saved now. The cultists no longer count, but the Flamereavers, Twilight Keepers, Marauders and Templars count until 11,999 of 12,000 Honored, and the {npc:14479} and Prophet until Exalted. Honored opens Kania's {item:20733} (10g), Mishta's {item:22773} (5g) and Forever's new Honored patterns (7g 50s each)."] = "从尊敬到崇敬需要12,000点声望。{npc:15306}收10份{quest:8319}给100点声望，可反复交，直到崇拜：不做任务的话，到崇敬需要交120次（1,200份文本）；做完任务后约需950份文本。现在就把留着的文本交掉。教徒不再计入，但裂焰者、暮光守护者、掠夺者和圣殿骑士计入，直到尊敬的11,999/12,000；{npc:14479}和先知计入到崇拜。尊敬解锁卡尼亚的{item:20733}（10金）、米什塔的{item:22773}（5金）和Forever新增的尊敬图样（每份7金50银）。",
	["Kills alone to the top of Friendly is 8,999 kills (6,999 for druids), but the texts they drop (about 3,000) are worth 30,000 more: most of the way to Exalted."] = "只靠击杀刷到友善满需要8,999次击杀（德鲁伊6,999次），但他们掉落的文本（约3,000份）还能再值30,000点：足够走到崇拜的大部分路程。",
	["Larksbane"] = "拉克斯班",
	["Mistress Natalia"] = "纳塔莉亚女士",
	["Mistress Natalia Mar'alith"] = "纳塔莉亚·玛拉利斯女士",
	["Mistress Natalia: group of 3 to 5"] = "纳塔莉亚女士：3到5人队伍",
	["Natalia, elite: group up"] = "纳塔莉亚，精英：组队",
	["Nature resistance enchants and patterns, badge gear and Forever's new {zone:1451} patterns, from {zone:1451}'s camps."] = "自然抗性附魔与图样、徽章装备，以及Forever新增的{zone:1451}图样，都来自{zone:1451}的各营地。",
	["Neutral to Honored is 9,000 reputation (7,000 for druids). Every {npc:11880}, Geolord, Stonecaller, Master and Overlord gives 1 reputation until 5,999 of 6,000 Friendly, one point short of Honored; there they stop. Save every {item:20404} and leave the quests of the next steps for later: each kill below that point is a free point on top of its text, and the texts and quests pay the same at any standing. A text drops about every third kill, so 30 kills make 30 reputation and 10 texts (100 reputation later). Four camps: south-west of the Hold (39,44), the far west (26,34), the far south-west (19,84) and the north-east below {area:2742} (66,18: Overlords, and Flamereavers that count until the top of Honored). The {npc:15308} (87% text) walks between 18,31 and 23,69. Texts sell on the auction house if you would rather buy. At 5,999 Friendly the last point into Honored comes from a Flamereaver, Twilight Keeper or Marauder, or from your first 10 texts at {npc:15306}."] = "从中立到尊敬需要9,000点声望（德鲁伊7,000点）。每个{npc:11880}、地质领主、唤石者、大师和霸主都给1点声望，直到友善的5,999/6,000，离尊敬只差一点；到那里他们就停止给声望。把每份{item:20404}都留着，后续步骤的任务也留到以后做：在那一点之前的每次击杀，除了文本之外还白得一点；而文本和任务在任何声望等级都付同样的点数。约每三次击杀掉一份文本，所以30次击杀可得30点声望和10份文本（之后值100点）。四个营地：要塞西南（39,44）、最西边（26,34）、最西南（19,84）和{area:2742}下方的东北（66,18：霸主，以及计入到尊敬满的裂焰者）。{npc:15308}（87%掉文本）在18,31和23,69之间走动。如果你宁愿花钱，文本在拍卖行有售。友善5,999时，进入尊敬的最后一点来自裂焰者、暮光守护者或掠夺者，或者在{npc:15306}处交最初10份文本。",
	["Now cash in the one-time quests: about 1,700 reputation alone, 2,400 with the group quests. They are level 55 to 60, so they pay in full at 60. {quest:8280} needs {quest:8275} first. {npc:15196} is an elite scorpid with two guards (group of 2 or 3). {npc:15174}'s {quest:8307} is for Cooks: its recipe makes the {item:20452} he wants. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "现在把一次性任务变现：光任务约1,700点声望，加上组队任务共2,400点。它们是55到60级任务，所以60级交时给全额。{quest:8280}需要先做{quest:8275}。{npc:15196}是一只带两名守卫的精英蝎子（2到3人队伍）。{npc:15174}的{quest:8307}是给厨师的：其配方能做出他要的{item:20452}。{npc:15189}站在他建筑的上层：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["Optional, 100 reputation once: {quest:9419}. Your side's camp sits by a hive: {npc:17080}'s by {area:2743} (Alliance), {npc:17079}'s by {area:2744} (Horde). Silithyst rises from glowing geysers around the desert: walk through one, carry the Silithyst to your camp's Silithyst Extractor, then talk to the camp's leader. It is a world PvP objective: players of the other side can take it from you."] = "可选，一次性100点声望：{quest:9419}。你所在阵营的营地就在虫巢旁：{npc:17080}的营地在{area:2743}旁（联盟），{npc:17079}的在{area:2744}旁（部落）。希利苏斯晶体从沙漠各处的发光喷泉升起：走进其中一个，把晶体带到你营地的希利苏斯晶体萃取器，然后和营地首领交谈。这是一个世界PvP目标：敌对阵营的玩家可以从你手中夺走它。",
	["Optional, and needed only for the Dredge quests later: {npc:15187} sends you to {zone:1451} with {quest:8275}, a 10-reputation letter. Skip it if you are already in {zone:1451}."] = "可选，只有后续的挖掘任务才需要：{npc:15187}让你带着{quest:8275}去{zone:1451}，那是一封值10点声望的信。如果你已经在{zone:1451}，就跳过。",
	["Optional, and needed only for the Dredge quests later: {npc:15188} sends you to {zone:1451} with {quest:8275}, a 10-reputation letter. Skip it if you are already in {zone:1451}."] = "可选，只有后续的挖掘任务才需要：{npc:15188}让你带着{quest:8275}去{zone:1451}，那是一封值10点声望的信。如果你已经在{zone:1451}，就跳过。",
	["Optional, for {quest:9023}: {npc:14507} is the first boss of {area:19}, a 20-player raid in north-east {zone:1434}."] = "可选，为{quest:9023}：{npc:14507}是{area:19}的第一个首领，那是{zone:1434}东北的20人团队副本。",
	["Optional: Natalia waits deep in {area:2744}, the hive in the south of {zone:1451}. She is a level 62 elite who mind-controls, fears and heals herself below half health: bring a group of 3 to 5 and interrupt her heals."] = "可选：纳塔莉亚等在{area:2744}深处，那是{zone:1451}南部的虫巢。她是62级精英，会精神控制、恐惧，并在血量低于一半时自愈：带3到5人队伍，打断她的治疗。",
	["Optional: {quest:1123}'s chain pays 525 Cenarion reputation over seven quests of level 55 to 57, full at 60. {npc:10881} sends you to {npc:5769} on {area:1639}, who sends you to {quest:1123} in {area:2361}, {zone:1450}."] = "可选：{quest:1123}的任务链在七个55到57级任务中共给525点塞纳里奥声望，60级时给全额。{npc:10881}让你去{area:1639}的{npc:5769}那里，后者再让你去{zone:1450}的{area:2361}找{quest:1123}。",
	["Optional: {quest:6762}'s chain pays 525 Cenarion reputation over seven quests of level 55 to 57, full at 60. {npc:10878} sends you to {npc:3516}, who sends you to {npc:4217}, who sends you to {quest:6762} in {area:2361}, {zone:1450}."] = "可选：{quest:6762}的任务链在七个55到57级任务中共给525点塞纳里奥声望，60级时给全额。{npc:10878}让你去{npc:3516}那里，后者让你去{npc:4217}那里，再让你去{zone:1450}的{area:2361}找{quest:6762}。",
	["Quests elsewhere"] = "其他地区的任务",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 210 text turn-ins (2,100 texts), or less with the rest. From Honored, Bor takes 3 {quest:8363} for 100 (each Duke also gives 25, to Exalted), and {npc:15282} takes one {item:20515} for {quest:9248} (200, once). From Revered, {quest:8343} leads to {quest:8341}: 3 signets and 5 Large Brilliant Shards buy the Ring of Lordship, and set, medallion and ring open the {object:180466} for an Abyssal Lord: a level 63 boss for a raid of about 20, 50 reputation, and an {item:20515}. Bor pays 200 for the first scepter and 150 for each 3 after. Revered opens Mishta's {item:22252} (5g), {item:22660} (9g) and {item:22756} (5g); Exalted is the standing for Champion's Battlegear at {npc:15176}."] = "从崇敬到崇拜需要21,000点声望：交210次文本（2,100份），加上其他途径会更少。从尊敬起，博尔收3个{quest:8363}给100点（每个公爵也给25点，直到崇拜），{npc:15282}收一个{item:20515}用于{quest:9248}（200点，一次）。从崇敬起，{quest:8343}会引向{quest:8341}：3枚印戒和5块大块魔光碎片可换领主之戒，而套装、勋章和戒指能开启{object:180466}，召唤一位深渊领主：63级首领，约20人团队，50点声望，外加一个{item:20515}。博尔为第一根权杖付200点，之后每3根付150点。崇敬解锁米什塔的{item:22252}（5金）、{item:22660}（9金）和{item:22756}（5金）；崇拜是{npc:15176}处冠军战斗装备所需的声望。",
	["Rubbings and brains"] = "拓片与大脑",
	["Rutgar and Frankal hand out the next two quests at their camp. Each hive has a {object:210337} to rub with the {item:20453}, and its silithid drop the brains: {area:2742} north of the Hold, {area:2743} in the west, {area:2744} in the south. Inside {area:2744} waits Mistress Natalia (level 62 elite, mind control and fear; group of 3 to 5). Now and then a hive silithid drops {quest:8308}: it starts a quest for Rutgar worth 100."] = "鲁特加和弗兰卡尔在他们的营地发放接下来的两个任务。每个虫巢都有一个{object:210337}，可用{item:20453}拓印，而虫巢的异种蝎会掉落大脑：要塞以北的{area:2742}、西边的{area:2743}、南边的{area:2744}。{area:2744}深处有纳塔莉亚女士（62级精英，精神控制和恐惧；3到5人队伍）。虫巢异种蝎偶尔会掉落{quest:8308}：它会开启一个给鲁特加的任务，值100点。",
	["Signets and scepters to Exalted"] = "印戒与权杖：到崇拜",
	["Silithyst"] = "希利苏斯晶体",
	["Stonelash Flayers, Pincers and Rock Stalkers live south and south-west of the Hold; their stingers and fangs drop about one time in ten. Dredge Crushers dig south and west of the Hold."] = "石鞭撕掠者、石鞭钳虫和岩石潜伏者住在要塞以南和西南；它们的毒刺和獠牙约十次击杀掉一个。挖掘粉碎者在要塞以南和以西挖掘。",
	["Stonelash Scorpids and Sand Skitterers roam the sands around the Hold; Dredge Strikers dig north-east of it. The {object:180503} lies in the cultist camp south-west of the Hold."] = "石鞭蝎和沙地疾行者在要塞周围的沙地上游荡；挖掘打击者在要塞东北挖掘。{object:180503}在要塞西南的教徒营地里。",
	["Stonelash and Dredge Crushers"] = "石鞭蝎与挖掘粉碎者",
	["Templars and the Abyssal Council"] = "圣殿骑士与深渊议会",
	["The Tortured Druids and Sentinels roam the ruins of {area:2738}, south-east of {area:3425}; the {object:178553} sits on the top floor of its wasp-circled tower."] = "受折磨的德鲁伊和哨兵在{area:2738}的废墟中游荡，位于{area:3425}东南；{object:178553}在它那座被黄蜂环绕的塔顶。",
	["The broken camp in the far north-west of {zone:1451}: the Twilight Tablet Fragments lie on the ground among the ruins."] = "{zone:1451}最西北的破败营地：暮光石板碎片散落在废墟之间的地上。",
	["The cultist camp west of {area:3425}"] = "{area:3425}以西的教徒营地",
	["The dwarves' camp in the south of {zone:1451}. Talk {npc:15171} and {npc:15170} through their whole stories for {quest:8304}. {item:20379} lies on the mountain south-east of the camp. {npc:15196} lives up the trail east of the camp: an elite, and his {spell:10101} can throw you off the cliff."] = "矮人营地在{zone:1451}南部。把{npc:15171}和{npc:15170}的完整故事听完，可获得{quest:8304}。{item:20379}在营地东南的山上。{npc:15196}住在营地以东的小路上：他是精英，他的{spell:10101}能把你打下悬崖。",
	["The emissary in {zone:1454}"] = "{zone:1454}的特使",
	["The emissary in {zone:1455}"] = "{zone:1455}的特使",
	["The nearest Twilight's Hammer camp lies just south-west of the Hold. Avengers, Geolords and Stonecallers (level 57 to 59) each drop an {item:20404} about a third of the time, and every cultist kill is 1 reputation. {npc:11804} walks the edge of the camp. Keep every cultist robe, cowl and mantle you loot: they are the Twilight Trappings for the Wind Stones later."] = "最近的暮光之锤营地就在要塞西南。复仇者、地质领主和唤石者（57到59级）各约三分之一概率掉落一份{item:20404}，而每杀一个教徒得1点声望。{npc:11804}在营地边缘走动。拾到的每一件教徒长袍、头巾和披肩都留着：它们就是之后风石所需的暮光装束。",
	["The three Twilight Keepers"] = "三位暮光守护者",
	["The {area:3100}"] = "{area:3100}",
	["The {area:3454}, when they open"] = "{area:3454}，开放后",
	["The {faction:609}'s other quests are spread over {zone:1414} and the Plaguelands. In Classic a quest pays less once it is 6 or more levels below you (a fifth less per level, down to a fifth): at 60, The Wildlife Suffers Too ({npc:10739}, {zone:1422}, levels 54 and 56) would pay 60 and 75 instead of 75 and 75, and Corruption of Earth and Seed ({area:2100}, level 51) 30 instead of 150. Your first turn-in shows which rule Forever uses. Shards of the Felvine ({quest:1123}, level 60, the {item:18501} from Alzzin in {area:2577}) pays 150 and its Reliquary 100 at any level."] = "{faction:609}的其他任务分布在{zone:1414}和瘟疫之地。在经典旧世，任务比玩家低6级或更多时奖励会减少（每级少五分之一，最低到五分之一）：60级时，《野生动物也受苦》（{npc:10739}，{zone:1422}，54和56级）只给60和75而不是75和75，而《大地与种子的腐化》（{area:2100}，51级）给30而不是150。你第一次交任务就能看出Forever采用哪条规则。《魔藤碎片》（{quest:1123}，60级，{area:2577}中阿尔津掉的{item:18501}）在任何等级都给150，其后续的圣物匣任务给100。",
	["Tortured Druid"] = "受折磨的德鲁伊",
	["Tortured Sentinel"] = "受折磨的哨兵",
	["Twilight Avenger"] = "暮光复仇者",
	["Twilight Flamereaver"] = "暮光裂焰者",
	["Twilight Geolord"] = "暮光地质领主",
	["Twilight Overlord"] = "暮光霸主",
	["Twilight Stonecaller"] = "暮光唤石者",
	["Wanted poster: {npc:15196}, elite"] = "通缉令：{npc:15196}，精英",
	["Wearing a full set of Twilight Trappings (cultist Cowl, Mantle and Robe, about 8%, 8% and 6% per cultist) lets you use a {object:180456}: two stand in each of the three western camps. A random Abyssal Templar appears: a level 60 elite for 1 to 3 players, 5 reputation until the top of Honored and an {item:20513} 93% of the time. The summon uses up the set (and later the medallion and ring too), and if the elemental gets away they are gone: summon only when you can win. {quest:8361} pays 100 for the first crest; after that Bor takes 3 crests for 50. From Friendly, {npc:15270} sends you to {quest:8331}: 3 crests and a {item:14344} buy the Medallion of Station that, worn with a set, opens the larger {object:180461} for a Duke (level 62 elite, group of 5; 25 reputation, {item:20514} 85%)."] = "穿齐一套暮光装束（教徒的头巾、披肩和长袍，每只教徒约8%、8%和6%）就能使用{object:180456}：三个西部营地各立着两个。会随机出现一位深渊圣殿骑士：60级精英，适合1到3名玩家，给5点声望直到尊敬满，并且93%概率掉落{item:20513}。召唤会消耗整套装束（之后还要消耗勋章和戒指），而且如果元素逃掉，它们就没了：只在有把握取胜时才召唤。{quest:8361}为第一枚纹章给100点；之后博尔收3枚纹章给50点。从友善起，{npc:15270}会让你去接{quest:8331}：3枚纹章和一块{item:14344}可换身份勋章；它与套装一起穿戴时，能开启更大的{object:180461}，召唤一位公爵（62级精英，5人队伍；25点声望，85%概率掉{item:20514}）。",
	["deliver Silithyst at the extractor"] = "把希利苏斯晶体送到萃取器",
	["raid of 20"] = "20人团队",
	["{area:3425} is the walled druid camp in north-central {zone:1451}, with flight points for both sides. Everyone starts Neutral with the {faction:609} (druids at 2,000 of 3,000). Bor and {npc:15270} stand together in the main building. {quest:8318} opens the {item:20404} turn-ins for good. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers in this guide are without it."] = "{area:3425}是{zone:1451}中北部有围墙的德鲁伊营地，两阵营都有飞行点。所有人对{faction:609}都从中立起步（德鲁伊为3,000中的2,000）。博尔和{npc:15270}一起站在主建筑里。{quest:8318}会永久开放{item:20404}的交纳。传承特长“外交家”可使每次获取量最多提高10%；本指南中的数字不含它。",
	["{item:20385}, elite: group of 2 or 3"] = "{item:20385}，精英：2或3人队伍",
	["{item:20404}: save them"] = "{item:20404}：留着",
	["{item:20452}, from the {object:180503}"] = "{item:20452}，来自{object:180503}",
	["{item:20452}, from {item:20424} and {item:3713}"] = "{item:20452}，来自{item:20424}和{item:3713}",
	["{item:20456}, deep in {area:2744}"] = "{item:20456}，在{area:2744}深处",
	["{item:20465}, {npc:14862}: raid of 20"] = "{item:20465}，{npc:14862}：20人团队",
	["{item:20513}: Templar, group of 1 to 3"] = "{item:20513}：圣殿骑士，1到3人队伍",
	["{item:20514}: Duke, group of 5"] = "{item:20514}：公爵，5人队伍",
	["{item:20515}: Lord, raid of 20"] = "{item:20515}：领主，20人团队",
	["{item:22216}: raid of 20"] = "{item:22216}：20人团队",
	["{npc:11939} in {area:2361}"] = "{area:2361}的{npc:11939}",
	["{npc:15170}: 100"] = "{npc:15170}：100",
	["{npc:15171} and {npc:15170}"] = "{npc:15171}和{npc:15170}",
	["{npc:15174}, for Cooks"] = "{npc:15174}，给厨师",
	["{npc:15189} and {npc:15190} stand upstairs in their building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15189}和{npc:15190}站在他们建筑的上层：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["{npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15189}站在他建筑的上层：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["{npc:15190} and Proudhorn"] = "{npc:15190}和傲角",
	["{npc:15190} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "{npc:15190}站在他建筑的上层：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。",
	["{npc:15191}, after {quest:8275}"] = "{npc:15191}，完成{quest:8275}后",
	["{npc:15194} hides in the hills of eastern {zone:1451}. He also decodes {quest:8319} for a chance at a scroll of beckoning, but {quest:8349} pays the reputation: keep the texts for Bor."] = "{npc:15194}藏在{zone:1451}东部的山丘里。他也能解读{quest:8319}，有机会得到一张召唤卷轴，但{quest:8349}才给声望：把文本留给博尔。",
	["{npc:15201}: still counts at 5,999 Friendly"] = "{npc:15201}：友善5,999时仍计入",
	["{npc:15270}, Friendly"] = "{npc:15270}，友善",
	["{npc:15270}, Revered"] = "{npc:15270}，崇敬",
	["{npc:15270}, level 60"] = "{npc:15270}，60级",
	["{npc:15306}: 10 texts, 100"] = "{npc:15306}：10份文本，100",
	["{npc:15306}: 10 texts, 100, for the last point"] = "{npc:15306}：10份文本，100，用于最后一点",
	["{npc:15540} stands by the moonwell of {area:3425}. {quest:8507} (25 reputation, repeatable) sends you with unsigned papers to your side's captain: {npc:15440}'s Ironforge Brigade outside {area:2743} (Alliance) or {npc:15612}'s Orgrimmar Legion outside {area:2744} (Horde). Use the papers first, then talk to the captain: a level 60 elite silithid attacks; keep the captain alive and he signs. Kaldon then lets you pick a Combat, Logistics or {item:20809}, each holding a random briefing worth 50 reputation and a badge: 30 hive silithid kills (elites), goods such as 30 Heavy Runecloth Bandages or 3 {item:7936}, or one Templar, {npc:15542} or scout report. One badge of each kind buys {quest:9338} at Kaldon: 200 reputation, repeatable. A full round is about 375 reputation."] = "{npc:15540}站在{area:3425}的月井旁。{quest:8507}（25点声望，可重复）会让你带着未签署的文件去找本阵营的队长：{area:2743}外{npc:15440}的铁炉堡旅（联盟），或{area:2744}外{npc:15612}的奥格瑞玛军团（部落）。先使用文件，再和队长交谈：一只60级精英异种蝎会攻击；让队长活下来，他就会签字。然后卡尔东让你选择战斗、后勤或{item:20809}，每份都含一份随机简报，值50点声望和一枚徽章：30只虫巢异种蝎（精英）、30卷厚符文布绷带或3个{item:7936}之类的货物，或一位圣殿骑士、{npc:15542}或侦察报告。在卡尔东处每种各一枚徽章可换{quest:9338}：200点声望，可重复。完整一轮约375点声望。",
	["{npc:16091}: 100"] = "{npc:16091}：100",
	["{quest:1123} lives in {area:2361}. She sends you to {npc:13220} at {area:3077}, the camp in the north-east corner of {zone:1451}."] = "{quest:1123}住在{area:2361}。她让你去{area:3077}的{npc:13220}那里，那是{zone:1451}东北角的营地。",
	["{quest:8308}, a rare drop"] = "{quest:8308}，稀有掉落",
	["{quest:8314} leads to {quest:8315}: {npc:15183} sends you to the {area:3257} to summon {npc:14862}, a level 63 boss for a raid of about 20. Take it only with a raid."] = "{quest:8314}会引向{quest:8315}：{npc:15183}让你去{area:3257}召唤{npc:14862}，一个63级首领，需要约20人团队。只在有团队时再去。",
	["{quest:8319} to Revered"] = "{quest:8319}：到崇敬",
	["{quest:8321} (level 61, not elite) waits at the back of {area:3446}, the cave in the north-east of {zone:1451}. Flamereavers and Twilight Masters guard the way: the Flamereavers count until the top of Honored, the Masters stop at the top of Friendly like the other cultists."] = "{quest:8321}（61级，非精英）等在{area:3446}深处，那是{zone:1451}东北的洞穴。裂焰者和暮光大师把守道路：裂焰者计入到尊敬满，而大师和其他教徒一样在友善满时停止。",
	["{quest:8507}, level 60"] = "{quest:8507}，60级",
	["{quest:8800}: {npc:15176}'s badge gear"] = "{quest:8800}：{npc:15176}的徽章装备",
	["{zone:1451} quests at {area:3425}"] = "{zone:1451}任务：{area:3425}",
}

G["forever/class/hunter/the-hunters-charm"] = {
	["Experience at 50 through {zone:1447} and the {area:1417}; Classic's item choice may be gone on Forever."] = "50级时在{zone:1447}和{area:1417}获得经验；经典旧世的物品选择在Forever可能已取消。",
	["Hunter"] = "猎人",
	["In Classic Ogtinc let you choose the {item:19991}, the {item:19992} or the {item:20083} here. Forever's change notes say the choice is gone, though its quest page still lists three unnamed rewards: look at the reward window before you hand in."] = "经典旧世中，奥格廷克曾让你在这里选择{item:19991}、{item:19992}或{item:20083}。Forever的更新说明称该选择已取消，但任务页面仍列出三个未命名的奖励：交任务前先看清奖励窗口。",
	["Morphaz is an elite green drake (level 52) inside the {area:1417}, a five-player dungeon: needs a group of five. The temple stands in the {area:74} in eastern {zone:1435}: climb its outer steps, dive into the flooded hall and follow the stairs down to the entrance. Horde: fly to {area:75}; Alliance: fly to {area:1438} or {area:42} and ride on. He is not there when you arrive: first kill the six troll guardians on the platforms around the upper ring, which opens the way down to {npc:5710} in the Pit of Sacrifice. Jammal'an's death brings out two drakes, Weaver and Dreamscythe (pull them one at a time); when both are dead, Morphaz and Hazzas appear together and cannot be split. Clear the dragonkin around the pit first, because they call for help. Morphaz uses {spell:12533} and {spell:11019}. The tooth always drops. Warriors in the group may want the same run for the voodoo feathers of the balcony trolls."] = "莫法兹是{area:1417}（5人副本）内的一只52级精英绿龙：需要五人小队。神庙位于{zone:1435}东部的{area:74}：登上外层台阶，潜入淹水大厅，再沿楼梯向下走到入口。部落：飞到{area:75}；联盟：飞到{area:1438}或{area:42}，然后继续骑行。你到达时他并不在：先杀掉上层环廊平台上的六个巨魔守卫，这会打开通往献祭之池中{npc:5710}的路。贾玛兰一死，两条龙——韦弗和梦镰——就会出现（一次拉一只）；两条都死后，莫法兹和哈扎斯会一起出现，且无法分开。先清掉坑周围的龙类，因为它们会呼叫增援。莫法兹会使用{spell:12533}和{spell:11019}。牙齿必定掉落。队伍里的战士可能也想要这趟副本，去拿露台巨魔的巫毒羽毛。",
	["You need six {item:20087}. Wavethrashers (three-headed sea beasts) live along {zone:1447}'s coasts, mostly underwater: the Young Wavethrashers (level 51-52) of the north-east shore drop a scale about one kill in three, the Wavethrashers (52-53) of the east coast by the {area:1229} about as often (a few walk the beach there), the Great Wavethrashers (53-54) of the south-east shore about one in seven. {spell:1494} does not show them; fight them where you can breathe, and bring water breathing if you can. Elite sharks swim the deeper water."] = "你需要六个{item:20087}。破浪者（三头海兽）生活在{zone:1447}的海岸一带，大多在水下：东北海岸的幼年破浪者（51-52级）约三次击杀掉一片鳞片；东海岸{area:1229}附近的破浪者（52-53级）掉率差不多（有几只会走上那片海滩）；东南海岸的巨型破浪者（53-54级）约七分之一。{spell:1494}无法显示它们；在能呼吸的地方与它们战斗，可以的话带上水下呼吸。深水区有精英鲨鱼游弋。",
	["You need two Perfect Courser Antlers. Mosshoof Coursers (level 52-53, deer) graze all over {zone:1447} and drop one about one kill in twelve, so expect two dozen kills. Good herds: north of the {area:1220} in the north, and the hills north-east and south-east of {area:1237}; the {area:1234} area also has elite giants and dragonkin. They Enrage at 30% health. Coursers share spawn points with the Thunderhead hippogryphs: if none are around, kill the hippogryphs and coursers may spawn instead. Respawn is about five and a half minutes."] = "你需要两只完美的骏马鹿角。苔蹄骏马（52-53级，鹿）遍布{zone:1447}，约十二次击杀掉一只，所以准备杀上二十多只。好猎场：北部{area:1220}以北，以及{area:1237}东北和东南的丘陵；{area:1234}一带还有精英巨人和龙类。它们在血量30%时会狂暴。骏马与雷首角鹰兽共享刷新点：如果周围没有骏马，就杀角鹰兽，骏马可能会顶替刷新。刷新时间约五分半。",
	["{item:20017}, from Mosshoof Coursers"] = "{item:20017}，来自苔蹄骏马",
	["{npc:8405} lives on a raised spot on the cliffs at the north-east rim of the {area:1221}, west-central {zone:1447}. Keep to the high ridges around the ruins: the pit below does not lead up to him. Alliance: fly to {area:3137}; Horde: fly to {area:1237}, a short ride west of him."] = "{npc:8405}住在{area:1221}东北边缘的悬崖上一处高台，位于{zone:1447}中西部。沿着废墟周围的高脊走：下面的坑无法通到他那里。联盟：飞到{area:3137}；部落：飞到{area:1237}，再向西骑一小段路即到。",
}

G["forever/class/warlock/impsys-request"] = {
	["Amber Voodoo Feathers: Gasher, {npc:5716}"] = "琥珀色巫毒羽毛：加舍尔、{npc:5716}",
	["At 50 {npc:3326} in the {object:172960} sends you to {npc:14470} in {zone:1448} with a piece of {item:14256}."] = "50级时，{object:172960}里的{npc:3326}让你带着一块{item:14256}去{zone:1448}找{npc:14470}。",
	["At 50 {npc:4563} in the {object:36082} sends you to {npc:14470} in {zone:1448} with a piece of {item:14256}."] = "50级时，{object:36082}里的{npc:4563}让你带着一块{item:14256}去{zone:1448}找{npc:14470}。",
	["At 50 {npc:461} in the {object:2164}, in the {object:2101}, sends you to {npc:14470} in {zone:1448} with a piece of {item:14256}."] = "50级时，{object:2101}中{object:2164}里的{npc:461}让你带着一块{item:14256}去{zone:1448}找{npc:14470}。",
	["At 50 {npc:5172} in {zone:1455} sends you to {npc:14470} in {zone:1448} with a piece of {item:14256}."] = "50级时，{zone:1455}的{npc:5172}让你带着一块{item:14256}去{zone:1448}找{npc:14470}。",
	["Blue Voodoo Feathers: Hukku, Mijan"] = "蓝色巫毒羽毛：胡库、米詹",
	["Choose the {item:20536} (staff), the {item:20534} (off-hand) or the {item:20530}."] = "选择{item:20536}（法杖）、{item:20534}（副手）或{item:20530}。",
	["Green Voodoo Feathers: Zolo, Loro"] = "绿色巫毒羽毛：佐洛、洛罗",
	["One {item:14256}: the Jadefire satyrs of {zone:1448} drop it about one kill in fourteen, and so do the Legashi satyrs and the Felguard Sentries you hunt for Niby's essences. Quicker: buy one at the Auction House. You need it for the trainer's {quest:8419} or for {npc:14470}'s own {quest:8420}, the same errand: whichever you hold."] = "一块{item:14256}：{zone:1448}的碧火萨特约十四次击杀掉一个，你为尼比的精华而猎杀的雷加什萨特和恶魔卫士哨兵也一样。更快的方法：在拍卖行买一块。训练师的{quest:8419}或{npc:14470}自己的{quest:8420}都需要它，其实是同一件事：你手上有哪个任务就用哪个。",
	["The Irontree treants (level 52) of {area:1767}, in northern {zone:1448} west of {area:1998}, drop {item:20613} one time in four; the big {npc:7149} (55) often drops three at once but hits hard and dazes. The Tainted Oozes (51) around {npc:14470} and along the Bloodvenom drop the essence one time in five."] = "{area:1767}（{zone:1448}北部、{area:1998}以西）的铁树林树人（52级）约四次击杀掉一个{item:20613}；那只巨大的{npc:7149}（55级）常常一次掉三个，但伤害高、会把人打晕。{npc:14470}周围和毒血河沿岸的被污染的软泥怪（51级）约五次掉一个精华。",
	["The {area:1417} ({area:1477}, level 50-56, a group of five) stands in the middle of the {area:74}: swim down into the temple and take the stairs to the entrance. The six troll guardians (level 51-52, elite) stand on the balconies around the central pit, each with adds; each drops his feather every time: Gasher and {npc:5716} the Amber, Hukku and Mijan the Blue, Zolo and Loro the Green. Not soloable at 52."] = "{area:1417}（{area:1477}，50-56级，5人小队）位于{area:74}中部：游进神庙，沿楼梯走到入口。六个巨魔守卫（51-52级，精英）站在中央坑周围的露台上，各自带着小怪；每个守卫每次必掉自己的羽毛：加舍尔和{npc:5716}掉琥珀色，胡库和米詹掉蓝色，佐洛和洛罗掉绿色。52级无法单刷。",
	["Warlock"] = "术士",
	["{npc:14470} now wants six {item:20609} from the {area:1417}: a dungeon run."] = "{npc:14470}现在要六个来自{area:1417}的{item:20609}：得下一趟副本。",
	["{npc:14470} waits beside {npc:14469} on a rise just north-east of {area:1997}: coming north over the {area:1765} bridge, they stand off the road to the east, past a few oozes. Hand him the trainer's {quest:8419} with the cloth. Next he wants ten {item:20613} and four {item:20614}."] = "{npc:14470}在{area:1997}东北方的一处高地上，就在{npc:14469}旁边：从{area:1765}桥上向北走，他们站在路东侧、离路有点距离，要经过几只软泥怪。把带着布的{quest:8419}交给他。接下来他要十个{item:20613}和四个{item:20614}。",
	["{npc:14470} waits beside {npc:14469} on a rise just north-east of {area:1997}: coming north over the {area:1765} bridge, they stand off the road to the east, past a few oozes. Take his own {quest:8420} and hand him the cloth at once. Next he wants ten {item:20613} and four {item:20614}."] = "{npc:14470}在{area:1997}东北方的一处高地上，就在{npc:14469}旁边：从{area:1765}桥上向北走，他们站在路东侧、离路有点距离，要经过几只软泥怪。接他本人的{quest:8420}，并立即把布交给他。接下来他要十个{item:20613}和四个{item:20614}。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/lil-timmy"] = {
	["Horde players buy the {npc:7386} (60s) from {npc:262471}, a trader new in Forever, at {area:2539}, the Darkspear camp at the southern tip of {zone:1442}, on the way up from the {zone:1413}. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goal stays ticked afterwards."] = "部落玩家从{npc:262471}处购买{npc:7386}（60银）。他是Forever新增的商人，位于{area:2539}，即{zone:1442}南端的暗矛营地，从{zone:1413}上来的路上。每件宠物物品在使用时都会教会对应的伙伴；之后该目标仍保持打勾。",
	["{npc:8666} sells the {npc:7386} (60s). He starts at {object:2098} and walks through the {object:2096}, {object:2100} and the {object:28027} before he vanishes near the square again; if he is not around, wait for him at {object:2098}. By beta reports he carries one kitten at a time: if he has none, someone just bought it. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goal stays ticked afterwards."] = "{npc:8666}出售{npc:7386}（60银）。他从{object:2098}出发，穿过{object:2096}、{object:2100}和{object:28027}，然后在广场附近再次消失；如果找不到他，就在{object:2098}等他。据测试服报告，他一次只带一只小猫：如果他没有，那就是刚被人买走了。每件宠物物品在使用时都会教会对应的伙伴；之后该目标仍保持打勾。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/musical-gustjumper"] = {
	["From {area:16635} follow the road south, then cut across the field to the top of the waterfall: five frogs sit together on a rock there, by a log. Mobs patrol nearby, so a level 1 character should watch its back. Stand by the rock, target a frog and type /sing. The frogs sing back, the group disappears and one frog hops onto the log beside you: click it to take the {item:268109}, then use it to learn the pet. The item is not bound until you use it, so a friend on the island can sing again and trade you one."] = "从{area:16635}沿路向南，然后穿过田野走到瀑布顶端：五只青蛙一起坐在那里的岩石上，旁边有根木头。附近有怪物巡逻，1级角色要小心背后。站到岩石旁，选中一只青蛙，输入 /sing。青蛙会回唱，蛙群随即消失，一只青蛙跳到身边的木头上：点击它拿到{item:268109}，然后使用它学会宠物。该物品在使用前不会绑定，所以岛上的朋友可以再唱一次，然后交易给你一只。",
	["{zone:2521} is the Skyborne starting island; by beta reports anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the cliffs south of {area:17045}, north of {zone:1456}, about every five minutes (another flies from {area:279}; either faction may take either)."] = "{zone:2521}是天裔的新手岛；据测试服报告，任何人都可以去。一艘飞船约每五分钟从{area:17045}以南、{zone:1456}以北的悬崖起飞（另一艘从{area:279}飞往；双方阵营都可乘坐任一班）。",
	["{zone:2521} is the Skyborne starting island; by beta reports anyone may visit. A skyboat leaves the north side of {area:279} about every five minutes (another flies from north of {zone:1456}; either faction may take either)."] = "{zone:2521}是天裔的新手岛；据测试服报告，任何人都可以去。一艘飞船约每五分钟从{area:279}北侧起飞（另一艘从{zone:1456}以北飞往；双方阵营都可乘坐任一班）。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/weevil-k-neevil"] = {
	["Back to {npc:217412}"] = "返回{npc:217412}",
	["Hand {npc:217412} the three specimens: she gives you {item:280456} and 35s."] = "把三只标本交给{npc:217412}：她会给你{item:280456}和35银。",
	["The Arbor Tarantulas sit in northern Stranglethorn. Use the kit's tool on one to catch it."] = "林木狼蛛栖息在荆棘谷北部。用工具包里的工具对一只使用，即可捕捉。",
	["The Flesh Pickers feed in the {area:596} in the middle of southern {zone:1443}. Use the kit's tool on one."] = "食肉虫在{zone:1443}南部中段的{area:596}觅食。用工具包里的工具对一只使用。",
	["The Hay Weevils crawl in the north-west of {zone:1417}. Use the kit's tool on one."] = "干草象鼻虫在{zone:1417}西北部爬行。用工具包里的工具对一只使用。",
	["{npc:217412}, a Forsaken bug collector, keeps her menagerie in western {zone:1435}. She hands you an Entomology Starter Kit: open it for the tools that catch the three bugs. The bugs are far apart (northern Stranglethorn, {zone:1417} and {zone:1443}), so do them while you pass. If you lose the kit, she sells another for 50s."] = "{npc:217412}是被遗忘者的昆虫收集者，在{zone:1435}西部养着她的虫笼。她交给你一个昆虫学入门工具包：打开它，取出捕捉这三种虫子的工具。三种虫子相距很远（荆棘谷北部、{zone:1417}和{zone:1443}），所以顺路去做。如果弄丢了工具包，她还会以50银再卖一个给你。",
	["{npc:217588} in {zone:1434}"] = "{npc:217588}在{zone:1434}",
	["{npc:217589} in {zone:1417}"] = "{npc:217589}在{zone:1417}",
	["{npc:217590} in {zone:1443}"] = "{npc:217590}在{zone:1443}",
}

G["forever/exploration/kalimdor-1-30"] = {
	["Go back west across the {zone:1413}; the road west from {area:378} climbs through the only pass into {zone:1412}, tauren country with guards at {area:222} and {zone:1456}."] = "向西穿过{zone:1413}返回；从{area:378}向西的路翻越唯一的山口进入{zone:1412}，那是牛头人的地盘，{area:222}和{zone:1456}都有守卫。",
	["Leave {zone:1412} by the same pass and ride south through the {zone:1413} to the {area:485} down into {zone:1441}. {area:484} is a Horde town."] = "从同一个山口离开{zone:1412}，向南穿过{zone:1413}，沿{area:485}向下进入{zone:1441}。{area:484}是部落城镇。",
	["Leave {zone:1412} by the same pass, ride north through the {zone:1413} and west at {area:1702} into the {zone:1442}. {area:460} is the Horde town; {area:467} in the north is Alliance."] = "从同一个山口离开{zone:1412}，向北穿过{zone:1413}，在{area:1702}向西进入{zone:1442}。{area:460}是部落城镇；北边的{area:467}是联盟的。",
	["The road east out of south-eastern Stonetalon comes down into the {zone:1413} at {area:1702}. {area:380} and {area:378} are Horde towns; {area:392} is a neutral port."] = "从石爪山东南部向东的路在{area:1702}下降到{zone:1413}。{area:380}和{area:378}是部落城镇；{area:392}是中立港口。",
	["The road west from {area:378} climbs through the only pass into {zone:1412}."] = "从{area:378}向西的路翻越唯一的山口进入{zone:1412}。",
