G["forever/professions/skinning"] = {
	["Any {skill:393} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:393} at any level (10c), and so does the Junior Skinning Trainer in each starting area; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:7005} from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot skin without it. The first-hour quest of each starting area (Rascally Rodents, Coldridge Valley Mail Delivery, The Woodland Protector, Galgar's {item:11584}, A Humble Task, Marla's Last Wish) offers {item:247846} as a reward: reading it gives 2 skill, up to 15. Trade goods vendors and the junior trainers sell the {item:277114}, a four-slot bag for leather and hides (25c). If you sat at your starting area's campfire for The Great Outdoors, the camping guide there also offers Camping 101: {skill:393}: hand it in to the skinning trainer it names once you reach skill 20, for the {spell:1229517} recipe."] = "本阵营任意{skill:393}训练师都教初级{skill:393}，不限角色等级（10铜）；每个新手地区的初级剥皮训练师也一样；箭头会指向最近的一位。从材料商或杂货商处买一把{item:7005}：放在背包里，没有它就无法剥皮。每个新手地区的第一小时任务（《淘气的地鼠》、《寒脊山谷邮件投递》、《林地保护者》、加尔加的{item:11584}、《谦卑的任务》、《玛拉的遗愿》）都会把{item:247846}作为奖励：阅读它可获得2点技能，最高到15。材料商和初级训练师还出售{item:277114}，一个四格皮革与毛皮背包（25铜）。如果你为了《户外活动》在新手地区的营火旁坐过，那里的露营指南还会提供“露营入门：{skill:393}”：技能达到20后交给它指定的剥皮训练师，可得{spell:1229517}配方。",
	["Artisan {skill:393} raises the cap to 300; it needs skill 200 and no character level, and costs 5g: train it as soon as you reach 200. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:393} trainer of your faction."] = "大师级{skill:393}把上限提高到300；需要技能200，不限角色等级，费用5金：一到200就立刻去学。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:393}训练师。",
	["Beasts 1-10: {zone:2521} (1-50)"] = "野兽1-10级：{zone:2521}（1-50）",
	["Beasts 19-22: {zone:1440} (100-125)"] = "野兽19-22级：{zone:1440}（100-125）",
	["Beasts 19-29: {zone:1440} (125-150)"] = "野兽19-29级：{zone:1440}（125-150）",
	["Beasts 21-33: {zone:1416} (150-175)"] = "野兽21-33级：{zone:1416}（150-175）",
	["Beasts 35-41: {zone:1435} (200-225)"] = "野兽35-41级：{zone:1435}（200-225）",
	["Beasts 51-55: {zone:1422} (275-300)"] = "野兽51-55级：{zone:1422}（275-300）",
	["Expert {skill:393} raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and no character level, and costs 50s: train it as soon as you reach 125. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:393} trainer of your faction."] = "高级{skill:393}把上限提高到225；需要技能125，不限角色等级，费用50银：一到125就立刻去学。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:393}训练师。",
	["Galestrider, Prideclaw"] = "风行者、傲爪兽",
	["Goretusk, {npc:547}"] = "血牙野猪、{npc:547}",
	["Journeyman {skill:393} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and no character level, and costs 5s: train it as soon as you reach 50. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:393} trainer of your faction. {spell:1229517}, Forever's camping item for {skill:393}, is taught from skill 20 (1s, or free from Camping 101: {skill:393}): three {item:2318} and two {item:4470} each, it gives points until 25; placed beside a campfire it gives everyone at the camp a buff for an hour."] = "中级{skill:393}把上限提高到150；需要技能50，不限角色等级，费用5银：一到50就立刻去学。箭头会指向本阵营最近的{skill:393}训练师。{spell:1229517}是Forever的{skill:393}露营物品，技能20起可学（1银，或通过“露营入门：{skill:393}”免费获得）：每次需要三张{item:2318}和两个{item:4470}，可提供技能点直到25；放在营火旁时，会给营地中的所有人一小时增益。",
	["Kill and skin Cloudrunner (6), Galestrider (5), {npc:250928} (7), {npc:251284} (6), {npc:251291} (6), {npc:250873} (1), {npc:251707} (8), Prideclaw (5), {npc:250926} (3), {npc:256092} (10), {npc:253282} (8), {npc:250937} (4), Vuldren (6), {npc:250874} (10), {npc:254588} (8) along the loop until {skill:393} 50; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-15. Expect about 60 beasts for these 49 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：云奔者（6级）、风行者（5级）、{npc:250928}（7级）、{npc:251284}（6级）、{npc:251291}（6级）、{npc:250873}（1级）、{npc:251707}（8级）、傲爪兽（5级）、{npc:250926}（3级）、{npc:256092}（10级）、{npc:253282}（8级）、{npc:250937}（4级）、鹫龙（6级）、{npc:250874}（10级）、{npc:254588}（8级），直到{skill:393}达到50；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级1-15。这49点大约需要60只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin Coyote (10), {npc:833} (11), {npc:454} (12), Goretusk (14), {npc:547} (16, needs 60) along the loop until {skill:393} 100; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 130 beasts for these 50 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：土狼（10级）、{npc:833}（11级）、{npc:454}（12级）、血牙野猪（14级）、{npc:547}（16级，需技能60），直到{skill:393}达到100；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级10-20。这50点大约需要130只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin Worg (10), {npc:1778} (11), {npc:1766} (11), {npc:1797} (12), {npc:1923} (16, needs 60) along the loop until {skill:393} 100; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 160 beasts for these 50 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：座狼（10级）、{npc:1778}（11级）、{npc:1766}（11级）、{npc:1797}（12级）、{npc:1923}（16级，需技能60），直到{skill:393}达到100；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级10-20。这50点大约需要160只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin {npc:1084} (35), {npc:1082} (38), {npc:768} (39), {npc:1087} (41, needs 205) along the loop until {skill:393} 225; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 35-45. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:1084}（35级）、{npc:1082}（38级）、{npc:768}（39级）、{npc:1087}（41级，需技能205），直到{skill:393}达到225；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级35-45。这25点大约需要30只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin {npc:1125} (5), {npc:1127} (7), {npc:1196} (7), {npc:1199} (5), {npc:1126} (6), {npc:704} (2), {npc:705} (1), {npc:1689} (9), {npc:708} (3), {npc:1201} (7), {npc:1138} (6), {npc:1131} (7), {npc:1128} (5) along the loop until {skill:393} 50; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 beasts for these 49 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:1125}（5级）、{npc:1127}（7级）、{npc:1196}（7级）、{npc:1199}（5级）、{npc:1126}（6级）、{npc:704}（2级）、{npc:705}（1级）、{npc:1689}（9级）、{npc:708}（3级）、{npc:1201}（7级）、{npc:1138}（6级）、{npc:1131}（7级）、{npc:1128}（5级），直到{skill:393}达到50；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin {npc:1150} (30), {npc:683} (30), {npc:855} (30), {npc:681} (30), {npc:688} (31), {npc:1108} (32), Panther (32), {npc:682} (32), {npc:685} (33), {npc:689} (34), {npc:1085} (34), {npc:686} (35), {npc:1151} (35), {npc:1152} (35), {npc:854} (36, needs 180), {npc:684} (37, needs 185), {npc:690} (39, needs 195) along the loop until {skill:393} 200; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 30-45. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:1150}（30级）、{npc:683}（30级）、{npc:855}（30级）、{npc:681}（30级）、{npc:688}（31级）、{npc:1108}（32级）、黑豹（32级）、{npc:682}（32级）、{npc:685}（33级）、{npc:689}（34级）、{npc:1085}（34级）、{npc:686}（35级）、{npc:1151}（35级）、{npc:1152}（35级）、{npc:854}（36级，需技能180）、{npc:684}（37级，需技能185）、{npc:690}（39级，需技能195），直到{skill:393}达到200；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级30-45。这25点大约需要30只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin {npc:1190} (10), {npc:1186} (11), {npc:1188} (13), {npc:1693} (14), {npc:1191} (14), {npc:1189} (16, needs 60), {npc:1192} (16, needs 60) along the loop until {skill:393} 100; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 10-20. Expect about 100 beasts for these 50 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:1190}（10级）、{npc:1186}（11级）、{npc:1188}（13级）、{npc:1693}（14级）、{npc:1191}（14级）、{npc:1189}（16级，需技能60）、{npc:1192}（16级，需技能60），直到{skill:393}达到100；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级10-20。这50点大约需要100只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin {npc:1548} (7), {npc:1547} (5), Duskbat (1), {npc:1553} (6), {npc:1513} (3), {npc:1549} (9), {npc:1554} (8) along the loop until {skill:393} 50; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 beasts for these 49 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:1548}（7级）、{npc:1547}（5级）、暮色蝙蝠（1级）、{npc:1553}（6级）、{npc:1513}（3级）、{npc:1549}（9级）、{npc:1554}（8级），直到{skill:393}达到50；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin {npc:1815} (51), {npc:1817} (53), {npc:1816} (55) along the loop until {skill:393} 300; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 51-58. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:1815}（51级）、{npc:1817}（53级）、{npc:1816}（55级），直到{skill:393}达到300；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级51-58。这25点大约需要30只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin {npc:1922} (7), {npc:525} (5), Prowler (9), {npc:524} (7), {npc:113} (5), {npc:69} (2), {npc:822} (8), {npc:299} (1) along the loop until {skill:393} 50; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. A quest here needs {skill:393}: Rough Wolf Pelts (level 7, {npc:6306}). Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 beasts for these 49 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:1922}（7级）、{npc:525}（5级）、徘徊者（9级）、{npc:524}（7级）、{npc:113}（5级）、{npc:69}（2级）、{npc:822}（8级）、{npc:299}（1级），直到{skill:393}达到50；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。这里有个任务需要{skill:393}：《粗糙的狼皮》（7级，{npc:6306}）。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60只野兽。",
	["Kill and skin {npc:2033} (8), {npc:2032} (2), Nightsaber (5), {npc:2043} (7), {npc:1985} (2), {npc:2031} (1), {npc:1984} (1) along the loop until {skill:393} 50; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. Zone level 1-10. Expect about 60 beasts for these 49 points."] = "沿环线击杀并剥皮：{npc:2033}（8级）、{npc:2032}（2级）、夜刃豹（5级）、{npc:2043}（7级）、{npc:1985}（2级）、{npc:2031}（1级）、{npc:1984}（1级），直到{skill:393}达到50；每具尸体先拾取再剥皮，并尽量剥取技能允许的最高等级野兽。L级野兽所需技能：20级及以下为(L-10)×10，20级以上为L×5。区域等级1-10。这49点大约需要60只野兽。",
