G["forever/reputation/steamwheedle-cartel"] = {
	["100 to every town"] = "每座城镇100",
	["100 {faction:577}"] = "{faction:577}100",
	["25 to every town"] = "每座城镇25",
	["50 {faction:577}"] = "{faction:577}50",
	["Back to {npc:10267}"] = "返回{npc:10267}",
	["Back to {npc:14637}"] = "返回{npc:14637}",
	["Black Broodlings in the north-east"] = "东北方的黑色雏龙",
	["Dire Maul North: {npc:14338}"] = "厄运之槌北区：{npc:14338}",
	["Every goblin town at once: {npc:14637}'s zapped giants and {npc:14338}'s shackles, then five new quartermasters and their hats."] = "一次搞定所有地精城镇：{npc:14637}的被电巨人任务和{npc:14338}的镣铐，然后还有五名新军需官和他们的帽子。",
	["Every town to Exalted"] = "每座城镇到崇拜",
	["Every town to Friendly"] = "每座城镇到友善",
	["Every town to Honored"] = "每座城镇到尊敬",
	["Every town to Revered"] = "每座城镇到崇敬",
	["Five goblin towns share one reputation family, the Steamwheedle Cartel: {faction:470}, {faction:21}, {faction:369}, {faction:577} and Forever's new {faction:2827} in the {zone:2548}. Everyone starts each at Neutral (500 into it). A gain with one town gives the others half as much; a quest for the Cartel itself, like {npc:14637}'s, pays every town in full. Losses spread the same way: a {npc:4624} or any goblin of the towns costs 125 (half that with the other towns), and Bloodsail Buccaneers reputation is earned only that way. {npc:14637} camps on the road through central {zone:1444} and works for anyone, even players the goblins hate. His first two quests are level 48: in Classic they paid less once you were 6 or more levels above them (a fifth at 57 and up), but they open his repeatables, which are level 55 and pay in full at 60."] = "五座地精城镇共享同一个声望阵营——热砂港财团：{faction:470}、{faction:21}、{faction:369}、{faction:577}，以及Forever在{zone:2548}新增的{faction:2827}。每个人每座城镇都从中立开始（已有500点进度）。在一座城镇获得的声望，会将其余城镇各分到一半；而像{npc:14637}这样直接为财团做的任务，则全额计入每座城镇。损失也照此分摊：一个{npc:4624}或这些城镇的任何地精会损失125点（其余城镇减半），血帆海盗的声望只能靠这种方式获得。{npc:14637}在穿越{zone:1444}中部的路旁扎营，为任何人工作，甚至包括地精们憎恨的玩家。他的头两个任务是48级：经典旧世中，当你高出它们6级或更多时收益会减少（57级及以上只有五分之一），但完成它们会开启他的可重复任务——那些是55级，60级时全额给付。",
	["Forever's goblin quartermasters: gear for levels 20 to 50 at Friendly and Honored"] = "Forever的地精军需官：友善和尊敬可购20至50级装备",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 240 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins, or 40 Free Knot runs, or a mix. Nothing can be saved up: residue and cores drop only while their quest is in your log, and you can carry one {item:18250} at a time, so hand each in before the next run. Honored opens each quartermaster's blue items."] = "友善到尊敬需要6,000点：240次{npc:14637}的上交，或40趟“解救诺特”，也可以混合。无法提前囤积：残渣和核心只在该任务在你的日志中时才会掉落，而且你一次只能携带一个{item:18250}，所以每趟都要先把上一个交掉。尊敬会开放各军需官的蓝色装备。",
	["From now on {npc:14637} offers {quest:7725} (10 residue) and {quest:7726} (6 cores), again and again: 25 reputation with every town each time."] = "从此以后，{npc:14637}会反复提供{quest:7725}（10个残渣）和{quest:7726}（6个核心）：每次每座城镇25点声望。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000 more: 480 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins (4,800 residue) or 80 Free Knot runs. Revered opens the five cosmetic hats, the reason most players do this. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "尊敬到崇敬还需12,000点：480次{npc:14637}的上交（4,800个残渣）或80趟“解救诺特”。崇敬会开放五顶装饰用帽子，多数玩家就是为此而来。传承专长“外交家”最多额外增加10%。",
	["Neutral 500 to Friendly is 2,500 with each town. The quests above pay every town up to 700 ({npc:14637}'s two 300, {npc:10267}'s 150, the first Free Knot 150 and the first Ogre Suit 100; less when you are well above their level); {npc:14637}'s repeatables do the rest, 25 to every town each: 10 residue (ten giants) or 6 cores (about twelve elementals). The towns' own quests count too, each giving the other towns half: {faction:470}'s in the {zone:1413} (levels 10-25, about 4,300: the Samophlange chain 625, {npc:3446}'s errands, the Wizzlecrank and Gilthares escorts 150 each), {faction:21}'s in Stranglethorn, Arathi and the {zone:1418} (30-50, about 6,500: the three OOX robot rescues 250 each, An OOX of Your Own 200, Stranglethorn Fever 200, Facing Negolash 200, the Sunken Treasure chain at {area:327}), {faction:369}'s in {zone:1446} (43-55, about 3,000: the {item:8548} 200, Wastewander Justice 100 each, the WANTED posters) and {faction:577}'s in {zone:1452} (52-60, about 1,450: {npc:9298}'s Winterfall chain, Umi's yeti quests). Forever adds a few low ones: A Simmering Storm and Stormy Potential in {zone:1411} and WANTED: Bruuz ({faction:470} 100 each), Important Heirlooms in {zone:1455} ({faction:369} 100). In Classic they pay in full only while at most 5 levels below you; past that each level takes a fifth off, down to a fifth. Kills help while they are not grey, 5 each: Southsea pirates in the {zone:1413} for {faction:470} and in {zone:1446} for {faction:369} and Stranglethorn's Venture Co. camps for {faction:21}, up to the end of Honored; Wastewander bandits for {faction:369} and Bloodsail pirates for {faction:21} only up to the end of Neutral. Friendly opens each quartermaster's first gear."] = "中立500点到友善需要每座城镇2,500点。上述任务每座城镇最多给700点（{npc:14637}的两个任务各300，{npc:10267}的150，第一次“解救诺特”150，第一次食人魔套装100；当你高出任务等级很多时会给得更少）；其余靠{npc:14637}的可重复任务，每次每座城镇25点：10个残渣（十个巨人）或6个核心（约十二个元素生物）。各城镇自己的任务也算，且给其余城镇一半：{faction:470}在{zone:1413}的任务（10-25级，约4,300点：采样器任务链625，{npc:3446}的跑腿任务，维兹克兰克和吉尔萨雷斯护送各150），{faction:21}在荆棘谷、阿拉希和{zone:1418}的任务（30-50级，约6,500点：三次OOX机器人救援各250，《你自己的OOX》200，《荆棘谷热》200，《直面内格拉什》200，以及{area:327}的沉没的宝藏任务链），{faction:369}在{zone:1446}的任务（43-55级，约3,000点：{item:8548} 200，《废土正义》每个100，通缉告示）以及{faction:577}在{zone:1452}的任务（52-60级，约1,450点：{npc:9298}的冬泉任务链、乌米的雪人任务）。Forever还加了几个低级任务：{zone:1411}的《酝酿的风暴》和《风暴潜能》，以及《通缉：布鲁兹》（{faction:470}各100）；{zone:1455}的《重要传家宝》（{faction:369} 100）。在经典旧世中，只有当你最多比任务低5级时才全额给付；再往上每高一级扣掉五分之一，最低到五分之一。击杀在怪物尚未变灰时有用，每只5点：{zone:1413}的南海海盗给{faction:470}、{zone:1446}的南海海盗给{faction:369}，以及荆棘谷的风险投资公司营地给{faction:21}，直到尊敬结束；废土强盗给{faction:369}、血帆海盗给{faction:21}，只到中立结束。友善会开放各军需官的第一批装备。",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 more with each town: 840 of {npc:14637}'s turn-ins or 140 Free Knot runs. No quartermaster sells anything for Exalted: this is for the title bar only."] = "崇敬到崇拜每座城镇还需21,000点：840次{npc:14637}的上交或140趟“解救诺特”。没有军需官在崇拜时出售任何东西：这纯粹是为了头衔栏。",
	["Scalding Broodlings east of {area:251}"] = "{area:251}以东的灼热雏龙",
	["Scalding Broodlings west of {area:251}"] = "{area:251}以西的灼热雏龙",
	["Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays"] = "海元素和海之飞溅",
	["Southsea Dock Worker"] = "南海码头工人",
	["Southsea Freebooter"] = "南海劫掠者",
	["Southsea Pirate"] = "南海海盗",
