	["Souvenir Sea Shell, Honored"] = "纪念海螺，尊敬",
	["Steamwheedle Cartel Reputation"] = "热砂港财团声望",
	["The Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays (level 47-49) drift along the {area:1108} and in the shallows below the giants: about half drop a {item:18958}."] = "海元素和海之飞溅（47-49级）沿着{area:1108}以及巨人们下方的浅滩漂游：约半数掉落一个{item:18958}。",
	["The Southsea pirates of {area:1336} (level 44-45) on the east coast of {zone:1446} give {faction:369} 5 each up to the end of Honored, and the other towns half. Two quests at {area:977} pay 100 {faction:369} each: {quest:8366} (10 of each pirate) and {quest:8365} (20 Southsea Pirate Hats, one in ten pirates). From level 56 the pirates are grey and pay little: skip this step then."] = "位于{zone:1446}东海岸{area:1336}的南海海盗（44-45级）每只给{faction:369} 5点，直到尊敬满，其他城镇减半。{area:977}的两个任务各给{faction:369} 100点：{quest:8366}（每种海盗各10个）和{quest:8365}（20顶南海海盗帽，约十只海盗掉一顶）。56级起这些海盗变灰，收益很少：届时跳过本步骤。",
	["Use {item:18904} on a living giant ({npc:5357}, {npc:5358}, or a Shore, Deep or {npc:5361}, level 47-50) and it shrinks into a zapped version; kill that for its {item:18956}, one every time. The Land Walkers and Cliff Giants in the north-west hills are the thickest; the striders walk the coast and the shallows. The shrinker lasts two hours: if it runs out, abandon the quest and take it again."] = "对一只活着的巨人使用{item:18904}（{npc:5357}、{npc:5358}，或海岸巨人、深海巨人、{npc:5361}，47-50级），它就会缩小成被电的版本；杀掉它拿{item:18956}，每次一个。西北丘陵的陆地行者和峭壁巨人最密集；涉行者则沿海岸和浅滩行走。缩小器持续两小时：如果效果消失，就放弃任务重新接取。",
	["Zapped giants"] = "被电的巨人",
	["{area:1336}, below 56"] = "{area:1336}，56级以下",
