	["{npc:10267}, a goblin at {area:251} in the north of the {zone:1428}, has a chain that pays every town 150 and {faction:577} 150 more. Use her {item:12284} on a broodling, kill it while the device holds it, and pick up the {quest:4726} it leaves. The device takes only Black and Scalding Broodlings, not the Flamescale Broodlings of the west: Scalding Broodlings (level 53-54) roam just west and east of {area:251}, Black Broodlings (51-52) the north-east corner of the zone, the thickest group. They are few and spread out: the path passes both and ends among the Black Broodlings."] = "{npc:10267}是{zone:1428}北部{area:251}的一名地精，她的任务链让每座城镇得到150点，{faction:577}再多150点。对一只雏龙使用她的{item:12284}，在装置控制住它时将其击杀，然后拾取它留下的{quest:4726}。装置只对黑色雏龙和灼热雏龙有效，对西边的焰鳞雏龙无效：灼热雏龙（53-54级）在{area:251}正西和正东游荡，黑色雏龙（51-52级）在该区域东北角，是最密集的一群。它们数量少且分散：路线会经过两者，最后在黑色雏龙群中结束。",
	["{npc:14338} sits shackled in Dire Maul North, the Gordok ogres' wing (a five-player dungeon from level 57: group up). Every {item:18250} frees him once: 150 to every town, and he is shackled again on your next run. Gordok ogres drop the keys (about one in fifteen; {npc:14321} one in seven): a full run of the wing usually brings one. His {item:18258} pays 100 the first time and 50 after, for 4 Bolts of Runecloth, 8 {item:8170}, 2 {item:14341} and the {item:18240} from the basket in the wing. Under 57 when you get here? Unskip this step later."] = "{npc:14338}被镣铐锁在厄运之槌北区，也就是戈多克食人魔的侧翼（57级起的5人副本：要组队）。每用一个{item:18250}就能解救他一次：每座城镇150点，下次进副本时他又会被锁上。戈多克食人魔会掉落钥匙（约十五分之一；{npc:14321}七分之一）：完整打一趟通常能拿到一把。他的{item:18258}首次给100点，之后50点，需要4卷符文布、8个{item:8170}、2个{item:14341}，以及该侧翼篮子里拿的{item:18240}。到这里时不到57级？那就以后再回来完成这一步。",
	["{npc:255897} sells {faction:2827}'s rewards in {area:16727}, on the east coast of the {zone:2548}, alongside general goods. Friendly, level 40 gear: {item:276200} 2g 74s (Stamina, attack power), {item:276201} 2g 94s (Intellect, Spirit), {item:276202} 2g 36s (Agility, Spirit). Honored: {item:276203}, a two-handed weapon, 9g 46s (Stamina, Strength, Agility); {item:276204}, a shield, 3g 80s (Stamina, spell damage, healing). Revered: {item:276199}, 10g."] = "{npc:255897}在{zone:2548}东海岸的{area:16727}出售{faction:2827}的奖励，就在杂货旁边。友善，40级装备：{item:276200} 2金74银（耐力、攻击强度），{item:276201} 2金94银（智力、精神），{item:276202} 2金36银（敏捷、精神）。尊敬：{item:276203}，双手武器，9金46银（耐力、力量、敏捷）；{item:276204}，盾牌，3金80银（耐力、法术伤害、治疗）。崇敬：{item:276199}，10金。",
	["{npc:265574}, {faction:470}'s quartermaster, by the docks. Friendly, level 20 gear: {item:274740} 41s (Stamina, Agility), {item:274741} 54s (Stamina, spell power), {item:274742} 34s (Intellect, Agility). Honored: {item:274743}, an off-hand, 66s (Intellect, Spirit); {item:274744}, a one-handed mace, 1g 65s (Stamina, Strength). Revered: the {item:274021}, a cosmetic hat, 2g."] = "{npc:265574}是{faction:470}的军需官，在码头旁。友善，20级装备：{item:274740} 41银（耐力、敏捷），{item:274741} 54银（耐力、法术强度），{item:274742} 34银（智力、敏捷）。尊敬：{item:274743}，副手物品，66银（智力、精神）；{item:274744}，单手锤，1金65银（耐力、力量）。崇敬：{item:274021}，装饰用帽子，2金。",
	["{npc:265575}, {faction:21}'s quartermaster. Friendly, level 30 gear: {item:274745} 1g 10s (Strength, Agility), {item:274746} 1g 48s (healing and spell damage), {item:274747} 1g 3s (Intellect, Spirit). Honored: {item:274748}, a gun, 3g 11s (attack power, Stamina); Souvenir Sea Shell, a necklace, 1g 66s (health regeneration, Stamina). Revered: {item:274022}, 5g."] = "{npc:265575}是{faction:21}的军需官。友善，30级装备：{item:274745} 1金10银（力量、敏捷），{item:274746} 1金48银（治疗和法术伤害），{item:274747} 1金3银（智力、精神）。尊敬：{item:274748}，枪，3金11银（攻击强度、耐力）；纪念海螺，项链，1金66银（生命回复、耐力）。崇敬：{item:274022}，5金。",
	["{npc:265576}, {faction:369}'s quartermaster. Friendly, level 40 gear: {item:274750} 2g 74s (Intellect, healing, spell damage), {item:274751} 2g 94s (Agility, attack power), {item:274752}, a cloak, 2g 36s (Spirit, spell power). Honored: {item:274753}, a one-handed weapon, 9g 46s (Strength, Agility); {item:274754}, a ring, 3g 80s (Strength, Stamina). Revered: the {item:274023}, 10g."] = "{npc:265576}是{faction:369}的军需官。友善，40级装备：{item:274750} 2金74银（智力、治疗、法术伤害），{item:274751} 2金94银（敏捷、攻击强度），{item:274752}，披风，2金36银（精神、法术强度）。尊敬：{item:274753}，单手武器，9金46银（力量、敏捷）；{item:274754}，戒指，3金80银（力量、耐力）。崇敬：{item:274023}，10金。",
	["{npc:265577}, {faction:577}'s quartermaster. Friendly, level 50 gear: {item:274755} 3g 10s (Spirit, Intellect), {item:274756} 5g 84s (Agility, Stamina, frost resistance), {item:274757} 4g 68s (Agility, attack power), {item:274758}, a chest, 10g 96s (Strength, Stamina). Honored, three trinkets at about 7g 55s: {item:274759} (nature resistance), {item:274760} (frost resistance) and {item:274761} (shadow resistance), the last two with a use. Revered: {item:274024}, 25g."] = "{npc:265577}是{faction:577}的军需官。友善，50级装备：{item:274755} 3金10银（精神、智力），{item:274756} 5金84银（敏捷、耐力、冰霜抗性），{item:274757} 4金68银（敏捷、攻击强度），{item:274758}，胸甲，10金96银（力量、耐力）。尊敬：三件饰品约7金55银：{item:274759}（自然抗性）、{item:274760}（冰霜抗性）和{item:274761}（暗影抗性），后两件带使用效果。崇敬：{item:274024}，25金。",
	["{quest:4726}, left by the broodlings"] = "{quest:4726}，由雏龙留下",
	["{quest:4808} is in {faction:577}. The Chillwind Chimaeras (level 55-57) south-west of {faction:577} drop the horns one time in five."] = "{quest:4808}在{faction:577}。{faction:577}西南的寒风奇美拉（55-57级）约五次掉落一只角。",
	["{quest:4810} gives 50 to every town. Her later quests, Egg Freezing (150 to every town) and Egg Collection (200), are done in the Rookery of Upper Blackrock Spire, a ten-player dungeon: take them up with your group."] = "{quest:4810}每座城镇给50点。她后续的《冷冻蛋》（每座城镇150点）和《收集蛋》（200点）要在黑石塔上层的雏龙巢穴完成，那是10人副本：和队伍一起上去接。",
	["{quest:5525}, again on every later run: 150"] = "{quest:5525}，之后每趟再来一次：150",
	["{quest:5525}: 150 to every town"] = "{quest:5525}：每座城镇150",
	["{quest:7003}: 150 to every town"] = "{quest:7003}：每座城镇150",
	["{quest:7721}: 150 to every town"] = "{quest:7721}：每座城镇150",
	["{quest:7725}: 10 residue"] = "{quest:7725}：10个残渣",
	["{quest:7726}: 6 cores"] = "{quest:7726}：6个核心",
}

G["forever/reputation/timbermaw-hold"] = {
	["At Exalted, {npc:11555}, in the tunnel by {npc:11557}, gives {quest:8481}: plant his {item:21144} in the mouth of {npc:10738}'s cave and defeat the demon {npc:15623} (level 62, elite: bring a group). The reward is {item:21326}, a trinket that calls a Timbermaw ally, and 200 reputation."] = "崇拜时，{npc:11555}在隧道里、{npc:11557}旁边，给你{quest:8481}：把他的{item:21144}插在{npc:10738}的洞口，并击败恶魔{npc:15623}（62级，精英：带队伍去）。奖励是{item:21326}，一枚召唤木喉盟友的饰品，外加200点声望。",
