	["Deadwood Avenger"] = "死木复仇者",
	["Deadwood Den Watcher"] = "死木巢穴守望者",
	["Deadwood Gardener"] = "死木园丁",
	["Deadwood Headdress Feathers: keep them"] = "死木头饰羽毛：留着",
	["Deadwood Pathfinder"] = "死木探路者",
	["Deadwood Shaman"] = "死木萨满祭司",
	["Deadwood Warrior"] = "死木战士",
	["Friendly to Honored"] = "友善到尊敬",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000: 1,200 kills. Keep all feathers and beads. Honored opens at {npc:11557}: {item:19445} (3 gold), and for 2 gold 20 silver each Pattern: {item:19043} and {item:19044} ({skill:165}) and {item:19047} ({skill:197})."] = "友善到尊敬是6,000点：1,200次击杀。所有羽毛和念珠都留着。尊敬后可在{npc:11557}处购买：{item:19445}（3金），以及每张2金20银的图样：{item:19043}和{item:19044}（{skill:165}）以及{item:19047}（{skill:197}）。",
	["Grizzle Snowpaw"] = "灰鬃雪爪",
	["High Chief Winterfall"] = "冬泉大酋长",
	["Honored to Revered"] = "尊敬到崇敬",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000: 2,400 kills, the last ones that count. Kills stop at 11,999 of 12,000 Honored and never tip you into Revered: when they stop, hand in one set of 5 feathers or beads to cross over. Saving every feather and bead pays off now: about 4,800 kills from the start to the end of Honored leave you with about 2,100 feathers and beads, and that is all of Revered to Exalted. Turning them in early would cost you about 2,400 more kills."] = "尊敬到崇敬是12,000点：2,400次击杀，最后这些击杀才算数。击杀会停在尊敬的11,999/12,000处，绝不会把你推进崇敬：等它停下时，交一组5根羽毛或5串念珠来跨过去。现在把每根羽毛、每串念珠都留着就值了：从开始到尊敬结束约4,800次击杀，会给你留下约2,100根羽毛和念珠，而这就是崇敬到崇拜的全部所需。提前交掉会让你多杀约2,400次。",
	["Kills stopped at the end of Honored. Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 420 turn-ins, 2,100 feathers and beads. Hand in the feathers to {npc:15395} at the tunnel or {npc:11554} in the south, the beads to {npc:11556}, five at a time. The named furbolgs (Ror, Bloodmaw, {npc:14342}, {npc:10199}, {npc:10738}) still count. Revered opens at {npc:11557}, for 4 gold each: Pattern: {item:19048} and {item:19049} ({skill:165}) and {item:19050} ({skill:197})."] = "击杀在尊敬结束处停止。崇敬到崇拜是21,000点：420次上交，2,100根羽毛和念珠。羽毛交给隧道里的{npc:15395}或南边的{npc:11554}，念珠交给{npc:11556}，每次五个。那些有名有姓的熊怪（罗尔、血牙、{npc:14342}、{npc:10199}、{npc:10738}）仍然计数。崇敬后可在{npc:11557}处购买，每张4金：图样{item:19048}和{item:19049}（{skill:165}）以及{item:19050}（{skill:197}）。",
	["Neutral to Friendly"] = "中立到友善",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000: 600 kills. Keep all feathers and beads."] = "中立到友善是3,000点：600次击杀。所有羽毛和念珠都留着。",
	["Overlord Ror"] = "罗尔霸主",
	["Ragepaw"] = "怒爪",
	["Recipes for Leatherworkers, Tailors, Enchanters and Alchemists from Friendly to Revered"] = "友善到崇敬的制皮、裁缝、附魔和炼金配方",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
	["Safe passage through the tunnels, agility enchants and furbolg recipes; the trinket at Exalted."] = "安全穿越隧道、敏捷附魔和熊怪配方；崇拜时还有饰品。",
	["Tailors with skill 290: {npc:11557} takes 2 {item:14342} once for 100 reputation and teaches the {item:15802}."] = "裁缝技能290：{npc:11557}一次性收下2块{item:14342}，给100点声望，并教你{item:15802}。",
	["The Deadwood furbolgs (level 48-50) hold the village at the south end of {zone:1448}. Keep every {item:21377}: they are worth 10 reputation each later and never stop counting. {npc:9464} (15 reputation) and the rare {npc:14342} (25) live here and count until Exalted. In Classic, quests 6 or more levels below you pay less and grey mobs give about a fifth: at level 60 {quest:8460} paid 30 instead of 150 and these furbolgs about 1 a kill. Do it while leveling if you can."] = "死木熊怪（48-50级）占据{zone:1448}南端的村庄。每根{item:21377}都留着：之后每根值10点声望，而且永远不会停止计数。{npc:9464}（15点声望）和稀有的{npc:14342}（25点）住在这里，且计数直到崇拜。经典旧世中，比你低6级或更多的任务收益会减少，灰名怪物只给约五分之一：60级时{quest:8460}只给30点而非150点，这些熊怪每只约1点。可以的话边升级边做。",
	["The Winterfall furbolgs rarely drop a {quest:8471} (3-4%). {npc:11558} takes it in the tunnel too: 150 reputation and three Major Healing and Mana Potions."] = "冬泉熊怪很少掉落{quest:8471}（3-4%）。{npc:11558}也在隧道里收：150点声望，外加三瓶强效治疗药水和三瓶强效法力药水。",
	["The northern Deadwood (level 53-55) camp just south of the tunnel. They drop feathers about half the time: the best feather spot. {npc:9462} gives 15 until Exalted."] = "北边的死木营地（53-55级）就在隧道正南。它们约有一半几率掉羽毛：是最好的羽毛点。{npc:9462}给15点，直到崇拜。",
	["The northern Deadwood rarely drop a {quest:8470} (about 3%). From Neutral, {npc:11558} takes it in the tunnel, on the {zone:1448} side: 150 reputation and two Major Healing and Mana Potions."] = "北边的死木熊怪很少掉落{quest:8470}（约3%）。从中立起，{npc:11558}会在隧道{zone:1448}一侧收：150点声望，外加两瓶强效治疗药水和两瓶强效法力药水。",
	["These quests and their kills bring you just past Unfriendly (500 from the start). If {quest:8460} paid you less (at level 60 in Classic: 30), kill about 40 more northern Deadwood. From Unfriendly the Timbermaw in the tunnel leave you alone."] = "这些任务及其击杀会把你刚好带过冷淡（从开始算500点）。如果{quest:8460}给你的较少（经典旧世60级时为30点），就再杀约40只北边死木熊怪。达到冷淡后，隧道里的木喉就不会再攻击你。",
	["Unfriendly to Neutral"] = "冷淡到中立",
	["Unfriendly to Neutral is 3,000: about 540 more kills after these quests. Three camps: the northern Deadwood by the {zone:1448} mouth of the tunnel; the Winterfall camps around {area:2246} and {area:2243}, just south and south-east of {npc:11556} (Pathfinders give 6 a kill, Den Watchers and Totemics 5, the shortest walk to a turn-in); and {area:2244} in the east. Pick the least crowded. Keep all feathers and beads."] = "冷淡到中立是3,000点：这些任务后还需约540次击杀。三处营地：隧道{zone:1448}入口旁北边的死木；{area:2246}和{area:2243}周围的冬泉营地，就在{npc:11556}正南和东南（探路者每只给6点，巢穴守望者和图腾师5点，是离上交点最近的）；以及东边的{area:2244}。挑人最少的一处。所有羽毛和念珠都留着。",
	["Walk through the tunnel to its {zone:1452} mouth; {npc:11556} stands just outside. Do not attack any Timbermaw: each one costs 25 reputation."] = "穿过隧道走到{zone:1452}一侧的出口；{npc:11556}就站在外面。不要攻击任何木喉：每只扣25点声望。",
	["Winterfall Den Watcher"] = "冬泉巢穴守望者",
	["Winterfall Pathfinder"] = "冬泉探路者",
	["Winterfall Pathfinders, {area:2246}"] = "冬泉探路者，{area:2246}",
	["Winterfall Shaman"] = "冬泉萨满祭司",
	["Winterfall Ursa"] = "冬泉巨熊",
	["Xandivious"] = "赞迪维斯",
	["{area:2244} lies in the east of {zone:1452}, just past {area:2255}. Keep every {item:21383} you loot (10 reputation each later). The Shamans, Den Watchers and Ursas share their spawn points, so kill every furbolg in the village to make the ones you need appear; more Ursas walk the ridge just south-west of the village. {npc:10199} (rare) and {npc:10738}, in the cave at the back, give 25 until Exalted. Alliance: the Wintersaber Trainers' Winterfall Intrusion asks for the same Shamans and Ursas."] = "{area:2244}在{zone:1452}东部，就在{area:2255}过去一点。拾到的每串{item:21383}都留着（之后每串10点声望）。萨满、巢穴守望者和巨熊共享刷新点，所以把村子里的熊怪全部杀掉，才能让你需要的那些出现；村子西南的山脊上还有更多巨熊走动。{npc:10199}（稀有）和洞穴深处的{npc:10738}给25点，直到崇拜。联盟：冬刃豹训练师的《冬泉入侵》也需要同样的萨满和巨熊。",
	["{area:2244}, the cave at the back. Clear the furbolgs around the mouth first, plant the torch, kill {npc:15623} and loot the Essence from his Demon Bag."] = "{area:2244}，洞穴深处。先清掉洞口周围的熊怪，插下火炬，杀掉{npc:15623}，再从它的恶魔包里拾取精华。",
	["{faction:576} starts at Hostile (2,500 of 3,000), so its furbolgs attack you in their tunnels; {npc:11554}, {npc:15395} and {npc:11556} talk to everyone. {npc:11554} waits by the road in the south of {zone:1448}, near the {area:2479}. Every Deadwood and Winterfall furbolg you kill gives 5 reputation up to the last point of Honored, so the quests below pay twice. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "{faction:576}从中立开始就是敌对（3,000点中已有2,500），所以它的熊怪会在隧道里攻击你；{npc:11554}、{npc:15395}和{npc:11556}则与所有人交谈。{npc:11554}在{zone:1448}南部的路边等候，靠近{area:2479}。你杀的每个死木和冬泉熊怪都给5点声望，直到尊敬的最后一刻，所以下面的任务会付双份。传承专长“外交家”会让每次获得的声望最多增加10%。",
	["{item:19445} ({skill:333}), 3 gold"] = "{item:19445}（{skill:333}），3金",
	["{item:21383}: keep them"] = "{item:21383}：留着",
	["{npc:10199}, rare"] = "{npc:10199}，稀有",
	["{npc:10738}, elite"] = "{npc:10738}，精英",
	["{npc:11557} stands in the tunnel, near its {zone:1448} mouth. From Friendly he sells: {item:13484} (1 gold 50 silver), {item:22392} (2 gold 50 silver), {item:20253} (1 gold 60 silver) and {item:15065} (2 gold). He also takes 30 {quest:6031} once for 100 reputation and a choice of shoulders or gauntlets, and Tailors with skill 290 can bring him 2 {item:14342} for 100 more and the {item:15802} pattern."] = "{npc:11557}站在隧道里，靠近{zone:1448}一侧的入口。从友善起他出售：{item:13484}（1金50银）、{item:22392}（2金50银）、{item:20253}（1金60银）和{item:15065}（2金）。他还会一次性收下30个{quest:6031}，给100点声望和护肩或护手任选其一；技能290的裁缝可以带2块{item:14342}给他，换100点声望和{item:15802}图样。",
	["{npc:14342}, rare"] = "{npc:14342}，稀有",
	["{npc:15395} stands at the {zone:1448} mouth of the Timbermaw tunnel, at the top of the road in the north of {zone:1448}."] = "{npc:15395}站在木喉隧道的{zone:1448}入口，就在{zone:1448}北部道路的顶端。",
	["{npc:15623}, 25 reputation"] = "{npc:15623}，25点声望",
	["{quest:6031} drops from the humanoids of the level 50-60 zones, the Deadwood and Winterfall furbolgs among them."] = "{quest:6031}由50-60级区域的人形怪掉落，其中也包括死木和冬泉熊怪。",
	["{quest:6031} for {npc:11557}"] = "{quest:6031}交给{npc:11557}",
	["{quest:6031}: 30 {quest:6031}"] = "{quest:6031}：30个{quest:6031}",
	["{quest:8466}, {quest:8467} and {quest:8469} are open now: 50 reputation for 5 feathers or 5 beads, as often as you like. Do not hand them in yet."] = "{quest:8466}、{quest:8467}和{quest:8469}现已开放：5根羽毛或5串念珠换50点声望，想交多少次都行。先别急着交。",
	["{quest:8466}: 5 feathers, 50 reputation"] = "{quest:8466}：5根羽毛，50点声望",
	["{quest:8467}: 5 feathers, 50 reputation"] = "{quest:8467}：5根羽毛，50点声望",
	["{quest:8467}: once your kills stop, 5 feathers into Revered"] = "{quest:8467}：击杀不再计数后，用5根羽毛跨入崇敬",
	["{quest:8469}: 5 beads, 50 reputation"] = "{quest:8469}：5串念珠，50点声望",
	["{quest:8469}: or 5 beads"] = "{quest:8469}：或者5串念珠",
}

G["forever/class/druid/bloodpetal-poison"] = {
	["A five-player dungeon: needs a group of five, about level 50-55. Horde: fly to {area:75}; Alliance: fly to {area:1438} in the {zone:1419} and ride north. {area:1477} stands in the middle of the {area:74} in the {zone:1435}: climb the stairs on the ruin's south side, dive into the flooded hall, swim down through it and follow the stairs and passages down to the portal. {npc:8580} (level 50 elite, {spell:12887} and {spell:6524}) only appears when the six serpent statues on the balcony ring above the altar pit are clicked in order: South, North, South-west, South-east, North-west, North-east (each turns green when right; a wrong order fails). Clear the trash by each statue and the pit below first; jumping down into the water is the quick way down, but a knockback near the edge can kill. The {item:22444} always drops."] = "五人副本：需要五人组队，等级约50到55。部落：飞往{area:75}；联盟：飞往{zone:1419}的{area:1438}，再向北骑。{area:1477}位于{zone:1435}的{area:74}中央：从遗迹南侧登上台阶，跳进被水淹没的大厅，向下游过大厅，沿台阶和通道一路向下到传送门。只有当祭坛坑上方环形阳台上的六座蛇像按顺序点击后，{npc:8580}（50级精英，会{spell:12887}和{spell:6524}）才会出现：南、北、西南、东南、西北、东北（点对时每座变绿；顺序错误则失败）。先清掉每座蛇像旁和下方祭坛坑里的小怪；直接跳进水里是最快的下去方式，但在边缘附近被击退可能致死。{item:22444}必掉。",
	["Cast {spell:18960}. {npc:12042} stands in {area:2361}; your class trainer ({npc:3033}, {npc:4217} or Theridran in {zone:1453}) offers the same quest."] = "施放{spell:18960}。{npc:12042}站在{area:2361}；你的职业训练师（{npc:3033}、{npc:4217}，或{zone:1453}的瑟里德兰）也给同样的任务。",
	["Devilsaur"] = "魔暴龙",
	["Druid"] = "德鲁伊",
	["Eight of each. The Gorishi Wasps and Stingers (level 51-52) in and around the {area:540}, the hive in the south-west of the crater, drop a sting about one kill in seven; the wasps share spawn points with the other bugs, so kill whatever stands near you to make room for more wasps (respawn five minutes). The bugs' {spell:8137} makes you take more physical damage for 30 minutes; Workers call for help when hurt. The Bloodpetal Sprouts grow all over the crater (around {area:541} and the western half): open them, about every other one gives a {item:22434}, back in three to five minutes."] = "每样八个。环形山西南部蜂巢{area:540}内及其周边的格里什黄蜂和格里什钉刺者（51到52级）约每七只掉一根刺；黄蜂与其他虫类共享刷新点，所以把身边能杀的都杀掉，给黄蜂腾出刷新位（五分钟重生）。这些虫子的{spell:8137}会让你在30分钟内承受更多物理伤害；工蜂受伤时会呼救。血瓣花苗遍布环形山（{area:541}一带和西半边）：打开它们，约每隔一株给一个{item:22434}，三到五分钟重生。",
	["Experience in Un'Goro at 50 and two healing potions; the Classic item choice may be gone in Forever."] = "50级在安戈洛的经验值，外加两瓶治疗药水；原版的物品选择在 Forever 中可能已取消。",
	["Use the {item:22432} on a living {npc:6498} (an Ironhide or {npc:6500}, or {npc:6584}, counts too): they are elite (level 54-55), hit with {spell:14099} and outrun travel form. Grouping up is encouraged, but a druid can do it alone: Hibernate or {spell:339} it from range, stab it (the barb does not break {spell:2637}), then leave. The credit counts the moment the barb lands, even if you die after. The nearest roams south-west of {area:541}."] = "对一头活着的{npc:6498}（铁皮魔暴龙，或{npc:6500}；{npc:6584}也算）使用{item:22432}：它们是54到55级精英，会用{spell:14099}，而且比旅行形态跑得快。建议组队，但德鲁伊也能单干：在远处用休眠或{spell:339}控制它，再刺入（刺不会打破{spell:2637}），然后离开。刺入的瞬间就算完成，哪怕你随后死亡。最近的一头在{area:541}西南游荡。",
	["{npc:9619}: the old item choice may be gone, count on the experience"] = "{npc:9619}：原版的物品选择可能已取消，以经验值为准",
}

G["forever/class/rogue/ravenholdt"] = {
	["At 24 any capital's rogue trainer ({npc:332} or {npc:918} in {zone:1453}, Gest or Ormok in {zone:1454}, and the others) has an {item:17126} from {npc:13936} for you: ask for it in their talk window. Open it: the quest gives you the {item:17125} for {npc:6707}. Learn {spell:1846} from your trainer first if you have not; the way in is a test of it."] = "24级时，任何主城的盗贼训练师（{zone:1453}的{npc:332}或{npc:918}、{zone:1454}的盖斯特或奥姆克，以及其他训练师）都有一封{npc:13936}写给你的{item:17126}：在他们的对话窗口中索要。打开它：任务会给你要交给{npc:6707}的{item:17125}。若还没学，先从训练师处学会{spell:1846}；进去的路就是它的考验。",
	["Back to {npc:13085}; the report sends you after the Perenolde heirlooms. Two towers stand among the {area:281}, in the middle of the {zone:1416}, held by ogres: the shield lies in the northern tower, the sword in the southern one, which elite ogres ring and watch from far off. Stay stealthed; nothing guards the heirlooms inside."] = "回到{npc:13085}；报告会派你去追查佩瑞诺德家族的传家宝。{zone:1416}中部的{area:281}之间矗立着两座食人魔占据的塔：盾牌在北塔，剑在南塔——南塔有精英食人魔环绕，并在远处监视。保持潜行；里面的传家宝无人看守。",
	["Falconcrest's men make the handoff at the southern end of {area:1057}, the old wall between Arathi and {area:287}. Kill the two guarding the box and take the {item:275882}. Keep the {item:275706}: {npc:13085} wants it back with the shipment."] = "法尔康克莱斯特的手下在{area:1057}南端接头，那里是阿拉希与{area:287}之间的旧墙。杀掉看守箱子的两人，拿走{item:275882}。保留{item:275706}：{npc:13085}要连同货物一起收回。",
	["Horde fly to {area:272}, Alliance to {area:271}. The trail to the manor is hard to see: it starts behind the plateau north of {area:275}, east of {area:272}, climbs into the hills and bends twice to a small tunnel. A chest sits in the tunnel: do not open it. Cast {spell:1846} near it and walk up close; that is the Rite of Cunning (it comes back after 5 minutes). Opening the chest calls Milton, an elite rogue of about level 32. Through the tunnel lies {area:3486}: {npc:6707} is upstairs inside. Do not attack anyone at the manor: it costs {npc:13936} reputation."] = "部落飞往{area:272}，联盟飞往{area:271}。通往庄园的小径很难发现：起点在{area:275}以北、{area:272}以东的高地背后，爬上山丘后拐两次到达一条小隧道。隧道里有个箱子：不要打开。在箱子旁施放{spell:1846}并走近，这就是狡诈仪式（5分钟后可再次使用）。打开箱子会召来米尔顿，一名32级左右的精英盗贼。穿过隧道就是{area:3486}：{npc:6707}在楼上屋内。不要攻击庄园里的任何人：会损失{npc:13936}声望。",
	["In your mid 30s {npc:13085} has two more jobs; take both. Barton leads a Syndicate scouting party at {area:280}, in the east of the {zone:1416}, inside one of the houses with stealthed Syndicate around him. Pick his pocket for the report and do not kill him: he does not drop it. If you are lower than him he sees through stealth; Master of Deception helps, or Distract him, Vanish and come in from behind. {spell:921} can miss several times in a row."] = "35级左右时{npc:13085}还有两个任务；都接。巴顿带领一支辛迪加侦察队在{zone:1416}东部的{area:280}，在其中一栋房子里，周围有潜行的辛迪加。扒他的口袋拿报告，不要杀他：他不会掉落报告。等级比他低时他能看穿潜行；诡计大师天赋有帮助，或者用扰乱引开他，消失后从背后靠近。{spell:921}可能连续失手好几次。",
	["Lord Tomas"] = "托马斯领主",
	["Opens {area:3486}, the hidden rogue house in the Alterac hills, and {npc:13085}'s jobs against the Syndicate."] = "解锁{area:3486}——奥特兰克丘陵中隐藏的盗贼之家——以及{npc:13085}对抗辛迪加的任务。",
	["Ravenholdt"] = "拉文霍特",
	["Rite of Cunning: {spell:1846} beside the tunnel chest"] = "狡诈仪式：在隧道箱子旁使用{spell:1846}",
	["Rogue"] = "盗贼",
	["She will not talk without something to bargain with. Her stash is upstairs in a house close to the keep: take the {item:275709}. If it is already open, wait for it to come back."] = "没有筹码她不会开口。她的藏匿物在城堡附近一栋房子的楼上：拿走{item:275709}。如果已经被打开过，就等它刷新。",
	["Stromgarde's Syndicate Prowlers and Conjurors are elite (level 35-36): a rogue of 36 can slip past them, but fighting one alone is hard, so stay hidden or bring a friend. Put on the {item:275706} ({quest:96784} hands it to you at the footlocker) to pass as one of them; stealth or suspicious acts can break it. If the footlocker gave you no uniform, Anastasia hands you one with {quest:96785}. {npc:266847} is not inside the keep: she stands on a ledge on the outside of the castle wall. Jump across to it from the roof of the house beside the ledge."] = "激流堡的辛迪加游荡者和咒术师是35到36级精英：36级的盗贼能从他们身边溜过，但单挑一个很吃力，所以要么保持隐蔽，要么叫个朋友。穿上{item:275706}（{quest:96784}会在储物箱处交给你）冒充他们；潜行或可疑举动会使其失效。如果储物箱没给你制服，阿纳斯塔西娅会用{quest:96785}给你一套。{npc:266847}不在城堡里：她站在城堡外墙的一处凸台上。从凸台旁那栋房子的屋顶跳过去。",
	["one emblem each time, 100 reputation"] = "每次一枚徽记，100声望",
	["{area:324} in western Arathi is a Syndicate stronghold; to get in you need a uniform. {area:313}, in north-western Arathi, is held by Syndicate Highwaymen, Pathstalkers and Mercenaries (level 30-32): find the {object:656157} there and take the uniform; that ends {quest:96783}."] = "阿拉希西部的{area:324}是辛迪加的据点；要进去你需要制服。阿拉希西北的{area:313}由辛迪加拦路强盗、巡路者和雇佣兵（30到32级）占据：在那里找到{object:656157}，拿走制服；这样就能完成{quest:96783}。",
	["{item:17124}, by {spell:921}"] = "{item:17124}，靠{spell:921}取得",
	["{item:275482}: {spell:921} on Barton"] = "{item:275482}：对巴顿使用{spell:921}",
	["{item:275635}, in the southern tower"] = "{item:275635}，在南塔",
	["{item:275636}, in the northern tower"] = "{item:275636}，在北塔",
	["{item:275709}: Anastasia's Stash"] = "{item:275709}：阿纳斯塔西娅的藏匿物",
	["{npc:13085}: 70 silver, 300 {npc:13936} reputation"] = "{npc:13085}：70银，300点{npc:13936}声望",
	["{npc:266216} is inside {area:275}, the Syndicate fortress south of the manor; he can stand in any of fifteen spots in the keep, so search. Quick and quiet, says {npc:13085}. Pick the pockets of the level 20-21 Syndicate Rogues, Shadow Mages and Watchmen on your way: they carry {quest:6701} for the guards' repeatable reputation quest."] = "{npc:266216}在{area:275}，即庄园以南的辛迪加堡垒内；他可能站在城堡里十五个位置中的任何一个，所以要搜。{npc:13085}说要快、要安静。路上顺手扒那些20到21级辛迪加盗贼、暗影法师和看守的口袋：他们身上带着{quest:6701}，可用于卫兵的可重复声望任务。",
	["{quest:96784}: the {item:275706}"] = "{quest:96784}：{item:275706}",
}

G["forever/class/warrior/quelserrar"] = {
	["A tank sword at 60: a {area:2577} book, then {npc:10184}'s breath tempers the blade (the sword is not in Forever's items yet)."] = "60级的坦克剑：一本{area:2577}的书，再用{npc:10184}的吐息淬炼剑刃（该剑尚未加入 Forever 的物品数据）。",
	["Back to {npc:14368} in the Athenaeum of Dire Maul West: through the West door with the {item:18249} again, and a group to reach the library."] = "回到厄运之槌西区图书馆（Athenaeum）的{npc:14368}：同样要用{item:18249}走西门，还得带上一队人才能到图书馆。",
	["Kill {npc:10184}, then target her corpse and use the {item:18488} on it before the 20 minutes run out. It becomes the {item:18492}, with no time limit."] = "杀掉{npc:10184}，然后在20分钟结束前选中她的尸体并使用{item:18488}。它会变成{item:18492}，没有时间限制。",
	["Onyxia"] = "奥妮克希亚",
	["Raid"] = "团队副本",
	["Shen'dralar reputation"] = "辛德拉声望",
	["The book is a rare random drop from the bosses of all three {area:2577} wings (Alzzin, Hydrospawn and the rest of the East, Tendris, Illyanna, Kalendris, {npc:11496} and the West, {npc:11501} and the North's guards) and very rarely from the tribute chest; it can be traded, so the auction house may have one. {area:2577} is a five-player dungeon in the ruins of central {zone:1444}: needs a group of five. Right-click the book to start the quest; it stays in your bags."] = "这本书是{area:2577}三个区域首领的稀有随机掉落（东区的阿尔兹恩、海多斯帕恩等，西区的坦德里斯、伊莉安娜、卡伦德里斯、{npc:11496}，以及北区的{npc:11501}和守卫），贡品箱中极少见；它可以交易，所以拍卖行里可能有。{area:2577}是{zone:1444}中部废墟中的五人副本：需要五人组队。右键点击书本开始任务；书会留在你的背包里。",
	["click the heated blade on the ground"] = "点击地上被加热的剑",
	["from {item:18401}"] = "来自{item:18401}",
	["{item:18488}, on her corpse"] = "{item:18488}，用在她的尸体上",
	["{item:18489}: plant it in her breath"] = "{item:18489}：插进她的吐息中",
	["{npc:10184} is the 40-player raid boss of {area:2159}, a cave in the {area:511} of southern {zone:1445}; she returns once a week. Tell the raid first. Late in the fight (around 10-15% health, when she has landed again) use the {item:18489} to plant it in the path of her fire breath, usually by the main tank's feet. When her breath has heated it, click the {object:179562} to take the {item:18488}: from then you have 20 minutes. Her breath can kill you while you plant or pick up the blade; if you die and nobody brings you back before she dies, wait for next week. Planted in the wrong place? Abandon the quest, take it again from Lydros for a new blade."] = "{npc:10184}是{area:2159}的40人团队副本首领，那是在{zone:1445}南部{area:511}中的一处洞穴；她每周刷新一次。先跟团队说清楚。战斗后期（血量约10%到15%、她再次落地时），用{item:18489}把它插进她火焰吐息的路径上，通常放在主坦克脚下。等她吐息把它加热后，点击{object:179562}取走{item:18488}：从那时起你有20分钟。她吐息时你插剑或取剑都可能被烧死；如果你死了，在她死前没人把你救起，就等下周。插错地方了？放弃任务，再从利德罗斯那里接一次，拿一把新剑。",
	["{npc:10184}'s breath"] = "{npc:10184}的吐息",
	["{npc:10184}'s corpse"] = "{npc:10184}的尸体",
	["{npc:14368} stands in the Athenaeum, the library at the far end of Dire Maul West, past the Court of the Highborne and the Prison of Immol'thar. The West door needs the {item:18249}, which Pusillin drops in Dire Maul East (he runs; chase him), or a rogue to pick it. Clearing to the library needs your group of five. He takes the book, hands you {item:18513} to give straight back, then the {item:18489}. Keep that blade: lose it, and you must abandon the quest and take it again."] = "{npc:14368}站在图书馆（Athenaeum），即厄运之槌西区最深处的藏书室，要穿过上层精灵庭院和伊莫塔尔之牢。西门需要{item:18249}，它在厄运之槌东区由普希林掉落（他会逃跑，追上去），或者让盗贼开锁。清到图书馆需要你的五人小队。他收下书，交给你{item:18513}让你立刻交回，然后给你{item:18489}。保管好那把剑：弄丢了就必须放弃任务、重新接取。",
	["{npc:14368}, in the Athenaeum"] = "{npc:14368}，在图书馆（Athenaeum）",
	["{npc:14368}: hand back the Dull and Flat Elven Blade"] = "{npc:14368}：交回“钝而平的精灵之剑”",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/bitter-baitling"] = {
	["1 {item:274026}"] = "1个{item:274026}",
	["Back to {npc:15077}"] = "回到{npc:15077}",
	["Hurry back and hand the 40 Tastyfish to {npc:15077}: the first players to do so win, and the winners get the coin with their prize. If you are too late to win, {npc:15078} still pays a little gold for every 5 Tastyfish."] = "赶快回去，把40条美味鱼交给{npc:15077}：最先交到的玩家获胜，获胜者会在奖品中得到那枚硬币。如果你来不及获胜，{npc:15078}仍会按每5条美味鱼付一点金币。",
	["Schools of Tastyfish"] = "美味鱼群",
	["The winner's coin, from {npc:15077}"] = "获胜者的硬币，来自{npc:15077}",
	["The {item:276275} costs one {item:274026}, the prize for winning the Stranglethorn Fishing Extravaganza. The contest runs on Sundays from 2 to 4 pm server time: be on the {area:35} docks when it starts and take {quest:8193} from {npc:15077}. Bring your best {skill:356} skill and lures so no fish gets away, a mount and empty bags, and bind your hearthstone in {area:35}."] = "{item:276275}需要一个{item:274026}，那是赢下荆棘谷钓鱼大赛的奖品。比赛在服务器时间每周日14:00到16:00举行：开始时待在{area:35}的码头上，从{npc:15077}处接{quest:8193}。带上你最高的{skill:356}技能和鱼饵，别让鱼跑掉；还要带坐骑和空背包，并把炉石绑定在{area:35}。",
	["While the contest runs, schools of {item:19807} appear along the Stranglethorn coast, none inside {area:35}. Fish 40 {item:19807} from them; each school lasts only a few casts, so ride on to the next as soon as one is gone. The arrow takes you up the west coast north of {area:35}; more schools lie further north and just south of {area:35}."] = "比赛期间，荆棘谷海岸会出现{item:19807}鱼群，{area:35}内没有。从鱼群里钓40条{item:19807}；每个鱼群只能钓几竿，所以一个消失就立刻骑马去下一个。箭头会带你沿{area:35}以北的西海岸向北；更北处和{area:35}正南方还有更多鱼群。",
	["{npc:15077}, during the contest"] = "{npc:15077}，比赛期间",
	["{npc:15078}, {npc:15077}'s apprentice, stands beside him on the {area:35} docks and trades the {item:276275} for the coin."] = "{npc:15078}是{npc:15077}的学徒，站在他旁边{area:35}的码头上，用硬币兑换{item:276275}。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/disgusting-oozeling"] = {
	["Oozes"] = "软泥怪",
	["Oozes drop the {item:20768} about once in 20-30 kills; the best are the Vile Slimes, Devouring Oozes and the {npc:12387} in the ooze field of eastern {zone:1422} (level 54-57). Open every bag: most hold potions or herbs, and only about one bag in 50 holds the {item:20769}, so expect over a thousand kills. Both the bags and the pet can be traded: unopened bags on the Auction House are lottery tickets, the pet itself the sure buy."] = "软泥怪约每20到30次击杀掉落一个{item:20768}；最好的是{zone:1422}东部软泥场地里的邪恶软泥怪、吞噬软泥怪和{npc:12387}（54到57级）。每个袋子都打开：大多是药水或草药，约每50个袋子才有一个装着{item:20769}，所以预期要杀上千只。袋子和宠物都能交易：拍卖行里未开封的袋子像买彩票，宠物本身才是稳的买卖。",
	["Open your Oozing Bags"] = "打开你的软泥袋子",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/hyacinth-macaw"] = {
	["Bloodsail camp, the {area:43}"] = "血帆营地，{area:43}",
	["Every Bloodsail pirate on the Stranglethorn coast (level 39-45) can drop it, but only about once in 5,000 kills; the Swabbies on the ships off the southern tip, about once in 2,500. That is a grind of many hours, so most players kill pirates while doing something else there, or buy the cage on the Auction House. The waypoint is the Swashbucklers' and Warlocks' camp on the {area:43}, south of {area:35}. Every pirate kill also lowers your Bloodsail Buccaneers standing."] = "荆棘谷海岸的每个血帆海盗（39到45级）都可能掉落，但约每5,000次击杀才掉一次；南端外海船上的血帆水手约每2,500次。这是要刷很多小时的苦活，所以大多数玩家会在那边做别的事时顺手杀海盗，或者直接在拍卖行买笼子。路径点设在{area:43}的血帆狂徒和术士营地，位于{area:35}以南。每杀一个海盗还会降低你的血帆海盗团声望。",
}

G["forever/reputation/alterac-valley"] = {
	["Alterac Valley Marks of Honor: play games"] = "奥特兰克山谷荣誉徽记：打战场",
	["Back at the gate"] = "回到大门处",
	["Back in {area:2959}"] = "回到{area:2959}",
	["Back in {area:2961}"] = "回到{area:2961}",
	["Commander Karl Philips"] = "指挥官卡尔·菲利普斯",
	["Commander Louis Philips"] = "指挥官路易斯·菲利普斯",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Alterac Valley\" and the last two insignia, 400 reputation that no longer counts for anything but the insignia. {npc:13217} sells the {item:19030} (200g, level 60; its own guide), {item:19325} and {item:21563} (75g56s), {item:19323} (156g49s), {item:19321} (79g53s), {item:19324} (125g66s) and the 50g tomes and off-hands."] = "崇拜会给予传承点数“奥特兰克山谷大师”，以及最后两枚徽记——那400点声望除了换徽记之外已无用处。{npc:13217}出售{item:19030}（200金，60级；另有专门攻略）、{item:19325}和{item:21563}（75金56银）、{item:19323}（156金49银）、{item:19321}（79金53银）、{item:19324}（125金66银），以及50金的典籍和副手物品。",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Alterac Valley\" and the last two insignia, 400 reputation that no longer counts for anything but the insignia. {npc:13219} sells the {item:19029} (200g, level 60; its own guide), {item:19325} and {item:21563} (75g56s), {item:19323} (156g49s), {item:19321} (79g53s), {item:19324} (125g66s) and the 50g tomes and off-hands."] = "崇拜会给予传承点数“奥特兰克山谷大师”，以及最后两枚徽记——那400点声望除了换徽记之外已无用处。{npc:13219}出售{item:19029}（200金，60级；另有专门攻略）、{item:19325}和{item:21563}（75金56银）、{item:19323}（156金49银）、{item:19321}（79金53银）、{item:19324}（125金66银），以及50金的典籍和副手物品。",
	["Friendly lets {npc:13840} upgrade your insignia: 100 reputation. Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. In Classic a full win paid 300 to 700 with its 3 marks; the Warbringer keeps taking 3 marks for 100. Inside, {item:17354} (75, from the Winterax caves) repeats every game; The Legend of Korrak (200, when he appears in the middle of the valley) goes back to {npc:13840} here. Friendly opens the {item:19031} (1g) and the Superior Healing and Mana Draughts (5s) at {npc:13219} beside him."] = "友善时{npc:13840}可以升级你的徽记：100声望。友善到尊敬需要6000声望。原版中一场全胜连同3枚徽记共付300到700；战争使者会一直以3枚徽记换100。在战场内，{item:17354}（75点，来自冰斧洞穴）每场可重复；“科拉克的传说”（200点，他在山谷中央出现时）交回给这里的{npc:13840}。友善会在旁边的{npc:13219}处解锁{item:19031}（1金）和强效治疗药水、法力药水（5银）。",
	["Friendly lets {npc:13841} upgrade your insignia: 100 reputation. Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. In Classic a full win paid 300 to 700 with its 3 marks; the Brigadier General keeps taking 3 marks for 100. Inside, {item:17354} (75, from the Winterax caves) repeats every game; {npc:12159} (200, when he appears in the middle of the valley) goes back to {npc:13841} here. Friendly opens the {item:19032} (1g) and the Superior Healing and Mana Draughts (5s) at {npc:13217} beside him."] = "友善时{npc:13841}可以升级你的徽记：100声望。友善到尊敬需要6000声望。原版中一场全胜连同3枚徽记共付300到700；准将会一直以3枚徽记换100。在战场内，{item:17354}（75点，来自冰斧洞穴）每场可重复；{npc:12159}（200点，他在山谷中央出现时）交回给这里的{npc:13841}。友善会在旁边的{npc:13217}处解锁{item:19032}（1金）和强效治疗药水、法力药水（5银）。",
	["Frostwolf Explosives Expert"] = "霜狼爆破专家",
	["Honored: insignia rank 3, 100 reputation. Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. {npc:13217} beside {npc:13841} sells the Stormpike Soldier's and Sage's Cloaks and Pendants (about 7g each), the Stormpike belts (4g74s to 7g12s) and the Major Healing and Mana Draughts (10s)."] = "尊敬：徽记3级，100声望。尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望。{npc:13841}旁的{npc:13217}出售雷矛士兵和贤者的披风与坠饰（每件约7金）、雷矛腰带（4金74银到7金12银），以及特效治疗药水和法力药水（10银）。",
	["Honored: insignia rank 3, 100 reputation. Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. {npc:13219} beside {npc:13840} sells the {npc:12051}'s and Advisor's Cloaks and Pendants (about 7g each), the Frostwolf belts (5g9s to 7g66s) and the Major Healing and Mana Draughts (10s)."] = "尊敬：徽记3级，100声望。尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望。{npc:13840}旁的{npc:13219}出售{npc:12051}和顾问的披风与坠饰（每件约7金）、霜狼腰带（5金9银到7金66银），以及特效治疗药水和法力药水（10银）。",
	["Iceblood Tower banner"] = "冰血哨塔旗帜",
	["Master of Alterac Valley: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "奥特兰克山谷大师：崇拜时获得一个传承点数",
	["Most of this happens on the way to {npc:11946}. Loot {quest:7223} from Horde players and guards you kill. Assault the {area:3301} or any Horde graveyard, burn a Horde tower (click its banner), and take {area:2963}. {npc:13154} stands at {area:2962}; the {npc:13597} at {area:2961}. {quest:7301} asks you to find where the three wing commanders landed. In Classic every tower, graveyard or mine paid 12 reputation, {npc:11947} 125 and {npc:11946} about 300."] = "这些大多是在前往{npc:11946}的路上完成的。从你杀死的部落玩家和卫兵身上拾取{quest:7223}。突袭{area:3301}或任意部落墓地，烧掉一座部落哨塔（点击其旗帜），并占领{area:2963}。{npc:13154}站在{area:2962}；{npc:13597}在{area:2961}。{quest:7301}要你查明三位空军指挥官降落在何处。原版中每座哨塔、墓地或矿坑给12点声望，{npc:11947}给125，{npc:11946}约300。",
	["Most of this happens on the way to {npc:11948}. Loot {item:17422} from Alliance players and guards you kill. Assault the {area:3301} or any Alliance graveyard, burn an Alliance bunker (click its banner), and take {area:2957}. {npc:13320} stands at {area:3304}; the {npc:13598} in {area:2959}. {quest:7302} asks you to find where the three wing commanders landed. In Classic every tower, graveyard or mine paid 12 reputation, {npc:11949} 125 and Vanndar about 300."] = "这些大多是在前往{npc:11948}的路上完成的。从你杀死的联盟玩家和卫兵身上拾取{item:17422}。突袭{area:3301}或任意联盟墓地，烧掉一座联盟碉堡（点击其旗帜），并占领{area:2957}。{npc:13320}站在{area:3304}；{npc:13598}在{area:2959}。{quest:7302}要你查明三位空军指挥官降落在何处。原版中每座哨塔、墓地或矿坑给12点声望，{npc:11949}给125，范达尔约300。",
	["One-time quests worth 2,000 and big wins make it the quickest of the four; Exalted gives a Legacy Point."] = "价值2,000的一次性任务加上大胜，使它成为四个战场声望中最快的；崇拜还会给一个传承点数。",
	["PvP Graveyard Credit Marker"] = "PvP墓地计数标记",
	["PvP Mine Credit Marker"] = "PvP矿坑计数标记",
	["PvP Tower Credit Marker"] = "PvP哨塔计数标记",
	["Queue at the gate, at any battlemaster or from the battleground screen; you enter at {area:2959} in the north. Before the gates open, take the quests in the town: they are done during the battle."] = "在大门处、任意战场军官处或战场界面排队；你会在北部的{area:2959}进入。开战前先在镇里接任务：它们在战斗中完成。",
	["Queue at the gate, at any battlemaster or from the battleground screen; you enter at {area:2961} in the south. Before the gates open, take the quests in the village: they are done during the battle."] = "在大门处、任意战场军官处或战场界面排队；你会在南部的{area:2961}进入。开战前先在村里接任务：它们在战斗中完成。",
	["Reputation · Battlegrounds"] = "声望 · 战场",
	["Revered: insignia rank 4, 150 reputation. Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons at {npc:13217}: {item:19100}, {item:19102} and {item:19104} (31g65s to 39g85s), and the {npc:14752} (5g). At 51 and up Concerted Efforts (3 marks each from {zone:1459}, {zone:1461} and {zone:1460}) pays 200 the first time and 150 after, plus reputation for the other two battlegrounds."] = "崇敬：徽记4级，150声望。崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，占爬升的一半。崇敬会在{npc:13217}处解锁武器：{item:19100}、{item:19102}和{item:19104}（31金65银到39金85银），以及{npc:14752}（5金）。51级及以上时，“共同努力”（各交3枚{zone:1459}、{zone:1461}和{zone:1460}徽记）第一次付200、之后150，并另给另外两个战场的声望。",
	["Revered: insignia rank 4, 150 reputation. Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons at {npc:13219}: {item:19099}, {item:19101} and Frostbite (31g53s to 39g71s), and the {npc:14751} (5g). At 51 and up For Great Honor (3 marks each from {zone:1459}, {zone:1461} and {zone:1460}) pays 200 the first time and 150 after, plus reputation for the other two battlegrounds."] = "崇敬：徽记4级，150声望。崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，占爬升的一半。崇敬会在{npc:13219}处解锁武器：{item:19099}、{item:19101}和霜咬（31金53银到39金71银），以及{npc:14751}（5金）。51级及以上时，“为了伟大的荣誉”（各交3枚{zone:1459}、{zone:1461}和{zone:1460}徽记）第一次付200、之后150，并另给另外两个战场的声望。",
	["Stormpike Explosives Expert"] = "雷矛爆破专家",
	["The Frostwolf camp stands outside the {zone:1459} gate in the {zone:1416}. Take every quest here: they all pay 100 or more, once."] = "霜狼营地设在{zone:1416}内{zone:1459}大门外。把这里的任务全接了：每个都给100点以上，但只能做一次。",
	["The Stormpike camp stands outside the {zone:1459} gate, on the {zone:1416} side above {area:287}. Take every quest here: they all pay 100 or more, once."] = "雷矛营地设在{zone:1459}大门外，{area:287}上方{zone:1416}一侧。把这里的任务全接了：每个都给100点以上，但只能做一次。",
