	["Your first Alterac Valley Marks of Honor go to the {npc:15350} by the gate: 150 the first time ({quest:8369}), then 100 for every 3 more. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1459} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "你的第一批奥特兰克山谷荣誉徽记交给大门旁的{npc:15350}：第一次150点（{quest:8369}），之后每3枚100点。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:1459}徽记：在达到上限前交掉或用掉。",
	["Your first Alterac Valley Marks of Honor go to the {npc:15351} beside {npc:13841}: 150 the first time ({quest:8375}), then 100 for every 3 more. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1459} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "你的第一批奥特兰克山谷荣誉徽记交给{npc:13841}旁的{npc:15351}：第一次150点（{quest:8375}），之后每3枚100点。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:1459}徽记：在达到上限前交掉或用掉。",
