	["{npc:13816} by the gate wants {npc:11946} dead: win a game in which your team kills him. Then he lets you pick a weapon ({quest:8271})."] = "大门旁的{npc:13816}要{npc:11946}死：赢下一场你的队伍杀死他的战斗。之后他让你挑选一件武器（{quest:8271}）。",
