	["{zone:1459} is a 40 against 40 battle for level 51 and up, and the fastest of the four battleground reputations: it has about 2,000 reputation of one-time quests, and a full win pays several hundred. The same one-time quests also pay 1,870 {zone:1454} reputation. {npc:13842} stands in the {object:172982}. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1459}是51级及以上的40对40战场，也是四个战场声望中最快的：一次性任务约值2,000声望，一场全胜还能给几百点。同样的一次性任务还会给1,870点{zone:1454}声望。{npc:13842}站在{object:172982}里。Forever 的传承特长“外交家”可使本篇攻略中的每个数字最多提高10%。",
	["{zone:1459} is a 40 against 40 battle for level 51 and up, and the fastest of the four battleground reputations: it has about 2,000 reputation of one-time quests, and a full win pays several hundred. The same one-time quests also pay 1,870 {zone:1455} reputation. {npc:13843} recruits outside the {object:32372}. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1459}是51级及以上的40对40战场，也是四个战场声望中最快的：一次性任务约值2,000声望，一场全胜还能给几百点。同样的一次性任务还会给1,870点{zone:1455}声望。{npc:13843}在{object:32372}外招募。Forever 的传承特长“外交家”可使本篇攻略中的每个数字最多提高10%。",
}

G["forever/reputation/darkspear-islands"] = {
	["Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor: play games"] = "暗矛群岛荣誉徽记：打战场",
	["Darkspear Islands Reputation"] = "暗矛群岛声望",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Darkspear Islands\" and opens the epics: gloves in plate, mail, leather and cloth for levels 50 and 60 ({item:271940}, Gloves, Handguards and Handwraps, 3g94s to 15g16s) and level 60 shoulders in every armor type ({item:271955}, Shoulders, Spaulders, Mantle, Epaulets, Shoulderpads and Shoulderguards, 9g44s to 16g86s). The {item:276504} comes from a short questline that Exalted opens here."] = "崇拜会给予传承点数“暗矛群岛大师”，并解锁史诗装备：50级和60级的板甲、锁甲、皮甲和布甲手套（{item:271940}，手套、护手和裹手，3金94银到15金16银），以及60级各甲种的护肩（{item:271955}，护肩、肩甲、衬肩、肩章、肩垫和肩铠，9金44银到16金86银）。{item:276504}来自崇拜在此解锁的一条短任务链。",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Darkspear Islands\" and opens the epics: gloves in plate, mail, leather and cloth for levels 50 and 60 ({item:272095}, Gloves, Handguards and Handwraps, 3g94s to 15g16s) and level 60 shoulders in every armor type ({item:272105}, Shoulders, Spaulders, Mantle, Epaulets, Shoulderpads and Shoulderguards, 9g44s to 16g86s). The {item:276502} comes from a short questline that Exalted opens here."] = "崇拜会给予传承点数“暗矛群岛大师”，并解锁史诗装备：50级和60级的板甲、锁甲、皮甲和布甲手套（{item:272095}，手套、护手和裹手，3金94银到15金16银），以及60级各甲种的护肩（{item:272105}，护肩、肩甲、衬肩、肩章、肩垫和肩铠，9金44银到16金86银）。{item:276502}来自崇拜在此解锁的一条短任务链。",
	["Forever's new battleground: its gear comes for every bracket from 30, and Exalted gives a Legacy Point."] = "Forever 新增的战场：从30级起每个等级段都有对应装备，崇拜还会给一个传承点数。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:263569}, the quartermaster at {area:385}: the trinkets {item:271903} and {item:271904} for levels 33 and 48 (1g49s to 11g85s), and food, bandages and draughts for the battleground. A Theramore care package for Friendly also exists in Forever's data."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000声望。友善会在{area:385}的军需官{npc:263569}处解锁第一批奖励：33级和48级的饰品{item:271903}和{item:271904}（1金49银到11金85银），以及战场用的食物、绷带和药剂。Forever 的数据里还存在一份友善可得的塞拉摩补给包。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:263570}, the quartermaster beside {npc:275276}: the trinkets {item:272059} and {item:272060} for levels 33 and 48 (1g49s to 11g85s), and food, bandages and draughts for the battleground (5s to 20s). A Darkspear care package for Friendly also exists in Forever's data."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000声望。友善会在{npc:275276}旁的军需官{npc:263570}处解锁第一批奖励：33级和48级的饰品{item:272059}和{item:272060}（1金49银到11金85银），以及战场用的食物、绷带和药剂（5银到20银）。Forever 的数据里还存在一份友善可得的暗矛补给包。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. Honored opens {item:271913}, {item:271908}, {item:271917} and {item:271907} for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (1g11s to 12g6s): rings, neck and cloak that fit the bracket you are in."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望。尊敬解锁{item:271913}、{item:271908}、{item:271917}和{item:271907}，分别对应28、38、48和58级（1金11银到12金6银）：戒指、项链和披风，适配你所在的等级段。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation. Honored opens {item:272064}, {item:272068}, {item:272072} and {item:272063} for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (1g11s to 12g6s): rings, neck and cloak that fit the bracket you are in."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望。尊敬解锁{item:272064}、{item:272068}、{item:272072}和{item:272063}，分别对应28、38、48和58级（1金11银到12金6银）：戒指、项链和披风，适配你所在的等级段。",
	["Master of Darkspear Islands: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "暗矛群岛大师：崇拜时获得一个传承点数",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. Forever has not said how much a game pays by itself; the sure part is the Brigadier General's 100 for every 3 marks, which is one win, so at most 30 wins from Neutral even before the games' own reputation. Each new bracket (40, 50, 60) brings a new first win for {npc:275273} (200) and a new first mark quest (150)."] = "中立到友善需要3000声望。Forever 没有说明单场战场本身给多少；确定的部分是准将每3枚徽记给的100点（相当于一胜），所以即使不算战场本身的声望，从中立起也最多30胜。每个新的等级段（40、50、60）都会带来一次新的首胜（{npc:275273}，200点）和一次新的首枚徽记任务（150点）。",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. Forever has not said how much a game pays by itself; the sure part is the Warbringer's 100 for every 3 marks, which is one win, so at most 30 wins from Neutral even before the games' own reputation. Each new bracket (40, 50, 60) brings a new first win for {npc:275276} (200) and a new first mark quest (150)."] = "中立到友善需要3000声望。Forever 没有说明单场战场本身给多少；确定的部分是战争使者每3枚徽记给的100点（相当于一胜），所以即使不算战场本身的声望，从中立起也最多30胜。每个新的等级段（40、50、60）都会带来一次新的首胜（{npc:275276}，200点）和一次新的首枚徽记任务（150点）。",
	["Reputation · Battlegrounds"] = "声望 · 战场",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58: {item:271924} (two-handed axe), {item:271928} (dagger), Guerrilla's Jagged Mace and {item:271932} (off-hand), 1g44s to 37g15s."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，占爬升的一半。崇敬解锁28、38、48和58级的武器：{item:271924}（双手斧）、{item:271928}（匕首）、游击队的锯齿钉锤和{item:271932}（副手），1金44银到37金15银。",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, half the climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58: {item:272079} (two-handed axe), {item:272083} (dagger), {item:272091} (mace) and the {item:272087} (off-hand), 1g44s to 37g15s."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，占爬升的一半。崇敬解锁28、38、48和58级的武器：{item:272079}（双手斧）、{item:272083}（匕首）、{item:272091}（钉锤）和{item:272087}（副手），1金44银到37金15银。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time ({quest:98887}), then 100 for every 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}; others in {zone:1456} and the {zone:1458}, at {area:321} and by the {zone:1459} gate. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "{npc:15350}第一次收3枚暗矛群岛荣誉徽记给150声望（{quest:98887}），之后每3枚给100。最近的在{zone:1413}北部的莫尔杉和{zone:1454}；其他在{zone:1456}和{zone:1458}、{area:321}以及{zone:1459}大门旁。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:2524}徽记：在达到上限前交掉或用掉。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98889}), then keeps taking 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350}在每个等级段第一次收3枚暗矛群岛荣誉徽记给150声望（{quest:98889}），之后继续每3枚一收。最近的在{zone:1413}北部的莫尔杉和{zone:1454}。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:2524}徽记。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98891}), then keeps taking 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350}在每个等级段第一次收3枚暗矛群岛荣誉徽记给150声望（{quest:98891}），之后继续每3枚一收。最近的在{zone:1413}北部的莫尔杉和{zone:1454}。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:2524}徽记。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98893}), then keeps taking 3 more. The nearest stand at Mor'shan in the north of the {zone:1413} and in {zone:1454}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15350}在每个等级段第一次收3枚暗矛群岛荣誉徽记给150声望（{quest:98893}），之后继续每3枚一收。最近的在{zone:1413}北部的莫尔杉和{zone:1454}。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:2524}徽记。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time ({quest:98895}), then 100 for every 3 more. He stands in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440}, at {area:320} in the {zone:1417} and at both gates of {zone:1459}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "{npc:15351}第一次收3枚暗矛群岛荣誉徽记给150声望（{quest:98895}），之后每3枚给100。他站在{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1457}，{zone:1440}南部的{area:3319}，{zone:1417}的{area:320}，以及{zone:1459}的两处大门旁。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:2524}徽记：在达到上限前交掉或用掉。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98897}), then keeps taking 3 more. He stands in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15351}在每个等级段第一次收3枚暗矛群岛荣誉徽记给150声望（{quest:98897}），之后继续每3枚一收。他站在{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1457}，{zone:1440}南部的{area:3319}，以及{area:320}。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:2524}徽记。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98899}), then keeps taking 3 more. He stands in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15351}在每个等级段第一次收3枚暗矛群岛荣誉徽记给150声望（{quest:98899}），之后继续每3枚一收。他站在{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1457}，{zone:1440}南部的{area:3319}，以及{area:320}。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:2524}徽记。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 150 reputation for 3 Darkspear Islands Marks of Honor the first time in each bracket ({quest:98901}), then keeps taking 3 more. He stands in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:3319} in southern {zone:1440} and at {area:320}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:2524} marks."] = "{npc:15351}在每个等级段第一次收3枚暗矛群岛荣誉徽记给150声望（{quest:98901}），之后继续每3枚一收。他站在{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1457}，{zone:1440}南部的{area:3319}，以及{area:320}。Forever 的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:2524}徽记。",
	["The {zone:2524} lie off the coast of {zone:1445}: 15 against 15, from level 30. Hold the four capture points to gain points, faster the more you hold, and carry the flag from the middle to a base your team holds for more; the first team to 2000 points wins. The sea kills: cross on the bridges. Queue at any battlemaster or step through the portal here at the {area:391}, north of {area:392}. {npc:275276} pays 200 reputation for your first win. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:2524}位于{zone:1445}外海：15对15，30级起可参加。占领四个据点可以得分，占得越多得分越快；再把中央的旗帜运到己方控制的基地可得更多分；先到2000分的一方获胜。海水会致命：走桥过海。在任意战场军官处排队，或从这里{area:392}以北{area:391}的传送门进入。首次获胜时{npc:275276}会给200声望。Forever 的传承特长“外交家”可使本篇攻略中的每个数字最多提高10%。",
	["The {zone:2524} lie off the coast of {zone:1445}: 15 against 15, from level 30. Hold the four capture points to gain points, faster the more you hold, and carry the flag from the middle to a base your team holds for more; the first team to 2000 points wins. The sea kills: cross on the bridges. Queue at any battlemaster or step through the portal here at {area:385}, south of {area:392}. {npc:275273} pays 200 reputation for your first win. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:2524}位于{zone:1445}外海：15对15，30级起可参加。占领四个据点可以得分，占得越多得分越快；再把中央的旗帜运到己方控制的基地可得更多分；先到2000分的一方获胜。海水会致命：走桥过海。在任意战场军官处排队，或从这里{area:392}以南{area:385}的传送门进入。首次获胜时{npc:275273}会给200声望。Forever 的传承特长“外交家”可使本篇攻略中的每个数字最多提高10%。",
	["after a win"] = "获胜后",
