	["{spell:13501} is orange at 130 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 20 crafts to 150, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. One {item:11083} a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the {item:6339} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:1210} (1 for 75-150): {item:1210} turns up in about one {object:1731}, {object:1732} or {object:1733} in 100: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {item:6338} (1 for 75-150): {skill:164}: {item:6338}; or the Auction House. {item:10938} (4 for 75-150): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 5-15; or the Auction House. {item:11083} (20 for 75-150): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 21-30; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:13501}在130时为橙色（155黄、175绿、195灰）：大约20次制作可到150，每次一点。每次需要1个{item:11083}。每次一点约耗一个{item:11083}（21-30级绿装）。先做好{item:6339}：配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。{item:1210}（75-150需1个）：{item:1210}在约百分之一的{object:1731}、{object:1732}或{object:1733}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。{item:6338}（75-150需1个）：{skill:164}：{item:6338}；或在拍卖行购买。{item:10938}（75-150需4个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级5-15的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11083}（75-150需20个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级21-30的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。{skill:333} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:13501} is orange at 150 (yellow 155, green 175, grey 195): about 11 crafts to 160. Each takes 1 {item:11083}. One {item:11083} a craft (level 21-30 greens). Make the {item:11130} now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:11082} (1 for 150-225): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 16-25; or the Auction House. {item:11083} (71 for 150-225): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 21-30; or the Auction House. {item:11128} (1 for 150-225): {skill:164}: {item:11128}; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:13501}在150时为橙色（155黄、175绿、195灰）：大约11次制作可到160。每次需要1个{item:11083}。每次约耗一个{item:11083}（21-30级绿装）。趁{item:11130}还能涨点时先做出来：后面的配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。{item:11082}（150-225需1个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级16-25的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11083}（150-225需71个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级21-30的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11128}（150-225需1个）：{skill:164}：{item:11128}；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
