	["{spell:13746} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 245, grey 265): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {item:11137}. One {item:11137} a craft (level 31-40 greens). Make the {item:11145} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. {item:7971} (1 for 150-225): {item:7971} is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find. {item:11135} (1 for 150-225): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 26-35; or the Auction House. {item:11137} (21 for 150-225): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 31-40; or the Auction House. {item:11144} (1 for 150-225): {skill:164}: {item:11144}; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one. {skill:333} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:13746}在205时为橙色（225黄、245绿、265灰）：大约20次制作可到225，每次一点。每次需要1个{item:11137}。每次一点约耗一个{item:11137}（31-40级绿装）。先做好{item:11145}：配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。{item:7971}（150-225需1个）：{item:7971}是稀有掉落（没有哪种怪物能达到五十分之一的掉率）：在拍卖行买，或留着你找到的。{item:11135}（150-225需1个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级26-35的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11137}（150-225需21个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级31-40的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。{item:11144}（150-225需1个）：{skill:164}：{item:11144}；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。{skill:333} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:13746} to 225"] = "{spell:13746} 到225",
	["{spell:13815} is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 250, grey 270): about 39 crafts to 253. Each takes 1 {item:11137}. {npc:11073} teaches it with Artisan: learn it on that visit. {item:11137} again; bring about 40. {item:11137} (39 for 225-300): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 31-40; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:13815}在225时为橙色（230黄、250绿、270灰）：大约39次制作可到253。每次需要1个{item:11137}。{npc:11073}会随大师级一并教授：那次造访时学。又是{item:11137}；带约40个。{item:11137}（225-300需39个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级31-40的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
	["{spell:13815} to 253"] = "{spell:13815} 到253",
