	["{spell:20017} to 300"] = "{spell:20017} 到300",
	["{spell:7418} is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 22, grey 25): about 31 crafts to 25. Each takes 1 {item:247786}. One {item:247786} (10c) a craft; grey at 25 on Forever. Make the {item:6218} first: the recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7418}在1时为橙色（20黄、22绿、25灰）：大约31次制作可到25。每次需要1个{item:247786}。每次约耗一个{item:247786}（10铜）；在Forever中25时变灰。先做好{item:6218}：配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
