	["{spell:7420} is yellow at 75 (yellow 70, green 90, grey 110): about 22 crafts to 90. Each takes 1 {item:10940}. One {item:10940} a craft: the dust most level 5-20 greens break into, armour above all. {item:10938} (from weapons) does the same job through Bracer - Minor Deflect or Chest - {spell:7423} if you have more of it. {item:10940} (121 for 75-150): {skill:333}: disenchant green items of item level 5-20; or the Auction House. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7420}在75时为黄色（70黄、90绿、110灰）：大约22次制作可到90。每次需要1个{item:10940}。每次约耗一个{item:10940}：大多数5-20级绿装（尤其是护甲）分解出的尘。{item:10938}（来自武器）若你存量更多，也能靠“护腕 - 次级偏斜”或“胸甲 - {spell:7423}”这两个配方顶替。{item:10940}（75-150需121个）：{skill:333}：分解物品等级5-20的绿装；或在拍卖行购买。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
	["{spell:7420} to 75"] = "{spell:7420} 到75",
