	["{spell:7771} is orange at 90 (yellow 110, green 130, grey 150): about 48 crafts to 130. Each takes 2 {item:10940}. Two {item:10940} a craft (the trainer teaches it from 70 for 2s); keep disenchanting the greens of the 10-20 zones. Enchant any item for that slot in your bags, even a grey one."] = "{spell:7771}在90时为橙色（110黄、130绿、150灰）：大约48次制作可到130。每次需要2个{item:10940}。每次两份{item:10940}（训练师从70起教，收费2银）；继续分解10-20级区域的绿装。给包中该部位的任意一件物品附魔，哪怕是灰色的。",
