	["74 {item:2838} for {spell:3967}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125) in {zone:1417} (30-40), {zone:1434} (30-45) and {zone:1443} (30-40); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1417} is marked."] = "74个{item:2838}，用于{spell:3967}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）产自{zone:1417}（30-40）、{zone:1434}（30-45）和{zone:1443}（30-40）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1417}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
	["74 {item:2838} for {spell:3967}: {skill:186}: {object:1735} (skill 125) in {zone:1441} (25-35), {zone:1417} (30-40) and {zone:1434} (30-45); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:1735} in {zone:1441} is marked."] = "74个{item:2838}，用于{spell:3967}：{skill:186}：{object:1735}（技能125）产自{zone:1441}（25-35）、{zone:1417}（30-40）和{zone:1434}（30-45）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1441}中{object:1735}最密集的一簇已标记。",
	["Apprentice {skill:202} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:202} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:5956} and pair it with {skill:186}: {item:2835} and {item:2770} are the first parts. 1-75 takes about 4s 15c of recipes and 18s 18c of vendor goods, plus 46 {item:2835} and 75 {item:2840} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:202}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜把技能练到75。本阵营任意{skill:202}训练师都教；箭头会指向最近的一位。买一个{item:5956}，再配合{skill:186}：{item:2835}和{item:2770}是最早的零件。1-75大约花4银15铜的配方钱和18银18铜的商人货物，外加46个{item:2835}和75个{item:2840}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}); Horde {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 225-300 takes about 2g 80s of recipes, plus 118 {item:3860}, 212 {item:7912}, 156 {item:12359} and 24 {item:14047} to gather or buy."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300，收费4金50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:202} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）；部落{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。225-300大约花2金80银的配方钱，外加118个{item:3860}、212个{item:7912}、156个{item:12359}和24个{item:14047}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12585} (from 175)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:12585}（175起）。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12596} (from 210)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:12596}（210起）。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:12621} (from 245)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:12621}（245起）。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3922} (from 30, 1s 15c). Also learn {spell:1230656} (1s): Forever's {skill:202} camp item, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. It takes a {spell:3922} and a {spell:3924}, which you learn at 30 and 50, so it gives no points. The Camping 101: {skill:202} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an engineering trainer who teaches it free."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:3922}（30起，1银15铜）。同时学习{spell:1230656}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:202}露营物品，放在营火旁的营地。它需要一把{spell:3922}和一个{spell:3924}，而这两种你在30级和50级就会学，所以不涨点。“露营入门：{skill:202}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的工程学训练师那里。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3945} (from 125)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:3945}（125起）。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3967} (from 190)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:3967}（190起）。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:3973} (from 90) and {spell:3950} (from 140)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:3973}（90起）和{spell:3950}（140起）。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:7430} (from 50, 1s 50c) and {spell:3924} (from 50, 1s 50c)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:7430}（50起，1银50铜）和{spell:3924}（50起，1银50铜）。",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:8334} (from 100)."] = "回到{skill:202}训练师处：{spell:8334}（100起）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 18 {item:2880} (18s) and {item:5956} (a tool: one, kept in your bags, 18c); about 18s 18c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, Gorina and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：18个{item:2880}（18银）和{item:5956}（工具：一个，放在包里，18铜）；总共约18银18铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:5514}和{npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、Gorina和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 31 {item:6530} (31s); about 31s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5494} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3333} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：31个{item:6530}（31银）；总共约31银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:5494}和{npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3333}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 45 {item:2880} (45s); about 45s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} and {npc:1286}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, Gorina and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：45个{item:2880}（45银）；总共约45银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:5514}和{npc:1286}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、Gorina和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}) and {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}) and {npc:11017} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:9271} (from 150) and {spell:3953} (from 145). 150-225 takes about 31s of vendor goods, plus 19 {item:2319}, 19 {item:2592}, 31 {item:2836}, 74 {item:2838}, 100 {item:2841}, 6 {item:2842}, 81 {item:3575}, 19 {item:3860} and 62 {item:7912} to gather or buy."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225，收费50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:202} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）和{npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）；部落{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）和{npc:11017}（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:9271}（150起）和{spell:3953}（145起）。150-225大约花31银的商人货物，外加19个{item:2319}、19个{item:2592}、31个{item:2836}、74个{item:2838}、100个{item:2841}、6个{item:2842}、81个{item:3575}、19个{item:3860}和62个{item:7912}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:202} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}), {npc:1676} ({zone:1431}), {npc:5518} ({zone:1453}), {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}) and {npc:11029} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:8736} ({zone:1446}), {npc:11031} ({zone:1458}), {npc:3412} ({zone:1454}) and {npc:11017} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3929} (from 75, 2s 50c) and {spell:3930} (from 75, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 5s of recipes and 45s of vendor goods, plus 15 {item:2836}, 27 {item:2838}, 72 {item:2840}, 61 {item:2841} and 2 {item:2842} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费5银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:202} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:202}训练师都教：联盟{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）、{npc:1676}（{zone:1431}）、{npc:5518}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）和{npc:11029}（{zone:1455}）；部落{npc:8736}（{zone:1446}）、{npc:11031}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:3412}（{zone:1454}）和{npc:11017}（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:3929}（75起，2银50铜）和{spell:3930}（75起，2银50铜）。75-150大约花5银的配方钱和45银的商人货物，外加15个{item:2836}、27个{item:2838}、72个{item:2840}、61个{item:2841}和2个{item:2842}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Learn {skill:202}"] = "学习{skill:202}",
	["a tool, keep it in your bags"] = "一件工具，放在包里",
	["{item:10505} is yellow at 175 (yellow 175, green 185, grey 195): about 31 crafts to 191. Each takes 2 {item:7912}. Two {item:7912} a craft (Mithril Deposits). Make plenty: the triggers, slugs and Gyro-Shot all use it."] = "{item:10505}在175时为黄色（175黄、185绿、195灰）：大约31次制作可到191。每次需要2个{item:7912}。每次两个{item:7912}（秘银矿脉）。多做些：触发器、弹丸和陀螺弹都要用它。",
	["{item:10505} to 191"] = "{item:10505} 到191",
	["{item:10512} is yellow at 210 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 19 crafts to 225. Each takes 1 {item:3860} and 1 {item:10505} and makes 200. Use the 19 {item:10505} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One {item:3860} and one {item:10505} a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (19 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House. {skill:202} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:10512}在210时为黄色（210黄、230绿、250灰）：大约19次制作可到225。每次需要1个{item:3860}和1个{item:10505}，产出200个。用你先前做好的那19个{item:10505}；上面的数量未计入它们。每次一个{item:3860}和一个{item:10505}；猎人们会买这种弹丸。附近需要铁砧。{item:3860}（150-225需19个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3858}；或在拍卖行购买。{skill:202} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{item:10512} is yellow at 225 (yellow 210, green 230, grey 250): about 62 crafts to 245. Each takes 1 {item:3860} and 1 {item:10505} and makes 200. Make the 50 {item:10505} first. Use the 12 {item:10505} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. One {item:3860} and one {item:10505} a craft; hunters buy the slugs. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (118 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:10512}在225时为黄色（210黄、230绿、250灰）：大约62次制作可到245。每次需要1个{item:3860}和1个{item:10505}，产出200个。先做好那50个{item:10505}。用你先前做好的那12个{item:10505}；上面的数量未计入它们。每次一个{item:3860}和一个{item:10505}；猎人们会买这种弹丸。附近需要铁砧。{item:3860}（225-300需118个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3858}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{item:10513} is yellow at 245 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 28 crafts to 265. Each takes 2 {item:3860} and 2 {item:10505} and makes 200. Make the 56 {item:10505} first. Two Mithril Bars and two {item:10505} a craft. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{item:10513}在245时为黄色（245黄、265绿、285灰）：大约28次制作可到265。每次需要2个{item:3860}和2个{item:10505}，产出200个。先做好那56个{item:10505}。每次两个秘银锭和两个{item:10505}。附近需要铁砧。",
	["{item:10513} to 265"] = "{item:10513} 到265",
	["{item:15994} is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 290, grey 300): about 24 crafts to 287. Each takes 3 {item:12359} and 1 {item:14047}. Three Thorium Bars and a {item:14047} a craft; the widgets are parts for the later Thorium gadgets. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:12359} (156 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:10620}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:15994}在265时为橙色（280黄、290绿、300灰）：大约24次制作可到287。每次需要3个{item:12359}和1个{item:14047}。每次三个瑟银锭和一块{item:14047}；这些零件是后续瑟银装置的组件。附近需要铁砧。{item:12359}（225-300需156个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:10620}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{item:15994} to 287"] = "{item:15994} 到287",
	["{item:16000} is orange at 287 (yellow 295, green 305, grey 315): about 14 crafts to 300. Each takes 6 {item:12359}. The schematic binds when picked up; six Thorium Bars a craft. Needs an anvil nearby. {skill:202} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:16000}在287时为橙色（295黄、305绿、315灰）：大约14次制作可到300。每次需要6个{item:12359}。图纸拾取即绑定；每次六个瑟银锭。附近需要铁砧。{skill:202} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{item:16042} teaches {item:15994} ({skill:202} 260) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:5175} ({zone:1455}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:3413} ({zone:1454}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too."] = "{item:16042}教{item:15994}（{skill:202} 260），售价1金20银。出售者：联盟{npc:5175}（{zone:1455}），限量；部落{npc:3413}（{zone:1454}），限量。卖家每次只备一两个，售出后过段时间补货；拍卖行也常有的卖。",
	["{item:16047} teaches {item:16000} ({skill:202} 275) for 1g 60s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:260565} ({zone:2548}) and {npc:11185} ({zone:1452}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:11185} ({zone:1452}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:16047}教{item:16000}（{skill:202} 275），售价1金60银。出售者：联盟{npc:260565}（{zone:2548}）和{npc:11185}（{zone:1452}），限量；部落{npc:11185}（{zone:1452}），限量。卖家每次只备一两个，售出后过段时间补货；它拾取即绑定，所以拍卖行永远没有。",
	["{item:6533} is yellow at 150 (yellow 150, green 160, grey 170): about 31 crafts to 166. Each takes 2 {item:2841}, 1 {item:6530} and 1 {spell:3929} and makes 3. Make the 31 {spell:3929} first. {item:6530} come from trade and fishing suppliers; the attractors sell to fishermen. {item:2841} (100 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6533}在150时为黄色（150黄、160绿、170灰）：大约31次制作可到166。每次需要2个{item:2841}、1个{item:6530}和1个{spell:3929}，产出3个。先做好那31个{spell:3929}。{item:6530}由杂货和钓鱼供应商出售；这种诱饵卖给渔夫。{item:2841}（150-225需100个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2840}和{item:3576}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{item:6533} to 166"] = "{item:6533} 到166",
	["{item:6712} is orange at 100 (yellow 115, green 122, grey 130): about 31 crafts to 125. Each takes 1 {item:2841}, 2 {spell:3922} and 1 {item:2880}. Make the 29 {spell:3922} first. Use the 33 {spell:3922} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. Practice Locks sell to rogues, or open them yourself. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2841} (61 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6712}在100时为橙色（115黄、122绿、130灰）：大约31次制作可到125。每次需要1个{item:2841}、2个{spell:3922}和1个{item:2880}。先做好那29个{spell:3922}。用你先前做好的那33个{spell:3922}；上面的数量未计入它们。练习锁可以卖给盗贼，或者自己开。附近需要铁砧。{item:2841}（75-150需61个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2840}和{item:3576}；或在拍卖行购买。",
