	["{spell:3918} is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 30, grey 40): about 46 crafts to 35. Each takes 1 {item:2835}. One {item:2835} a craft; {item:2835} comes with the {item:2770} from Copper Veins."] = "{spell:3918}在1时为橙色（20黄、30绿、40灰）：大约46次制作可到35。每次需要1个{item:2835}。每次一个{item:2835}；{item:2835}与铜矿脉出的{item:2770}一同获得。",
	["{spell:3918} to 35"] = "{spell:3918} 到35",
	["{spell:3922} is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 52, grey 60): about 33 crafts to 57. Each takes 1 {item:2840}. One {item:2840} a craft. Keep the bolts: Practice Locks and later gadgets take them. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:5956} is a tool: keep it in your bags. {item:2840} (75 for 1-75): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3922}在35时为橙色（45黄、52绿、60灰）：大约33次制作可到57。每次需要1个{item:2840}。每次一个{item:2840}。留着这些螺栓：练习锁和后续装置都要用。附近需要铁砧。{item:5956}是工具：放在包里。{item:2840}（1-75需75个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2770}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{spell:3922} to 57"] = "{spell:3922} 到57",
	["{spell:3924} is orange at 57 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 18 crafts to 75, a point every craft. Each takes 2 {item:2840} and 1 {item:2880}. Two Copper Bars and a {item:2880} a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby. Make the {item:6219} now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there."] = "{spell:3924}在57时为橙色（80黄、95绿、110灰）：大约18次制作可到75，每次一点。每次需要2个{item:2840}和1个{item:2880}。每次两个铜锭和一个{item:2880}（锻造和工程学供应商）。附近需要铁砧。趁{item:6219}还能涨点时先做出来：后面的配方要求它在你包里，所以一直留着。",
	["{spell:3924} is yellow at 94 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 14 crafts to 100. Each takes 2 {item:2840} and 1 {item:2880}. Two Copper Bars and a {item:2880} a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{spell:3924}在94时为黄色（80黄、95绿、110灰）：大约14次制作可到100。每次需要2个{item:2840}和1个{item:2880}。每次两个铜锭和一个{item:2880}（锻造和工程学供应商）。附近需要铁砧。",
	["{spell:3924} to 100"] = "{spell:3924} 到100",
	["{spell:3924} to 75"] = "{spell:3924} 到75",
	["{spell:3930} is orange at 75 (yellow 85, green 90, grey 95): about 15 crafts to 94. Each takes 1 {spell:3929} and 1 {item:2840} and makes 200. Make the 15 {spell:3929} first: it gives points too while not grey. The {spell:3929} in each gives its own point while it is not grey: two chances a craft. Sell the shot to hunters or a vendor. {item:2840} (72 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3930}在75时为橙色（85黄、90绿、95灰）：大约15次制作可到94。每次需要1个{spell:3929}和1个{item:2840}，产出200个。先做好那15个{spell:3929}：它在未变灰前也能涨点。每次其中的{spell:3929}在未变灰时也会单独涨一点：一次制作两次机会。把弹药卖给猎人，或卖给商人。{item:2840}（75-150需72个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2770}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{spell:3930} to 94"] = "{spell:3930} 到94",
	["{spell:3945} is yellow at 125 (yellow 125, green 135, grey 145): about 27 crafts to 140. Each takes 1 {item:2838}. One {item:2838} a craft (Iron Deposits). Keep some: Iron Grenades take one each."] = "{spell:3945}在125时为黄色（125黄、135绿、145灰）：大约27次制作可到140。每次需要1个{item:2838}。每次一个{item:2838}（铁矿脉）。留一些：每个铁手雷都要一个。",
	["{spell:3945} to 140"] = "{spell:3945} 到140",
	["{spell:3950} is yellow at 140 (yellow 140, green 165, grey 190): about 10 crafts to 150. Each takes 2 {item:4377}, 3 {item:2841} and 1 {spell:3973} and makes 3. Make the 10 {spell:3973} (2 crafts) first. Use the 20 {item:4377} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2842} (2 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2775}; or the Auction House. {skill:202} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3950}在140时为黄色（140黄、165绿、190灰）：大约10次制作可到150。每次需要2个{item:4377}、3个{item:2841}和1个{spell:3973}，产出3个。先做好那10个{spell:3973}（2次制作）。用你先前做好的那20个{item:4377}；上面的数量未计入它们。训练师教这个，而且按数据这是通过这些点数最便宜的办法。附近需要铁砧。{item:2842}（75-150需2个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2775}；或在拍卖行购买。{skill:202} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:3950} to 150"] = "{spell:3950} 到150",
	["{spell:3953} is yellow at 166 (yellow 145, green 170, grey 195): about 19 crafts to 175. Each takes 2 {item:2841}, 1 {item:2319} and 1 {item:2592}. Bronze Frameworks are parts for later gadgets; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3953}在166时为黄色（145黄、170绿、195灰）：大约19次制作可到175。每次需要2个{item:2841}、1个{item:2319}和1个{item:2592}。青铜框架是后续装置的零件；多出来的卖给商人。",
	["{spell:3967} is yellow at 191 (yellow 190, green 210, grey 230): about 27 crafts to 210. Each takes 3 {item:3575}, 3 {spell:3945} and 1 {spell:3973} and makes 2. Make the 74 {spell:3945} and 30 {spell:3973} (6 crafts) first. Use the 7 {spell:3945} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. A {item:2842} makes five Silver Contacts (grey by now: no points, but no trip to a vendor either); the {spell:3945} comes from {item:2838}. Each craft makes two bombs. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 30, {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}), {npc:5518} ({zone:1453}), {npc:4586} ({zone:1458}) or {npc:3494} ({area:392}) sends you to {spell:20220} ({npc:7944}, {zone:1455}, or {npc:7406}, {area:35}: 6 Mithril Tubes, an {item:4407} and 2 Advanced Target Dummies) or Goblin Engineering ({npc:8126}, {area:976}: 20 Big Iron Bombs, 20 {item:10507} and 5 {npc:2675}). The {item:4407} schematic now binds when picked up, but the quest takes a scope someone else made. The membership card lasts 14 days of play; renewing it costs 2g. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2842} (6 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2775}; or the Auction House. {item:3575} (81 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2772}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3967}在191时为黄色（190黄、210绿、230灰）：大约27次制作可到210。每次需要3个{item:3575}、3个{spell:3945}和1个{spell:3973}，产出2个。先做好那74个{spell:3945}和30个{spell:3973}（6次制作）。用你先前做好的那7个{spell:3945}；上面的数量未计入它们。一个{item:2842}可做五个白银触点（现在已灰：不涨点，但也不用跑商人）；{spell:3945}来自{item:2838}。每次制作产出两个炸弹。专精（可选）：在200技能且角色30级时，{npc:5174}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:5518}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:4586}（{zone:1458}）或{npc:3494}（{area:392}）会派你去{spell:20220}（{npc:7944}，{zone:1455}，或{npc:7406}，{area:35}：6根秘银管、一个{item:4407}和2个高级假人）或地精工程学（{npc:8126}，{area:976}：20个大型铁炸弹、20个{item:10507}和5个{npc:2675}）。{item:4407}的图纸现在拾取即绑定，但任务要的是别人做的瞄准镜。会员卡可持续14天游戏时间；续费要2金。只能选一个；冲300都不需要，测试服也从未测过它们（只到30级就结束了）。附近需要铁砧。{item:2842}（150-225需6个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2775}；或在拍卖行购买。{item:3575}（150-225需81个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2772}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{spell:3967} to 210"] = "{spell:3967} 到210",
}

