	["420 {item:8170} for {item:13863} and {item:13867}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:1815}, {npc:1816} and {npc:1817} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "420个{item:8170}，用于{item:13863}和{item:13867}：{skill:393}：48-60级的野兽；或在拍卖行购买。在此剥取{npc:1815}、{npc:1816}和{npc:1817}（48-60级）；{skill:393}指南会为你规划路线。",
	["420 {item:8170} for {item:13863} and {item:13867}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 48-60; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:6369}, {npc:8760}, {npc:6380}, {npc:6379}, {npc:6378} and {npc:6377} here (level 48-60); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "420个{item:8170}，用于{item:13863}和{item:13867}：{skill:393}：48-60级的野兽；或在拍卖行购买。在此剥取{npc:6369}、{npc:8760}、{npc:6380}、{npc:6379}、{npc:6378}和{npc:6377}（48-60级）；{skill:393}指南会为你规划路线。",
	["567 {item:2592} for {spell:2402} and {spell:3866}: humanoids of level 15-30 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:3263} (level 19-20) here."] = "567个{item:2592}，用于{spell:2402}和{spell:3866}：15-30级的人形生物掉落；或在拍卖行购买。在此可由{npc:3263}（19-20级）掉落。",
	["567 {item:2592} for {spell:2402} and {spell:3866}: humanoids of level 15-30 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:98} (level 17-18) here."] = "567个{item:2592}，用于{spell:2402}和{spell:3866}：15-30级的人形生物掉落；或在拍卖行购买。在此可由{npc:98}（17-18级）掉落。",
	["900 {item:4338} for {item:9998} and {item:10024}: humanoids of level 35-50 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:4467} (level 46-47) here."] = "900个{item:4338}，用于{item:9998}和{item:10024}：35-50级的人形生物掉落；或在拍卖行购买。在此可由{npc:4467}（46-47级）掉落。",
	["900 {item:4338} for {item:9998} and {item:10024}: humanoids of level 35-50 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:5472} (level 46-47) here."] = "900个{item:4338}，用于{item:9998}和{item:10024}：35-50级的人形生物掉落；或在拍卖行购买。在此可由{npc:5472}（46-47级）掉落。",
	["Apprentice {skill:197} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:197} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Keep every {item:2589} you loot: humanoids of level 5-20 drop it. 1-75 takes about 50c of recipes and 7s 20c of vendor goods, plus 144 {item:2589} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:197}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜把技能练到75。本阵营任意{skill:197}训练师都教；箭头会指向最近的一位。拾到的{item:2589}都留着：5-20级的人形生物掉落。1-75大约花50铜的配方钱和7银20铜的商人货物，外加144个{item:2589}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300; it needs {skill:197} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11052} ({zone:1445}); Horde {npc:2399} ({zone:1424}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:18401} (from 205) and {spell:18402} (from 210). 225-300 takes about 1g 60s of recipes and 58g of vendor goods, plus 420 {item:8170}, 3195 {item:14047} and 124 {item:14227} to gather or buy."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300；它需要{skill:197} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:11052}（{zone:1445}）；部落{npc:2399}（{zone:1424}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:18401}（205起）和{spell:18402}（210起）。225-300大约花1金60银的配方钱和58金的商人货物，外加420个{item:8170}、3195个{item:14047}和124个{item:14227}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Back to a {skill:197} trainer: {spell:3839} (from 100, 5s) and {spell:3871} (from 135)."] = "回到{skill:197}训练师处：{spell:3839}（100起，5银）和{spell:3871}（135起）。",
	["Back to a {skill:197} trainer: {spell:3866} (from 85, 2s 50c)."] = "回到{skill:197}训练师处：{spell:3866}（85起，2银50铜）。",
	["Back to a {skill:197} trainer: {spell:8776} (from 15, 50c)."] = "回到{skill:197}训练师处：{spell:8776}（15起，50铜）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 108 {item:2321} (1g 8s), 34 {item:2324} (8s 50c) and 98 {item:2604} (49s); about 1g 65s 50c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：108个{item:2321}（1金8银）、34个{item:2324}（8银50铜）和98个{item:2604}（49银）；总共约1金65银50铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 116 {item:14341} (58g); about 58g in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：116个{item:14341}（58金）；总共约58金。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 44 {item:2321} (44s), 90 {item:4291} (4g 50s), 44 {item:6260} (22s) and 80 {item:8343} (16g); about 21g 16s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：44个{item:2321}（44银）、90个{item:4291}（4金50银）、44个{item:6260}（22银）和80个{item:8343}（16金）；总共约21金16银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 72 {item:2320} (7s 20c); about 7s 20c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：72个{item:2320}（7银20铜）；总共约7银20铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225; it needs {skill:197} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:1346} ({zone:1453}) and {npc:11052} ({zone:1445}); Horde {npc:2399} ({zone:1424}) and {npc:4576} ({zone:1458}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3865} (from 140). 150-225 takes about 15s of recipes and 21g 16s of vendor goods, plus 264 {item:4306} and 900 {item:4338} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {item:9998} (from 170) and {item:10024} (from 190), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225；它需要{skill:197} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:1346}（{zone:1453}）和{npc:11052}（{zone:1445}）；部落{npc:2399}（{zone:1424}）和{npc:4576}（{zone:1458}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:3865}（140起）。150-225大约花15银的配方钱和21金16银的商人货物，外加264个{item:4306}和900个{item:4338}，需自行采集或购买。把这些全带在包里来（上面的步骤备齐，其余从拍卖行买）：这些训练师还教{item:9998}（170起）和{item:10024}（190起），且制作无需工作台，所以就地制作，技能一到就学下一个配方。一趟顶三趟。",
	["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs {skill:197} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:197} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:1346} ({zone:1453}), {npc:2627} ({zone:1434}), {npc:5153} ({zone:1455}), {npc:4159} ({zone:1457}), {npc:252380} (Zephras Isle), Sellandus ({zone:1453}), {npc:251991} (Zephras Isle) and {npc:11052} ({zone:1445}); Horde {npc:2399} ({zone:1424}), {npc:2627} ({zone:1434}), {npc:4576} ({zone:1458}), {npc:3363} ({zone:1454}), {npc:3704} ({zone:1413}), {npc:252380} (Zephras Isle), {npc:11049} ({zone:1458}), {npc:251991} (Zephras Isle) and {npc:3004} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:2964} (from 55, 1s) and {spell:2402} (from 55, 2s 50c). Also learn {spell:1229504} (1s): Forever's {skill:197} camp item, a {spell:2963} and a {item:2320}; each faction has its own. The Camping 101: {skill:197} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a tailoring trainer who teaches it free. 75-150 takes about 11s of recipes and 1g 65s 50c of vendor goods, plus 567 {item:2592} and 204 {item:4306} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费5银；它需要{skill:197} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:197}训练师都教：联盟{npc:1346}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:2627}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:5153}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:4159}（{zone:1457}）、{npc:252380}（泽弗拉斯岛）、Sellandus（{zone:1453}）、{npc:251991}（泽弗拉斯岛）和{npc:11052}（{zone:1445}）；部落{npc:2399}（{zone:1424}）、{npc:2627}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:4576}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:3363}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:3704}（{zone:1413}）、{npc:252380}（泽弗拉斯岛）、{npc:11049}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:251991}（泽弗拉斯岛）和{npc:3004}（{zone:1456}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:2964}（55起，1银）和{spell:2402}（55起，2银50铜）。同时学习{spell:1229504}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:197}露营物品，需要一个{spell:2963}和一个{item:2320}；每个阵营各有自己的版本。“露营入门：{skill:197}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的裁缝训练师那里。75-150大约花11银的配方钱和1金65银50铜的商人货物，外加567个{item:2592}和204个{item:4306}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Learn {skill:197}"] = "学习{skill:197}",
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:12048} (from 170)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:12048}（170起）。",
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:12072} (from 190)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:12072}（190起）。",
	["from the pattern bought at the Auction House"] = "来自在拍卖行买到的图样",
	["{item:10024} is orange at 197 (yellow 205, green 220, grey 235): about 40 crafts to 225. Each takes 3 {spell:3865} and 2 {item:8343}. Make the 120 {spell:3865} first. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. {skill:197} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:10024}在197时为橙色（205黄、220绿、235灰）：大约40次制作可到225。每次需要3个{spell:3865}和2个{item:8343}。先做好那120个{spell:3865}。训练师教这个，而且按数据这是通过这些点数最便宜的办法。{skill:197} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{item:13856} is yellow at 225 (yellow 225, green 240, grey 255): about 11 crafts to 234. Each takes 3 {item:14048} and 1 {item:14341}. Make the 33 {item:14048} first. {item:14341} from tailoring vendors."] = "{item:13856}在225时为黄色（225黄、240绿、255灰）：大约11次制作可到234。每次需要3个{item:14048}和1个{item:14341}。先做好那33个{item:14048}。{item:14341}来自裁缝供应商。",
	["{item:13856} to 234"] = "{item:13856} 到234",
	["{item:13863} is orange at 234 (yellow 245, green 260, grey 275): about 43 crafts to 265. Each takes 4 {item:14048}, 4 {item:8170} and 1 {item:14341}. Make the 172 {item:14048} first. {npc:11189} in {area:2255} keeps one pattern at a time; the {area:1769} tunnel from {zone:1448} is the road in, so never kill Timbermaw furbolgs on the way."] = "{item:13863}在234时为橙色（245黄、260绿、275灰）：大约43次制作可到265。每次需要4个{item:14048}、4个{item:8170}和1个{item:14341}。先做好那172个{item:14048}。{area:2255}的{npc:11189}每次只保留一张图样；从{zone:1448}走{area:1769}隧道是唯一的路，所以路上千万别杀木喉熊怪。",
	["{item:13863} to 265"] = "{item:13863} 到265",
	["{item:13867} is orange at 265 (yellow 275, green 290, grey 305): about 62 crafts to 300. Each takes 7 {item:14048}, 2 {item:14227}, 4 {item:8170} and 1 {item:14341}. Make the 434 {item:14048} first. Its pattern ({item:14504}) drops from mobs all over the world and does not bind: buy it at the Auction House. Seven bolts, two {item:14227} and four {item:8170} a craft: the dearest stretch. The spiders of {zone:1422} and {zone:1451} drop the silk (the marked spots), or the Auction House. No pattern on the Auction House? {item:13863} still give a point now and then to 275, and {item:13864} ({npc:7940}, {zone:1450}) to 280, at 4 bolts a craft. {item:14342} (pattern from {npc:11189} or {npc:11188} in {area:2255}; 2 {item:14256} at a Moonwell) stays orange to 270 and yellow to 285, but it can be made once every four days. The {item:279943} patterns (Merchant's Favor sandals and waistcords from {npc:248202} or {npc:256735}; the wheel's blueprint drops from the {npc:246017} in the City of Dalaran) and {item:254123} (Pexmit in {zone:2482}, 10g; we could not confirm that vendor yet) are the other ways on. {skill:197} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:13867}在265时为橙色（275黄、290绿、305灰）：大约62次制作可到300。每次需要7个{item:14048}、2个{item:14227}、4个{item:8170}和1个{item:14341}。先做好那434个{item:14048}。它的图样（{item:14504}）由世界各地的怪物掉落，且不绑定：在拍卖行买。每次七个布卷、两份{item:14227}和四张{item:8170}：最贵的一段。{zone:1422}和{zone:1451}的蜘蛛掉落丝绸（标记处），或在拍卖行购买。拍卖行没有图样？{item:13863}到275前仍时不时涨点，{item:13864}（{npc:7940}，{zone:1450}）可到280，每次4个布卷。{item:14342}（图样来自{area:2255}的{npc:11189}或{npc:11188}；在月亮井旁用2个{item:14256}）到270仍是橙色、到285仍是黄色，但每四天才能做一次。{item:279943}系列图样（来自{npc:248202}或{npc:256735}的商人的恩惠凉鞋和腰带；纺车蓝图由达拉然城中的{npc:246017}掉落）和{item:254123}（{zone:2482}的Pexmit，10金；我们尚未能确认该商人）是其他继续提升的办法。{skill:197} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{item:13867} to 300"] = "{item:13867} 到300",
	["{item:14481} teaches {item:13863} ({skill:197} 230) for 1g 60s. Sold by {npc:11189} ({zone:1452}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:14481}教{item:13863}（{skill:197} 230），售价1金60银。出售者{npc:11189}（{zone:1452}），限量。卖家每次只备一两个，售出后过段时间补货；它拾取即绑定，所以拍卖行永远没有。",
	["{item:4306} (Alliance)"] = "{item:4306}（联盟）",
	["{item:4306} (Horde)"] = "{item:4306}（部落）",
	["{item:7026} is orange at 15 (yellow 50, green 67, grey 85): about 65 crafts to 75. Each takes 1 {spell:2963} and 1 {item:2320}. Make the 65 {spell:2963} first: it gives points too while not grey. Each belt takes one bolt; the belts sell to vendors."] = "{item:7026}在15时为橙色（50黄、67绿、85灰）：大约65次制作可到75。每次需要1个{spell:2963}和1个{item:2320}。先做好那65个{spell:2963}：它在未变灰前也能涨点。每条腰带用一个布卷；腰带可以卖给商人。",
	["{item:7053} is orange at 150 (yellow 160, green 175, grey 190): about 22 crafts to 170. Each takes 3 {spell:3839}, 2 {item:6260} and 2 {item:2321}. Make the 66 {spell:3839} first. Its recipe is the one bought above; it is the cheapest way through these points in the data."] = "{item:7053}在150时为橙色（160黄、175绿、190灰）：大约22次制作可到170。每次需要3个{spell:3839}、2个{item:6260}和2个{item:2321}。先做好那66个{spell:3839}。它的配方就是上面买的那个；按数据这是通过这些点数最便宜的办法。",
	["{item:7053} to 170"] = "{item:7053} 到170",
	["{item:7089} teaches {item:7053} ({skill:197} 140) for 15s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:6576} ({zone:1444}), limited stock and {npc:251997} ({zone:1416}); Horde: {npc:6574} ({zone:1417}), limited stock and {npc:251997} ({zone:1416})."] = "{item:7089}教{item:7053}（{skill:197} 140），售价15银。出售者：联盟{npc:6576}（{zone:1444}），限量，以及{npc:251997}（{zone:1416}）；部落{npc:6574}（{zone:1417}），限量，以及{npc:251997}（{zone:1416}）。",
	["{item:9998} is orange at 170 (yellow 185, green 200, grey 215): about 30 crafts to 197. Each takes 2 {spell:3865} and 3 {item:4291}. Make the 60 {spell:3865} first. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data."] = "{item:9998}在170时为橙色（185黄、200绿、215灰）：大约30次制作可到197。每次需要2个{spell:3865}和3个{item:4291}。先做好那60个{spell:3865}。训练师教这个，而且按数据这是通过这些点数最便宜的办法。",
	["{item:9998} to 197"] = "{item:9998} 到197",
	["{skill:197} 1-300"] = "{skill:197} 1-300",
	["{skill:197} 1-75: vendor goods"] = "{skill:197} 1-75：商人货物",
	["{skill:197} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:197} 150-225：商人货物",
	["{skill:197} 225-300: vendor goods"] = "{skill:197} 225-300：商人货物",
	["{skill:197} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:197} 75-150：商人货物",
	["{skill:197} recipes at 104"] = "{skill:197} 104时的配方",
	["{skill:197} recipes at 135"] = "{skill:197} 135时的配方",
	["{skill:197} recipes at 15"] = "{skill:197} 15时的配方",
	["{skill:197} recipes at 170"] = "{skill:197} 170时的配方",
	["{skill:197} recipes at 197"] = "{skill:197} 197时的配方",
	["{spell:2387} is orange at 1 (yellow 35, green 47, grey 60): about 7 crafts to 15, a point every craft. Each takes 1 {spell:2963} and 1 {item:2320}. Make the 7 {spell:2963} first: it gives points too while not grey. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data."] = "{spell:2387}在1时为橙色（35黄、47绿、60灰）：大约7次制作可到15，每次一点。每次需要1个{spell:2963}和1个{item:2320}。先做好那7个{spell:2963}：它在未变灰前也能涨点。训练师教这个，而且按数据这是通过这些点数最便宜的办法。",
	["{spell:2387} to 15"] = "{spell:2387} 到15",
	["{spell:2402} is orange at 75 (yellow 80, green 97, grey 115): about 42 crafts to 104. Each takes 1 {spell:2964} and 1 {item:2321}. Make the 42 {spell:2964} first: it gives points too while not grey. {spell:2964} is taught from 55 on Forever."] = "{spell:2402}在75时为橙色（80黄、97绿、115灰）：大约42次制作可到104。每次需要1个{spell:2964}和1个{item:2321}。先做好那42个{spell:2964}：它在未变灰前也能涨点。Forever中{spell:2964}从55起可学。",
	["{spell:2402} to 104"] = "{spell:2402} 到104",
	["{spell:3866} is orange at 104 (yellow 110, green 127, grey 145): about 49 crafts to 135. Each takes 3 {spell:2964}, 2 {item:2604} and 1 {item:2321}. Make the 147 {spell:2964} first. Three woolen bolts and two {item:2604} a shirt; {item:2592} drops from humanoids of level 15-30."] = "{spell:3866}在104时为橙色（110黄、127绿、145灰）：大约49次制作可到135。每次需要3个{spell:2964}、2个{item:2604}和1个{item:2321}。先做好那147个{spell:2964}。每件衬衫要三个毛布卷和两份{item:2604}；{item:2592}由15-30级的人形生物掉落。",
	["{spell:3866} to 135"] = "{spell:3866} 到135",
	["{spell:3871} is orange at 135 (yellow 145, green 150, grey 155): about 17 crafts to 150. Each takes 3 {spell:3839}, 2 {item:2324} and 1 {item:2321}. Make the 51 {spell:3839} first. Silk bolts from here on: {item:4306} drops from humanoids of level 25-45. {item:2324} from tailoring and trade supplies vendors. {skill:197} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3871}在135时为橙色（145黄、150绿、155灰）：大约17次制作可到150。每次需要3个{spell:3839}、2个{item:2324}和1个{item:2321}。先做好那51个{spell:3839}。从这里起用丝绸布卷：{item:4306}由25-45级的人形生物掉落。{item:2324}来自裁缝和杂货供应商。{skill:197} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:3871} to 150"] = "{spell:3871} 到150",
}

G["forever/reputation/bloodsail-buccaneers"] = {
	["\"Pretty Boy\" Duncan, a Bloodsail pirate, stands on the beach north of {area:35}. {area:35} players kill him for a quest: if he is not there, wait for him. He has a quest for you from level 55, while {area:35} is below Neutral; it is done once you are Friendly with the Bloodsail and Hated with {area:35}."] = "血帆海盗“小白脸”邓肯站在{area:35}以北的海滩上。{area:35}的玩家会为任务杀他：如果他不在，就等他。55级起他会给你一个任务，前提是{area:35}声望低于中立；当你与血帆达到友善、与{area:35}达到仇恨时才算完成。",
	["At Neutral the Bloodsail crew stop attacking you. {npc:2546} is aboard the {area:1757}, the pirate ship anchored south of {area:35}, on its middle deck. Swim out; take the quest and hand it in on the spot for the {item:22746}: the {item:22742}, Sash, Pants and Boots."] = "到中立后，血帆船员不再攻击你。{npc:2546}在{area:1757}上，那是停泊在{area:35}以南的海盗船，他在中层甲板。游过去；接任务并当场交回，换取{item:22746}：{item:22742}、腰带、裤子和靴子。",
	["Back to Firallon for the {item:12185} (in Classic its use calls a parrot to your shoulder): 200 more Bloodsail and 1,000 less {area:35}. Bruisers pay 25 only up to the end of Honored and Jazzrik, a lone goblin in the {zone:1418}, 5 up to the end of Revered; no quest is left, so Exalted cannot be reached."] = "回到菲拉隆处拿{item:12185}（经典旧世中，使用它会召唤一只鹦鹉停在肩上）：血帆声望再加200，{area:35}声望再减1,000。打手只在尊敬结束前每次给25点，而{zone:1418}中独行的地精Jazzrik在崇敬结束前每次给5点；已无任务可做，所以无法达到崇拜。",
	["Baron Revilgaz"] = "雷维尔加兹男爵",
	["Before you start"] = "开始之前",
	["Bloodsail Buccaneers Reputation"] = "血帆海盗声望",
	["Bloodsail standing goes up only by killing the people of {area:35}, and every kill costs you {area:35} 125 and the other goblin towns ({area:976}, {area:392}, {area:2255}, and in Forever likely Powderfuse) about 62 each. After the Bruisers this guide asks for, every goblin town is Hated: their guards attack you, and you lose their flight masters, inns, vendors and {area:976}'s and {area:2255}'s auction houses. Getting back takes longer than getting here (last step). Fly in, bind elsewhere, and do your goblin-town business first. The outfit and the hat need only Friendly; past that Bloodsail has nothing to give. {area:35}'s guards are not your enemies yet: tick At War for {area:35} in your reputation panel, then attack."] = "血帆声望只能通过杀{area:35}的人来提升，而每杀一个都会让你损失{area:35} 125点和其它地精城镇（{area:976}、{area:392}、{area:2255}，在Forever中很可能还有火药镇）各约62点。完成本指南要求的打手击杀后，所有地精城镇都会变为仇恨：卫兵会攻击你，你也会失去它们的飞行管理员、旅店、商人，以及{area:976}和{area:2255}的拍卖行。挽回这些比走到这里更费时（见最后一步）。飞进来，把炉石绑在别处，并先办完你在各大地精城镇的事务。套装和帽子只需友善；再往后血帆就没有什么可给的了。{area:35}的卫兵现在还不是你的敌人：在声望面板中为{area:35}勾选“交战”，然后再动手。",
	["Booty Bay Bruiser"] = "藏宝海湾打手",
	["Booty Bay Bruisers to Neutral"] = "靠藏宝海湾打手到中立",
	["Bruisers to Friendly"] = "靠打手到友善",
	["Every goblin town is now Hated. Forever's quest data takes the town reputation off the four goblin amends quests outside {area:392}, {area:35}, {area:976} and {area:2255}, so the climb back is the Cartel's own: {npc:14637} in {zone:1444} serves everyone, and his Zapped Giants quests pay 25 to every town at once; Bloodsail pirates give {area:35} 5 each up to the end of Neutral (and cost Bloodsail 25); Southsea pirates and the Venture Co. in Stranglethorn give the towns 5 each. The Steamwheedle Cartel guide has the details. Expect it to take longer than the war did."] = "现在所有地精城镇都是仇恨。Forever的任务数据把城镇声望从{area:392}、{area:35}、{area:976}和{area:2255}外的四个地精补偿任务中移除了，所以挽回之路只能靠财团自己：{zone:1444}的{npc:14637}面向所有人服务，他的“电击巨人”任务会一次性给每个城镇25点；血帆海盗在中立结束前每次给{area:35} 5点（并扣血帆25点）；荆棘谷的南海海盗和风险投资公司每次给各城镇5点。热砂财团指南有详细说明。做好它比那场战争花的时间更长的准备。",
	["Fleet Master Seahorn"] = "舰队指挥官西霍恩",
	["Look at your Bloodsail bar first. A new character starts Hated, 500 short of Hostile: 260 Bruisers to Neutral, at 25 each. But every {area:35} quest you did while leveling took five times its {area:35} reward off Bloodsail (An OOX of Your Own, Stranglethorn Fever and Facing Negolash 1,000 each), and every Bloodsail pirate you killed 25 more: after {area:35}'s quests you sit near the bottom of Hated, up to 1,680 Bruisers from Neutral. Divide what the bar still lacks to Hostile, plus 6,000, by 25. Bruisers (level 57) hit hard, net you and knock you back, and new ones come when a goblin calls for help. Fight on the path that turns left from the tunnel up to the blacksmith's house: two Bruisers patrol it and rarely meet. Once they are down, step into the house (or hit one of the goblins inside) and a fresh Bruiser comes running. Players manage 30 to 40 an hour. {area:35} is Hated after about 53 Bruisers from a fresh Neutral 500. At the New Year celebration the town's goblins are drunk and do not fight back. The Blackwater crew at {area:327} in the {zone:1417} (level 37-40) are easier but pay only 5 each. Do not kill Bloodsail pirates: each costs 25."] = "先看看你的血帆声望条。新角色从仇恨开始，离敌对差500点：杀260个打手可到中立，每个25点。但你在升级时做过的每个{area:35}任务都会按它{area:35}奖励的五倍扣除血帆声望（“你自己的OOX”、“荆棘谷热病”和“直面奈古拉什”各1,000点），而且每杀一个血帆海盗还要再扣25点：做完{area:35}的任务后，你会落在仇恨的最底端，离中立最多要杀1,680个打手。把声望条离敌对还差的部分加上6,000，再除以25。打手（57级）打得疼，会用网困住你并把你击退，而且地精一呼救就会来新的。在从隧道向上通往铁匠住宅的岔路左转那条路上打：两个打手在那里巡逻，很少撞在一起。把他们放倒后，走进屋子（或打里面的一个地精），就会有一个新打手跑来。玩家每小时能打30到40个。从全新的中立500起，约杀53个打手后{area:35}就会变成仇恨。新年庆典时，镇上的地精喝醉了，不会还手。{zone:1417}中{area:327}的黑水船员（37-40级）更容易，但每个只给5点。不要杀血帆海盗：每个扣25点。",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 more: 120 Bruisers. Friendly is the last standing that unlocks anything."] = "中立到友善还需3,000点：120个打手。友善是最后一个能解锁东西的声望等级。",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["The pirate outfit and the {item:10030}, bought with a war against {area:35} and every goblin town."] = "海盗套装和{item:10030}，是用与{area:35}及所有地精城镇为敌的战争换来的。",
	["The way back"] = "挽回之路",
	["The {item:10030}"] = "{item:10030}",
	["the path to the smithy"] = "通往铁匠铺的小路",
	["{npc:14637}: Zapped Giants, open to the Hated"] = "{npc:14637}：“电击巨人”，对仇恨者开放",
	["{npc:2496} and {npc:2487} stand on the top floor of the {area:35} inn, out on the balcony. Both are level 60 and Bruisers come to their aid: clear the stairs first and pull them one at a time. They come back, so a friend can kill them too."] = "{npc:2496}和{npc:2487}站在{area:35}旅店的顶层，在阳台上。两人都是60级，而且打手会来帮他们：先清干净楼梯，再一个一个拉。他们会复活，所以朋友也能来杀。",
	["{npc:2546}, on the {area:1757}: 25"] = "{npc:2546}，在{area:1757}上：25",
	["{npc:2546}: the {item:22746}"] = "{npc:2546}：{item:22746}",
	["{npc:4624}: +25"] = "{npc:4624}：+25",
}

G["forever/class/mage/celestial-orb"] = {
	["At 40 the mage trainers who send you to {npc:6546} ({npc:5497}, Bink, {npc:4568}, {npc:5885}) also have {quest:2861}, a quest any class can do. {npc:6546} then wants the {quest:2846} from {npc:7795}, a level 46 elite naga in {area:978}, the troll dungeon in north-western {zone:1446}: a group of five, level 44-54. She is one of the bosses by the sacred pool, and the tiara always drops. The reward window shows the {item:9527} and the {item:9531}."] = "40级时，派你去找{npc:6546}的法师训练师（{npc:5497}、宾克、{npc:4568}、{npc:5885}）也提供{quest:2861}，这是任何职业都能做的任务。{npc:6546}之后还要{npc:7795}身上的{quest:2846}：他是{zone:1446}西北部{area:978}（巨魔副本）里的46级精英纳迦，需五人队，44-54级。她是圣池旁的首领之一，头饰必掉。奖励窗口显示{item:9527}和{item:9531}。",
	["Back at {npc:6546}'s. Kill the critters around the cottage first: they join the fight. Accepting {quest:1955} starts a 3 minute timer, and {npc:6546} calls the {npc:6549} out in her garden: a level 40 elite that resists many spells, roots and slows. Grouping up is encouraged: a mage of 40 may need help or potions, at about 45 it is soloable. You can pull it from range from the dock. The timer keeps running after it dies, so hand the quest in straight away. If time runs out, abandon the quest and take it again; she calls the demon again."] = "回到{npc:6546}的住处。先杀掉小屋周围的小动物：它们会加入战斗。接受{quest:1955}会启动3分钟计时，{npc:6546}会在她的花园里召唤{npc:6549}：一只40级精英，抵抗许多法术，还会定身和减速。建议组队：40级的法师可能需要帮手或药水，约45级可单挑。你可以从码头远程拉它。它死后计时仍在继续，所以立刻交任务。若时间耗尽，放弃任务再接一次；她会再次召唤恶魔。",
	["Back to {npc:6546}. Accepting {quest:1957} opens a rift beside her cottage and starts a 10 minute timer: twelve {quest:1957} (level 40, Shock and {spell:403}) come out about four at a time. Attacking one does not pull the rest. Standing at the edge of the field draws them all; the tree south-west of it is out of their reach but in your spell range. Kill twelve and hand in before the timer runs out."] = "回到{npc:6546}。接受{quest:1957}会在她小屋旁打开一道裂隙，并启动10分钟计时：十二个{quest:1957}（40级，会震荡和{spell:403}）约每次出来四个。攻击一个不会引到其余的。站在场地边缘会把它们全引过来；场地西南的那棵树它们够不到，但在你的法术射程内。杀满十二个，在计时结束前交任务。",
	["Demon of the Orb"] = "宝珠中的恶魔",
	["Mage"] = "法师",
	["Mana Surge"] = "法力涌动",
	["The Burning Blade Summoners (level 38-39, not elite) work the {area:602} in southern {zone:1443}, east of {area:2408}, and every one carries an {item:7291}. They cast {spell:686} from 40 yards, keep an imp at their side and run for help at low health; Nether Maidens patrol the pillared ruin beside them, so pull with care. Horde mages: one more summoner stands alone in western {zone:1412}, south-west of {zone:1456}."] = "火刃召唤师（38-39级，非精英）在{zone:1443}南部、{area:2408}以东的{area:602}活动，每个都带着一个{item:7291}。他们会从40码外施放{spell:686}，身边带一只小鬼，血量低时跑去求援；虚空女妖在他们旁边的柱廊废墟巡逻，拉怪要小心。部落法师：还有一名召唤师独自站在{zone:1412}西部、{zone:1456}西南。",
	["{area:1517} is a dungeon in the northern {zone:1418}: a group of five. Go in by the rear entrance, a cave in {area:1898} south-east of the main entrance (elite dragons fly nearby): the {npc:7023} (level 42 elite) stands just past the first door. At 80, 60, 40 and 20 percent it breaks off an {npc:7209}, an elite too; while a shard lives, both reflect targeted spells, so use area spells and your wand on them. A solo trick: step out through the nearby zone line each time a shard appears; the Sentinel heals but keeps shrinking. It always drops the power source, and takes 2 hours to come back."] = "{area:1517}是{zone:1418}北部的一个副本：五人队。走后门进去，即正门东南{area:1898}的洞穴（附近有精英龙飞行）：{npc:7023}（42级精英）就在第一道门后。血量到80%、60%、40%和20%时，它会分裂出一个{npc:7209}，同样是精英；碎片活着时，两者都会反射指向性法术，所以用范围法术和魔杖对付它们。单刷技巧：每次碎片出现时，从附近的地区边界走出去；哨兵会回血，但会不断缩小。它必掉能量源，重生需2小时。",
	["{npc:5497} at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum, {zone:1453}'s {object:2101}, sends you back to {npc:6546}; Bink in {zone:1455} gives the same quest."] = "{zone:1453}的{object:2101}（巫师圣殿）顶层的{npc:5497}会派你回去找{npc:6546}；{zone:1455}的宾克给同样的任务。",
	["{npc:5885}, one of {zone:1454}'s mage trainers in {object:173161}, sends you back to {npc:6546}; {npc:4568} in the {zone:1458} and {npc:3048} in {zone:1456} give the same quest."] = "{object:173161}里{zone:1454}的法师训练师之一{npc:5885}会派你回去找{npc:6546}；{zone:1458}的{npc:4568}和{zone:1456}的{npc:3048}给同样的任务。",
	["{npc:6546}'s cottage is deep in the marsh west of Theramore, just north of the {area:508}; come in from the west road, the elites roam its east side."] = "{npc:6546}的小屋在塞拉摩以西沼泽深处，就在{area:508}以北；从西面的路进来，精英在农场东侧游荡。",
	["{npc:6549} (elite, 40)"] = "{npc:6549}（精英，40级）",
	["{quest:1958}: the {item:7515} (off-hand) or the {item:9517}"] = "{quest:1958}：{item:7515}（副手）或{item:9517}",
	["{quest:2861} (optional)"] = "{quest:2861}（可选）",
}

G["forever/class/rogue/the-azure-key"] = {
	["Alliance fly to {area:3137}, Horde to {area:1237}. Only the level 50-51 Timbermaw Shamans in the furbolg hills of northern {zone:1447} carry the bag (the level 47-49 furbolgs further south do not): about one kill in thirty drops it. {spell:921} them instead and you lose no Timbermaw reputation; if you are Unfriendly or better with {area:1769}, mark them At War in your reputation panel first. They cast {spell:403} and {spell:6535}, heal each other and run at low health."] = "联盟飞往{area:3137}，部落飞往{area:1237}。只有{zone:1447}北部熊怪丘陵里50-51级的木喉萨满带着袋子（更南边的47-49级熊怪没有）：约三十杀掉一个。改用{spell:921}就不会损失木喉声望；若你与{area:1769}的关系是冷淡或更好，先在声望面板里勾选“交战”。它们会施放{spell:403}和{spell:6535}，互相治疗，血量低时会逃跑。",
	["At 50 {npc:918} in {zone:1453}'s {object:2100} has it; so do Syurna in {zone:1457} and {npc:5165} in {zone:1455}."] = "50级时，{zone:1453}的{object:2100}里的{npc:918}有这个任务；{zone:1457}的赛尤娜和{zone:1455}的{npc:5165}也有。",
	["Look at the reward window before you hand in: Classic offered the {item:19982}, the {item:19984} or the {item:20255}, and Forever's notes say the choice may be gone."] = "交任务前先看奖励窗口：经典旧世提供{item:19982}、{item:19984}或{item:20255}，而Forever的说明称这个选择可能已取消。",
	["Morphaz, a level 52 elite green drake, lives deep in the {area:1417}: a group of five, level 50-54. The temple stands in the {area:74}; climb into the sunken building, swim down through it and follow the passage to the portal. Horde: fly to {area:75}; Alliance: fly to {area:1438} and ride on. He is not there when you arrive: first kill the six troll guardians (elites of 50-52) on the platforms around the upper ring, which opens the way down (the left-hand ramp from the entrance) to {npc:5710} in the Pit of Sacrifice. Jammal'an's death brings out two drakes, Weaver and Dreamscythe; when both are dead, Morphaz and Hazzas appear together and fight as a pair. Their {spell:12533} is nature damage: nature protection potions help; poisons and {spell:2094} do not work on them. The key always drops. Hunters, Priests and Mages of 50 need Morphaz too: one clear serves them all."] = "莫法兹是一头52级精英绿龙，住在{area:1417}深处：五人队，50-54级。神殿在{area:74}；爬进下沉的建筑，向下游过它，沿通道走到传送门。部落：飞往{area:75}；联盟：飞往{area:1438}再骑马过去。你到的时候它不在：先杀掉上层环台周围六名巨魔守卫（50-52级精英），这会打开下去的路（从入口走左侧斜坡）通往牺牲之坑的{npc:5710}。贾玛兰死后会出现两条龙，编织者和斩梦者；两者都死后，莫法兹和哈扎斯一同出现，成对作战。它们的{spell:12533}是自然伤害：自然防护药水有用；毒药和{spell:2094}对它们无效。钥匙必掉。50级的猎人、牧师和法师也需要莫法兹：一次通关能全带。",
	["Ravenholdt reputation and experience at 50; Classic's item choice may be gone on Forever."] = "50级可得拉文霍德声望和经验；经典旧世的物品选择在Forever上可能已取消。",
	["Rogue"] = "盗贼",
	["The Forest Oozes (level 52-53, {spell:6907} up close) drop a fragment four times in five: the biggest group, seven of them, is in the {area:2497} hills of north-eastern {zone:1447}, four more south-east of {area:1237}. Pick their pockets before the kill for an extra fragment or two. Killing the Mistwing Ravagers and hippogryphs that share their spots makes more oozes appear."] = "森林软泥怪（52-53级，近身会{spell:6907}）五分之四几率掉一块碎片：最大的一群有七只，在{zone:1447}东北的{area:2497}丘陵；{area:1237}东南还有四只。杀之前先偷它们的口袋，能多拿一两块碎片。杀掉与它们同处的雾翼掠夺者和角鹰兽会让更多软泥怪出现。",
	["{area:3486} hides in the hills east of {area:272}. Horde fly to {area:272}, Alliance to {area:271}. The trail starts behind the plateau north of {area:275}, climbs into the hills and runs through a small tunnel into the {zone:1416}; Lord Jorach is inside the manor. Do not attack anyone at the manor: lost Ravenholdt reputation makes him refuse to speak to you."] = "{area:3486}藏在{area:272}以东的丘陵中。部落飞往{area:272}，联盟飞往{area:271}。小径从{area:275}以北的高地后面开始，爬上丘陵，穿过一条小隧道进入{zone:1416}；乔拉奇领主就在庄园里。不要攻击庄园里的任何人：损失拉文霍德声望会让他拒绝与你交谈。",
	["{npc:8395}, camped below the cliffs just east of {area:1237}, teleports you up (dismount first); a trail leads to Xylem's tower."] = "{npc:8395}在{area:1237}以东悬崖下扎营，会把你传送上去（先下坐骑）；一条小路通向赛勒姆的高塔。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/magus-tirth"] = {
	["{npc:6548} at the {area:2240}, the goblin and gnome racetrack in the {area:439} of south-eastern {zone:1441}, sells the {item:11023} (1g) to both sides. The nearest flight paths are {area:484} (Horde) and {area:976} in {zone:1446} (both sides); from {area:976}, ride north into the {area:439}. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goal stays ticked afterwards."] = "{npc:6548}在{area:2240}，即{zone:1441}东南{area:439}的地精与侏儒赛道，向双方出售{item:11023}（1金）。最近的飞行点是{area:484}（部落）和{zone:1446}的{area:976}（双方）；从{area:976}向北骑进{area:439}。每件宠物物品使用后即教会对应伙伴；之后目标仍保持勾选。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/mechanical-chicken"] = {
	["Each robot starts with a distress beacon that mobs in its zone drop, about one kill in 40 to 100 in Classic's data. In {zone:1444} the best are the Coast Crawl Snapclaws and Deepseers (levels 43-45) on the {area:1108} and the Sprite Dragons (47-48), about 2.5%; ogres, harpies, naga and Grimtotems drop it about 1%. You can loot it from level 40."] = "每个机器人一开始都要靠其所在地区的怪物掉落遇难信标，按经典旧世的数据约40到100杀掉一个。在{zone:1444}，最好的是{area:1108}的海岸爬行钳爪者和深海先知（43-45级）以及精灵龙（47-48级），约2.5%；食人魔、鹰身人、纳迦和恐怖图腾约1%。40级起就能拾取。",
	["Most {zone:1425} mobs drop OOX-09/HL's beacon about once in 100 kills: Silvermane wolves, owlbeasts, Highvale elves, Witherbark and Vilebranch trolls. You can loot it from level 43."] = "{zone:1425}的大多数怪物约100杀掉一次OOX-09/HL的信标：银鬃狼、猫头鹰兽、高谷精灵、枯木和邪枝巨魔。43级起就能拾取。",
	["OOX-09/HL waits on the largest island of the lake west of {area:351}. Its escort to the shore beyond Overlook Cliff has two ambushes of three: Marauding Owlbeasts, then Vilebranch Ambushers; the robot warns you just before each."] = "OOX-09/HL在{area:351}以西湖中最大的岛上等待。护送它到眺望崖对岸的岸边会遭遇两拨各三只的伏击：先是游荡的猫头鹰兽，然后是邪枝伏击者；每次伏击前机器人都会警告你。",
	["OOX-17/TN stands in the hills near the {area:981} in south-east {zone:1446}. Its escort to {area:977} has two ambushes: three scorpids near the start, three Wastewander bandits near the end. The robot has about 3,000 health and stops to fight what you attack, so it can tank for a moment while you recover. Its turn-in is in {area:35} too."] = "OOX-17/TN站在{zone:1446}东南{area:981}附近的丘陵里。护送它到{area:977}会遭遇两拨伏击：起点附近三只蝎子，终点附近三名废土强盗。机器人约3,000生命，会停下来打你攻击的目标，所以能暂时替你抗一会儿，让你恢复。它的交付点也在{area:35}。",
	["Right-click the beacon. OOX-22/FE sits in a cave near {area:1105}, among yetis and apes. Its escort runs west along the road to the dock on the {area:1108} with three ambushes: three yetis, then three gorillas, then four or five gnolls with a caster. Bring a friend if you are under 47. The robot keeps walking unless it is hit, so stay close; if it will not move, another player has it: wait for it to come back. Its turn-in is in {area:35}; keep the quest for later."] = "右键点击信标。OOX-22/FE坐在{area:1105}附近的洞穴里，周围是雪人和猩猩。护送它沿路向西到{area:1108}的码头，途中三拨伏击：三只雪人，然后三只猩猩，然后四五只带施法者的豺狼人。不到47级就带个同伴。机器人除非被打中否则会一直走，所以要跟紧；若它不肯动，说明另一名玩家接走了：等它回来。它的交付点在{area:35}；把任务留到以后。",
	["{npc:7406} is in {area:35}, upstairs in the building north of the inn, above {npc:2490}. Hand in all three rescues; at level 45 he then offers {quest:3721}, which you turn straight back in for the {item:10398}."] = "{npc:7406}在{area:35}，旅店以北那栋建筑的楼上，{npc:2490}上方。交掉三次救援；45级时他会提供{quest:3721}，接完立刻交回，换取{item:10398}。",
	["{zone:1446} mobs drop OOX-17/TN's beacon about one kill in 50 to 150. Best: the Treasure Hunting Pirates and Buccaneers on the south shore (44-45) and the Ground Pounders in the north (41-43), about 2%. You can loot it from level 43."] = "{zone:1446}的怪物约50到150杀掉一次OOX-17/TN的信标。最好的是南岸的寻宝海盗和劫掠者（44-45级）以及北部的重击者（41-43级），约2%。43级起就能拾取。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/tiny-emerald-whelpling"] = {
	["The Dreaming Whelps (levels 35-36) live in western {zone:1435}, near the {zone:1430} border. They drop it about once in 1,250 kills, and there are only a handful, back about every five minutes, so expect days of farming; it can be traded, so the Auction House may be quicker."] = "梦境雏龙（35-36级）住在{zone:1435}西部，靠近{zone:1430}边界。约1,250杀掉一次，而且数量很少，约每五分钟刷新，所以要做好刷好几天的准备；它可以交易，拍卖行可能更快。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/worg-carrier"] = {
	["Lower {area:1583}"] = "{area:1583}下层",
	["Lower {area:1583}: Halycon's pups"] = "{area:1583}下层：哈莱孔的小狼",
	["The pups are in Lower Blackrock Spire (a group of five, level 55-60), not Upper: they run with Halycon, the great worg, deep in the dungeon beyond {npc:10584}'s ogres. Use the cage on a living {npc:10221} before the pack is dead. Taking damage interrupts the cast, so let the tank hold the pups and cage one from the side. A rogue or druid can sneak in, cage a pup from a corner, then vanish."] = "小狼在黑石塔下层（五人队，55-60级），不是上层：它们跟着巨狼哈莱孔，在{npc:10584}的食人魔之后的副本深处。在狼群死光前，对一只活着的{npc:10221}使用笼子。受到伤害会打断施法，所以让坦克拉住小狼，你从侧面笼住一只。盗贼或德鲁伊可以潜进去，从角落笼住一只，然后消失。",
	["{npc:10260} stands inside the cave at {area:251}, the camp in northern {zone:1428} east of {area:254}. He gives you an {item:12262}. He also gives En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why (the {item:12529}): take both, they are done in the same run."] = "{npc:10260}站在{area:251}的洞穴里，即{zone:1428}北部、{area:254}以东的营地。他给你一个{item:12262}。他还给“En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why”（{item:12529}）：两个都接，可以在同一趟里完成。",
}

