	["Apprentice {skill:171} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:171} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Pair it with {skill:182}: {item:2447} and {item:765} grow in every starting zone, and Empty Vials cost 4c at any alchemy or trade supplies vendor. 1-75 takes about 3s 28c of vendor goods, plus 82 {item:765} and 110 {item:2447} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:171}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜把技能练到75。本阵营任意{skill:171}训练师都教；箭头会指向最近的一位。配合{skill:182}：{item:2447}和{item:765}在每个新手地区都有生长，空瓶在任何炼金或杂货供应商处卖4铜。1-75大约花3银28铜的商人货物，外加82个{item:765}和110个{item:2447}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 4g 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:171} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:7948} ({zone:1444}); Horde {npc:1386} ({zone:1435}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 225-300 takes about 1g 30s of recipes and 4g 50s 40c of vendor goods, plus 43 {item:8836}, 43 {item:8838} and 43 {item:13422} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {spell:11460} (from 230) and {item:13423} (from 250), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300，收费4金50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:171} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:7948}（{zone:1444}）；部落{npc:1386}（{zone:1435}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。225-300大约花1金30银的配方钱和4金50银40铜的商人货物，外加43个{item:8836}、43个{item:8838}和43个{item:13422}，需自行采集或购买。把这些全带在包里来（上面的步骤备齐，其余从拍卖行买）：这些训练师还教{spell:11460}（230起）和{item:13423}（250起），且制作无需工作台，所以就地制作，技能一到就学下一个配方。一趟顶三趟。",
	["Back to an {skill:171} trainer: {spell:3171} (from 90)."] = "回到{skill:171}训练师处：{spell:3171}（90起）。",
	["Back to an {skill:171} trainer: {spell:3176} (from 125)."] = "回到{skill:171}训练师处：{spell:3176}（125起）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 51 {item:3372} (20s 40c) and 86 {item:8925} (4g 30s); about 4g 50s 40c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286}, {npc:5503} and {npc:1325}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3348} and {npc:3334})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：51个{item:3372}（20银40铜）和86个{item:8925}（4金30银）；总共约4金50银40铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}、{npc:5503}和{npc:1325}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3348}和{npc:3334}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 77 {item:3371} (3s 8c) and 15 {item:3372} (6s); about 9s 8c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286}, {npc:5503} and {npc:1325}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3348} and {npc:3334})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：77个{item:3371}（3银8铜）和15个{item:3372}（6银）；总共约9银8铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}、{npc:5503}和{npc:1325}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3348}和{npc:3334}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 82 {item:3371} (3s 28c); about 3s 28c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286}, {npc:5503} and {npc:1325}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3348} and {npc:3334})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：82个{item:3371}（3银28铜）；总共约3银28铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}、{npc:5503}和{npc:1325}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3348}和{npc:3334}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 83 {item:3372} (33s 20c); about 33s 20c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1286}, {npc:5503} and {npc:1325}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:3348} and {npc:3334})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：83个{item:3372}（33银20铜）；总共约33银20铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1286}、{npc:5503}和{npc:1325}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:3348}和{npc:3334}）。",
	["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:171} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:4160} ({zone:1457}) and {npc:7948} ({zone:1444}); Horde {npc:4611} ({zone:1458}) and {npc:1386} ({zone:1435}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 150-225 takes about 33s 20c of vendor goods, plus 40 {object:1623}, 39 {item:3356}, 39 {object:2045} and 40 {object:2046} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {spell:3452} (from 160) and {spell:11450} (from 195), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225，收费50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:171} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:4160}（{zone:1457}）和{npc:7948}（{zone:1444}）；部落{npc:4611}（{zone:1458}）和{npc:1386}（{zone:1435}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。150-225大约花33银20铜的商人货物，外加40个{object:1623}、39个{item:3356}、39个{object:2045}和40个{object:2046}，需自行采集或购买。把这些全带在包里来（上面的步骤备齐，其余从拍卖行买）：这些训练师还教{spell:3452}（160起）和{spell:11450}（195起），且制作无需工作台，所以就地制作，技能一到就学下一个配方。一趟顶三趟。",
	["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 4s 50c (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:171} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:171} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:4160} ({zone:1457}), {npc:4900} ({zone:1445}), {npc:2837} ({zone:1434}), {npc:3964} ({zone:1440}), {npc:7948} ({zone:1444}), {npc:5499} ({zone:1453}), {npc:11042} ({zone:1457}) and {npc:5177} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:3009} ({zone:1456}), {npc:4611} ({zone:1458}), {npc:4609} ({zone:1458}), {npc:2837} ({zone:1434}), {npc:1386} ({zone:1435}), {npc:2391} ({zone:1424}) and {npc:3347} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:2331} (from 25, 1s). Also learn {spell:1230564} (1s): Forever's {skill:171} camp item, 1 {item:2447} and 1 {item:3371}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: {skill:171} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to an alchemy trainer who teaches it free. 75-150 takes about 1s of recipes and 9s 8c of vendor goods, plus 77 {item:785}, 152 {item:2450} and 54 {item:2453} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费4银50铜（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:171} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:171}训练师都教：联盟{npc:4160}（{zone:1457}）、{npc:4900}（{zone:1445}）、{npc:2837}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:3964}（{zone:1440}）、{npc:7948}（{zone:1444}）、{npc:5499}（{zone:1453}）、{npc:11042}（{zone:1457}）和{npc:5177}（{zone:1455}）；部落{npc:3009}（{zone:1456}）、{npc:4611}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:4609}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:2837}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:1386}（{zone:1435}）、{npc:2391}（{zone:1424}）和{npc:3347}（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:2331}（25起，1银）。同时学习{spell:1230564}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:171}露营物品，需1个{item:2447}和1个{item:3371}，放在营火旁的营地以获得增益。“露营入门：{skill:171}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的炼金训练师那里。75-150大约花1银的配方钱和9银8铜的商人货物，外加77个{item:785}、152个{item:2450}和54个{item:2453}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Learn {skill:171}"] = "学习{skill:171}",
	["Still at the Artisan trainer: {spell:11460} (from 230)."] = "仍在大师级训练师处：{spell:11460}（230起）。",
	["Still at the Artisan trainer: {spell:17551} (from 250)."] = "仍在大师级训练师处：{spell:17551}（250起）。",
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:11450} (from 195)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:11450}（195起）。",
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:3452} (from 160)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:3452}（160起）。",
	["{item:13478} teaches {item:8951} ({skill:171} 265) for 1g 30s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:5178} ({zone:1455}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:3348} ({zone:1454}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; the Auction House often has it too."] = "{item:13478}教{item:8951}（{skill:171} 265），售价1金30银。出售者：联盟{npc:5178}（{zone:1455}），限量；部落{npc:3348}（{zone:1454}），限量。卖家每次只备一两个，售出后过段时间补货；拍卖行也常有的卖。",
	["{item:5997} is orange at 1 (yellow 55, green 75, grey 95): about 82 crafts to 75. Each takes 1 {item:765}, 1 {item:2447} and 1 {item:3371}. Known from the start and the cheapest way through the Apprentice range. Keep the elixirs (armour while you level) or sell them."] = "{item:5997}在1时为橙色（55黄、75绿、95灰）：大约82次制作可到75。每次需要1个{item:765}、1个{item:2447}和1个{item:3371}。一开始就会，是冲过初级段最便宜的办法。留着这些药剂（练级时加护甲），或者卖掉。",
	["{object:2045} (Alliance)"] = "{object:2045}（联盟）",
	["{object:2045} (Horde)"] = "{object:2045}（部落）",
	["{skill:171} 1-300"] = "{skill:171} 1-300",
	["{skill:171} 1-75: vendor goods"] = "{skill:171} 1-75：商人货物",
	["{skill:171} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:171} 150-225：商人货物",
	["{skill:171} 225-300: vendor goods"] = "{skill:171} 225-300：商人货物",
	["{skill:171} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:171} 75-150：商人货物",
	["{skill:171} recipes at 135"] = "{skill:171} 135时的配方",
	["{skill:171} recipes at 160"] = "{skill:171} 160时的配方",
	["{skill:171} recipes at 195"] = "{skill:171} 195时的配方",
	["{skill:171} recipes at 265"] = "{skill:171} 265时的配方",
	["{skill:171} recipes at 90"] = "{skill:171} 90时的配方",
	["{spell:11450} is orange at 195 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 32 crafts to 225. Each takes 1 {item:3355}, 1 {item:3821} and 1 {item:3372}. {item:3355} and {item:3821} are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the {zone:1418}). {skill:171} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:11450}在195时为橙色（215黄、235绿、255灰）：大约32次制作可到225。每次需要1个{item:3355}、1个{item:3821}和1个{item:3372}。{item:3355}和{item:3821}是30-45地区的草药（荆棘谷、阿拉希、{zone:1418}）。{skill:171} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:11450} is yellow at 225 (yellow 215, green 235, grey 255): about 8 crafts to 230. Each takes 1 {item:3355}, 1 {item:3821} and 1 {item:3372}. {item:3355} and {item:3821} are the herbs of the 30-45 zones (Stranglethorn, Arathi, the {zone:1418})."] = "{spell:11450}在225时为黄色（215黄、235绿、255灰）：大约8次制作可到230。每次需要1个{item:3355}、1个{item:3821}和1个{item:3372}。{item:3355}和{item:3821}是30-45地区的草药（荆棘谷、阿拉希、{zone:1418}）。",
	["{spell:11460} is orange at 230 (yellow 245, green 265, grey 285): about 43 crafts to 265. Each takes 1 {item:8836} and 1 {item:8925}. {item:8836} grow in the Plaguelands and {zone:1448} ({skill:182} 220); Crystal Vials come from alchemy vendors."] = "{spell:11460}在230时为橙色（245黄、265绿、285灰）：大约43次制作可到265。每次需要1个{item:8836}和1个{item:8925}。{item:8836}生长在瘟疫之地和{zone:1448}（{skill:182} 220）；水晶瓶来自炼金供应商。",
	["{spell:17554} is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 300, grey 320): about 43 crafts to 300. Each takes 2 {item:13423}, 1 {item:8838} and 1 {item:8925}. Make the 86 {item:13423} (43 crafts) first. {item:13422} comes from the {item:13422} schools on the coasts of the 40-55 zones, or the Auction House (fishers sell them in stacks). {item:8838} grows in the 40-55 zones. {skill:171} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:17554}在265时为橙色（280黄、300绿、320灰）：大约43次制作可到300。每次需要2个{item:13423}、1个{item:8838}和1个{item:8925}。先做好那86个{item:13423}（43次制作）。{item:13422}来自40-55地区海岸的{item:13422}鱼群，或拍卖行（渔夫成组出售）。{item:8838}生长在40-55地区。{skill:171} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:2331} is yellow at 75 (yellow 65, green 85, grey 105): about 28 crafts to 90. Each takes 1 {item:785}, 1 {item:2447} and 1 {item:3371}. The trainer teaches it from 25. It is yellow already, so count on about two crafts a point until {spell:3171} takes over at 90. {item:785} grows in the 10-25 zones."] = "{spell:2331}在75时为黄色（65黄、85绿、105灰）：大约28次制作可到90。每次需要1个{item:785}、1个{item:2447}和1个{item:3371}。训练师从25起教它。它已经是黄色，所以每涨一点约需两次制作，直到90时由{spell:3171}接手。{item:785}生长在10-25地区。",
	["{spell:2331} to 90"] = "{spell:2331} 到90",
	["{spell:3171} is orange at 90 (yellow 120, green 140, grey 160): about 49 crafts to 135. Each takes 1 {item:785}, 2 {item:2450} and 1 {item:3371}. Two {item:2450} and a {item:785} a craft, both from the 10-25 zones; orange to 120."] = "{spell:3171}在90时为橙色（120黄、140绿、160灰）：大约49次制作可到135。每次需要1个{item:785}、2个{item:2450}和1个{item:3371}。每次两个{item:2450}和一个{item:785}，两者都来自10-25地区；到120前都是橙色。",
	["{spell:3171} to 135"] = "{spell:3171} 到135",
	["{spell:3176} is orange at 135 (yellow 150, green 170, grey 190): about 15 crafts to 150, a point every craft. Each takes 2 {item:2453}, 2 {item:2450} and 1 {item:3372}. Two {item:2453} and two {item:2450} a craft; {item:2453} grows in the 15-30 zones. {skill:171} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3176}在135时为橙色（150黄、170绿、190灰）：大约15次制作可到150，每次一点。每次需要2个{item:2453}、2个{item:2450}和1个{item:3372}。每次两个{item:2453}和两个{item:2450}；{item:2453}生长在15-30地区。{skill:171} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:3176} is yellow at 150 (yellow 150, green 170, grey 190): about 12 crafts to 160. Each takes 2 {item:2453}, 2 {item:2450} and 1 {item:3372}. Two {item:2453} and two {item:2450} a craft; {item:2453} grows in the 15-30 zones."] = "{spell:3176}在150时为黄色（150黄、170绿、190灰）：大约12次制作可到160。每次需要2个{item:2453}、2个{item:2450}和1个{item:3372}。每次两个{item:2453}和两个{item:2450}；{item:2453}生长在15-30地区。",
	["{spell:3176} to 150"] = "{spell:3176} 到150",
	["{spell:3176} to 160"] = "{spell:3176} 到160",
	["{spell:3452} is orange at 160 (yellow 180, green 200, grey 220): about 39 crafts to 195. Each takes 1 {item:3820}, 1 {item:3356} and 1 {item:3372}. {item:3820} grows under water along the coasts: bring a water breathing elixir or come up for air. {item:3356} grows in the 20-40 zones."] = "{spell:3452}在160时为橙色（180黄、200绿、220灰）：大约39次制作可到195。每次需要1个{item:3820}、1个{item:3356}和1个{item:3372}。{item:3820}生长在沿海水下：带上水下呼吸药剂，或者浮上来换气。{item:3356}生长在20-40地区。",
	["{spell:3452} to 195"] = "{spell:3452} 到195",
}

G["forever/reputation/argent-dawn"] = {
	["Araj the Summoner"] = "召唤者阿拉基",
	["Archivist Galford"] = "档案员加尔福德",
	["Argent Dawn Valor Tokens"] = "银色黎明勇气勋章",
	["Argent Dawn Valor Tokens, from the stone turn-ins"] = "银色黎明勇气勋章，来自交石头",
	["At Exalted, {npc:11536} takes 25 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens for the {quest:5517} (150 reputation): +5 to every resistance, on your shoulders. After it, the quartermasters sell more for 40 gold each."] = "崇拜时，{npc:11536}收25枚银色黎明勇气勋章，换取{quest:5517}（150声望）：肩部装备，所有抗性+5。之后，军需官以每件40金出售更多。",
	["At Revered, {npc:11536} takes 10 Argent Dawn Valor Tokens for {quest:5504} (100 reputation). After it, any {faction:529} quartermaster sells the five shoulder enchants for 10 gold each: Flame, Frost, Arcane, Nature and {item:18173}, +5 to that resistance. Revered also opens the {item:13810} and its juice (60 silver) and the Revered recipes."] = "崇敬时，{npc:11536}收10枚银色黎明勇气勋章，换取{quest:5504}（100声望）。之后，任意{faction:529}军需官以每份10金出售五种肩部附魔：火焰、冰霜、奥术、自然和{item:18173}，对应抗性+5。崇敬还开放{item:13810}及其汁液（60银）和崇敬配方。",
	["Back at {area:2268}"] = "回到{area:2268}",
	["Dark Adept"] = "黑暗专家",
	["Dark Adepts and Shadowmages at {area:2272}"] = "{area:2272}的黑暗专家和暗影法师",
	["Ectoplasmic Resonators: the ghosts around the cauldron"] = "灵质共振器：瘟疫锅周围的鬼魂",
	["Every Scourge kill in the Plaguelands gives 5 reputation (named ones 15), from the level 50 ghouls and skeletons up; at level 60 pick the level 53 and up ones, since in Classic grey mobs give only about a fifth. Neutral to Friendly is 2,800: about 560 kills, fewer with the Plaguelands quests on the way. The densest Scourge stand around the four Scourge Cauldrons: {area:199} west of Andorhal (skeletons, 50-53), {area:200} north of Andorhal (zombies and ghouls, 52-55), the {area:202} in the south (ghouls, 54-55) and {area:201} in the east (ghosts, 56-57). Keep every Scourgestone and every quest you can save: turn-ins never stop counting, kills do. {quest:5510} drop from about four in ten of these Scourge, Invader's from about a third of the level 56 and up ones. If you die, take the Commission off and put it back on: it can lose its effect. Paladins (Human and Dwarf): {npc:10838} at {area:3197} asks 20 {quest:5510} once for Dispelling Evil, 100 reputation instead of 25. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "在瘟疫之地每杀一个天灾给5声望（具名的给15），从50级的食尸鬼和骷髅起；60级时挑53级及以上的，因为经典旧世中灰色怪物只给约五分之一。中立到友善需2,800：约560杀，路上做瘟疫之地任务会更少。天灾最密集的地方在四口天灾瘟疫锅周围：安多哈尔以西的{area:199}（骷髅，50-53）、安多哈尔以北的{area:200}（僵尸和食尸鬼，52-55）、南部的{area:202}（食尸鬼，54-55）和东部的{area:201}（鬼魂，56-57）。每块天灾石和每个能攒的任务都留着：交付永远算数，杀怪则不然。这些天灾约十分之四掉{quest:5510}，56级及以上的约三分之一掉入侵者之天灾石。若你死了，把委任状摘下来再戴上：它可能失效。圣骑士（人类和矮人）：{area:3197}的{npc:10838}会一次性索要20个{quest:5510}，换取“驱除邪恶”，给100声望而非25。传承特长“外交家”使所有获取提高最多10%。",
	["Friendly to Honored: stones and named Scourge"] = "友善到尊敬：石头与具名天灾",
	["Gish the Unmoving"] = "不动的基什",
	["Hed'mush the Rotting"] = "腐烂的赫德穆什",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000: about 2,400 {area:2057} and {area:2279} mobs, fewer with their bosses. Their mobs stop at 11,999 of 12,000 Honored; a boss or a turn-in takes you over. Solo, only Scourgestones, the cauldron deliveries and Araj count: 12,000 is 480 turn-ins, or 4,800 {quest:5509}. Keep the stones you get in the dungeons until their mobs stop counting. Honored opens recipes at all three quartermasters: {npc:11536} at {area:2268}, {npc:10857} at {area:3197}, {npc:10856} at the {area:152}. Also the {item:22014} (133 gold) for the Three Kings of Flame quest."] = "尊敬到崇敬需12,000：约2,400个{area:2057}和{area:2279}的怪物，加上它们的首领会更少。它们的怪物在尊敬11,999/12,000时停止；一个首领或一次交付就能带你越线。单刷时只有天灾石、瘟疫锅交付和阿拉基算数：12,000等于480次交付，或4,800个{quest:5509}。把副本里拿到的石头留到其中的怪物停止计数。尊敬开放三位军需官的配方：{area:2268}的{npc:11536}、{area:3197}的{npc:10857}、{area:152}的{npc:10856}。还有“烈焰三王”任务所需的{item:22014}（133金）。",
	["Honored to Revered: dungeons and stones"] = "尊敬到崇敬：副本与石头",
	["Hungering Wraith"] = "饥饿的怨灵",
	["Hungering Wraiths at {area:201}; any Scourge counts"] = "{area:201}的饥饿怨灵；任何天灾都算",
	["Lord Darkscythe"] = "暗镰领主",
	["Neutral to Friendly: Scourge of the {zone:1422}"] = "中立到友善：{zone:1422}的天灾",
	["Normal Scourge outside the dungeons stop giving reputation halfway through Friendly (3,000 of 6,000); {npc:10826}, {npc:10821} and {npc:10825} stop at the end of Friendly. After that only Araj, the {area:2057} and {area:2279} mobs, the cauldron deliveries and Scourgestones count. Now turn in the stones you saved: {npc:11039} at {area:2268} takes all three kinds, and so do the officers at {area:3197} and the {area:152}. Every turn-in pays 25 and an {item:12844}: keep 35 tokens for the mantles at Revered and Exalted. {quest:5509} are worth twice as much per stone: the Dark Adepts, Shadowmages, Dread Weavers and Scourge Champions (level 58-60) at {area:2272}, just north of {area:2268}, drop them about a third of the time or more, next to the turn-in. The named Scourge below drop a {item:12843} half the time or more ({npc:1850} two times in three, Araj and {npc:10821} half the time) and give 15 a kill, Araj until Exalted; {npc:1850} gives no reputation, only the stone. Friendly opens the Enriched Manna Biscuits (60 silver) at the quartermasters."] = "副本外的普通天灾在友善过半时（6,000中的3,000）就不再给声望；{npc:10826}、{npc:10821}和{npc:10825}在友善结束时停止。此后只有阿拉基、{area:2057}和{area:2279}的怪物、瘟疫锅交付和天灾石算数。现在把攒下的石头交掉：{area:2268}的{npc:11039}收全部三种，{area:3197}和{area:152}的军官也一样。每次交付给25声望和一枚{item:12844}：留35枚勋章换崇敬和崇拜时的斗篷。{quest:5509}每块石头价值翻倍：{area:2268}正北方{area:2272}的黑暗专家、暗影法师、恐惧编织者和天灾勇士（58-60级）约三分之一或更高几率掉落，就在交付点旁边。下列具名天灾有一半或更高几率掉{item:12843}（{npc:1850}三分之二，阿拉基和{npc:10821}一半），每杀一个给15声望，阿拉基直到崇拜；{npc:1850}不给声望，只给石头。友善时军需官开放强化玛纳饼干（60银）。",
	["Plagued Flesh Samples: the Scourge inside"] = "瘟疫血肉样本：里面的天灾",
	["Plagued Hatchling"] = "瘟疫雏龙",
	["Plaguelands quests and the Scourge Cauldrons"] = "瘟疫之地任务与天灾瘟疫锅",
	["Putridius"] = "普特里迪乌斯",
	["Recipes for Tailors, Leatherworkers, Blacksmiths, Enchanters and Alchemists from Honored and Revered"] = "尊敬和崇敬的裁缝、制皮、锻造、附魔和炼金配方",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 840 Scourgestone or cauldron turn-ins, or the dungeon bosses with their {quest:5508} (a full {area:2057} clear is about 600). Turn in every stone and {item:13920} you saved."] = "崇敬到崇拜需21,000：840次天灾石或瘟疫锅交付，或用副本首领及其{quest:5508}（一次{area:2057}全清约600）。把攒下的每一块天灾石和{item:13920}都交掉。",
	["Scourgestones, {area:2057} and {area:2279}: the shoulder resistance enchants and a dozen recipes."] = "天灾石、{area:2057}和{area:2279}：肩部抗性附魔和十几种配方。",
	["Soulless Ghoul"] = "无魂食尸鬼",
	["Soulless Ghouls at the {area:202}"] = "{area:202}的无魂食尸鬼",
	["The Plaguelands quests pay in full at 60 from level 55 up and never stop counting, about 1,500 in all; the leveling guides walk them. The cauldron chain from {npc:11053} at {area:3197} (Horde: {npc:11055} at the {area:152}): 150 per cauldron with its return ({area:199}'s pair is level 53: in Classic it pays three fifths at 60), then Mission Accomplished! 200. Alas, Andorhal 150 ({npc:1852}, elite). At {area:2268}, {npc:11063}'s {area:2262} quests (Brother Carlin 50 from Chromie in Andorhal, Villains of Darrowshire 100, Marauders of Darrowshire 100) and {npc:10926}'s Hidden Treasures 200 at the end of the {area:2262} story; {npc:12250} 75 from {npc:11038}. After Mission Accomplished!, each cauldron takes a repeatable delivery: 25 reputation every time, until Exalted. {npc:11056} at {area:3197} (Horde: {npc:11057} at the {area:152}) gives you a {item:13370}, without which the reagents never drop, and sells Arcane Quickeners for 50 silver (one per delivery; it crumbles after 30 minutes, so buy it last). Each delivery also takes 4 {item:14047}. Farm {area:201}: its ghosts drop an {item:13354} about one time in four, so about 16 kills fill a delivery; the other cauldrons want 5 or 6 reagents that drop one time in ten or less. Once the Plaguelands Scourge stop counting, this earns about four times what their Scourgestones alone do."] = "瘟疫之地的任务在60级时从55级起就全额给，且永远算数，总共约1,500；升级指南会带你做。{area:3197}的{npc:11053}（部落：{area:152}的{npc:11055}）的瘟疫锅系列：每口瘟疫锅连同回程给150（{area:199}那一对是53级：经典旧世中60级时只给五分之三），然后是“任务完成！”给200。接着是“唉，安多哈尔”150（{npc:1852}，精英）。在{area:2268}，{npc:11063}的{area:2262}任务（卡林兄弟50，来自安多哈尔的克罗米；达尔隆郡的恶棍100；达尔隆郡的掠夺者100）和{npc:10926}在{area:2262}故事末尾的“隐藏的宝藏”200；{npc:12250}给75，来自{npc:11038}。完成“任务完成！”后，每口瘟疫锅可重复交付：每次25声望，直到崇拜。{area:3197}的{npc:11056}（部落：{area:152}的{npc:11057}）会给你一个{item:13370}，没有它材料永远不会掉落；他还以50银出售奥术催化剂（每次交付一个；30分钟后碎裂，所以最后再买）。每次交付还需4个{item:14047}。刷{area:201}：其中的鬼魂约四分之一几率掉{item:13354}，所以约16杀够一次交付；其他瘟疫锅需要5或6种材料，掉落率十分之一或更低。一旦瘟疫之地的天灾停止计数，这比单交它们的天灾石多赚约四倍。",
	["the cauldron at {area:201}"] = "{area:201}的瘟疫锅",
	["{area:2057} lies under {area:2298}, the island town in the south-east of the {zone:1422}; your side's {area:2057} quests give the {item:13704} that opens it. It is the best {faction:529} run: its mobs give 5 up to the last point of Honored, and its thirteen bosses about 375 reputation a full clear plus ten or so {quest:5508} (about 250 more). {npc:10508} and {npc:1853} give 50 each."] = "{area:2057}位于{area:2298}之下，那是{zone:1422}东南的岛屿城镇；你方阵营的{area:2057}任务会给开启它的{item:13704}。这是刷{faction:529}最好的副本：其中的怪物一直给5点直到尊敬最后一点，十三个首领一次全清约375声望，外加十来个{quest:5508}（再多约250）。{npc:10508}和{npc:1853}各给50。",
	["{area:2268} quests"] = "{area:2268}的任务",
	["{area:2268}, on the east side of the {zone:1423}, is the {faction:529}'s home: {npc:11039}, {npc:11035} and {npc:243254} give its dungeon quests, 100 to 200 reputation each and about 1,700 in all. They are group quests for {area:2279} and {area:2057} (level 58-60, five players): take the ones your group will run. The Duke's chain ends at the {object:176317}, a chest of {faction:529} gear."] = "{area:2268}在{zone:1423}东侧，是{faction:529}的驻地：{npc:11039}、{npc:11035}和{npc:243254}给该副本任务，每个100到200声望，总共约1,700。它们是{area:2279}和{area:2057}的组队任务（58-60级，五人）：挑你队伍会打的接。公爵的系列任务在{object:176317}结束，那是一箱{faction:529}装备。",
	["{area:2279} is a group of five at the north end of the {zone:1423}. Its Scourge give 5 reputation a kill up to the last point of Honored, and its Scourge bosses 25 until Exalted ({npc:10440} 50), each with a {item:12843}. The Black Guard Sentries by the Baron give 5 until Exalted. The Scourge side, through the service entrance, pays far more than the Scarlet side."] = "{area:2279}是{zone:1423}北端的五人副本。其中的天灾每杀一个给5声望，直到尊敬最后一点；天灾首领给25直到崇拜（{npc:10440}给50），每人还掉一块{item:12843}。男爵身边的黑卫哨兵给5直到崇拜。走服务入口进去的天灾一侧，收益远高于血色一侧。",
	["{item:12843}: the named Scourge below, and dungeon bosses"] = "{item:12843}：下列具名天灾和副本首领",
	["{item:13180}: the supply crates"] = "{item:13180}：补给箱",
	["{item:13320}, 50 silver"] = "{item:13320}，50银",
	["{item:13482} ({skill:171}), 1 gold 50 silver"] = "{item:13482}（{skill:171}），1金50银",
	["{item:18170}: pick the resistance you need, 10 gold"] = "{item:18170}：挑选你需要的抗性，10金",
	["{item:19203} ({skill:164}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19203}（{skill:164}），2金20银",
	["{item:19205} ({skill:164}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19205}（{skill:164}），4金",
	["{item:19216} ({skill:197}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19216}（{skill:197}），2金20银",
	["{item:19217} ({skill:197}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19217}（{skill:197}），4金",
	["{item:19328} ({skill:165}), 2 gold 20 silver"] = "{item:19328}（{skill:165}），2金20银",
	["{item:19329} ({skill:165}), 4 gold"] = "{item:19329}（{skill:165}），4金",
	["{item:19442} ({skill:129}), 10 gold"] = "{item:19442}（{skill:129}），10金",
	["{item:19446}, 3 gold"] = "{item:19446}，3金",
	["{item:19447}, 6 gold"] = "{item:19447}，6金",
	["{npc:10811}, Scarlet side"] = "{npc:10811}，血色一侧",
	["{npc:10839} stands at the {area:152}, on the road from {zone:1420} into the {zone:1422}. {object:2160} starts at Neutral 200 for everyone. Wear the Commission trinket while you fight the Scourge: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it. {npc:11039} at {area:2268} gives the same Commission; you can only take one."] = "{npc:10839}站在{area:152}，位于从{zone:1420}进入{zone:1422}的路上。{object:2160}对所有人从中立200开始。打天灾时戴上委任状饰品：只有戴着它天灾石才会掉落。{area:2268}的{npc:11039}给同样的委任状；你只能拿一个。",
	["{npc:10840} stands in {area:3197}, in the south of the {zone:1422}. {object:2160} starts at Neutral 200 for everyone. Wear the Commission trinket while you fight the Scourge: Scourgestones only drop while you wear it. {npc:11039} at {area:2268} gives the same Commission; you can only take one."] = "{npc:10840}站在{area:3197}，在{zone:1422}南部。{object:2160}对所有人从中立200开始。打天灾时戴上委任状饰品：只有戴着它天灾石才会掉落。{area:2268}的{npc:11039}给同样的委任状；你只能拿一个。",
	["{npc:11056}: ask for a {item:13370}"] = "{npc:11056}：索要{item:13370}",
	["{npc:11057}, at the {area:152}: ask for a {item:13370}"] = "{npc:11057}，在{area:152}：索要{item:13370}",
	["{npc:1850}, {zone:1422}: the stone only"] = "{npc:1850}，{zone:1422}：只有石头",
	["{npc:1852}, Andorhal"] = "{npc:1852}，安多哈尔",
	["{quest:5212} leads to {quest:5213} (the {item:13176} in a {area:2279} ziggurat), which rewards the {item:13209} or the {item:19812}: better trinkets that also make Scourgestones drop, so they can replace the Commission. {quest:5251} leads on to the {item:13250} and {npc:10440}. A {item:13920}, a rare drop (about 6%) from the {quest:5529} once {quest:5529} is done, starts a quest worth 50 each time: keep them until Revered. {npc:10267} in the {zone:1428}, at the end of her {area:1583} quests, sends you to {npc:243254} (75) and on to {npc:11035}'s {item:12368} in {area:2057} (25 and 200)."] = "{quest:5212}通向{quest:5213}（{area:2279}某座通灵塔里的{item:13176}），奖励{item:13209}或{item:19812}：更好的饰品，同样能让天灾石掉落，因此可替代委任状。{quest:5251}继续通向{item:13250}和{npc:10440}。{item:13920}是{quest:5529}完成后从{quest:5529}身上掉落的稀有物品（约6%），会开启一个每次值50声望的任务：留到崇敬。{zone:1428}的{npc:10267}在她{area:1583}任务线末尾会派你去找{npc:243254}（75），再去{area:2057}找{npc:11035}的{item:12368}（25和200）。",
	["{quest:5508}: 1 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5508}：1个换25声望",
	["{quest:5509}: 10 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5509}：10个换25声望",
	["{quest:5510}: 20 for 25 reputation"] = "{quest:5510}：20个换25声望",
	["{quest:5510}: keep them"] = "{quest:5510}：留着",
	["{quest:5529}, in the hatchery"] = "{quest:5529}，在孵化间",
}

G["forever/reputation/nightclaw-druids"] = {
	["1000 reputation"] = "1000声望",
	["48 {skill:164}, {skill:165} and {skill:197} patterns"] = "48个{skill:164}、{skill:165}和{skill:197}图样",
	["500 reputation"] = "500声望",
	["Back to {area:16638}"] = "回到{area:16638}",
	["Back to {npc:254151} inside the den. Ten ears for 1000 reputation and a green piece: leather gloves, cloth pants or mail boots. {npc:254151} then takes ears five at a time, for 1000 each, as often as you like, up to level 18; in Classic the pay drops from level 19 and is 200 from level 22. The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "回到巢穴里的{npc:254151}。十只耳朵换1000声望和一件绿装：皮手套、布裤或锁甲靴。之后{npc:254151}每次收五只耳朵，每份1000声望，想交多少次都行，直到18级；经典旧世中19级起收益下降，22级起为200。传承特长“外交家”使所有获取提高最多10%。",
	["Ears at the {area:16629}"] = "在{area:16629}收集耳朵",
	["Exalted opens the {item:280363}, green cloth shoulders for level 15, for 8s 16c."] = "崇拜开放{item:280363}，15级绿色布甲护肩，售价8银16铜。",
	["Friendly to Honored"] = "友善到尊敬",
	["Head north into the {area:16631}. {npc:257944} holds the druids' camp in its north-east."] = "向北进入{area:16631}。{npc:257944}守在其东北的德鲁伊营地。",
	["Honored opens the chest and leg patterns (skill 60, 12s 50c): Skyforged chainmail and legguards, Gustwoven harness and trousers, Windraveled jerkin and pants, Stormsewn vest and leggings. Revered is 12000 more: 12 turn-ins (60 ears, about 160 cultist kills at the Shrine) up to level 18, 60 turn-ins (300 ears) from level 22."] = "尊敬开放胸甲和腿部图样（技能60，12银50铜）：天锻锁甲与护腿、风织胸甲与长裤、风行之皮上衣与长裤、风暴缝制背心与护腿。崇敬还需12000：18级前12次交付（60只耳朵，在神殿约160个邪教徒击杀），22级起60次交付（300只耳朵）。",
	["Honored to Revered"] = "尊敬到崇敬",
	["Naaleos Leafwhisper"] = "纳里奥斯·叶语",
	["Nightclaw Druids Reputation"] = "夜爪德鲁伊声望",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Revered opens the {item:280347}, a companion pet, for 50s. Exalted is 21000 more: 21 turn-ins (105 ears, about 280 kills) up to level 18, 105 turn-ins (525 ears) from level 22."] = "崇敬开放{item:280347}，一只小伙伴，售价50银。崇拜还需21000：18级前21次交付（105只耳朵，约280杀），22级起105次交付（525只耳朵）。",
	["Revered to Exalted"] = "崇敬到崇拜",
	["Skyboat from {area:279}"] = "从{area:279}乘飞船",
	["Skyboat from {zone:1456}"] = "从{zone:1456}乘飞船",
	["Skyboat to {zone:2521}"] = "乘飞船前往{zone:2521}",
	["The Al'Aketh Footsoldiers and Stormchasers camp just north of {npc:257944} and drop the Bloody Heirlooms (and ears, about one kill in four). The Shadowgale Shrieklings flying west of her drop the feathers; the {item:265105} grows on the trees along the stream west of her."] = "奥阿克步兵和逐风者扎营在{npc:257944}正北方，掉落血染传家宝（还有耳朵，约每四杀一个）。在她西边飞行的影风尖啸者掉落羽毛；{item:265105}长在她西边溪流沿岸的树上。",
	["The Nightfang Den and {npc:253622}"] = "夜牙巢穴与{npc:253622}",
	["The Nightfang Den is the cave north across the clearing from {npc:257944}. Heal the seven injured druids inside ({npc:258134} among them) and find {npc:258130}. {npc:253622} stands east of the den: he drops his head and a {quest:94490}; right-click the missive to start its quest."] = "夜牙巢穴是{npc:257944}北面隔着空地的洞穴。治疗里面七名受伤的德鲁伊（包括{npc:258134}），并找到{npc:258130}。{npc:253622}站在巢穴东侧：他掉落自己的头颅和一个{quest:94490}；右键点击信函即可开启其任务。",
	["The best ears are south of the forest at the {area:16629}: Skypriests drop one in more than half their kills, Guardians in four of ten, Spiritcallers and Honor Guards in a third. The {area:16626} just north-west of {area:16638} are next best (Brawlers and Pillagers, about four in ten). All cultists are level 8 to 10."] = "最好的耳朵在森林南边的{area:16629}：天空祭司超过半数击杀掉一只，守卫者十分之四，唤灵者和荣誉卫兵三分之一。{area:16638}西北的{area:16626}次之（斗殴者和掠夺者，约十分之四）。所有邪教徒都是8到10级。",
	["The storyline and {npc:254151}'s first quest leave you at Friendly with 2100 to spare. Honored is 3900 more: four turn-ins of five ears up to level 18, twenty from level 22. Friendly opens 32 of {npc:254151}'s patterns, in two colours, Cloudy and Azure: Blacksmithing Skyforged Wristguards and Chain (skill 50, 9s 50c), Gauntlets and Greaves (55, 11s); Leatherworking Gustwoven and Windraveled bracers and belts (50) and gloves and boots (55); Tailoring Stormsewn Cuffs and Cord (50), Handwraps and Shoes (55). They bind when you buy them, so buy them on the crafter."] = "剧情线和{npc:254151}的第一个任务会让你友善，还多出2100。尊敬还需3900：18级前四次交付、每次五只耳朵，22级起二十次。友善开放{npc:254151}的32张图样，分两种颜色：云纹和碧蓝：锻造的天锻护腕与锁甲（技能50，9银50铜）、手套与胫甲（55，11银）；制皮的风织与风行护腕和腰带（50）以及手套和靴子（55）；裁缝的风暴缝制护腕和腰带（50）、手套和鞋子（55）。购买即绑定，所以在制作角色上买。",
	["The {item:280363}"] = "{item:280363}",
	["ears for {npc:254151}: keep every one"] = "给{npc:254151}的耳朵：每一个都留着",
	["five ears per turn-in"] = "每次交付五只耳朵",
	["from {npc:253622}"] = "来自{npc:253622}",
	["{item:280347}, 50s"] = "{item:280347}，50银",
	["{npc:252359} stands in {area:16638}, the Skyborne town in the south of the isle, and has heard nothing from the druids up north. His errand is the start of the Nightclaw storyline (level 8 and up, any race). Every quest of it pays Nightclaw reputation: 4100 in all, enough for Friendly. Come early: in Classic a quest pays less once you are 6 levels above it, a fifth at most from 9 levels up, and these are level 11 to 13 quests."] = "{npc:252359}站在{area:16638}，即岛南部的天裔城镇；他一直没有北方德鲁伊的消息。他的差事是夜爪任务线的开端（8级及以上，任何种族）。这条线的每个任务都给夜爪声望：总共4100，足够到友善。早点来：经典旧世中，任务在你高出它6级后收益减少，高出9级起只有五分之一，而这些是11到13级的任务。",
	["{npc:252359} waits in {area:16638}. Hand in on your way to a skyboat or to the {area:16626}."] = "{npc:252359}在{area:16638}等候。去飞船或去{area:16626}的路上顺便交任务。",
	["{npc:254151}'s patterns"] = "{npc:254151}的图样",
	["{npc:254151}, the druids' quartermaster, waits inside their den: the cave just across the clearing north-east of {npc:257944} ({area:16720} on the map; {npc:257944} calls it the Nightfang Den). Take his ear quest now: the cultists you fight for {npc:257944} drop ears for it."] = "{npc:254151}是德鲁伊的军需官，在他们巢穴里等候：就是{npc:257944}东北隔着空地的洞穴（地图上为{area:16720}；{npc:257944}称它为夜牙巢穴）。现在就接他的耳朵任务：你为{npc:257944}打的邪教徒会掉耳朵。",
	["{npc:257944}'s next tasks"] = "{npc:257944}的后续任务",
	["{npc:257944}, the den's fate"] = "{npc:257944}，巢穴的命运",
	["{quest:93459}: 1000 reputation"] = "{quest:93459}：1000声望",
	["{zone:2521} is the Skyborne starting island, open to everyone. A skyboat leaves the cliffs south of {area:17045}, north of {zone:1456}, about every five minutes; another flies from {area:279}, and either faction may take either."] = "{zone:2521}是天裔的新手岛，所有人可去。约每五分钟有一艘飞船从{zone:1456}以北{area:17045}南面的悬崖出发；另一艘从{area:279}起飞，两个阵营都能乘坐任意一艘。",
	["{zone:2521} is the Skyborne starting island, open to everyone. A skyboat leaves the north side of {area:279} about every five minutes; another flies from north of {zone:1456}, and either faction may take either."] = "{zone:2521}是天裔的新手岛，所有人可去。约每五分钟有一艘飞船从{area:279}北侧出发；另一艘从{zone:1456}以北起飞，两个阵营都能乘坐任意一艘。",
	["{zone:2521}'s hidden druids: five cultist ears pay 1000 reputation, best done before you outlevel the isle."] = "{zone:2521}隐藏的德鲁伊：五只邪教徒耳朵换1000声望，最好在等级超过该岛之前完成。",
}

G["forever/reputation/warsong-gulch"] = {
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Warsong Gulch\" and opens the epics: {item:19578} (plate), {item:19582} (mail), {item:19587} (leather) and {item:19595} (cloth) for levels 40, 50 and 60 (2g47s to 12g11s), and the level 60 Outrider's legs in plate, chain, mail, leather, lizardhide and silk (16g57s to 25g33s). The {item:19505} is 5g."] = "崇拜给传承点数“战歌峡谷大师”，并开放史诗物品：40、50和60级可用的{item:19578}（板甲）、{item:19582}（锁甲）、{item:19587}（皮甲）和{item:19595}（布甲）（2金47银到12金11银），以及60级的斥候腿甲，分板甲、链甲、锁甲、皮甲、蜥蜴皮和丝绸（16金57银到25金33银）。{item:19505}售价5金。",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Warsong Gulch\" and opens the epics: {item:19578} (plate), {item:19582} (mail), {item:19587} (leather) and {item:19595} (cloth) for levels 40, 50 and 60 (2g47s to 12g11s), and the level 60 Sentinel's legs in plate, lamellar, chain, leather, lizardhide and silk (16g63s to 24g22s). The {item:19506} is 5g."] = "崇拜给传承点数“战歌峡谷大师”，并开放史诗物品：40、50和60级可用的{item:19578}（板甲）、{item:19582}（锁甲）、{item:19587}（皮甲）和{item:19595}（布甲）（2金47银到12金11银），以及60级的哨兵腿甲，分板甲、片甲、链甲、皮甲、蜥蜴皮和丝绸（16金63银到24金22银）。{item:19506}售价5金。",
	["Flag captures and Marks of Honor raise it; Exalted gives a Legacy Point and epic bracers and legs."] = "夺旗和荣誉勋章可提升声望；崇拜给一个传承点数以及史诗护腕和腿甲。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation, about 39 wins at the Classic rate. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:14753} beside {npc:14733}: the {item:21567} and {item:21565} trinkets (2g at level 20, 4g at level 40) and food, bandages and draughts that work in the battleground (5s to 20s). She also gives one Sentinel care package at Friendly (pick the one for your level): 10 reputation and a bag of battleground food and bandages."] = "友善到尊敬需6000声望，按经典旧世的速度约39胜。友善在{npc:14733}旁的{npc:14753}处开放第一批奖励：{item:21567}和{item:21565}饰品（20级2金，40级4金），以及在战场内有效的食物、绷带和药剂（5银到20银）。她还在友善时给一个哨兵关怀包（挑适合你等级的）：10声望和一包战场食物与绷带。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation, about 39 wins at the Classic rate. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:14754} beside {npc:14781}: the {item:21567} and {item:21565} trinkets (2g at level 20, 4g at level 40) and food, bandages and draughts that work in the battleground (5s to 20s). He also gives one Outrider care package at Friendly (pick the one for your level): 10 reputation and a bag of battleground food and bandages."] = "友善到尊敬需6000声望，按经典旧世的速度约39胜。友善在{npc:14781}旁的{npc:14754}处开放第一批奖励：{item:21567}和{item:21565}饰品（20级2金，40级4金），以及在战场内有效的食物、绷带和药剂（5银到20银）。他还在友善时给一个斥候关怀包（挑适合你等级的）：10声望和一包战场食物与绷带。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation, about 78 wins. Honored opens the {item:19526}, {item:19534} (neck), {item:19518} and {item:19510}, each sold for levels 18, 28, 38, 48 and 58 (cloak 36s50c to 9g6s, the rest 2g to 7g50s), and the Major Healing and Mana Draughts (10s)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需12000声望，约78胜。尊敬开放{item:19526}、{item:19534}（颈部）、{item:19518}和{item:19510}，各有18、28、38、48和58级版本出售（斗篷36银50铜到9金6银，其余2金到7金50银），以及强效治疗药剂和法力药剂（10银）。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation, about 78 wins. Honored opens the {item:19530} (cloak), {item:19538} (neck), {item:19522} and {item:19514}, each sold for levels 18, 28, 38, 48 and 58 (cloak 36s50c to 8g55s, the rest 2g to 7g50s), and the Major Healing and Mana Draughts (10s)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需12000声望，约78胜。尊敬开放{item:19530}（斗篷）、{item:19538}（颈部）、{item:19522}和{item:19514}，各有18、28、38、48和58级版本出售（斗篷36银50铜到8金55银，其余2金到7金50银），以及强效治疗药剂和法力药剂（10银）。",
	["Master of Warsong Gulch: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "战歌峡谷大师：崇拜时获得一个传承点数",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. In Classic a 3-capture win paid 105, and its 3 marks bring 50 more at the Brigadier General: about 155 a win, so some 20 wins. Losses still pay 35 for each flag your team captured. Forever has not published its battleground rates, so count the games as a rough guide. Below level 50, {npc:14733}'s one-mark quest and the Brigadier General's {quest:8372} come in a version for your bracket (from 20 and from 10): 200 once, then 100 and 50 per 3 marks."] = "中立到友善需3000声望。经典旧世中，三旗获胜给105，其3枚勋章在准将处再换50：每胜约155，所以约20胜。败局仍按你队伍每夺一面旗给35。Forever未公布其战场声望比例，因此对局数只能作粗略参考。50级以下，{npc:14733}的单勋章任务和准将的{quest:8372}有对应等级段的版本（分别从20级和10级起）：首次200，之后每3枚勋章给100和50。",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. In Classic a 3-capture win paid 105, and its 3 marks bring 50 more at the Warbringer: about 155 a win, so some 20 wins. Losses still pay 35 for each flag your team captured. Forever has not published its battleground rates, so count the games as a rough guide. Below level 50, {npc:14781}'s one-mark quest and the Warbringer's {quest:8368} come in a version for your bracket (from 20 and from 10): 200 once, then 100 and 50 per 3 marks."] = "中立到友善需3000声望。经典旧世中，三旗获胜给105，其3枚勋章在战争使者处再换50：每胜约155，所以约20胜。败局仍按你队伍每夺一面旗给35。Forever未公布其战场声望比例，因此对局数只能作粗略参考。50级以下，{npc:14781}的单勋章任务和战争使者的{quest:8368}有对应等级段的版本（分别从20级和10级起）：首次200，之后每3枚勋章给100和50。",
	["Reputation · Battlegrounds"] = "声望 · 战场",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, about 136 wins: half of the whole climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 18 to 58: {item:19542} (dagger), {item:19550}, {item:19558} and {item:19566} (91s to 35g9s). Forever's quartermaster also sells level-25 versions of the four weapons, Resilient helms for level 20 (2g50s) and the Trainee's Outrider Wolf mount (level 25, 10g) with no standing listed."] = "崇敬到崇拜需21000声望，约136胜：占整个历程的一半。崇敬开放18到58级的武器：{item:19542}（匕首）、{item:19550}、{item:19558}和{item:19566}（91银到35金9银）。Forever的军需官还出售这四种武器的25级版本、20级的坚韧头盔（2金50银）和见习斥候的狼坐骑（25级，10金），均未列出所需声望。",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, about 136 wins: half of the whole climb. Revered opens the weapons for levels 18 to 58: {item:19546} (dagger), {item:19554}, {item:19562} and {item:19570} (91s to 35g61s). Forever's quartermaster also sells level-25 versions of the four weapons, Resilient helms for level 20 (2g50s) and the Trainee's Sentinel Nightsaber mount (level 25, 10g) with no standing listed."] = "崇敬到崇拜需21000声望，约136胜：占整个历程的一半。崇敬开放18到58级的武器：{item:19546}（匕首）、{item:19554}、{item:19562}和{item:19570}（91银到35金61银）。Forever的军需官还出售这四种武器的25级版本、20级的坚韧头盔（2金50银）和见习哨兵的夜刃豹坐骑（25级，10金），均未列出所需声望。",
	["The {npc:15350} pays 100 reputation for 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor the first time, then 50 for every 3 more ({quest:8368}). One stands right here at Mor'shan; others in {zone:1454}, {zone:1456} (and on the plain below it) and the {zone:1458}, at {area:321} in the {zone:1417} and at the {zone:1459} gate in the {zone:1416}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1460} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "{npc:15350}首次给3枚战歌峡谷荣誉勋章换100声望，之后每3枚给50（{quest:8368}）。其中一位就在此地的莫尔杉；其他在{zone:1454}、{zone:1456}（及其下方平原）和{zone:1458}，{zone:1417}的{area:321}，以及{zone:1416}的{zone:1459}门口。Forever的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉勋章：交掉之前先想好要什么。你最多能携带30枚{zone:1460}勋章：到上限前交掉或花掉。",
	["The {npc:15351} pays 100 reputation for 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor the first time, then 50 for every 3 more ({quest:8372}). One stands right here at {area:3319} beside {npc:14733}; others in {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, at {area:320} in the {zone:1417} and at both gates of {zone:1459}. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1460} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "{npc:15351}首次给3枚战歌峡谷荣誉勋章换100声望，之后每3枚给50（{quest:8372}）。其中一位就在此地的{area:3319}，{npc:14733}旁；其他在{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1457}，{zone:1417}的{area:320}，以及{zone:1459}的两道门口。Forever的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉勋章：交掉之前先想好要什么。你最多能携带30枚{zone:1460}勋章：到上限前交掉或花掉。",
	["one {item:20558}: play a game"] = "一枚{item:20558}：打一局",
	["three Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor"] = "三枚战歌峡谷荣誉勋章",
	["{item:19505}, 5g"] = "{item:19505}，5金",
	["{item:19506}, 5g"] = "{item:19506}，5金",
	["{npc:14753}: Friendly rewards"] = "{npc:14753}：友善奖励",
	["{npc:14753}: Honored rewards"] = "{npc:14753}：尊敬奖励",
	["{npc:14753}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:14753}：崇敬奖励",
	["{npc:14754}: Friendly rewards"] = "{npc:14754}：友善奖励",
	["{npc:14754}: Honored rewards"] = "{npc:14754}：尊敬奖励",
	["{npc:14754}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:14754}：崇敬奖励",
	["{npc:15350}: 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：3枚勋章换50声望",
	["{npc:15350}: {quest:8368} again, 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：再次交{quest:8368}，3枚勋章换50声望",
	["{npc:15351}: 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：3枚勋章换50声望",
	["{npc:15351}: {quest:8372} again, 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：再次交{quest:8372}，3枚勋章换50声望",
	["{zone:1460} is a 10 against 10 capture-the-flag battle, from level 10. Queue at any battlemaster in the capitals or from the battleground screen. In Classic every flag your team captures pays everyone 35 reputation (45 on the {zone:1460} holiday weekend), and a game pays 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for a win, 1 for a loss. {npc:14733} pays 200 reputation for one mark, once per character: the best mark you will ever turn in. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1460}是10对10的夺旗战，10级起可玩。可在主城任意战场指挥官处或从战场界面排队。经典旧世中，你队伍每夺一面旗给所有人35声望（{zone:1460}节日周末为45），每局获胜给3枚战歌峡谷荣誉勋章，失败给1枚。{npc:14733}用一枚勋章给200声望，每个角色一次：这是你交过最值的勋章。Forever的传承特长“外交家”使本指南中的每个数字最多提高10%。",
	["{zone:1460} is a 10 against 10 capture-the-flag battle, from level 10. Queue at any battlemaster in the capitals or from the battleground screen; the Horde gate is here at {area:1599}. In Classic every flag your team captures pays everyone 35 reputation (45 on the {zone:1460} holiday weekend), and a game pays 3 Warsong Gulch Marks of Honor for a win, 1 for a loss. {npc:14781} pays 200 reputation for one mark, once per character: the best mark you will ever turn in. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1460}是10对10的夺旗战，10级起可玩。可在主城任意战场指挥官处或从战场界面排队；部落的入口就在这里{area:1599}。经典旧世中，你队伍每夺一面旗给所有人35声望（{zone:1460}节日周末为45），每局获胜给3枚战歌峡谷荣誉勋章，失败给1枚。{npc:14781}用一枚勋章给200声望，每个角色一次：这是你交过最值的勋章。Forever的传承特长“外交家”使本指南中的每个数字最多提高10%。",
}

G["forever/class/mage/atiesh"] = {
	["Atiesh"] = "埃提耶什",
	["Back to {npc:15192}"] = "回到{npc:15192}",
	["Back to {npc:15192} at the {area:2300}."] = "回到{area:2300}的{npc:15192}。",
	["Forty Splinters of Atiesh drop in Naxxramas, the 40-player raid in the necropolis over the {area:2277} in {zone:1423}: each of its twelve bosses before Sapphiron and {npc:15990}, and the Four Horsemen's chest, drops one about a third of the time, and the raid shares them out. It takes many weeks of clears. Keep every splinter in one stack."] = "纳克萨玛斯是位于{zone:1423}的{area:2277}上空那座浮空墓穴中的40人团队副本，会掉落四十块埃提耶什的碎片：萨菲隆和{npc:15990}之前的十二个首领，以及天启四骑士的箱子，各约三分之一几率掉一块，由团队平分。凑齐要花数周的通关。把所有碎片收在同一叠里。",
	["Raid"] = "团队副本",
	["Right-click the {quest:9250} to start the quest, then take it to {npc:15192}, the bronze dragon in elf form who stands outside the {area:2300} in eastern {zone:1446}. Fly to {area:976} and ride east."] = "右键点击{quest:9250}开始任务，然后把它交给{npc:15192}——这位以精灵形态出现的青铜龙站在{zone:1446}东部{area:2300}外。飞到{area:976}，再向东骑。",
	["Splinters of Atiesh"] = "埃提耶什的碎片",
	["Take the befouled staff to {area:2279}, the dungeon at the north end of {zone:1423}, through the main gate. On {object:175433} find the patch of {object:181206} with a small white flame on it, stand on it and use the staff: {npc:16387}, Hand of Sargeras (level 63 boss) steps out. Bring a strong group: his {spell:17466} hurts everyone and cannot be dispelled (shadow resistance helps), his {spell:28342} curse must be removed at once, and a warrior's Disarm makes him drop his sword, which a melee player can pick up and use against him. He stays up to two and a half hours, so you can regroup."] = "带着被污染的法杖前往{zone:1423}北端的副本{area:2279}，从正门进入。在{object:175433}上找到那片{object:181206}，上面有一小簇白色火焰，站上去并用法杖：{npc:16387}（萨格拉斯之手，63级首领）就会现身。带上强力的队伍：他的{spell:17466}会伤害所有人且无法驱散（暗影抗性有用），他的{spell:28342}诅咒必须立刻解除；战士的“缴械”能让他丢掉佩剑，近战玩家可以捡起来反过来对付他。他会停留长达两个半小时，所以可以重整队伍。",
	["The Greatstaff"] = "传说之杖",
	["The Staff Head and the Base"] = "杖头与杖座",
	["The legendary staff of the Guardian: forty splinters from Naxxramas, two raid bosses and a demon in {area:2279}."] = "守护者的传说法杖：四十块纳克萨玛斯碎片、两个团队副本首领，以及{area:2279}中的一个恶魔。",
	["Two more raid bosses, a full 40-player raid each, both pieces always drop: the {item:22733} from {npc:15990} on his throne at the top of Naxxramas, the {item:22734} from {npc:15727} at the bottom of the {area:16076}, behind the {area:3478} in southern {zone:1451}. Each boss comes back once a week."] = "还有两个团队副本首领，每个都需要一支满编40人团队，两件物品必定掉落：{item:22733}来自纳克萨玛斯顶层王座上的{npc:15990}，{item:22734}来自{zone:1451}南部{area:3478}之后、{area:16076}底部的{npc:15727}。每个首领每周刷新一次。",
	["the befouled staff, on the {object:181206} inside {area:2279}"] = "被污染的法杖，在{area:2279}内的{object:181206}上",
	["your class's {npc:16387} quest; he hands you the befouled staff"] = "你职业的{npc:16387}任务；他会把被污染的法杖交给你",
	["{item:22733}: {npc:15990}, Naxxramas"] = "{item:22733}：{npc:15990}，纳克萨玛斯",
