	["801 {item:12365} for {item:12643}, {item:12773} and {item:12775}: {skill:186}: {object:324} (skill 245) in {zone:1448} (48-55), {zone:1451} (55-60) and {zone:1452} (55-60); or the Auction House. The densest cluster of {object:324} in {zone:1448} is marked."] = "801个{item:12365}，用于{item:12643}、{item:12773}和{item:12775}：{skill:186}：{object:324}（技能245）产自{zone:1448}（48-55）、{zone:1451}（55-60）和{zone:1452}（55-60）；或在拍卖行购买。{zone:1448}中{object:324}最密集的一簇已标记。",
	["Apprentice {skill:164} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:164} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a {item:5956} (any blacksmithing supplier) and pair it with {skill:186}: {item:2835} and {item:2770} come from the Copper Veins of every starting zone. 1-75 takes about 1s of recipes, plus 286 {item:2835} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:164}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜把技能练到75。本阵营任意{skill:164}训练师都教；箭头会指向最近的一位。买一个{item:5956}（任何锻造供应商）并与{skill:186}配合：{item:2835}和{item:2770}来自每个新手区域的铜矿脉。1-75大约花1银的配方钱，外加286个{item:2835}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:164} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}); Horde {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:16640} (from 225), {spell:9968} (from 210), {spell:9920} (from 175), {spell:10001} (from 205) and {spell:16639} (from 225). 225-300 takes about 3g 60s of recipes, plus 44 {item:1210}, 596 {item:3860}, 142 {item:4304}, 19 {item:7909}, 19 {item:7910}, 44 {item:7912}, 11 {item:7971}, 206 {item:8170}, 2026 {item:12359}, 801 {item:12365} and 10 {item:12799} to gather or buy."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300，收费5金（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:164} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）；部落{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:16640}（225起）、{spell:9968}（210起）、{spell:9920}（175起）、{spell:10001}（205起）和{spell:16639}（225起）。225-300大约花3金60银的配方钱，外加44个{item:1210}、596个{item:3860}、142个{item:4304}、19个{item:7909}、19个{item:7910}、44个{item:7912}、11个{item:7971}、206个{item:8170}、2026个{item:12359}、801个{item:12365}和10个{item:12799}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:2672} (from 95, 5s)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:2672}（95起，5银）。",
	["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:2674} (from 100, 10s)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:2674}（100起，10银）。",
	["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:3320} (from 25, 1s). Also learn {spell:1230171} (1s): Forever's {skill:164} camp item, 1 {item:2835} and 1 {item:2840}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire for its buff. The Camping 101: {skill:164} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a blacksmithing trainer who teaches it free."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:3320}（25起，1银）。同时学习{spell:1230171}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:164}露营物品，需1个{item:2835}和1个{item:2840}，放在营火旁的营地以获得增益。“露营入门：{skill:164}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的锻造训练师那里。",
	["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:7223} (from 160)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:7223}（160起）。",
	["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:9918} (from 175)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:9918}（175起）。",
	["Back to a {skill:164} trainer: {spell:9959} (from 205)."] = "回到{skill:164}训练师处：{spell:9959}（205起）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 28 {item:2605} (28s); about 28s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817}). If you smelt the 195 {item:3859} yourself ({skill:186} 165: an {item:3575} and a Coal each), buy 195 Coal too (9g 75s, trade and blacksmithing suppliers); skip them if you buy the bars."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：28个{item:2605}（28银）；总共约28银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。如果你自己熔炼那195个{item:3859}（{skill:186} 165：每个需一个{item:3575}和一块煤），还要买195块煤（9金75银，杂货和锻造供应商）；若直接买锭则跳过。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: {item:5956} (a tool: one, kept in your bags, 18c); about 18c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5512}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3367}, {npc:5817} and Sovik)."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：{item:5956}（工具：一个，放在包里，18铜）；总共约18铜。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:5519}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5512}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3367}、{npc:5817}和Sovik）。",
	["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:164} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:4258} ({zone:1455}) and {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}); Horde {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}) and {npc:3355} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3501} (from 140) and {spell:3337} (from 100, 10s). 150-225 takes about 10s of recipes and 28s of vendor goods, plus 234 {item:2838}, 168 {item:3575}, 195 {item:3859}, 320 {item:3860} and 30 {item:7912} to gather or buy."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225，收费50银（经典旧世的价格；Forever的价格不在数据中）；它需要{skill:164} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:4258}（{zone:1455}）和{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）；部落{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）和{npc:3355}（{zone:1454}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:3501}（140起）和{spell:3337}（100起，10银）。150-225大约花10银的配方钱和28银的商人货物，外加234个{item:2838}、168个{item:3575}、195个{item:3859}、320个{item:3860}和30个{item:7912}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs {skill:164} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:164} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:4258} ({zone:1455}), {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}), {npc:3136} ({zone:1431}), {npc:252479} ({zone:2521}), {npc:10276} ({zone:1455}) and {npc:5511} ({zone:1453}); Horde {npc:2836} ({zone:1434}), {npc:252479} ({zone:2521}), {npc:4596} ({zone:1458}), {npc:2998} ({zone:1456}), {npc:3355} ({zone:1454}), {npc:1383} ({zone:1454}) and {npc:3478} ({zone:1413}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:2666} (from 45, 2s) and {spell:3326} (from 50, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 19s 50c of recipes and 18c of vendor goods, plus 256 {item:2836}, 28 {item:2838}, 210 {item:2840} and 320 {item:2841} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费5银；它需要{skill:164} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:164}训练师都教：联盟{npc:4258}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:3136}（{zone:1431}）、{npc:252479}（{zone:2521}）、{npc:10276}（{zone:1455}）和{npc:5511}（{zone:1453}）；部落{npc:2836}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:252479}（{zone:2521}）、{npc:4596}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:2998}（{zone:1456}）、{npc:3355}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:1383}（{zone:1454}）和{npc:3478}（{zone:1413}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:2666}（45起，2银）和{spell:3326}（50起，2银50铜）。75-150大约花19银50铜的配方钱和18铜的商人货物，外加256个{item:2836}、28个{item:2838}、210个{item:2840}和320个{item:2841}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Learn {skill:164}"] = "学习{skill:164}",
	["a tool, keep it in your bags"] = "一件工具，放在包里",
	["{item:12426} is orange at 285 (yellow 290, green 300, grey 310): about 19 crafts to 300. Each takes 34 {item:12359}, 1 {item:7910} and 1 {item:7909}. About 34 Thorium Bars a craft against the battleaxe's 40 and its grinding stones, orange to 290. Below character level 50 {npc:14567} has no quest for you: keep making Huge Thorium Battleaxes to 300 instead (yellow to 292, grey at 305: about twice the Thorium Bars). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:7909} (19 for 225-300): {item:7909} turns up in about one {object:2047} or {object:123309} in 500: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {item:7910} (19 for 225-300): {item:7910} turns up in about one {object:2047} or {object:123309} in 143: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {skill:164} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:12426}在285时为橙色（290黄、300绿、310灰）：大约19次制作可到300。每次需要34个{item:12359}、1个{item:7910}和1个{item:7909}。每次约需34个瑟银锭，而战斧每次要40个外加磨石，且到290都还是橙色。角色未满50级时{npc:14567}没有任务给你：那就继续做巨型瑟银战斧冲到300（292黄、305灰：约需两倍的瑟银锭）。附近需要铁砧。{item:7909}（225-300需19个）：{item:7909}在约五百分之一的{object:2047}或{object:123309}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。{item:7910}（225-300需19个）：{item:7910}在约一百四十三分之一的{object:2047}或{object:123309}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。{skill:164} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{item:12426} to 300"] = "{item:12426} 到300",
	["{item:12643} is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 232, grey 235): about 17 crafts to 235. Each takes 1 {item:12365}. One {item:12365} a craft (Thorium veins): cheap points at the start of Artisan."] = "{item:12643}在225时为橙色（230黄、232绿、235灰）：大约17次制作可到235。每次需要1个{item:12365}。每次一个{item:12365}（瑟银矿脉）：大师级开头便宜的涨点选择。",
	["{item:12773} is orange at 250 (yellow 275, green 287, grey 300): about 5 crafts to 255, a point every craft. Each takes 20 {item:12359}, 2 {item:12799}, 2 {item:12644} and 4 {item:8170}. Make the 10 {item:12644} first. {item:12799} turns up in about one Thorium vein in 130: buy the ten at the Auction House. Five crafts only, until the battleaxe plans can be used at 255. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:12359} (2026 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:10620}; or the Auction House. {item:12799} (10 for 225-300): {item:12799} turns up in about one {object:175404}, {object:177388} or {object:180215} in 143: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining."] = "{item:12773}在250时为橙色（275黄、287绿、300灰）：大约5次制作可到255，每次一点。每次需要20个{item:12359}、2个{item:12799}、2个{item:12644}和4个{item:8170}。先做好那10个{item:12644}。{item:12799}在约一百三十分之一的瑟银矿脉中出现：在拍卖行买十个。只需五次制作，到255就能改用巨斧图纸。附近需要铁砧。{item:12359}（225-300需2026个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:10620}；或在拍卖行购买。{item:12799}（225-300需10个）：{item:12799}在约一百四十三分之一的{object:175404}、{object:177388}或{object:180215}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。",
	["{item:12773} to 255"] = "{item:12773} 到255",
	["{item:12775} is orange at 255 (yellow 280, green 292, grey 305): about 31 crafts to 285. Each takes 40 {item:12359}, 6 {item:12644} and 6 {item:8170}. Make the 186 {item:12644} first. Plans from {npc:11278} ({area:2298}, {zone:1422}), unlimited stock, but they bind when picked up. Forty Thorium Bars and six Dense Grinding Stones a craft: the dearest stretch, so stop where the {quest:7654} take over. Other ways through: world-drop plans from the Auction House (the Radiant pieces: about 820 Thorium Bars and 190 Hearts of Fire for the Radiant route) or the Merchant's Favor sets. Needs an anvil nearby."] = "{item:12775}在255时为橙色（280黄、292绿、305灰）：大约31次制作可到285。每次需要40个{item:12359}、6个{item:12644}和6个{item:8170}。先做好那186个{item:12644}。图纸由{npc:11278}（{zone:1422}的{area:2298}）出售，不限量，但拾取即绑定。每次四十个瑟银锭和六个致密磨石：最贵的一段，所以到{quest:7654}接手时就停手。其他路径：拍卖行的世界掉落图纸（“光辉”系列：这条路线约需820个瑟银锭和190个火焰之心），或商人的恩惠套装。附近需要铁砧。",
	["{item:12775} to 285"] = "{item:12775} 到285",
	["{item:12819} teaches {item:12773} ({skill:164} 250) for 1g 60s. Sold by {npc:11278} ({zone:1422})."] = "{item:12819}教{item:12773}（{skill:164} 250），售价1金60银。出售者{npc:11278}（{zone:1422}）。",
	["{item:12823} teaches {item:12775} ({skill:164} 255) for 2g. Sold by {npc:11278} ({zone:1422})."] = "{item:12823}教{item:12775}（{skill:164} 255），售价2金。出售者{npc:11278}（{zone:1422}）。",
	["{item:6040} is yellow at 185 (yellow 185, green 197, grey 210): about 39 crafts to 205. Each takes 5 {item:3859} and 2 {spell:3337}. Make the 78 {spell:3337} first. Steel Bars are smelted from an {item:3575} and a Coal ({skill:186} 165; Coal from trade and blacksmithing suppliers), so each bracer is five of each. Each bracer takes two Heavy Grinding Stones: make them first. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 40, {npc:5164} ({zone:1455}) or {npc:11177} ({zone:1454}) starts The Art of the {spell:9788}: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 {item:7936} and an {item:7935}, whose plans come from a Mithril Order quest chain. {npc:11146} ({zone:1455}) or {npc:11178} ({zone:1454}) starts The Way of the Weaponsmith: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes and 2 Big Black Maces; on Forever the {item:3853} plans ({npc:2482}, {area:35}) and {item:3855} plans bind when picked up, so buy and use them yourself. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3859} (195 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3575} and Coal; or the Auction House."] = "{item:6040}在185时为黄色（185黄、197绿、210灰）：大约39次制作可到205。每次需要5个{item:3859}和2个{spell:3337}。先做好那78个{spell:3337}。钢锭由{item:3575}和煤熔炼而成（{skill:186} 165；煤来自杂货和锻造供应商），所以每个护腕各需五份。每个护腕还要两块重型磨石：先做好。专精（可选）：在200和角色40级时，{npc:5164}（{zone:1455}）或{npc:11177}（{zone:1454}）会开启{spell:9788}的专精任务：交4顶华丽的秘银头盔、2个{item:7936}和一个{item:7935}，这些图纸来自秘银会任务链。{npc:11146}（{zone:1455}）或{npc:11178}（{zone:1454}）会开启武器铸造师之路：交4把月钢阔剑、4把巨型铁斧、2把重型秘银斧和2把大型黑锤；在Forever中，{item:3853}图纸（{npc:2482}，{area:35}）和{item:3855}图纸拾取即绑定，所以要自己买图纸、自己做。只能选一个；到300都不需要它们，而且测试版从未测过它们（只测到30级）。附近需要铁砧。{item:3859}（150-225需195个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3575}和煤；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{item:6040} to 205"] = "{item:6040} 到205",
	["{item:7930} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 235, grey 245): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 16 {item:3860}. Sixteen Mithril Bars a craft and nothing else; orange to 225 on Forever, so a point every craft to the Artisan cap. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (320 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House. {skill:164} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:7930}在205时为橙色（225黄、235绿、245灰）：大约20次制作可到225，每次一点。每次需要16个{item:3860}。每次十六个秘银锭，别无他物；在Forever中到225都是橙色，所以每次一点直冲大师级上限。附近需要铁砧。{item:3860}（150-225需320个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3858}；或在拍卖行购买。{skill:164} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{item:7930} to 225"] = "{item:7930} 到225",
	["{item:7933} is yellow at 235 (yellow 230, green 240, grey 250): about 30 crafts to 247. Each takes 14 {item:3860} and 4 {item:4304}. Mithril Bars from Mithril Deposits; {item:4304} from skinners or the Auction House. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3860} (596 for 225-300): {skill:186}: smelt {item:3858}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:7933}在235时为黄色（230黄、240绿、250灰）：大约30次制作可到247。每次需要14个{item:3860}和4个{item:4304}。秘银锭来自秘银矿脉；{item:4304}来自剥皮者或拍卖行。附近需要铁砧。{item:3860}（225-300需596个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:3858}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{item:7933} to 247"] = "{item:7933} 到247",
	["{item:7945} is green at 247 (yellow 230, green 242, grey 255): about 11 crafts to 250. Each takes 16 {item:3860}, 1 {item:7971}, 4 {item:1210}, 1 {item:7966} and 2 {item:4304}. Make the 11 {item:7966} first. Only about 11 crafts to bridge 247-250, but each wants four Shadowgems (about one {object:1732} in a hundred) and a {item:7971}: buy those at the Auction House unless your bags already hold them. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:1210} (44 for 225-300): {item:1210} turns up in about one {object:1731}, {object:1732} or {object:1733} in 100: buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find while mining. {item:7971} (11 for 225-300): {item:7971} is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find."] = "{item:7945}在247时为绿色（230黄、242绿、255灰）：大约11次制作可到250。每次需要16个{item:3860}、1个{item:7971}、4个{item:1210}、1个{item:7966}和2个{item:4304}。先做好那11个{item:7966}。跨过247-250只需约11次制作，但每次都要四块影宝石（约百分之一的{object:1732}）和一个{item:7971}：除非包里已有，否则去拍卖行买。附近需要铁砧。{item:1210}（225-300需44个）：{item:1210}在约百分之一的{object:1731}、{object:1732}或{object:1733}中出现：在拍卖行买，或采矿时留意收集。{item:7971}（225-300需11个）：{item:7971}是稀有掉落（没有哪种怪物能达到五十分之一的掉率）：在拍卖行买，或留着你找到的。",
	["{item:7945} to 250"] = "{item:7945} 到250",
	["{item:7964} is yellow at 175 (yellow 175, green 180, grey 185): about 30 crafts to 185. Each takes 1 {item:7912}. One {item:7912} a craft (Mithril Deposits): cheap points between the iron and the steel bracers. Use the stones on your weapons or sell them."] = "{item:7964}在175时为黄色（175黄、180绿、185灰）：大约30次制作可到185。每次需要1个{item:7912}。每次一个{item:7912}（秘银矿脉）：在铁护腕和钢护腕之间便宜的涨点选择。把磨石用在武器上，或者卖掉。",
	["{npc:14567} ({zone:1446}) trades {item:12700} ({skill:164} 270) for 40 {item:12359} in {quest:7654}, which needs {skill:164} 265 and character level 50; take {quest:7652} first (it asks for nothing). The plans bind when picked up."] = "{npc:14567}（{zone:1446}）在{quest:7654}中以40个{item:12359}换取{item:12700}（{skill:164} 270），该任务需要{skill:164} 265和角色50级；先接{quest:7652}（它不要求任何东西）。图纸拾取即绑定。",
	["{skill:164} 1-300"] = "{skill:164} 1-300",
	["{skill:164} 150-225: vendor goods"] = "{skill:164} 150-225：商人货物",
	["{skill:164} 75-150: vendor goods"] = "{skill:164} 75-150：商人货物",
	["{skill:164} recipes at 113"] = "{skill:164} 113时的配方",
	["{skill:164} recipes at 205"] = "{skill:164} 205时的配方",
	["{skill:164} recipes at 35"] = "{skill:164} 35时的配方",
	["{spell:2660} is orange at 1 (yellow 15, green 35, grey 55): about 42 crafts to 35. Each takes 1 {item:2835}. One {item:2835} a craft, a point every craft to 15."] = "{spell:2660}在1时为橙色（15黄、35绿、55灰）：大约42次制作可到35。每次需要1个{item:2835}。每次一个{item:2835}，到15前每次一点。",
	["{spell:2660} to 35"] = "{spell:2660} 到35",
	["{spell:2666} is orange at 83 (yellow 85, green 105, grey 125): about 21 crafts to 100. Each takes 10 {item:2840}. Forever teaches {spell:2666} from 45; it stays orange to 85. Ten Copper Bars a craft: smelt your {item:2770}. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:5956} is a tool: keep it in your bags. {item:2840} (210 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2770}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:2666}在83时为橙色（85黄、105绿、125灰）：大约21次制作可到100。每次需要10个{item:2840}。Forever从45起就教{spell:2666}；它到85都保持橙色。每次十个铜锭：熔炼你的{item:2770}。附近需要铁砧。{item:5956}是工具：放在包里。{item:2840}（75-150需210个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2770}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{spell:2672} is orange at 113 (yellow 125, green 140, grey 155): about 64 crafts to 150. Each takes 5 {item:2841} and 2 {spell:3326}. Make the 128 {spell:3326} first. Each bracer takes two Coarse Grinding Stones ({item:2836} from Tin Veins): make them first; they give points too. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:2841} (320 for 75-150): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2840} and {item:3576}; or the Auction House. {skill:164} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:2672}在113时为橙色（125黄、140绿、155灰）：大约64次制作可到150。每次需要5个{item:2841}和2个{spell:3326}。先做好那128个{spell:3326}。每个护腕要两块粗制磨石（{item:2836}来自锡矿脉）：先做好；它们也能涨点。附近需要铁砧。{item:2841}（75-150需320个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2840}和{item:3576}；或在拍卖行购买。{skill:164} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:2674} is yellow at 100 (yellow 100, green 107, grey 115): about 28 crafts to 113. Each takes 1 {item:2838}. {item:2838} comes from Iron Deposits; one a craft."] = "{spell:2674}在100时为黄色（100黄、107绿、115灰）：大约28次制作可到113。每次需要1个{item:2838}。{item:2838}来自铁矿脉；每次一个。",
	["{spell:2674} to 113"] = "{spell:2674} 到113",
	["{spell:3320} is green at 75 (yellow 45, green 65, grey 85): about 58 crafts to 83. Each takes 2 {item:2835}. Two {item:2835} a craft. Grinding stones are parts for later plans; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3320}在75时为绿色（45黄、65绿、85灰）：大约58次制作可到83。每次需要2个{item:2835}。每次两个{item:2835}。磨石是后续图纸的零件；多出来的卖给商人。",
	["{spell:3320} is orange at 35 (yellow 45, green 65, grey 85): about 64 crafts to 75. Each takes 2 {item:2835}. Two {item:2835} a craft. Grinding stones are parts for later plans; the extras sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3320}在35时为橙色（45黄、65绿、85灰）：大约64次制作可到75。每次需要2个{item:2835}。每次两个{item:2835}。磨石是后续图纸的零件；多出来的卖给商人。",
	["{spell:3501} is orange at 150 (yellow 165, green 177, grey 190): about 28 crafts to 175. Each takes 6 {item:3575} and 1 {item:2605}. Six Iron Bars and a {item:2605} a craft; {item:2605} comes from tailoring, leatherworking and trade supplies vendors. Orange to 165 on Forever, so a point every craft for the first fifteen. Needs an anvil nearby. {item:3575} (168 for 150-225): {skill:186}: smelt {item:2772}; or the Auction House."] = "{spell:3501}在150时为橙色（165黄、177绿、190灰）：大约28次制作可到175。每次需要6个{item:3575}和1个{item:2605}。每次六个铁锭和一个{item:2605}；{item:2605}由裁缝、制皮和杂货供应商出售。在Forever中到165都是橙色，所以前十五次每次一点。附近需要铁砧。{item:3575}（150-225需168个）：{skill:186}：熔炼{item:2772}；或在拍卖行购买。",
	["{spell:3501} to 175"] = "{spell:3501} 到175",
}

G["forever/reputation/ravenholdt"] = {
	["100"] = "100",
	["300"] = "300",
	["At level 50 your class trainer has another letter for you, and {npc:6768} a short chain: 360 reputation in all. The {quest:8234} drops from Timbermaw Shamans in northern {zone:1447} (about 1 in 27, or pick their pockets); the {quest:8235} from Forest Oozes in {zone:1447} (4 in 5). {quest:8236} comes from Morphaz, an elite drake deep in the {area:1477}: a five-player dungeon, group up."] = "50级时，职业训练师会再给你一封信，{npc:6768}则给你一条短任务链：合计360点声望。{quest:8234}由{zone:1447}北部的木喉萨满掉落（约二十七分之一，或者直接扒口袋）；{quest:8235}由{zone:1447}的森林软泥怪掉落（五分之四）。{quest:8236}来自{area:1477}深处的精英龙类莫法兹：那是五人副本，请组队。",
	["Back to {npc:13085}"] = "回到{npc:13085}",
	["Barton hides in a house in {area:280}, among stealthed Syndicate. Pick his pocket for the report; Distract turns him around if you are under his level."] = "巴顿藏身于{area:280}的一栋房子里，周围是潜行的辛迪加。扒他的口袋拿报告；若你的等级低于他，用“扰乱”把他转过身来。",
	["Everyone, not only rogues: in Classic every Syndicate human gave {faction:349} 5 reputation up to the end of Honored (11,999 of 12,000) and not one point more, so 0 to there is 4,200 kills (3,600 after a rogue's quests and emblems). This step ticks at Honored; keep killing until the bar stops moving, then go on to the junkboxes. The highest Syndicate are in the north-west of the {zone:1416}, Syndicate Assassins and Enforcers (level 38-40), with Syndicate Sentries (36-37) nearer the middle. At 60 all Syndicate are grey, and in Classic grey kills gave about a fifth: farm them before 48 if you can. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "所有人，不只是盗贼：在经典旧世中，每个辛迪加人类成员在尊敬结束前（12,000中的11,999）都给{faction:349} 5点声望，绝不多给一点，所以从0到那里需要击杀4,200次（做完盗贼任务和徽记后为3,600次）。这一步在尊敬时勾选；继续杀到声望条不再移动，再去弄垃圾箱。等级最高的辛迪加在{zone:1416}西北部：辛迪加刺客和执法者（38-40级），更靠中部的是辛迪加哨兵（36-37级）。到60级时所有辛迪加都是灰色，而经典旧世中杀灰名只有约五分之一：如果可能，就在48级前刷。传承“外交家”最多加10%。",
	["From the top of Honored to Exalted is 21,001 reputation, and {quest:8249} is the only way: {npc:6707} pays 50 and a {item:20086} for every five Heavy Junkboxes (Classic Era paid 75), 421 turn-ins and 2,105 boxes. Boxes count at any standing, so take the cheap kills to their cap first. Any class can hand them in. Rogues get them by picking the pockets of humanoids around level 50 and up: Lower {area:1583} and {area:1584} are the classic spots, pick every pocket, reset and go again. The boxes do not bind, so everyone else buys them from rogues or at the auction house. Hand them in unopened; an opened box you empty vanishes, so leave one item in it."] = "从尊敬满到崇拜是21,001点声望，而{quest:8249}是唯一的途径：{npc:6707}每五个重垃圾箱支付50点和一把{item:20086}（经典旧世时期为75），共需421次上交、2,105个箱子。箱子在任何声望等级都计数，所以先用便宜的击杀刷到上限。任何职业都能上交。盗贼靠扒50级以上人形生物的口袋获得：下层{area:1583}和{area:1584}是经典地点，每个口袋都扒，重置后再来。箱子不绑定，所以其他人可以向盗贼买或在拍卖行买。上交时不要打开；打开并清空的箱子会消失，所以留一件物品在里面。",
	["Heavy Junkboxes to Exalted"] = "用重垃圾箱冲到崇拜",
	["Lord Tomas"] = "托马斯领主",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3,000 reputation; the quests above pay 700 of it. Any {npc:6766} on the path takes {quest:6701}, 100 reputation each, until you reach Friendly: 23 emblems after the quests. Pick the pockets of Syndicate humans; they never drop emblems when killed. The Arathi camps pay best: Syndicate Prowlers and Conjurors carry one about a quarter of the time. Kill what you have robbed so the next ones respawn fresh."] = "从中立到友善是3,000点声望；上面的任务给了其中700点。路上任何{npc:6766}都收{quest:6701}，每枚徽记100点，直到你达到友善：做完任务后还需23枚徽记。去扒辛迪加人类的口袋；杀死他们永远不会掉徽记。阿拉希的营地收益最好：辛迪加游荡者和咒术师约有四分之一携带徽记。把扒过的怪杀掉，好让下一批刷新。",
	["Put on the {item:275706} and go into Stromgarde. {npc:266847} waits on a ledge just outside the castle; players reach her by jumping from the roof of the house beside the ledge. Her stash is upstairs in a house near the keep."] = "穿上{item:275706}，进入激流堡。{npc:266847}在城堡外的一处壁架上等候；玩家从壁架旁那栋房子的屋顶跳过去找她。她的藏匿物在城堡主楼附近一栋房子的楼上。",
	["Ravenholdt"] = "拉文霍特",
	["Ravenholdt Reputation"] = "拉文霍特声望",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Rogues from level 24: ask your class trainer in a capital \"May I have it, please?\" for the {item:17126}, and read it. The path up to the manor starts in the hills north of {area:275}. In the tunnel on the way lies a chest: do not open it (an elite guard jumps out), just walk past it to earn the Rite of Cunning. {npc:6707} waits on the manor's balcony."] = "24级起的盗贼：在主城的职业训练师那里说“请把它给我好吗？”来索要{item:17126}，然后阅读它。通往庄园的路从{area:275}北面的丘陵开始。途中隧道里有个箱子：不要打开（会跳出一个精英守卫），直接走过去就能获得“狡诈仪式”。{npc:6707}在庄园的阳台上等你。",
	["Stromgarde: {npc:266847}"] = "激流堡：{npc:266847}",
	["Syndicate Assassin"] = "辛迪加刺客",
	["Syndicate Enforcer"] = "辛迪加执法者",
