	["Syndicate kills to the end of Honored"] = "击杀辛迪加至尊敬结束",
	["The assassins' guild: Forever's new rogue quests, then Syndicate kills and Heavy Junkboxes to Exalted."] = "刺客公会：先做Forever新增的盗贼任务，再靠击杀辛迪加和重垃圾箱冲到崇拜。",
	["The hand-off is at the southern end of {area:1057}, in the west of the {zone:1417}: two Syndicate guard the box. Kill them or lure them off, then take the {item:275882}. Keep the uniform: {npc:13085} wants it back."] = "交接点在{zone:1417}西部{area:1057}的南端：两名辛迪加看守着箱子。杀掉他们或把他们引开，然后拿走{item:275882}。留着制服：{npc:13085}要收回。",
	["The two heirlooms lie in two towers of the {area:281}, the ogre-held ruin in the middle of the {zone:1416}. The tower with the sword is ringed by elite ogres: stay in stealth. Neither item is guarded once you are inside."] = "两件传家宝分别放在{area:281}的两座塔中，那是{zone:1416}中部被食人魔占据的废墟。放剑的塔周围有精英食人魔：保持潜行。进去之后两件物品都没人看守。",
	["The {object:656157} stands among the Syndicate camps of {area:313}, north of Stromgarde. Open it to finish {quest:96783} and take the {item:275706}."] = "{object:656157}立在激流堡以北{area:313}的辛迪加营地之间。打开它即可完成{quest:96783}并拿到{item:275706}。",
	["a {npc:6766}: 100 per emblem"] = "一个{npc:6766}：每枚徽记100",
	["walk past the trapped chest in the tunnel"] = "走过隧道里那个有陷阱的箱子",
