	["{item:20023}: Forest Oozes"] = "{item:20023}：森林软泥怪",
	["{item:275482}: pickpocket Barton"] = "{item:275482}：扒巴顿的口袋",
	["{item:275635}, the sword"] = "{item:275635}，那把剑",
	["{item:275636}, the shield"] = "{item:275636}，那面盾",
	["{item:275709}, in Anastasia's Stash upstairs"] = "{item:275709}，在楼上阿纳斯塔西娅的藏匿物中",
	["{npc:13085}, in the manor, has Forever's new rogue quests: 100 reputation each for {quest:96779}, {quest:96781} and {quest:96782}, which follows it, and 300 for {quest:96786} at the end of the Stromgarde chain ({quest:96783} and the two quests after it pay nothing). All can be done solo with stealth from level 30; below that, the Master of Deception talent and a {item:5140} for Vanish help."] = "庄园里的{npc:13085}有Forever新增的盗贼任务：{quest:96779}、{quest:96781}和紧随其后的{quest:96782}各给100点声望，激流堡任务链最后的{quest:96786}给300点（{quest:96783}及其后的两个任务不给声望）。从30级起都能靠潜行单人完成；等级更低时，“诡计大师”天赋和用于“消失”的{item:5140}会有帮助。",
	["{npc:13085}: 100"] = "{npc:13085}：100",
