	["{npc:266216} is inside {area:275}, the Syndicate fortress east of {area:271}. Stealth past the guards in the courtyard."] = "{npc:266216}在{area:271}以东的辛迪加堡垒{area:275}内。潜行绕过庭院里的守卫。",
