	["{npc:12944}'s {area:2717} recipes: fire resistance gear, {object:147516} armour and the Exalted epic weapon plans."] = "{npc:12944}的{area:2717}配方：抗火装备、{object:147516}护甲，以及崇拜时的史诗武器图纸。",
