G["forever/reputation/zandalar-tribe"] = {
	["100"] = "100",
	["200"] = "200",
	["25 and a token"] = "25点和一枚徽章",
	["At Exalted your necklace takes its last upgrade, Rin'wosho sells {item:20013} (5g), and Rin'wosho trades 15 Zandalar Honor Tokens for one Signet of the Zandalar, the shoulder enchant: Might (attack power), Mojo (spell damage) or Serenity (healing)."] = "崇拜时，你的项链完成最后一次升级，林沃绍出售{item:20013}（5金），并且林沃绍可用15枚赞达拉荣誉徽章换一枚赞达拉徽记，即肩部附魔：力量（攻击强度）、魔精（法术伤害）或宁静（治疗）。",
	["At Friendly your class's trainer on the isle gives a necklace for free (100 reputation); the same NPC upgrades it at Honored, Revered and Exalted (100 each) with no raid item needed. Friendly also opens Rin'wosho's first recipes ({item:19766}, {item:19687}, {item:19778}, {item:19695}, {item:20001}, {item:20012}, 5g each; {item:20757}, 4g) and the Paragons of Power bracers (150 for the Primal Hakkari bracer token of your class)."] = "友善时，岛上你职业的训练师会免费给你一条项链（100点声望）；同一个NPC会在尊敬、崇敬和崇拜时升级它（每次100点），不需要团队副本物品。友善还会开放林沃绍的第一批配方（{item:19766}、{item:19687}、{item:19778}、{item:19695}、{item:20001}、{item:20012}，每张5金；{item:20757}，4金）以及力量典范护腕（用你职业的原始哈卡莱护腕徽记加150点）。",
	["Destroy one bijou at the {object:180367}, the stone altar on the west side of {area:3357} (right-click the bijou there), then tell {npc:15070}: 150 reputation and an extra {item:19858}, once. From then on every bijou you destroy at the altar pays 75 reputation and a token, and every set of three coins {npc:15070} takes pays 25 and a token. They never stop counting."] = "在{area:3357}西侧的石祭坛{object:180367}处销毁一枚小饰物（在那里右键点击小饰物），然后告诉{npc:15070}：一次性获得150点声望和一个额外的{item:19858}。此后，你在祭坛销毁的每枚小饰物都给75点声望和一枚徽章，{npc:15070}每收下一套三枚硬币也给25点和一枚徽章。它们永远会计数。",
	["Exalted: the {quest:8246}"] = "崇拜：{quest:8246}",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000: one and a half clears. Honored opens {item:19683}, {item:19686}, {item:19689}, {item:19691}, {item:19694} and {spell:24361} (5g each), {item:20000} (12g), {item:20756} (4g) and {spell:471400} (4g), the Paragons of Power belts and mantles (150 each), {quest:8196} (one Honor Token) and The {item:22635}."] = "友善到尊敬是6,000点：一趟半副本。尊敬会开放{item:19683}、{item:19686}、{item:19689}、{item:19691}、{item:19694}和{spell:24361}（每张5金）、{item:20000}（12金）、{item:20756}（4金）和{spell:471400}（4金），以及力量典范腰带和披肩（各150点）、{quest:8196}（一枚荣誉徽章）和{item:22635}。",
	["Friendly: your class necklace"] = "友善：你职业的项链",
	["Honored to Revered is 12,000: about three clears. Two one-time quests help: {quest:8201} ({npc:14910} on the isle: 200 for five Channeler's Heads from the High Priests, strung on his {item:19883}) and {quest:8183} (one per kill, for whoever loots it; {npc:14875} on the isle pays 200 and a Zandalarian Hero badge, charm or medallion). Revered opens {item:19682}, {item:19685}, {item:19688}, {item:19690}, {item:19693} and {spell:24365} (5g each), the Paragons of Power chests and mantles (150) and {quest:8243}."] = "尊敬到崇敬是12,000点：约三趟副本。两个一次性任务能帮上忙：{quest:8201}（岛上的{npc:14910}：用五位高阶祭司的五个引导者之头，串在他的{item:19883}上，给200点）和{quest:8183}（每次击杀一个，谁拾取归谁；岛上的{npc:14875}给200点和一个赞达拉英雄徽章、护符或奖章）。崇敬会开放{item:19682}、{item:19685}、{item:19688}、{item:19690}、{item:19693}和{spell:24365}（每张5金）、力量典范胸甲和披肩（150点）以及{quest:8243}。",
	["Honored: necklace, {item:22635} and mangoes"] = "尊敬：项链、{item:22635}和芒果",
	["Reputation · Raids and dungeons"] = "声望 · 团队副本与地下城",
	["Revered: necklace, coins and bijous"] = "崇敬：项链、硬币和小饰物",
	["Shoulder and head enchants, a class necklace upgraded at every standing, and {area:19}'s set pieces."] = "肩部和头部附魔、随每级声望升级的职业项链，以及{area:19}的套装部件。",
	["Trash stopped counting at 11,999 Honored. Revered to Exalted is 21,000: bosses give about 1,350 a clear, and now the saved coins and bijous pay: 75 per bijou (280 bijous alone), 25 per coin set. Coins and bijous are tradeable, so the auction house is the only solo way. Each Paragons piece pays 150, each {npc:15042} enchant 100, each {item:22635} 200. Rin'wosho trades one of {npc:15042}'s potables (Spirit, Sheen or {item:20081}) for an Honor Token."] = "小怪的计数在尊敬的11,999处停止。崇敬到崇拜是21,000点：首领每趟约给1,350点，而现在之前攒下的硬币和小饰物开始生效：每枚小饰物75点（仅小饰物就有280枚），每套硬币25点。硬币和小饰物可以交易，所以拍卖行是唯一的单人途径。每件力量典范部件给150点，每个{npc:15042}的附魔给100点，每个{item:22635}给200点。林沃绍可用一瓶{npc:15042}的药水（灵魂、光泽或{item:20081}）换一枚荣誉徽章。",
	["Your class's necklace at Friendly, upgraded at Honored, Revered and Exalted"] = "你职业的项链：友善获得，尊敬、崇敬、崇拜升级",
	["Zandalar Tribe Reputation"] = "赞达拉部族声望",
	["your class's {item:19813}"] = "你职业的{item:19813}",
	["{area:19} is the troll city in the north-east of {zone:1434}: a 20-player raid. Trash pays 3 to 5 each until 11,999 of 12,000 Honored, one point short of Revered; the Speakers 15, Ohgan 15, the {area:3398} boss 25, {npc:15114} and the five High Priests 100, {npc:11382} and Jin'do 200 and Hakkar 400, all the way to Exalted. A full clear is about 4,050: one clear reaches Friendly (3,000). Loot every coin, bijou, {item:22637}, {item:19881} and Primal Hakkari set piece. Coins and bijous pay the same at any standing: save them until the trash stops counting, except one bijou for {quest:8240}."] = "{area:19}是{zone:1434}东北的巨魔城市：一个20人团队副本。小怪每个给3到5点，直到尊敬的12,000点中的11,999点，距崇敬只差一点；演讲者15点，奥甘15点，{area:3398}的首领25点，{npc:15114}和五位高阶祭司100点，{npc:11382}和金度200点，哈卡400点，一直算到崇拜。全通一趟约4,050点：一趟就能到友善（3,000点）。拾取每一枚硬币、每一件小饰物、{item:22637}、{item:19881}和原始哈卡莱套装部件。硬币和小饰物在任何声望等级给的都一样：留到小怪不再计数时再交，但{quest:8240}需要一枚小饰物除外。",
	["{area:19} to Friendly"] = "{area:19}到友善",
	["{area:19} to Honored"] = "{area:19}到尊敬",
	["{area:19} to Revered"] = "{area:19}到崇敬",
	["{area:3357} is the small island off the north-west coast of {zone:1434}, west of the {area:122}: swim over from the coast. Everyone starts Neutral with the {faction:270}. {npc:15070} takes coins and bijous, {npc:14921} sells the recipes and trades Honor Tokens, and {npc:14902}, {npc:14903}, {npc:14904} and {npc:14905} hand out the class necklaces and the set pieces. Almost all Zandalar reputation comes from {area:19}, a 20-player raid, and {area:19} is not among the first raids Blizzard has announced for Forever: until it opens there is no Zandalar reputation to earn, and no coins or bijous on the auction house either. Once it is open, the only solo way is buying coins and bijous on the auction house (75 per bijou, 25 per set of three coins). The Legacy perk Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers in this guide are without it."] = "{area:3357}是{zone:1434}西北海岸外的小岛，位于{area:122}以西：从海岸游过去。每个人与{faction:270}都从中立开始。{npc:15070}收硬币和小饰物，{npc:14921}出售配方并兑换荣誉徽章，{npc:14902}、{npc:14903}、{npc:14904}和{npc:14905}发放职业项链和套装部件。几乎所有赞达拉声望都来自20人团队副本{area:19}，而{area:19}并不在暴雪为Forever公布的首批团队副本中：在它开放之前，没有赞达拉声望可赚，拍卖行上也不会有硬币或小饰物。一旦开放，唯一的单人途径就是在拍卖行购买硬币和小饰物（每枚小饰物75点，每套三枚硬币25点）。传承特长“外交家”会让每次收益最多增加10%；本篇攻略中的数字不含它。",
	["{item:19707}; any of the nine colours does"] = "{item:19707}；九种颜色中任意一种都行",
	["{item:22637}, Jin'do or Mandokir"] = "{item:22637}，金度或曼多基尔",
