	["{npc:15042} takes an {item:18331}, Rapidity or Focus for the {item:22635} head and leg enchant: 200 reputation each, again and again. The Arcanum binds to you, so it never sells: {npc:14368} in the library of {area:2577} makes it from the matching Libram ({area:2577} drops, and on the auction house), a {item:18335} and Large Brilliant Shards, plus {item:12735}, two {item:12938} or two {item:12753}. {npc:14921} trades {quest:8196} for an Honor Token."] = "{npc:15042}接受{item:18331}——迅速或专注——用于{item:22635}的头部和腿部附魔：每次给200点声望，可反复交。秘文拾取即绑定，所以永远不会出售：{area:2577}图书馆里的{npc:14368}会用对应的圣典（{area:2577}掉落，也在拍卖行有售）、一个{item:18335}和大块魔光碎片，再加上{item:12735}、两个{item:12938}或两个{item:12753}来制作。{npc:14921}可用{quest:8196}换一枚荣誉徽章。",
	["{npc:15042}'s enchants, from Friendly"] = "{npc:15042}的附魔，友善起",
	["{npc:15042}'s head and leg enchants, from Friendly"] = "{npc:15042}的头部和腿部附魔，友善起",
	["{npc:15042}, a spirit just inside {area:19}'s entrance, trades your class's head and leg enchant for a {item:22637} ({npc:11380} or {npc:11382}, about 90%) and your class's {item:19813} (the Jinxed Hoodoo Piles scattered through {area:19}, now and then from its trash): 100 reputation each, as often as you like."] = "{npc:15042}是{area:19}入口内不远处的灵魂，可用一个{item:22637}（{npc:11380}或{npc:11382}，约90%）和你职业的{item:19813}（散布在{area:19}各处的被诅咒的巫毒堆，小怪偶尔也会掉）换取你职业的头部和腿部附魔：每次100点声望，想交多少次都行。",
	["{npc:15042}: idol and doll, 100"] = "{npc:15042}：神像和人偶，100",
	["{npc:15042}: {item:18329}, 200"] = "{npc:15042}：{item:18329}，200",
