	["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:2956}, {npc:2957}, {npc:3035}, {npc:3566}, {npc:2972}, {npc:2959}, {npc:2958} and {npc:2960} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:2956}、{npc:2957}、{npc:3035}、{npc:3566}、{npc:2972}、{npc:2959}、{npc:2958}和{npc:2960}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
	["349 {item:2318} for {spell:2152}, {spell:3756} and {spell:3763} (210 of them for 75-150: pick them all now): {skill:393}: beasts of level 5-20; or the Auction House. Skin {npc:3126}, {npc:3123}, {npc:3122}, {npc:3125}, {npc:3099}, {npc:3110}, {npc:3121}, {npc:3100}, {npc:3130} and {npc:3127} here (level 5-20); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "349个{item:2318}，用于{spell:2152}、{spell:3756}和{spell:3763}（其中210个用于75-150：现在全部采到手）：靠{skill:393}剥取5到20级的野兽；或去拍卖行。在此剥取{npc:3126}、{npc:3123}、{npc:3122}、{npc:3125}、{npc:3099}、{npc:3110}、{npc:3121}、{npc:3100}、{npc:3130}和{npc:3127}（5到20级）；{skill:393}攻略会规划路线。",
	["430 {item:14047} for {item:15094}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:11880} (level 57-59) here."] = "430个{item:14047}，用于{item:15094}：45到60级的人形生物会掉落；或去拍卖行。这里由{npc:11880}（57到59级）掉落。",
	["430 {item:14047} for {item:15094}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it; or the Auction House. It drops from {npc:7027} (level 56-57) here."] = "430个{item:14047}，用于{item:15094}：45到60级的人形生物会掉落；或去拍卖行。这里由{npc:7027}（56到57级）掉落。",
	["Apprentice {skill:165} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Any {skill:165} trainer of your faction teaches it; the arrow picks the nearest. Pair it with {skill:393}: {item:2318} comes from the beasts of every starting zone. {item:2320} and Salt are sold by leatherworking and trade supplies vendors. 1-75 takes about 1s 50c of recipes and 5s of vendor goods, plus 349 {item:2318} to gather or buy."] = "初级{skill:165}让你在任何角色等级下花10铜学会，可制作到75。本阵营任意{skill:165}训练师都教；箭头会指向最近的一位。搭配{skill:393}：{item:2318}来自每个新手地区的野兽。{item:2320}和盐由制皮和贸易补给商出售。1-75大约花1银50铜的配方钱和5银的商人货物，外加349个{item:2318}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300; it needs {skill:165} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}); Horde {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:19058} (from 205). 225-300 takes about 3g 40s of recipes and 44g 90s of vendor goods, plus 1009 {item:8170} and 430 {item:14047} to gather or buy."] = "大师级把上限从225提高到300；它需要{skill:165} 200和角色35级，所以从200起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:11097}（{zone:1425}）；部落{npc:11098}（{zone:1444}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:19058}（205起）。225-300大约花3金40银的配方钱和44金90银的商人货物，外加1009个{item:8170}和430个{item:14047}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:3756} (from 40, 1s 50c). Also learn {spell:1229432} (1s): Forever's {skill:165} camp item, 5 {item:2318}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. The Camping 101: {skill:165} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a leatherworking trainer who teaches it free."] = "回到{skill:165}训练师处：{spell:3756}（40起，1银50铜）。同时学习{spell:1229432}（1银）：这是Forever的{skill:165}露营物品，需5个{item:2318}，放在营火旁的营地。“露营入门：{skill:165}”任务来自你新手地区的露营指南（在“户外活动”之后），会派你去一位免费教它的制皮训练师那里。",
	["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:3780} (from 125, 7s 50c)."] = "回到{skill:165}训练师处：{spell:3780}（125起，7银50铜）。",
	["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:9074} (from 95, 5s)."] = "回到{skill:165}训练师处：{spell:9074}（95起，5银）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 39 {item:2325} (3g 90s) and 82 {item:14341} (41g); about 44g 90s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：39个{item:2325}（3金90银）和82个{item:14341}（41金）；总共约44金90银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 50 {item:2320} (5s); about 5s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：50个{item:2320}（5银）；总共约5银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 70 {item:2320} (7s) and 50 {item:2321} (50s); about 57s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：70个{item:2320}（7银）和50个{item:2321}（50银）；总共约57银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 8 {item:2321} (8s) and 32 {item:4291} (1g 60s); about 1g 68s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "一次买齐这一段所需的全部：8个{item:2321}（8银）和32个{item:4291}（1金60银）；总共约1金68银。箭头会指向本阵营最近的卖家（{zone:1453}：{npc:1347}、{npc:1286}和{npc:5565}；{zone:1454}：{npc:3364}、{npc:3367}和{npc:5817}）。",
	["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225; it needs {skill:165} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}) and {npc:4212} ({zone:1457}); Horde {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}) and {npc:3007} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. 150-225 takes about 1g 68s of vendor goods, plus 257 {item:4304} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {item:4304} (from 155) and {item:8173} (from 175), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3. {item:8170} (from 205) takes a second trip, to other trainers (below)."] = "高级把上限从150提高到225；它需要{skill:165} 125和角色20级，所以从125起任何一次造访都能学。只有少数训练师教：联盟{npc:11097}（{zone:1425}）和{npc:4212}（{zone:1457}）；部落{npc:11098}（{zone:1444}）和{npc:3007}（{zone:1456}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。150-225大约花1金68银的商人货物，外加257个{item:4304}，需自行采集或购买。把材料全部带在包里再来（前几步攒下的，其余从拍卖行买）：这些训练师也教{item:4304}（155起）和{item:8173}（175起），而这些制作无需工作台，所以就在原地制作，技能一到就学新配方。一趟搞定，而不是三趟。{item:8170}（205起）要再跑一趟，找其他训练师（见下）。",
	["Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s; it needs {skill:165} 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every {skill:165} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:3967} ({zone:1440}), {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}), {npc:252376} ({zone:2521}), Faldron ({zone:1457}), {npc:5127} ({zone:1455}), {npc:5564} ({zone:1453}) and {npc:4212} ({zone:1457}); Horde {npc:4588} ({zone:1458}), {npc:1385} ({zone:1434}), {npc:252376} ({zone:2521}), {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}), {npc:3365} ({zone:1454}), {npc:3703} ({zone:1413}), {npc:8153} ({zone:1443}), Tarn ({zone:1456}) and {npc:3007} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3763} (from 55, 3s). 75-150 takes about 15s 50c of recipes and 57s of vendor goods, plus 144 {item:2319}, 24 {item:2457} and 308 {item:4234} to gather or buy."] = "中级把上限从75提高到150，收费5银；它需要{skill:165} 50和角色10级，所以从50起任何一次造访都能学。并非每位{skill:165}训练师都教：联盟{npc:3967}（{zone:1440}）、{npc:11097}（{zone:1425}）、{npc:252376}（{zone:2521}）、法尔顿（{zone:1457}）、{npc:5127}（{zone:1455}）、{npc:5564}（{zone:1453}）和{npc:4212}（{zone:1457}）；部落{npc:4588}（{zone:1458}）、{npc:1385}（{zone:1434}）、{npc:252376}（{zone:2521}）、{npc:11098}（{zone:1444}）、{npc:3365}（{zone:1454}）、{npc:3703}（{zone:1413}）、{npc:8153}（{zone:1443}）、塔恩（{zone:1456}）和{npc:3007}（{zone:1456}）。箭头会指向本阵营最近的一位。现在学：{spell:3763}（55起，3银）。75-150大约花15银50铜的配方钱和57银的商人货物，外加144个{item:2319}、24个{item:2457}和308个{item:4234}，需自行采集或购买。",
	["Learn {skill:165}"] = "学习{skill:165}",
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:10487} (from 175)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:10487}（175起）。",
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:20650} (from 155)."] = "仍在高级训练师处：{spell:20650}（155起）。",
	["{item:15083} is orange at 239 (yellow 255, green 265, grey 275): about 39 crafts to 269. Each takes 8 {item:8170}, 1 {item:2325} and 1 {item:14341}. Eight {item:8170} a craft; {item:2325} and {item:14341} from leatherworking or tailoring vendors."] = "{item:15083}在239时为橙色（255黄、265绿、275灰）：大约39次制作可到269。每次需要8个{item:8170}、1个{item:2325}和1个{item:14341}。每次八个{item:8170}；{item:2325}和{item:14341}从制皮或裁缝供应商处购买。",
	["{item:15083} to 269"] = "{item:15083}到269",
	["{item:15094} is orange at 269 (yellow 285, green 295, grey 305): about 43 crafts to 300. Each takes 14 {item:8170}, 10 {item:14047} and 1 {item:14341}. 14 {item:8170} and 10 {item:14047} a craft: the dearest stretch. {skill:165} 300 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:15094}在269时为橙色（285黄、295绿、305灰）：大约43次制作可到300。每次需要14个{item:8170}、10个{item:14047}和1个{item:14341}。每次十四个{item:8170}和十个{item:14047}：这是最贵的一段。{skill:165} 300是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{item:15564} is yellow at 225 (yellow 225, green 235, grey 245): about 23 crafts to 239. Each takes 5 {item:8170}. Use the 20 {item:8170} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. Five {item:8170} a craft. Specialisation (optional): at 225 and character level 40. Dragonscale: {npc:7866} ({zone:1447}) or {npc:7867} ({zone:1418}) wants 2 Tough Scorpid Breastplates, 2 {item:8204} (patterns drop from the Wastewander bandits in {zone:1446}) and 10 {item:8165}. Elemental: {npc:7868} ({zone:1427}) or {npc:7869} ({zone:1417}) wants 2 each of {item:7077}, {item:7079}, {item:7075} and {item:7081}. Tribal (from 235): {npc:7870} ({zone:1444}) or {npc:7871} ({zone:1434}) wants a {item:8211} and Helmet, after the Wild Leather quests from {npc:7852} or {npc:7854} in {zone:1444}. On Forever the specialisation patterns need a {item:279941}. You can take only one; none is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30)."] = "{item:15564}在225时为黄色（225黄、235绿、245灰）：大约23次制作可到239。每次需要5个{item:8170}。用你早先做的20个{item:8170}；上面的计数没有算它们。每次五个{item:8170}。专精（可选）：需225和角色40级。龙鳞制皮：{npc:7866}（{zone:1447}）或{npc:7867}（{zone:1418}）要2件硬甲蝎胸甲、2个{item:8204}（图样由{zone:1446}的废土匪徒掉落）和10个{item:8165}。元素制皮：{npc:7868}（{zone:1427}）或{npc:7869}（{zone:1417}）要{item:7077}、{item:7079}、{item:7075}和{item:7081}各2个。部族制皮（235起）：{npc:7870}（{zone:1444}）或{npc:7871}（{zone:1434}）要一个{item:8211}和一件头盔，前提是先完成{zone:1444}中{npc:7852}或{npc:7854}的野性之皮任务。在Forever，专精图样需要一个{item:279941}。只能选一种；冲300不需要专精，而且测试版从未测过它们（测试只到30级）。",
	["{item:15564} to 239"] = "{item:15564}到239",
	["{item:15725} teaches {item:15083} ({skill:165} 235) for 1g 20s. Sold by Alliance: {npc:12942} ({zone:1422}), limited stock; Horde: {npc:12943} ({zone:1422}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:15725}教你{item:15083}（{skill:165} 235），售价1金20银。联盟由{npc:12942}（{zone:1422}）出售，库存有限；部落由{npc:12943}（{zone:1422}）出售，库存有限。卖家通常只存一两件，卖掉后过一段时间才补货；它拾取即绑定，所以拍卖行永远没有。",
	["{item:15756} teaches {item:15094} ({skill:165} 265) for 2g 20s. Sold by {npc:12941} ({zone:1423}), limited stock. Its sellers keep one or two in stock that come back some time after a sale; it binds when picked up, so the Auction House never has it."] = "{item:15756}教你{item:15094}（{skill:165} 265），售价2金20银。由{npc:12941}（{zone:1423}）出售，库存有限。卖家通常只存一两件，卖掉后过一段时间才补货；它拾取即绑定，所以拍卖行永远没有。",
	["{item:4304} is orange at 155 (yellow 175, green 177, grey 180): about 23 crafts to 177. Each takes 6 {item:4234}. Six {item:4234} make one {item:4304}, orange until 175: keep them, the Thick Armor Kits next use them."] = "{item:4304}在155时为橙色（175黄、177绿、180灰）：大约23次制作可到177。每次需要6个{item:4234}。六个{item:4234}可做一个{item:4304}，在175前都是橙色：留着它们，接下来的厚护甲片要用。",
	["{item:4304} to 177"] = "{item:4304}到177",
	["{item:7285} is orange at 102 (yellow 120, green 132, grey 145): about 24 crafts to 125. Each takes 1 {item:2457}, 6 {item:2319} and 1 {item:2321}. Each takes an {item:2457}: an alchemist makes it from a {item:2452} and a {item:765}, and the Auction House has it cheap. With no elixirs, take {spell:3763} on to 105 and {item:2316} (from 85: 8 {item:2319}, a {item:4340} and a {item:2321}) to 125: about 28 cloaks, 224 {item:2319} in all. {item:2457} (24 for 75-150): {skill:171}: {item:2457}; or the Auction House."] = "{item:7285}在102时为橙色（120黄、132绿、145灰）：大约24次制作可到125。每次需要1个{item:2457}、6个{item:2319}和1个{item:2321}。每次都要一个{item:2457}：炼金师用{item:2452}和{item:765}制作，拍卖行卖得很便宜。若不用药剂，就把{spell:3763}做到105，再用{item:2316}（85起：8个{item:2319}、一个{item:4340}和一个{item:2321}）做到125：大约28件披风，共224个{item:2319}。{item:2457}（75-150需24个）：{skill:171}：{item:2457}；或去拍卖行。",
	["{item:7285} to 125"] = "{item:7285}到125",
	["{item:8170} is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 225, grey 225): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 6 {item:4304}. {item:8170} from {item:4304}: the points come cheap and you need the {item:8170} next. {skill:165} 225 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{item:8170}在205时为橙色（225黄、225绿、225灰）：大约20次制作可到225，每次一点。每次需要6个{item:4304}。由{item:4304}制得{item:8170}：涨点很便宜，而且接下来正需要{item:8170}。{skill:165} 225是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{item:8170} to 225"] = "{item:8170}到225",
	["{item:8173} is orange at 177 (yellow 195, green 205, grey 215): about 32 crafts to 205. Each takes 5 {item:4304} and 1 {item:4291}. Use the 23 {item:4304} you made earlier; the counts above leave them out. Five {item:4304} a craft; the kits sell to vendors."] = "{item:8173}在177时为橙色（195黄、205绿、215灰）：大约32次制作可到205。每次需要5个{item:4304}和1个{item:4291}。用你早先做的23个{item:4304}；上面的计数没有算它们。每次五个{item:4304}；护甲片可以卖给商人。",
	["{item:8173} to 205"] = "{item:8173}到205",
