	["{skill:165} recipes at 125"] = "{skill:165} 125时的配方",
	["{skill:165} recipes at 155"] = "{skill:165} 155时的配方",
	["{skill:165} recipes at 177"] = "{skill:165} 177时的配方",
	["{skill:165} recipes at 205"] = "{skill:165} 205时的配方",
	["{skill:165} recipes at 51"] = "{skill:165} 51时的配方",
	["{spell:2152} is orange at 1 (yellow 30, green 45, grey 60): about 64 crafts to 51. Each takes 1 {item:2318}. One {item:2318} a craft; the kits sell to vendors."] = "{spell:2152}在1时为橙色（30黄、45绿、60灰）：大约64次制作可到51。每次需要1个{item:2318}。每次一个{item:2318}；护甲片可以卖给商人。",
	["{spell:2152} to 51"] = "{spell:2152}到51",
	["{spell:22331} (from 205) is taught only by the Artisan trainers: Alliance {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}); Horde {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}). You can train Artisan there now if you are level 35 (it needs {skill:165} 200), which saves the trip at 225."] = "{spell:22331}（205起）只由大师级训练师教授：联盟{npc:11097}（{zone:1425}）；部落{npc:11098}（{zone:1444}）。如果你已35级（它需要{skill:165} 200），现在就可以在那里学大师级，省掉225时再跑一趟。",
	["{spell:3756} is orange at 51 (yellow 70, green 85, grey 100): about 25 crafts to 75. Each takes 3 {item:2318} and 2 {item:2320}. Forever teaches {spell:3756} from 40."] = "{spell:3756}在51时为橙色（70黄、85绿、100灰）：大约25次制作可到75。每次需要3个{item:2318}和2个{item:2320}。Forever中{spell:3756}从40起可学。",
	["{spell:3756} to 75"] = "{spell:3756}到75",
