	["{spell:3763} to 102"] = "{spell:3763}到102",
	["{spell:3780} is orange at 125 (yellow 145, green 155, grey 165): about 26 crafts to 150. Each takes 5 {item:4234} and 1 {item:2321}. Five {item:4234} a craft (beasts of level 28-40); the kits sell to vendors. {skill:165} 150 is a Legacy System milestone."] = "{spell:3780}在125时为橙色（145黄、155绿、165灰）：大约26次制作可到150。每次需要5个{item:4234}和1个{item:2321}。每次五个{item:4234}（28到40级的野兽）；护甲片可以卖给商人。{skill:165} 150是传承系统里程碑。",
	["{spell:3780} is yellow at 150 (yellow 145, green 155, grey 165): about 8 crafts to 155. Each takes 5 {item:4234} and 1 {item:2321}. Five {item:4234} a craft (beasts of level 28-40); the kits sell to vendors."] = "{spell:3780}在150时为黄色（145黄、155绿、165灰）：大约8次制作可到155。每次需要5个{item:4234}和1个{item:2321}。每次五个{item:4234}（28到40级的野兽）；护甲片可以卖给商人。",
