	["Assault the {area:3422} banner"] = "突袭{area:3422}旗帜",
	["Assaulting a base means clicking its banner until it turns: you need not hold it. Four marks in all: one for {npc:14984}, three for the Brigadier General. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1461} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "突袭基地就是点击它的旗帜直到旗帜变色：你不需要守在那里。总共四枚徽记：一枚交给{npc:14984}，三枚交给准将。Forever的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:1461}徽记：在达到上限前交掉或用掉。",
	["Assaulting a base means clicking its banner until it turns: you need not hold it. Four marks in all: one for {npc:15022}, three for the Warbringer. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 {zone:1461} marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that."] = "突袭基地就是点击它的旗帜直到旗帜变色：你不需要守在那里。总共四枚徽记：一枚交给{npc:15022}，三枚交给战争使者。Forever的PvP装备除了荣誉还要花荣誉徽记：交之前先想好想要什么。你最多只能携带30枚{zone:1461}徽记：在达到上限前交掉或用掉。",
	["At Exalted, {npc:14983} asks your team to hold all five bases at the same time. It pays 200 reputation and the {item:20132}, the only way to get it."] = "崇拜时，{npc:14983}要求你的队伍同时占领全部五座基地。奖励200声望和{item:20132}，这是获得它的唯一途径。",
	["At Exalted, {npc:15021} asks your team to hold all five bases at the same time. It pays 200 reputation and the {item:20131}, the only way to get it."] = "崇拜时，{npc:15021}要求你的队伍同时占领全部五座基地。奖励200声望和{item:20131}，这是获得它的唯一途径。",
	["At level 60 and Friendly, {npc:14983} asks your team to hold four bases at the same time: 200 reputation, once. It opens {quest:8115} for Exalted."] = "60级且友善时，{npc:14983}要求你的队伍同时占领四座基地：200声望，仅一次。它会解锁崇拜阶段的{quest:8115}。",
	["At level 60 and Friendly, {npc:15021} asks your team to hold four bases at the same time: 200 reputation, once. It opens {quest:8122} for Exalted."] = "60级且友善时，{npc:15021}要求你的队伍同时占领四座基地：200声望，仅一次。它会解锁崇拜阶段的{quest:8122}。",
	["Back to {area:320}"] = "回到{area:320}",
	["Back to {area:321}"] = "回到{area:321}",
	["Every 200 resources your team gathers pays it; Exalted gives a Legacy Point, epic shoulders and the tabard."] = "你的队伍每采集200点资源就会结算一次声望；崇拜会给一个传承点数、史诗护肩和战袍。",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Arathi Basin\" and opens the epics: the level 60 Defiler's shoulders in every armor type (12g75s to 20g), {item:20068} (13g18s), {item:20069} (50g46s) and Mindfang (42g83s), both from level 55."] = "崇拜会给予传承点数“阿拉希盆地大师”，并开放史诗奖励：各甲种的60级污染者护肩（12金75银到20金）、{item:20068}（13金18银）、{item:20069}（50金46银）和心灵之牙（42金83银），后两件从55级起可买。",
	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Arathi Basin\" and opens the epics: the level 60 Highlander's shoulders in every armor type (12g33s to 18g50s), {item:20073} (12g14s), {item:20069} (55g10s) and Sageclaw (44g24s), both from level 55."] = "崇拜会给予传承点数“阿拉希盆地大师”，并开放史诗奖励：各甲种的60级高地人护肩（12金33银到18金50银）、{item:20073}（12金14银）、{item:20069}（55金10银）和贤者之爪（44金24银），后两件从55级起可买。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation, about 40 wins at the Classic rate. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:15126} beside {npc:15021}: the {item:20072} trinket for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (72s to 4g12s), and food and bandages that work in {zone:1461} (10s to 20s). He also gives one Defiler's care package at Friendly (pick the one for your level): 10 reputation and a bag of battleground food and bandages."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000声望，按原版速率约需40场胜利。友善会在{npc:15021}旁的{npc:15126}处开放首批奖励：适用于28、38、48和58级的{item:20072}饰品（72银到4金12银），以及在{zone:1461}中可用的食物和绷带（10银到20银）。他还会在友善时给一个污染者补给包（按你的等级挑选）：10声望和一袋战场食物与绷带。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation, about 40 wins at the Classic rate. Friendly opens the first rewards at {npc:15127} beside {npc:14983}: the {item:20071} trinket for levels 28, 38, 48 and 58 (72s to 4g12s), and food and bandages that work in {zone:1461} (10s to 20s). He also gives one Arathor care package at Friendly (pick the one for your level): 10 reputation and a bag of battleground food and bandages."] = "友善到尊敬需要6000声望，按原版速率约需40场胜利。友善会在{npc:14983}旁的{npc:15127}处开放首批奖励：适用于28、38、48和58级的{item:20071}饰品（72银到4金12银），以及在{zone:1461}中可用的食物和绷带（10银到20银）。他还会在友善时给一个阿拉索补给包（按你的等级挑选）：10声望和一袋战场食物与绷带。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation, about 80 wins. Honored opens the Defiler's belts in plate, lamellar, chain, mail, leather, lizardhide and cloth for levels 28 to 58 (75s to 8g78s)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望，约需80场胜利。尊敬会开放污染者腰带，包括板甲、鳞甲、锁甲、链甲、皮甲、蜥蜴皮和布甲，适用于28到58级（75银到8金78银）。",
	["Honored to Revered is 12000 reputation, about 80 wins. Honored opens the Highlander's belts in plate, lamellar, chain, mail, leather, lizardhide and cloth for levels 28 to 58 (72s to 8g84s)."] = "尊敬到崇敬需要12000声望，约需80场胜利。尊敬会开放高地人腰带，包括板甲、鳞甲、锁甲、链甲、皮甲、蜥蜴皮和布甲，适用于28到58级（72银到8金84银）。",
	["Master of Arathi Basin: a Legacy Point at Exalted"] = "阿拉希盆地大师：崇拜时获得一个传承点数",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. In Classic a win paid 100 and its 3 marks bring 50 more at the Brigadier General ({quest:8374}, again and again): about 150 a win, some 20 wins. Forever has not published its battleground rates, so count the games as a rough guide. Below level 50 the quests at {area:320} come in a version for your bracket (from level 20): 200 for assaulting the bases, 200 for one mark, then 100 and 50 per 3 marks at the Brigadier General."] = "中立到友善需要3000声望。原版中一场胜利给100，3枚徽记在准将处（{quest:8374}，可反复交）再换50：每场约150，约20场。Forever没有公布战场声望速率，所以把场次当作粗略参考。50级以下时，{area:320}的任务会提供适合你等级段的版本（20级起）：突袭各基地200，交一枚徽记200，之后在准将处每3枚徽记得100和50。",
	["Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. In Classic a win paid 100 and its 3 marks bring 50 more at the Warbringer ({quest:8370}, again and again): about 150 a win, some 20 wins. Forever has not published its battleground rates, so count the games as a rough guide. Below level 50 the quests at {area:321} come in a version for your bracket (from level 20): 200 for assaulting the bases, 200 for one mark, then 100 and 50 per 3 marks at the Warbringer."] = "中立到友善需要3000声望。原版中一场胜利给100，3枚徽记在战争使者处（{quest:8370}，可反复交）再换50：每场约150，约20场。Forever没有公布战场声望速率，所以把场次当作粗略参考。50级以下时，{area:321}的任务会提供适合你等级段的版本（20级起）：突袭各基地200，交一枚徽记200，之后在战争使者处每3枚徽记得100和50。",
	["Reputation · Battlegrounds"] = "声望 · 战场",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, about 140 wins: half of the whole climb. Revered opens the Defiler's boots and greaves for levels 28 to 58 (1g12s to 13g41s), the ones with the run-speed bonus."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，约需140场胜利，占整个爬升的一半。崇敬会开放污染者长靴和护胫，适用于28到58级（1金12银到13金41银），也就是带移动速度加成的那几件。",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21000 reputation, about 140 wins: half of the whole climb. Revered opens the Highlander's boots and greaves for levels 28 to 58 (1g7s to 13g65s), the ones with the run-speed bonus."] = "崇敬到崇拜需要21000声望，约需140场胜利，占整个爬升的一半。崇敬会开放高地人长靴和护胫，适用于28到58级（1金7银到13金65银），也就是带移动速度加成的那几件。",
	["all five bases held at once"] = "同时占领全部五座基地",
	["four bases held at once"] = "同时占领四座基地",
	["hand in the three marks first"] = "先交三枚徽记",
	["one {item:20559}"] = "一个{item:20559}",
	["three more marks"] = "再交三枚徽记",
	["{npc:14983}: assault four bases, 200"] = "{npc:14983}：突袭四座基地，200",
	["{npc:14984}: one mark, 200"] = "{npc:14984}：一枚徽记，200",
	["{npc:15021}: assault four bases, 200"] = "{npc:15021}：突袭四座基地，200",
	["{npc:15022}: one mark, 200"] = "{npc:15022}：一枚徽记，200",
	["{npc:15126}: Exalted rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：崇拜奖励",
	["{npc:15126}: Friendly rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：友善奖励",
	["{npc:15126}: Honored rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：尊敬奖励",
	["{npc:15126}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:15126}：崇敬奖励",
	["{npc:15127}: Exalted rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：崇拜奖励",
	["{npc:15127}: Friendly rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：友善奖励",
	["{npc:15127}: Honored rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：尊敬奖励",
	["{npc:15127}: Revered rewards"] = "{npc:15127}：崇敬奖励",
	["{npc:15350}: 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：3枚徽记换50声望",
	["{npc:15350}: three marks, 100"] = "{npc:15350}：三枚徽记，100",
	["{npc:15350}: {quest:8370} again, 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15350}：再次交{quest:8370}，3枚徽记换50声望",
	["{npc:15351}: 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：3枚徽记换50声望",
	["{npc:15351}: three marks, 100"] = "{npc:15351}：三枚徽记，100",
	["{npc:15351}: {quest:8374} again, 50 reputation for 3 marks"] = "{npc:15351}：再次交{quest:8374}，3枚徽记换50声望",
	["{zone:1461} is a 15 against 15 battle over five bases, from level 20: hold bases to gather resources, and the first team to 2000 wins. Queue at any battlemaster in the capitals or from the battleground screen. In Classic every 200 resources your team gathers pay everyone 10 reputation, so a win pays 100 and a close loss nearly as much; a game also pays 3 Arathi Basin Marks of Honor for a win, 1 for a loss. The three quests here pay 500 reputation together (200, 200 and 100), once. Forever's Legacy Diplomat perk adds up to 10% to every number in this guide."] = "{zone:1461}是15对15、围绕五座基地的战场，20级起可进：占领基地以采集资源，先到2000点的一方获胜。可在任意主城的战场军官处排队，或用战场界面排队。原版中你的队伍每采集200点资源，全队每人得10声望，所以一场胜利给100，惜败也差不多；一场胜利还给3枚阿拉希盆地荣誉徽记，失败给1枚。这里的三个任务合计给500声望（200、200和100），仅一次。Forever的传承专长“外交家”会使本攻略中的所有数值最多增加10%。",
}

G["forever/reputation/centaur-clans"] = {
	["12 recipes for Carved Centaur Totems at the clan quartermasters, no standing needed"] = "部族军需官处有12种雕纹半人马图腾的配方，无需声望",
	["At Honored, and after {quest:92743}, {npc:5398} sends you to {npc:253136} at the northern entrance of the {quest:92841}, in {zone:2652}. {npc:253136}'s quests (500 each: {quest:92844}, {quest:92846}, Corrupting Tears, Proof of Concept, No Mercy for the Weak, Bone Raising) and Hagiak's at the {area:16675} ({area:16677}, Long-Term Solutions, Threat of Starvation, Return to {npc:253136}) end with {npc:5601}: raise the dead khan with {npc:253136}'s staff at the tent by the lake in {area:604}, for 6,000, a title and a rare level 35 weapon. They all ask you to stay Honored or better. Honored to Revered is 12,000: the valley's quests pay about 11,000 of it, two {quest:92811} turn-ins the rest."] = "尊敬时且完成{quest:92743}后，{npc:5398}会派你去找{npc:253136}，他在{zone:2652}的{quest:92841}北入口。{npc:253136}的任务（每个500：{quest:92844}、{quest:92846}、腐化之泪、概念验证、对弱者毫不留情、白骨复苏）以及哈吉亚克在{area:16675}的任务（{area:16677}、长期解决方案、饥荒威胁、回到{npc:253136}）都以{npc:5601}收尾：在{area:604}湖畔的帐篷旁，用{npc:253136}的法杖复活死去的可汗，可获6,000声望、一个头衔和一件35级稀有武器。这些任务都要求你保持尊敬或更高。尊敬到崇敬需要12,000：山谷中的任务约给11,000，其余靠两次{quest:92811}上交。",
	["At Honored, {npc:5397} sends you east to {npc:253177} at the southern entrance of the {quest:93034}, in {zone:2652}. {npc:253177}'s quests (500 each) take you among the undead and the outcasts there: {quest:93035}, {quest:93037} and {quest:93041}, then A Cleansing Cry from {npc:5397}, and a second line (Saving Our Own, Bone Burying, Checking Things Out) that ends with {npc:5601}: kill the Magram khan in his own village for 6,000, a title and a rare level 35 weapon. They all ask you to stay Honored or better. Honored to Revered is 12,000: the valley's quests pay about 10,600 of it, two or three {quest:92811} turn-ins the rest."] = "尊敬时，{npc:5397}会派你向东去找{npc:253177}，他在{zone:2652}的{quest:93034}南入口。{npc:253177}的任务（每个500）会带你深入那里的亡灵与弃民之中：{quest:93035}、{quest:93037}和{quest:93041}，然后是从{npc:5397}处接的“净化之呼”，以及第二条任务线（“拯救同胞”“埋葬白骨”“探查情况”），最终也以{npc:5601}收尾：在他自己的村庄里杀死玛格拉姆可汗，可获6,000声望、一个头衔和一件35级稀有武器。这些任务都要求你保持尊敬或更高。尊敬到崇敬需要12,000：山谷中的任务约给10,600，其余靠两三次{quest:92811}上交。",
	["Back to {npc:5397}, then east to the {zone:1435}: {quest:1373} (level 37) waits by a black cauldron in {area:76}, north-east of {area:75}."] = "回到{npc:5397}，再向东前往{zone:1435}：{quest:1373}（37级）在{area:75}东北、{area:76}的一口黑色大锅旁等你。",
	["Both quartermasters sell the same 12 recipes for Carved Centaur Totems, no standing needed: {item:273613} and - Lesser Healing Power; Greater Spellblasting and {item:250941}; {item:250538} and {item:250606} plans; {item:252462}, {item:253973}, {item:10011} and {item:274490} patterns; the {item:269900} and {item:269902} schematics. Keep the totems you need for them before you hand the rest in."] = "两位军需官出售同样的12种雕纹半人马图腾配方，无需声望：{item:273613}和次级治疗能量；强效法术冲击和{item:250941}；{item:250538}和{item:250606}图纸；{item:252462}、{item:253973}、{item:10011}和{item:274490}图样；{item:269900}和{item:269902}结构图。交掉剩下的图腾之前，先留出换这些配方所需的量。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 3,000 into it (4,000 with {quest:1371}), so 2,000 to 3,000 to go. {npc:253139}'s {quest:92811} takes 5 Carved Centaur Totems for 750, again and again; the Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western {zone:1443} drop them, and the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Gelkis kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village has two craft orders for 1,000 each: Mirda's 3 Greater Shadow Protection Potions and Grolkar's 2 Massive Iron Axes (blacksmithing). {npc:5398}'s {quest:92743} (1,000) is no craft order: he wants a {item:254392} from a crypt in the {zone:1418}, and Forever's quest pages put it in his chain before the {quest:92841}, so bring it before you reach Honored. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "友善到尊敬需要6,000；做完部族任务后你大约已有3,000（若完成{quest:1371}则4,000），还差2,000到3,000。{npc:253139}的{quest:92811}用5个雕纹半人马图腾换750，可反复交；{zone:1443}西部的玛拉迪半人马（36到40级）会掉落，而且图腾不绑定，所以拍卖行是另一个来源。每杀一个吉尔吉斯人加20，但Forever的击杀数据只到友善末期，距尊敬还差1点。友善时村里有两个各值1,000的制作订单：米尔达的3瓶强效暗影防护药水和格罗卡的2把巨型铁斧（锻造）。{npc:5398}的{quest:92743}（1,000）不是制作订单：他要一个来自{zone:1418}某处墓穴的{item:254392}，而Forever的任务页面把它列在{quest:92841}之前的任务链中，所以在到达尊敬前就带上它。传承专长“外交家”最多再加10%。",
	["Friendly to Honored is 6,000; after the clan's quests you are about 4,000 into it, so 2,000 to go. {npc:253140}'s {quest:92812} takes 5 Carved Centaur Totems for 750, again and again: three turn-ins, 15 totems. The Maraudine centaurs (level 36-40) of western {zone:1443} drop them; the totems do not bind, so the auction house is the other source. Magram kills add 20 each, but Forever's kill data stops them at the end of Friendly, 1 short of Honored. At Friendly the village also has three craft orders for 1,000 each: Halea wants 3 Greater Mystic Essences, {npc:253140} a {item:10008} (tailoring) and Talra a {item:5739} (leatherworking). Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10%."] = "友善到尊敬需要6,000；做完部族任务后你大约已有4,000，还差2,000。{npc:253140}的{quest:92812}用5个雕纹半人马图腾换750，可反复交：三次上交，共15个图腾。{zone:1443}西部的玛拉迪半人马（36到40级）会掉落；图腾不绑定，所以拍卖行是另一个来源。每杀一个玛格拉姆人加20，但Forever的击杀数据只到友善末期，距尊敬还差1点。友善时村里还有三个各值1,000的制作订单：哈莉亚要3瓶强效秘法精华，{npc:253140}要一个{item:10008}（裁缝），塔尔拉要一个{item:5739}（制皮）。传承专长“外交家”最多再加10%。",
	["From Revered on only {quest:92811} is left: Revered to Exalted is 21,000, 28 turn-ins, 140 totems."] = "从崇敬起只剩{quest:92811}：崇敬到崇拜需要21,000，28次上交，140个图腾。",
	["From Revered on only {quest:92812} is left: Revered to Exalted is 21,000, 28 turn-ins, 140 totems. Nothing is sold for standing; the recipes below need only totems."] = "从崇敬起只剩{quest:92812}：崇敬到崇拜需要21,000，28次上交，140个图腾。声望不卖任何东西；下面的配方只需要图腾。",
	["Gelkis Stamper"] = "吉尔吉斯踩踏者",
	["Gelkis Windchaser"] = "吉尔吉斯逐风者",
	["Gelkis and Magram Centaur Reputation"] = "吉尔吉斯与玛格拉姆半人马声望",
