	["Pick your clan"] = "选择你的部族",
	["Reputation · World"] = "声望 · 世界",
	["Take the quests of one clan"] = "只接一个部族的任务",
	["The Gelkis (south-west {zone:1443}) and the Magram (south-east) are at war: every kill of one clan gives the other 20 and costs its own clan 100, so you can only climb with one. Both start Neutral. Forever's quests are worth far more than kills now, and the choice quests no longer cost the other clan anything. Alliance: {npc:5396} at {area:608} offers {quest:1382} (Gelkis) and {quest:1385} (Magram). Horde: {npc:5412}, east of Shadowprey, offers {quest:1368} and {quest:1367}. Take the one of your clan and its Buying Friendship (3,000 for carrying a tote of totems), then tick the task. The guide goes on with the Gelkis; take the Magram's quests instead and it jumps to the Magram half. Do the clan's quests by level 50 if you can: in Classic a quest pays less once it is 6 or more levels below you, down to a fifth."] = "吉尔吉斯（{zone:1443}西南）与玛格拉姆（东南）正在交战：每杀一个部族成员，另一部族加20，自己部族减100，所以你只能靠一个部族爬声望。两者初始都是中立。如今Forever的任务价值远高于击杀，而且选择任务不再让另一部族受损。联盟：{area:608}的{npc:5396}提供{quest:1382}（吉尔吉斯）和{quest:1385}（玛格拉姆）。部落：暗影猎手村以东的{npc:5412}提供{quest:1368}和{quest:1367}。接你部族的那一个及其“购买友谊”（带着一箱图腾去，得3,000），然后勾选该任务。攻略继续按吉尔吉斯走；若改接玛格拉姆的任务，它会跳到玛格拉姆那一半。尽量在50级前做完部族任务：原版中任务比你低6级或更多时收益会降低，最低到五分之一。",
	["The Kolkar centaurs (level 30-33) hold the camps south of {area:608}, along the eastern road. About one in four drops a {item:6079}."] = "科卡尔半人马（30到33级）占据{area:608}以南沿东侧道路的营地。约每四个掉落一个{item:6079}。",
	["The Kolkar centaurs (level 30-33) hold the camps south of {area:608}."] = "科卡尔半人马（30到33级）占据{area:608}以南的营地。",
	["The Sacks of Meat lie about {area:604}, in the south-east. Every Magram you kill on the way pays the Gelkis 20."] = "肉袋散落在东南部{area:604}一带。路上每杀一个玛格拉姆人，吉尔吉斯加20。",
	["The Tears of Theradras are crystals in the cave behind {area:606}, in the south-west. Every Gelkis you kill on the way pays the Magram 20."] = "瑟莱德丝之泪是西南部{area:606}后方洞穴中的水晶。路上每杀一个吉尔吉斯人，玛格拉姆加20。",
	["The ritual site is a tent by the lake in the middle of {area:604}. {npc:253136} pays 6,000, a title, and your pick of three rare level 35 weapons: {item:271800} (polearm: Stamina, attack power, Agility), {item:271803} (staff: Intellect, Stamina, Spirit) or {item:271804} (main-hand mace: Intellect, Stamina, Spirit)."] = "仪式地点是{area:604}中部湖畔的一顶帐篷。{npc:253136}给6,000声望、一个头衔，以及三件35级稀有武器中你选的一件：{item:271800}（长柄武器：耐力、攻击强度、敏捷）、{item:271803}（法杖：智力、耐力、精神）或{item:271804}（主手锤：智力、耐力、精神）。",
	["The totem recipes"] = "图腾配方",
	["{area:604} fills the valley of south-east {zone:1443}; {npc:5398} stands on its north side, {npc:253139}, the Magram quartermaster, near the lake. Buying Friendship alone takes you from Neutral to Friendly."] = "{area:604}占据{zone:1443}东南的山谷；{npc:5398}站在它的北侧，玛格拉姆军需官{npc:253139}在湖边。仅“购买友谊”一项就能把你从中立带到友善。",
	["{area:604}: {npc:5398} and {npc:253139}"] = "{area:604}：{npc:5398}和{npc:253139}",
	["{area:606} sits in the hills of south-west {zone:1443}; {npc:5397} stands at its heart. {npc:253140}, the Gelkis quartermaster, is at the south end of the village. Buying Friendship alone takes you from Neutral to Friendly."] = "{area:606}位于{zone:1443}西南的山丘中；{npc:5397}站在它的中心。吉尔吉斯军需官{npc:253140}在村子南端。仅“购买友谊”一项就能把你从中立带到友善。",
	["{area:606}: {npc:5397} and {npc:253140}"] = "{area:606}：{npc:5397}和{npc:253140}",
