	["{npc:5398} wants an {item:4392}: engineers make it (4 {item:4234}, a {item:4389}, a {item:4382} and an {item:4387}); others buy one. It pays 1,000 and a choice of two engineering schematics, the {item:269900} or the {item:269902}."] = "{npc:5398}要一个{item:4392}：工程师可以制作（4个{item:4234}、一个{item:4389}、一个{item:4382}和一个{item:4387}）；其他人则直接买。它给1,000声望，并可从两张工程学结构图中选一张：{item:269900}或{item:269902}。",
	["{npc:5398}: 1,000"] = "{npc:5398}：1,000",
