	["{npc:5398}: 500"] = "{npc:5398}：500",
	["{npc:5601} (level 37) leads the Magram from the west side of {area:604}, with his bodyguards. The kill costs the Magram 500. {npc:5397} pays 6,000, a title, and your pick of three rare level 35 weapons: {item:271801} (two-handed axe: Strength, Stamina, Agility), {item:271802} (one-handed mace: Strength, Stamina, Agility) or {item:271805} (off-hand: Spirit, Intellect, Stamina)."] = "{npc:5601}（37级）带着卫兵从{area:604}西侧统领玛格拉姆。杀他会让玛格拉姆损失500。{npc:5397}给6,000声望、一个头衔，以及三件35级稀有武器中你选的一件：{item:271801}（双手斧：力量、耐力、敏捷）、{item:271802}（单手锤：力量、耐力、敏捷）或{item:271805}（副手：精神、智力、耐力）。",
	["{npc:5601}'s quest: a clan title and a choice of three rare level 35 weapons"] = "{npc:5601}的任务：一个部族头衔，以及三件35级稀有武器任选一件",
